    ["Examine Wheel Rut (I-9) again to complete the quest and receive the Ram Staff."] = "Examina de nuevo el Wheel Rut (I-9) para completar la quest y recibir el Ram Staff.",
    ["Examine Wheel Rut (I-9) in the dead-end tunnel to the south."] = "Examina el Wheel Rut (I-9) en el túnel sin salida al sur.",
    ["Examine a ??? that spawns randomly in Yhoator Jungle. Once you find it, the Empty Barrel turns into a Barrel of Opo-opo brew."] = "Examina una ??? que aparece al azar en Yhoator Jungle. Cuando la encuentres, el Empty Barrel se convierte en un Barrel of Opo-opo brew.",
    ["Examine a Shattered Telepoint at one of the three Crags."] = "Examina un Shattered Telepoint en uno de los tres Crags.",
    ["Examine a Shattered Telepoint at the Crag of Holla, Dem, or Mea."] = "Examina un Shattered Telepoint en el Crag of Holla, Dem o Mea.",
    ["Examine all eight sections of Chamber of Oracles to place the eight fragments."] = "Examina las ocho secciones de la Chamber of Oracles para colocar los ocho fragmentos.",
    ["Examine blue warp ??? exit to leave the battlefield."] = "Examina la ??? de warp azul de salida para abandonar el campo de batalla.",
    ["Examine dead-end target (J-7)."] = "Examina el objetivo del callejón sin salida (J-7).",
    ["Examine glowing ??? near the Augural Conveyor (B-6)."] = "Examina la ??? brillante cerca del Augural Conveyor (B-6).",
    ["Examine it again and place the jar of Firesand."] = "Examínalo de nuevo y coloca el jar of Firesand.",
    ["Examine it again to enter the battle against Galarhigg."] = "Examínalo de nuevo para entrar en la batalla contra Galarhigg.",
    ["Examine it again to enter the battlefield against Count Bifrons and four Orcs."] = "Examínalo de nuevo para entrar en el campo de batalla contra Count Bifrons y cuatro Orcs.",
    ["Examine it again to obtain the Reinforced Cermet."] = "Examínala de nuevo para obtener el Reinforced Cermet.",
    ["Examine it again to spawn Count Halphas and four Dark Demons."] = "Examínalas de nuevo para invocar a Count Halphas y a cuatro Dark Demons.",
    ["Examine one of the three Cavernous Maws:"] = "Examina uno de los tres Cavernous Maws:",
    ["Examine the ??? again after about a minute to obtain the Warlock's Boots. Zoning is not required."] = "Examina de nuevo la ??? tras un minuto aproximadamente para obtener las Warlock's Boots. No hace falta cambiar de zona.",
    ["Examine the ??? again after defeating the Nasus."] = "Examina de nuevo la ??? tras derrotar a los Nasus.",
    ["Examine the ??? again for a cutscene and a Regal Die. Return to Lower Jeuno and trade the Regal Die to Sniggnix for the key item Second signed forged envelope."] = "Examina de nuevo la ??? para una escena y un Regal Die. Vuelve a Lower Jeuno y entrega el Regal Die a Sniggnix para obtener el key item Second signed forged envelope.",
    ["Examine the ??? again for a cutscene and your reward. Optional: Ceraulian has an extra cutscene and Rahal some extra dialogue afterwards."] = "Examina de nuevo la ??? para una escena y tu recompensa. Opcional: después, Ceraulian tiene una escena extra y Rahal algo de diálogo extra.",
    ["Examine the ??? again for another cutscene."] = "Examina de nuevo la ??? para otra escena.",
    ["Examine the ??? again for the key item Zeelozok's earplug, and return to Koblakiq to complete the quest and receive the Goblin Grenade."] = "Examina de nuevo la ??? para obtener el key item Zeelozok's earplug y vuelve con Koblakiq para completar la quest y recibir la Goblin Grenade.",
    ["Examine the ??? again to exchange the Antique amulet for the Cathedral medallion, then return to Rouva."] = "Examina de nuevo la ??? para cambiar el Antique amulet por el Cathedral medallion y vuelve con Rouva.",
    ["Examine the ??? again to spawn Migratory Hippogryph. If you zone after the first examine, you have to examine it again as a Dancer, so plan to fight it on Dancer."] = "Examina de nuevo la ??? para hacer aparecer a Migratory Hippogryph. Si cambias de zona tras el primer examen, tienes que volver a examinarla como Dancer, así que prepárate para luchar como Dancer.",
    ["Examine the ??? again to spawn the mannequin NM Alsha. It casts Silence, Paralyze and sometimes Cure III on you; below about 20% it casts Fire II on itself, and if it kills itself you must zone and try again, since you have to land the final blow."] = "Examina de nuevo la ??? para hacer aparecer al NM maniquí Alsha. Te lanza Silence, Paralyze y a veces Cure III; por debajo del 20% aproximadamente se lanza Fire II a sí mismo, y si se mata solo debes cambiar de zona y volver a intentarlo, ya que tienes que dar tú el golpe final.",
    ["Examine the ??? at (F-10) on the first map, in a hidden area at (F-9), with the wyvern out to spawn Cleuvarion M Resoaix and Rompaulion S Citalle. Only Rompaulion has to be defeated; a level 60 party of Trusts can handle it."] = "Examina la ??? en (F-10) del primer mapa, en una zona oculta en (F-9), con el wyvern fuera para hacer aparecer a Cleuvarion M Resoaix y Rompaulion S Citalle. Solo hay que derrotar a Rompaulion; un grupo de Trusts de nivel 60 puede con él.",
    ["Examine the ??? at (G-8) in the south-west corner, behind the shack. There are two ??? close together; the right one says \"You have found the location of the seal\" and then \"You place a Seal of banishing on it.\""] = "Examina la ??? en (G-8), en la esquina suroeste, detrás de la cabaña. Hay dos ??? muy juntas; la de la derecha dice \"You have found the location of the seal\" y luego \"You place a Seal of banishing on it.\"",
    ["Examine the ??? at the north-east corner of (G-9) to spawn Necroplasm. Trusts are allowed. It may not be targetable with Tab while it sits on the stalagmite, so move away to pull it off. Defeat it and examine the ??? again for the key item Indigested stalagmite."] = "Examina la ??? de la esquina noreste de (G-9) para hacer aparecer a Necroplasm. Se permiten Trusts. Puede que no se pueda seleccionar con Tab mientras está sobre la estalagmita, así que aléjate para sacarlo de ahí. Derrótalo y examina de nuevo la ??? para obtener el key item Indigested stalagmite.",
    ["Examine the ??? for the final cutscene and your Puppetry Churidars."] = "Examina la ??? para la última escena y tus Puppetry Churidars.",
    ["Examine the ??? in Arrapago Reef (H-10) for a cutscene, as a Corsair of level 40 or higher. You are asked a question; the answer is Maze of Shakhrami, but a wrong guess is fine."] = "Examina la ??? en Arrapago Reef (H-10) para una escena, como Corsair de nivel 40 o superior. Se te hace una pregunta; la respuesta es Maze of Shakhrami, pero fallar no importa.",
    ["Examine the ??? in Arrapago Reef (H-10), map 1, for a cutscene. You need to be a Corsair of level 50 or higher, and a Lamian Fang Key is required to reach this point."] = "Examina la ??? en Arrapago Reef (H-10), mapa 1, para una escena. Debes ser Corsair de nivel 50 o superior, y hace falta una Lamian Fang Key para llegar a este punto.",
    ["Examine the ??? in Eastern Altepa Desert, in the lower part of (H-8), to spawn Decurio I-III. The Survival Guide warp puts you very near; Teleport-Altep is another good option."] = "Examina la ??? en Eastern Altepa Desert, en la parte baja de (H-8), para invocar a Decurio I-III. El warp de la Survival Guide te deja muy cerca; Teleport-Altep es otra buena opción.",
    ["Examine the ??? in Labyrinth of Onzozo (F-8) to spawn the NM Ubume, a level 60-65 Bard bird that loves Horde Lullaby. The Survival Guide lands you at (G-11), near the Buburimu Peninsula zone line; walking in from Buburimu Peninsula also works."] = "Examina la ??? en Labyrinth of Onzozo (F-8) para hacer aparecer al NM Ubume, un pájaro Bard de nivel 60-65 al que le encanta Horde Lullaby. La Survival Guide te deja en (G-11), cerca del límite de zona de Buburimu Peninsula; entrar caminando desde Buburimu Peninsula también sirve.",
    ["Examine the ??? in Valkurm Dunes at (B-7) between 18:00 and 4:00 to spawn Doman (Fomor) and Onryo (Ghost), both around level 52. The Survival Guide to Gustav Tunnel lands you just outside (B-7)."] = "Examina la ??? de Valkurm Dunes en (B-7) entre las 18:00 y las 4:00 para hacer aparecer a Doman (Fomor) y Onryo (Ghost), ambos de nivel 52 aproximadamente. La Survival Guide a Gustav Tunnel te deja justo fuera de (B-7).",
    ["Examine the ??? in the waterfall area at (G-6) to obtain the Ornate Package."] = "Examina la ??? en la zona de la cascada en (G-6) para obtener el Ornate Package.",
    ["Examine the ??? inside the room to spawn the NM Yagudo Muralist along with your Adventuring Fellow. Defeat it, speak with your Fellow, then examine the ??? again to obtain the key item. Another player must wait 3 minutes before spawning the NM again."] = "Examina la ??? de dentro de la sala para hacer aparecer al NM Yagudo Muralist junto con tu Adventuring Fellow. Derrótalo, habla con tu Fellow y examina de nuevo la ??? para obtener el key item. Otro jugador debe esperar 3 minutos antes de volver a hacer aparecer al NM.",
    ["Examine the ??? on a tree at (H-6) in Jugner Forest for a cutscene."] = "Examina la ??? de un árbol en (H-6) de Jugner Forest para una escena.",
    ["Examine the ??? on the ground floor of the Temple of the Goddess (G-8) (take the elevator). If you zone at any time after this, you have to start over with Salim."] = "Examina la ??? de la planta baja del Temple of the Goddess (G-8) (toma el ascensor). Si cambias de zona en cualquier momento tras esto, tienes que volver a empezar con Salim.",
    ["Examine the ??? on the south side of the oasis to spawn Maharaja, a tiger. Defeat it and examine the ??? again for the key item Annals of Truth."] = "Examina la ??? del lado sur del oasis para hacer aparecer a Maharaja, un tigre. Derrótalo y examina de nuevo la ??? para obtener el key item Annals of Truth.",
    ["Examine the ??? on the table to obtain the Firepower Case."] = "Examina la ??? de la mesa para obtener el Firepower Case.",
    ["Examine the ??? on the west side of the island at (I-11), at the cliff's edge, to spawn the NM Sturmtiger."] = "Examina la ??? del lado oeste de la isla en (I-11), al borde del acantilado, para hacer aparecer al NM Sturmtiger.",
    ["Examine the ??? there to spawn Gambilox Wanderling and defeat it. It respawns after 3 minutes for other party members; if the ??? only says it smells like a Goblin, wait a few minutes."] = "Examina allí la ??? para hacer aparecer a Gambilox Wanderling y derrótalo. Reaparece tras 3 minutos para otros miembros del grupo; si la ??? solo dice que huele a Goblin, espera unos minutos.",
    ["Examine the ??? to get the Stalactite dew."] = "Examina la ??? para obtener el Stalactite dew.",
    ["Examine the ??? to spawn Baronial Bat, weak to Wind and Light. Defeat it and examine the ??? again for the key item Annals of Truth."] = "Examina la ??? para hacer aparecer a Baronial Bat, débil a Wind y Light. Derrótalo y examina de nuevo la ??? para obtener el key item Annals of Truth.",
    ["Examine the ??? to spawn Beet Leafhopper, a fly weak to Ice. Defeat it and examine the ??? again for the key item Annals of Truth."] = "Examina la ??? para hacer aparecer a Beet Leafhopper, una mosca débil a Ice. Derrótala y examina de nuevo la ??? para obtener el key item Annals of Truth.",
    ["Examine the ??? to spawn Bodach, a skeleton weak to Fire and Light. Defeat it and examine the ??? again for the key item Annals of Truth."] = "Examina la ??? para hacer aparecer a Bodach, un esqueleto débil a Fire y Light. Derrótalo y examina de nuevo la ??? para obtener el key item Annals of Truth.",
    ["Examine the ??? to spawn Cailleach Bheur, a Black Mage skeleton weak to Fire and Light. Defeat it and examine the ??? again for the key item Annals of Truth."] = "Examina la ??? para hacer aparecer a Cailleach Bheur, un esqueleto Black Mage débil a Fire y Light. Derrótalo y examina de nuevo la ??? para obtener el key item Annals of Truth.",
    ["Examine the ??? to spawn Girtablulu, a scorpion weak to Ice and Light. Defeat it and examine the ??? again for the Annals of Truth."] = "Examina la ??? para hacer aparecer a Girtablulu, un escorpión débil a Ice y Light. Derrótalo y examina de nuevo la ??? para obtener los Annals of Truth.",
    ["Examine the ??? to spawn Greenman, a treant weak to Fire and Dark. Defeat it and examine the ??? again for the key item Annals of Truth."] = "Examina la ??? para hacer aparecer a Greenman, un treant débil a Fire y Dark. Derrótalo y examina de nuevo la ??? para obtener el key item Annals of Truth.",
    ["Examine the ??? to spawn Kettenkaefer, a beetle weak to Ice and Light. Defeat it and examine the ??? again for the key item Annals of Truth."] = "Examina la ??? para hacer aparecer a Kettenkaefer, un escarabajo débil a Ice y Light. Derrótalo y examina de nuevo la ??? para obtener el key item Annals of Truth.",
    ["Examine the ??? to spawn Megapod Megalops, a crab weak to Ice and Lightning. Defeat it and examine the ??? again for the key item Annals of Truth."] = "Examina la ??? para hacer aparecer a Megapod Megalops, un cangrejo débil a Ice y Lightning. Derrótalo y examina de nuevo la ??? para obtener el key item Annals of Truth.",
    ["Examine the ??? to spawn Mokumokuren, a hecteyes. Defeat it and examine the ??? again for the key item Annals of Truth."] = "Examina la ??? para hacer aparecer a Mokumokuren, un hecteyes. Derrótalo y examina de nuevo la ??? para obtener el key item Annals of Truth.",
    ["Examine the ??? to spawn Water Leaper, a pugil weak to Ice and Lightning. Defeat it and examine the ??? again for the key item Annals of Truth."] = "Examina la ??? para hacer aparecer a Water Leaper, un pugil débil a Ice y Lightning. Derrótalo y examina de nuevo la ??? para obtener el key item Annals of Truth.",
    ["Examine the ???."] = "Examina la ???.",
    ["Examine the Acid-eaten Door in Mount Zhayolm (I-9) for a short cutscene, then trade it 3 Slabs of Plumbago for the lightning cell."] = "Examina la Acid-eaten Door en Mount Zhayolm (I-9) para una escena corta y luego entrégale 3 Slabs of Plumbago para obtener la célula de rayo.",
    ["Examine the Audience Chamber door."] = "Examina la puerta de la Audience Chamber.",
    ["Examine the Audience Chamber in Ru'Lude Gardens (H-6). Then, in any order, get approval letters from Halver in Chateau d'Oraguille (I-9) (San d'Orian approval letter), Iron Eater in Metalworks (J-8) (Bastokan approval letter) and Kupipi in Heavens Tower (Windurstian approval letter)."] = "Examina la Audience Chamber en Ru'Lude Gardens (H-6). Luego, en cualquier orden, consigue cartas de aprobación de Halver en Chateau d'Oraguille (I-9) (San d'Orian approval letter), de Iron Eater en Metalworks (J-8) (Bastokan approval letter) y de Kupipi en Heavens Tower (Windurstian approval letter).",
    ["Examine the Audience Chamber to receive the Letter to Aldo."] = "Examina la Audience Chamber para recibir la Letter to Aldo.",
    ["Examine the Audience Chamber."] = "Examina la Audience Chamber.",
    ["Examine the Beastmen's Banner (F-8) while wearing the barbut to spawn the Diamond Quadav (WHM) and six other Quadav NMs. Only the Diamond Quadav has to be defeated; the others then disappear. It can use Benediction, which heals and wakes the NMs around it."] = "Examina el Beastmen's Banner (F-8) llevando el barbut para hacer aparecer al Diamond Quadav (WHM) y otros seis NMs Quadav. Solo hay que derrotar al Diamond Quadav; los demás desaparecen entonces. Puede usar Benediction, que cura y despierta a los NMs de alrededor.",
    ["Examine the Beastmen's Banner again while wearing the barbut for a cutscene, then trade the Quadav Barbut to it to receive Da'Vhu's Barbut."] = "Examina de nuevo el Beastmen's Banner llevando el barbut para una escena y luego entrégale el Quadav Barbut para recibir el Da'Vhu's Barbut.",
    ["Examine the Bulwark Gate again."] = "Examina de nuevo la Bulwark Gate.",
    ["Examine the Bulwark Gate in Sauromugue Champaign (S) at (E-6) again."] = "Examina de nuevo la Bulwark Gate en Sauromugue Champaign (S) en (E-6).",
    ["Examine the Cermet Portal again."] = "Examina de nuevo el Cermet Portal.",
    ["Examine the Cracked Wall at (G-8) to spawn Queen of Coins and Queen of Swords."] = "Examina la Cracked Wall en (G-8) para invocar a Queen of Coins y Queen of Swords.",
    ["Examine the Cracked Wall at (I-8)."] = "Examina la Cracked Wall en (I-8).",
    ["Examine the Cryptexphere (F-6) while wearing the helm to spawn the Orcish Overlord and six other Orc NMs. Only the Orcish Overlord has to be defeated; the others then disappear."] = "Examina la Cryptexphere (F-6) llevando el casco para hacer aparecer al Orcish Overlord y otros seis NMs Orc. Solo hay que derrotar al Orcish Overlord; los demás desaparecen entonces.",
    ["Examine the Cryptexphere again while wearing the helm for a cutscene, then trade the Orc Helm to it to receive Gadzradd's Helm."] = "Examina de nuevo la Cryptexphere llevando el casco para una escena y luego entrégale el Orc Helm para recibir el Gadzradd's Helm.",
    ["Examine the Dilapidated Gate in Misareaux Coast (F-7) for a cutscene. The Unity warp puts you right in front of this gate."] = "Examina la Dilapidated Gate en Misareaux Coast (F-7) para una escena. El warp de Unity te deja justo delante de esta puerta.",
    ["Examine the Door: Merchant's House in Lower Jeuno (G-11) again for another cutscene."] = "Examina de nuevo la Door: Merchant's House en Lower Jeuno (G-11) para otra escena.",
    ["Examine the Door: Merchant's House in Lower Jeuno for a cutscene and your rewards."] = "Examina la Door: Merchant's House en Lower Jeuno para una escena y tus recompensas.",
    ["Examine the Ergon Locus ??? again to spawn Deranged Ameretat (about 75,000 HP). It uses Sweet Breath and Bad Breath, and below 50% Extremely Bad Breath, which it skips while an enfeebling Indi- or Geo- effect is up. It has very high magic evasion and resists nearly all enfeebles, including Stun; ranged Trusts such as Apururu, Semih Lafihna or Tenzen II work well."] = "Examina de nuevo la ??? Ergon Locus para hacer aparecer a Deranged Ameretat (unos 75,000 HP). Usa Sweet Breath y Bad Breath, y por debajo del 50% Extremely Bad Breath, que no usa mientras haya activo un efecto Indi- o Geo- de debilitamiento. Tiene una evasión mágica muy alta y resiste casi todos los debilitamientos, incluido Stun; los Trusts a distancia como Apururu, Semih Lafihna o Tenzen II funcionan bien.",
    ["Examine the Fossil Rock at (F-8) on map 2 to spawn the NM Ichorous Ire, which drops a Burnite Shell."] = "Examina la Fossil Rock en (F-8) del mapa 2 para invocar al NM Ichorous Ire, que suelta una Burnite Shell.",
    ["Examine the Galka Statue again."] = "Examina de nuevo la Galka Statue.",
    ["Examine the Glowing Pebbles at (I-5) for a cutscene, then, on Dancer, trade them the Yagudo Glue for another."] = "Examina los Glowing Pebbles en (I-5) para una escena y luego, como Dancer, entrégales el Yagudo Glue para otra.",
    ["Examine the Gravestone at (H-8) to obtain the middle map piece."] = "Examina la Gravestone en (H-8) para obtener la pieza de mapa central.",
    ["Examine the Great Hall behind Halver."] = "Examina el Great Hall detrás de Halver.",
    ["Examine the Great Hall."] = "Examina el Great Hall.",
    ["Examine the Heavy Stone Door to face Corrupted Soffeil, Corrupted Yorgos, and Corrupted Ulbrig."] = "Examina la Heavy Stone Door para enfrentarte a Corrupted Soffeil, Corrupted Yorgos y Corrupted Ulbrig.",
    ["Examine the Hut Door to enter the battlefield."] = "Examina la Hut Door para entrar en el campo de batalla.",
    ["Examine the Imperial Whitegate in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (L-8) for a cutscene. Other cutscenes can play first, so keep examining it until this quest shows as active in your log. From here you no longer need to be on Blue Mage."] = "Examina la Imperial Whitegate en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (L-8) para una escena. Pueden salir otras escenas antes, así que sigue examinándola hasta que esta quest aparezca activa en tu registro. A partir de aquí ya no necesitas ser Blue Mage.",
    ["Examine the Imperial Whitegate in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (L-8/9) to receive the key item Imperial missive. The quest now appears under Aht Urhgan: Current Quests."] = "Examina la Imperial Whitegate en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (L-8/9) para recibir el key item Imperial missive. La quest aparece ahora en Aht Urhgan: Current Quests.",
    ["Examine the Imperial Whitegate in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (L-8/9) to receive the key item Present for Megomak."] = "Examina la Imperial Whitegate en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (L-8/9) para recibir el key item Present for Megomak.",
    ["Examine the Imperial Whitegate in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (L-8/9)."] = "Examina la Imperial Whitegate en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (L-8/9).",
    ["Examine the Inconspicuous Barrel in Western Adoulin (I-4) for a cutscene; it takes the Rune saber and the gem."] = "Examina el Inconspicuous Barrel de Western Adoulin (I-4) para una escena; se queda con el Rune saber y la gema.",
    ["Examine the Inconspicuous Barrel in Western Adoulin (I-4), near the Adoulin Waterfront waypoint, to hand over the Secrets of Runic Enhancement."] = "Examina el Inconspicuous Barrel de Western Adoulin (I-4), cerca del waypoint de Adoulin Waterfront, para entregar los Secrets of Runic Enhancement.",
    ["Examine the Iron Box again while wearing the coif for a cutscene, then trade the Goblin Coif to it to receive Choplix's Coif."] = "Examina de nuevo la Iron Box llevando la cofia para una escena y luego entrégale el Goblin Coif para recibir el Choplix's Coif.",
    ["Examine the Mahogany Door at (G-8) to confirm the Windurst Woods scoop."] = "Examina la Mahogany Door en (G-8) para confirmar la Windurst Woods scoop.",
    ["Examine the Memory Flux again."] = "Examina de nuevo el Memory Flux.",
    ["Examine the Memory Flux."] = "Examina el Memory Flux.",
    ["Examine the Molten Rift again to spawn Staumarth and defeat it (any job; the Apex Efts nearby don't aggro). It resists everything but Thunder and uses Spectral Floe and Scouring Spate. If you lose, just examine the Rift again; no new Ifritite needed. You receive the key item Frost-encrusted flame gem."] = "Examina de nuevo la Molten Rift para hacer aparecer a Staumarth y derrótalo (cualquier job; los Apex Efts de alrededor no atacan). Resiste todo menos Thunder y usa Spectral Floe y Scouring Spate. Si pierdes, examina de nuevo la Rift; no hace falta otra Ifritite. Recibes el key item Frost-encrusted flame gem.",
    ["Examine the Night Flowers down the ramp in Qufim Island (F-8) between 21:30 and 4:00 for a cutscene."] = "Examina las Night Flowers por la rampa de Qufim Island (F-8) entre las 21:30 y las 4:00 para una escena.",
    ["Examine the Odyssean Passage and enter it for a cutscene that completes the quest. You can now take part in Monstrosity."] = "Examina el Odyssean Passage y entra para una escena que completa la quest. Ya puedes participar en Monstrosity.",
    ["Examine the Old Toolbox at the intersection of (H-7) and (H-8) to receive the key item Old toolbox."] = "Examina el Old Toolbox en la intersección de (H-7) y (H-8) para recibir el key item Old toolbox.",
    ["Examine the Ornate Door again to enter the battlefield."] = "Examina de nuevo la Ornate Door para entrar en el campo de batalla.",
    ["Examine the Overgrown Grave again to spawn Ancestral Rage (about 70,000 HP). It has very high physical damage reduction (Monk's Formless Strikes doesn't work on it) and uses high-tier Earth and Dark magic, Sleepga II, area Drain and Aspir, Entomb (Petrify, Slow, hate reset) and Tenebral Crush (Defense Down). Repose and Lullaby can sleep it."] = "Examina de nuevo la Overgrown Grave para hacer aparecer a Ancestral Rage (unos 70,000 HP). Tiene una reducción de daño físico muy alta (las Formless Strikes de Monk no funcionan con él) y usa magia de Earth y Dark de alto nivel, Sleepga II, Drain y Aspir de área, Entomb (Petrify, Slow, reinicio del odio) y Tenebral Crush (Defense Down). Repose y Lullaby pueden dormirlo.",
    ["Examine the Primordial Convergence again for a cutscene and your reward. If you lose, Dabnorrin sells another Vessel of summoning for 5,000 Bayld, 10 Beastmen's Seals or 50,000 gil."] = "Examina de nuevo la Primordial Convergence para una escena y tu recompensa. Si pierdes, Dabnorrin vende otro Vessel of summoning por 5,000 Bayld, 10 Beastmen's Seals o 50,000 gil.",
    ["Examine the Prince's Royal Room (G/H-7) again to unlock Trust: Trion."] = "Examina de nuevo la Prince's Royal Room (G/H-7) para desbloquear Trust: Trion.",
    ["Examine the Prince's Royal Room (G/H-7)."] = "Examina la Prince's Royal Room (G/H-7).",
    ["Examine the Reinforced Gateway."] = "Examina el Reinforced Gateway.",
    ["Examine the Riverbed, choose a portion (sizable, moderate or small) and then how to wash (vigorously, thoroughly or gently), washing away as much sediment as you can without losing gold dust. Results are random, but \"A sizable portion\", \"Wash vigorously\", \"Wash thoroughly\" and then \"Wash gently\" over and over usually works until \"Wash carefully to extract gold\" appears; choose it."] = "Examina el Riverbed, elige una porción (sizable, moderate o small) y luego cómo lavar (vigorously, thoroughly o gently), quitando todo el sedimento posible sin perder polvo de oro. Los resultados son aleatorios, pero \"A sizable portion\", \"Wash vigorously\", \"Wash thoroughly\" y luego \"Wash gently\" una y otra vez suele funcionar hasta que aparece \"Wash carefully to extract gold\"; elígelo.",
    ["Examine the Rubious Crystal again."] = "Examina de nuevo el Rubious Crystal.",
    ["Examine the Rune of Release before the time limit runs out, or the mission fails even if all the objectives were met. Then speak with Rytaal in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10) to finalize the mission and hand back the Assault Orders."] = "Examina la Rune of Release antes de que se acabe el tiempo, o la misión falla aunque se hayan cumplido todos los objetivos. Después habla con Rytaal en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10) para cerrar la misión y devolver las Assault Orders.",
    ["Examine the Runic Seal in Alzadaal Undersea Ruins (I-8/9) to start the battle against Alexander; Trusts can't be used. He can spawn up to three Alexander Images, and at low HP uses Divine Judgment, dealing high damage to everyone in range."] = "Examina el Runic Seal en Alzadaal Undersea Ruins (I-8/9) para empezar la batalla contra Alexander; no se pueden usar Trusts. Puede hacer aparecer hasta tres Alexander Images y, con HP bajo, usa Divine Judgment, que causa mucho daño a todos los que estén en su alcance.",
    ["Examine the Runic Seal in Alzadaal Undersea Ruins (I-8/9) to start the battle against Alexander; Trusts can't be used. He can spawn up to three Alexander Images, and at low HP uses Divine Judgment, dealing high damage to everyone in range. The fight is aimed at level 75."] = "Examina el Runic Seal en Alzadaal Undersea Ruins (I-8/9) para empezar la batalla contra Alexander; no se pueden usar Trusts. Puede hacer aparecer hasta tres Alexander Images y, con HP bajo, usa Divine Judgment, que causa mucho daño a todos los que estén en su alcance. La pelea está pensada para nivel 75.",
    ["Examine the Sarcophagus at (I-9) to obtain the right map piece."] = "Examina el Sarcophagus en (I-9) para obtener la pieza de mapa derecha.",
    ["Examine the Shattered Telepoint."] = "Examina el Shattered Telepoint.",
    ["Examine the Spatial Displacement around (D-6)."] = "Examina el Spatial Displacement cerca de (D-6).",
    ["Examine the Spatial Displacement to enter the Ouryu battlefield."] = "Examina el Spatial Displacement para entrar en el campo de batalla Ouryu.",
    ["Examine the Stalagmite in the circular room at (H-10) on map 2 to spawn Polevik, an Earth Elemental. Don't fall down the hole in this room."] = "Examina la Stalagmite de la sala circular de (H-10) en el mapa 2 para hacer aparecer a Polevik, un Earth Elemental. No caigas por el agujero de esta sala.",
    ["Examine the Stone Door to enter Promyvion-Vahzl."] = "Examina la Stone Door para entrar en Promyvion-Vahzl.",
    ["Examine the Stone Lid while wearing the headgear to spawn the Yagudo Avatar with Duu Masa the Onecut, Fee Jugu the Ramfist, Goo Pake the Bloodhound, Kee Taw the Nightingale, Laa Yaku the Austere and Poo Yozo the Babbler. Only the Yagudo Avatar must be defeated; the others then despawn. Examine the Stone Lid again, wearing the headgear, for a cutscene."] = "Examina la Stone Lid llevando el tocado para hacer aparecer al Yagudo Avatar con Duu Masa the Onecut, Fee Jugu the Ramfist, Goo Pake the Bloodhound, Kee Taw the Nightingale, Laa Yaku the Austere y Poo Yozo the Babbler. Solo hay que derrotar al Yagudo Avatar; los demás desaparecen entonces. Examina de nuevo la Stone Lid, llevando el tocado, para una escena.",
    ["Examine the Throne Room door to enter the battlefield against Aquila and Haudrale."] = "Examina la Throne Room door para entrar en el campo de batalla contra Aquila y Haudrale.",
    ["Examine the Tiger Bones in the cave to spawn the Old Sabertooth, and watch it die naturally, which takes about three Earth minutes. Don't fight or otherwise disturb it, or you won't get the key item."] = "Examina los Tiger Bones de la cueva para hacer aparecer al Old Sabertooth y míralo morir de forma natural, lo que tarda unos tres minutos reales. No luches contra él ni lo molestes, o no conseguirás el key item.",
    ["Examine the Transcendental Radiance again to enter the Dawn battlefield."] = "Examina de nuevo la Transcendental Radiance para entrar en el campo de batalla Dawn.",
    ["Examine the Transcendental Radiance again to enter the battlefield, and defeat Eald'narche and Kam'lanaut."] = "Examina de nuevo la Transcendental Radiance para entrar en el campo de batalla y derrota a Eald'narche y Kam'lanaut.",
    ["Examine the Veridical Conflux again."] = "Examina de nuevo el Veridical Conflux.",
    ["Examine the Viscous Liquid again to spawn the NM Mamool Ja."] = "Examina de nuevo el Viscous Liquid para invocar al NM Mamool Ja.",
    ["Examine the Weathered Boat again for a cutscene and the Deluxe Carbine."] = "Examina de nuevo el Weathered Boat para una escena y la Deluxe Carbine.",
    ["Examine the Weathered Boat on the beach at (F-9) for a cutscene. The NM Rohemolipaud, an Elvaan Ranger, appears. After about 1,400 damage, or once the fight has gone on long enough, he uses Camouflage and the fight ends. Each party member who needs the quest must start the fight separately."] = "Examina el Weathered Boat de la playa en (F-9) para una escena. Aparece el NM Rohemolipaud, un Ranger Elvaan. Tras unos 1,400 de daño, o cuando la pelea dura lo suficiente, usa Camouflage y la pelea termina. Cada miembro del grupo que necesite la quest debe empezar la pelea por separado.",
    ["Examine the Yahse Wildflower in Yahse Hunting Grounds (K-7) for the key item Yahse wildflower petal."] = "Examina la Yahse Wildflower de Yahse Hunting Grounds (K-7) para obtener el key item Yahse wildflower petal.",
    ["Examine the blank target at the Nyzul Isle Staging Point in Alzadaal Undersea Ruins (J-8/9) for a cutscene."] = "Examina el objetivo vacío del Nyzul Isle Staging Point en Alzadaal Undersea Ruins (J-8/9) para una escena.",
    ["Examine the blue ??? at the top of the stairs."] = "Examina la ??? azul en lo alto de las escaleras.",
    ["Examine the door on the lower level of Bastok Mines (J-6), near the Alchemy Guild. It must be closed when you examine it; if another player has it open, the cutscene doesn't trigger."] = "Examina la puerta del nivel inferior de Bastok Mines (J-6), cerca del Alchemy Guild. Debe estar cerrada cuando la examines; si otro jugador la tiene abierta, la escena no se activa.",
    ["Examine the door to Prince Trion's room (Door: Prince Royal's Rm) at Chateau d'Oraguille (H-7) while you are a Paladin, for a cutscene. If you were a Paladin when you finished A Boy's Dream, you already had it. Check your active quests: you should see Under Oath. The rest of the quest can be completed as any job."] = "Examina la puerta de la habitación de Prince Trion (Door: Prince Royal's Rm) en Chateau d'Oraguille (H-7) siendo Paladin, para una escena. Si eras Paladin cuando terminaste A Boy's Dream, ya la viste. Revisa tus quests activas: deberías ver Under Oath. El resto de la quest puede completarse con cualquier job.",
    ["Examine the green Unstable Displacement in the northwest section of Riverne - Site #B01 (E-7) for a cutscene. You can warp and use the Home Point to get there, or farm one Giant Scale to get to (E-7) the long way."] = "Examina el Unstable Displacement verde en la sección noroeste de Riverne - Site #B01 (E-7) para una escena. Puedes teletransportarte y usar el Home Point para llegar, o farmear una Giant Scale para llegar a (E-7) por el camino largo.",
    ["Examine the key item Carrier pigeon letter (permanent key items) from The Stars of Ifrit. You receive it before the end of that quest, so you don't need to complete The Stars of Ifrit first."] = "Examina el key item Carrier pigeon letter (permanent key items) de The Stars of Ifrit. Lo recibes antes del final de esa quest, así que no hace falta completar The Stars of Ifrit primero.",
    ["Examine the pools on map 2 of Fei'Yin, located at (H-8), (H-5) and lastly (F-5). They are the little green marks on the map. Home Point #2, just outside the Cloister of Frost, is the closest warp."] = "Examina los estanques del mapa 2 de Fei'Yin, situados en (H-8), (H-5) y por último (F-5). Son las pequeñas marcas verdes del mapa. El Home Point #2, justo fuera del Cloister of Frost, es el warp más cercano.",
    ["Examine the sarcophagus again for a cutscene and your Beast Trousers."] = "Examina de nuevo el sarcófago para una escena y tus Beast Trousers.",
    ["Examine the second Cracked Wall at (J-8)."] = "Examina la segunda Cracked Wall en (J-8).",
    ["Examine the shimmering light."] = "Examina la luz brillante.",
    ["Examine the southern Rhinostery door in Windurst Waters (S)."] = "Examina la puerta sur del Rhinostery en Windurst Waters (S).",
    ["Examine the sparkling ??? beside a Cavernous Maw in Batallia Downs, Rolanberry Fields, or Sauromugue Champaign."] = "Examina la ??? reluciente junto a un Cavernous Maw en Batallia Downs, Rolanberry Fields o Sauromugue Champaign.",
    ["Examine the tombstone inside to receive the Ancient San d'Orian Book."] = "Examina la tombstone del interior para recibir el Ancient San d'Orian Book.",
    ["Examine the two doors to the Princes' quarters if you want to hear their additional dialogue."] = "Examina las dos puertas de los aposentos de los Princes si quieres oír su diálogo adicional.",
    ["Examine the unnamed target on a manhole cover at (L-7) in Mount Zhayolm for a cutscene that begins the quest. This quest requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack. Zurtermor has dropped his precious pickaxe into a crevasse."] = "Examina el objetivo sin nombre de una tapa de alcantarilla en (L-7) de Mount Zhayolm para una escena que empieza la quest. Esta quest requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan. Zurtermor ha dejado caer su valioso pico en una grieta.",
    ["Examining the ??? spawns two Pudding NMs; defeat them and examine it again for the key item Indigested ore. Trusts are allowed, and buffs (songs, rolls, Indi-bubbles) cast before the level restriction carry over."] = "Examinar la ??? hace aparecer dos NMs Pudding; derrótalos y examínala de nuevo para obtener el key item Indigested ore. Se permiten Trusts, y los buffs (canciones, rolls, burbujas Indi) lanzados antes de la restricción de nivel se mantienen.",
    ["Exit Norg into Sea Serpent Grotto. Head south until you reach the fork at (H-6) and go east. Turn south at (J-5), head east at (J-10), and turn east at (K-12)."] = "Sal de Norg a Sea Serpent Grotto. Ve al sur hasta la bifurcación de (H-6) y ve al este. Gira al sur en (J-5), ve al este en (J-10) y gira al este en (K-12).",
    ["Exit Norg into Sea Serpent Grotto. Once there, head south until you reach (H-7) and go west from there."] = "Sal de Norg a Sea Serpent Grotto. Una vez allí, ve al sur hasta (H-7) y desde allí ve al oeste.",
    ["Exit Norg, re-enter, and speak with Jaucribaix to receive the key item Yomotsu Hirasaka."] = "Sal de Norg, vuelve a entrar y habla con Jaucribaix para recibir el key item Yomotsu Hirasaka.",
    ["Exit Sealion's Den and examine the Phomiuna Aqueducts entrance on the bottom floor."] = "Sal de Sealion's Den y examina la entrada de Phomiuna Aqueducts en el piso inferior.",
    ["Exit east to Caedarva Mire and go to (I-10). Check the ??? on the east side of the pond for a cutscene."] = "Sal hacia el este a Caedarva Mire y ve a (I-10). Revisa la ??? en el lado este del estanque para una escena.",
    ["Exit the dock, then talk to Blandine again."] = "Sal del muelle y vuelve a hablar con Blandine.",
    ["Exit the fortress and examine ??? (I-9), then examine it again to face War Lynx."] = "Sal de la fortaleza y examina la ??? (I-9), luego examínala de nuevo para enfrentarte a War Lynx.",
    ["Exoray Mold: drops from Exorays (uncommon), or collect three Exoray mold crumbs in Crawlers' Nest. Run past the crawlers and bees, up the hill, drop into the \"sack room\" and head south-south-west (not the south-south-east dead end): ??? on the path from (I-10), map 1, towards map 3, and another further along at (I-6), map 3. Use Sneak around the Exorays."] = "Exoray Mold: lo sueltan los Exorays (poco común), o reúne tres Exoray mold crumbs en Crawlers' Nest. Pasa corriendo junto a los crawlers y las abejas, sube la colina, déjate caer a la \"sala de los sacos\" y ve al sur-suroeste (no al callejón sin salida del sur-sureste): ??? en el camino de (I-10), mapa 1, hacia el mapa 3, y otra más adelante en (I-6), mapa 3. Usa Sneak cerca de los Exorays.",
    ["Fall off the path to the one below at (H-8) and continue north. Follow the path until you find the ??? at (H-3). Interacting with it gives you a Sea serpent statue."] = "Déjate caer del camino al de abajo en (H-8) y sigue al norte. Sigue el camino hasta encontrar la ??? en (H-3). Al interactuar con ella recibes una Sea serpent statue.",
    ["Famous biologist Professor Clavauert is researching apkallu on Ilrusi Atoll. The more discoveries he makes in Aht Urhgan, the more likely he is to join the Empire. Assist him by capturing apkallu. Mission orders: capture the apkallu."] = "El famoso biólogo Professor Clavauert investiga a los apkallu en Ilrusi Atoll. Cuantos más descubrimientos haga en Aht Urhgan, más probable es que se una al Empire. Ayúdale capturando apkallu. Órdenes de la misión: capturar a los apkallu.",
    ["Farm Topaz Quadav enemies until you obtain a Quadav Mage Blood. Only one is needed if you are doing this with a group."] = "Farmea enemigos Topaz Quadav hasta obtener una Quadav Mage Blood. Solo hace falta una si lo haces en grupo.",
    ["Fastest: The Boyahda Tree Home Point or Unity Warp puts you on map 2; run to (G-10) and go south into the tunnel to map 3, then continue south to the ??? at (J-8)."] = "Lo más rápido: el Home Point o el Unity Warp de The Boyahda Tree te deja en el mapa 2; corre hasta (G-10) y ve al sur por el túnel hasta el mapa 3, y sigue al sur hasta la ??? en (J-8).",
    ["Fastest: take Ifrit's Cauldron Home Point #1 to map 7, run south and then north to drop off the lip at (J-4), then go south to transition M at (J-8) onto map 6, and north to the ???."] = "Lo más rápido: toma el Home Point #1 de Ifrit's Cauldron al mapa 7, corre al sur y luego al norte para dejarte caer del borde en (J-4), luego ve al sur hasta la transición M de (J-8) al mapa 6 y al norte hasta la ???.",
    ["Fastest: the Proto-Waypoint warp to North Gustaberg puts you almost at the Waterfall Base (walk east and over the bridge to the north)."] = "Lo más rápido: el warp de Proto-Waypoint a North Gustaberg te deja casi en la Waterfall Base (camina al este y cruza el puente hacia el norte).",
    ["Fastest: the Unity Warp (level 122) puts you in the Oubliette past the drop; head east through connection B to the ??? at (I-8). Otherwise, with Silent Oil, go to the Chateau d'Oraguille, take the eastern door of the entry hall and follow the path north into the Oubliette. Inside, go south to (H-7/8), then west to (E-7/8) and drop down; head south, then west, turning south whenever you have to, until (F-9), then go east along the path to the ??? at (I-8)."] = "Lo más rápido: el Unity Warp (nivel 122) te deja en el Oubliette pasada la caída; ve al este por la conexión B hasta la ??? en (I-8). Si no, con Silent Oil, ve al Chateau d'Oraguille, toma la puerta este del vestíbulo y sigue el camino al norte hasta el Oubliette. Dentro, ve al sur hasta (H-7/8), luego al oeste hasta (E-7/8) y déjate caer; ve al sur y luego al oeste, girando al sur cuando sea necesario, hasta (F-9), y después al este por el camino hasta la ??? en (I-8).",
    ["Fastest: the Unity Warp (level 128) puts you in the tunnel leading to the NM, with a Grounds Tome nearby for Sneak and Invisible; head north hugging the east wall to the ??? near the (I-9)/(J-9) intersection. Otherwise, with Silent Oil and Prism Powder, follow the path to (G-9) and take the western tunnel, go east at its fork, and from the large room take the eastern tunnel at (I-8) to the ??? at (I-9), map 2."] = "Lo más rápido: el Unity Warp (nivel 128) te deja en el túnel que lleva al NM, con un Grounds Tome cerca para Sneak e Invisible; ve al norte pegado a la pared este hasta la ??? cerca del cruce de (I-9)/(J-9). Si no, con Silent Oil y Prism Powder, sigue el camino hasta (G-9) y toma el túnel oeste, ve al este en su bifurcación y, desde la sala grande, toma el túnel este de (I-8) hasta la ??? en (I-9), mapa 2.",
    ["Fastest: the Unity Warp (level 128) to Den of Rancor puts you on the ledge at (G-12); drop down the east side and walk south-east to the ??? at (I-13). Den of Rancor Home Point #1 also puts you on the right map."] = "Lo más rápido: el Unity Warp (nivel 128) a Den of Rancor te deja en la cornisa de (G-12); déjate caer por el lado este y camina al sureste hasta la ??? en (I-13). El Home Point #1 de Den of Rancor también te deja en el mapa correcto.",
    ["Fastest: the Unity Warp to Cape Teriggan (level 128) brings you to (H-7); the Cloister of Gales Home Point (F-5) and the Survival Guide at the Outpost (G-8) also work. Otherwise, with Silent Oil and Prism Powder, go through Kuftal Tunnel: from (I-7) head north without taking any branches; at (I-4) the tunnel loops south into a larger space, so curve straight back north-west and exit into Cape Teriggan."] = "Lo más rápido: el Unity Warp a Cape Teriggan (nivel 128) te lleva a (H-7); el Home Point del Cloister of Gales (F-5) y la Survival Guide del Outpost (G-8) también sirven. Si no, con Silent Oil y Prism Powder, ve por Kuftal Tunnel: desde (I-7) ve al norte sin tomar desvíos; en (I-4) el túnel gira al sur hacia un espacio mayor, así que tuerce enseguida de vuelta al noroeste y sal a Cape Teriggan.",
    ["Feed the chocobo standing next to Osker by trading it one Gausebit Grass. You can feed it once every real-life minute (counted from :00, not from your last try). The command /item \"Gausebit Grass\" <t> speeds this up; stand closer to the chocobo than to Osker so F8 retargets it."] = "Alimenta al chocobo que está junto a Osker entregándole una Gausebit Grass. Puedes alimentarlo una vez por minuto real (contado desde :00, no desde tu último intento). El comando /item \"Gausebit Grass\" <t> lo agiliza; colócate más cerca del chocobo que de Osker para que F8 lo vuelva a seleccionar.",
    ["Fight Schultz and his Crimson Grimoire. You win when Schultz is down to about 20% HP; the Grimoire does not have to be defeated. Engage quickly, since both buff themselves if left alone, and neither can be slept reliably. If you are not using Trusts or are undergeared, defeat the Grimoire first, as it has much less HP."] = "Lucha contra Schultz y su Crimson Grimoire. Ganas cuando Schultz baja a un 20% de HP aproximadamente; no hace falta derrotar al Grimoire. Ataca rápido, ya que ambos se potencian si los dejas, y ninguno se puede dormir con fiabilidad. Si no usas Trusts o vas con poco equipo, derrota primero al Grimoire, que tiene mucho menos HP.",
    ["Fight Valkeng. It starts as a Harlequin Frame (Dia II, Slapstick) and every 30 seconds switches by the damage it has taken most: melee makes it Valoredge (fast, accurate, very high physical damage reduction), ranged makes it Sharpshot (ranged attacks every 5 seconds, low physical defense), magic makes it Stormwaker (elemental magic every 10 seconds, very high magic defense). Mixing damage types helps. After the fight, your answer in the cutscene doesn't matter."] = "Lucha contra Valkeng. Empieza como Harlequin Frame (Dia II, Slapstick) y cada 30 segundos cambia según el tipo de daño que más haya recibido: cuerpo a cuerpo lo convierte en Valoredge (rápido, preciso, reducción de daño físico muy alta), a distancia en Sharpshot (ataques a distancia cada 5 segundos, defensa física baja), y la magia en Stormwaker (magia elemental cada 10 segundos, defensa mágica muy alta). Mezclar tipos de daño ayuda. Tras la pelea, tu respuesta en la escena da igual.",
    ["Fill each test tube at its Mythralline Wellspring (the ??? at each pond), in any order. Enter Wajaom Woodlands through the Ironbound Gate at (H-10) and Bhaflau Thickets through the Ironbound Gate at (H-7)."] = "Llena cada tubo de ensayo en su Mythralline Wellspring (la ??? de cada estanque), en cualquier orden. Entra en Wajaom Woodlands por la Ironbound Gate de (H-10) y en Bhaflau Thickets por la Ironbound Gate de (H-7).",
    ["Final cutscene: if you have killed Fenrir after reaching Windurst Rank 10, you have the Dark Mana Orb among your temporary key items. Zone, then speak with Kohlo-Lakolo again with that key item for a final, concluding cutscene."] = "Escena final: si has matado a Fenrir tras alcanzar el Windurst Rank 10, tienes la Dark Mana Orb entre tus key items temporales. Cambia de zona y luego habla de nuevo con Kohlo-Lakolo con ese key item para una escena final de cierre.",
    ["Finally, enter the southern Eldieme Necropolis entrance from Batallia Downs at (I-10)."] = "Por último, entra por la entrada sur de Eldieme Necropolis desde Batallia Downs en (I-10).",
    ["Finally, return to Kubhe Ijyuhla to complete the quest. She rewards you with an Imperial Bronze Piece."] = "Por último, vuelve con Kubhe Ijyuhla para completar la quest. Te recompensa con una Imperial Bronze Piece.",
    ["Finally, speak with Alois in the conference room of the President's Office in Metalworks (J-8) to complete the quest and receive the Fukuro."] = "Por último, habla con Alois en la sala de conferencias de la President's Office en Metalworks (J-8) para completar la quest y recibir el Fukuro.",
    ["Finally, speak with Saliyahf at (G-7) for your reward, 3 Imperial Bronze Pieces, and to finish the quest."] = "Por último, habla con Saliyahf en (G-7) por tu recompensa, 3 Imperial Bronze Pieces, y para terminar la quest.",
    ["Find Munahda's package at a targetable spot in Al Zahbi; it moves after another player finds it. Possible spots: (G-7) in the water, (G-8) at the entrance to the south tunnel, (I-10) in the chocobo alley, (J-7) behind Kahah Hobichai, (I-5) Flameserpent Square, (H-9) in the tunnel from Galeserpent Square to the chocobo alley, and (J-9) Galeserpent Square."] = "Busca el paquete de Munahda en un punto seleccionable de Al Zahbi; se mueve cuando otro jugador lo encuentra. Puntos posibles: (G-7) en el agua, (G-8) en la entrada del túnel sur, (I-10) en el callejón de los chocobos, (J-7) detrás de Kahah Hobichai, (I-5) Flameserpent Square, (H-9) en el túnel de Galeserpent Square al callejón de los chocobos, y (J-9) Galeserpent Square.",
    ["Find Varchet in Southern San d'Oria at (L-6), right next to the fountains. You need to gamble against him; each attempt costs 5 gil, so keep trying until you win. You can still gamble with him after the quest is complete."] = "Encuentra a Varchet en Southern San d'Oria en (L-6), justo al lado de las fuentes. Tienes que apostar contra él; cada intento cuesta 5 gil, así que sigue intentándolo hasta ganar. Puedes seguir apostando con él después de completar la quest.",
    ["Find Zantaviat just inside Davoi."] = "Encuentra a Zantaviat nada más entrar en Davoi.",
    ["Find a Warhorse Hoofprint and examine it for the key item Dark Rider hoofprint. It shows up on widescan and can be in Bhaflau Thickets, Caedarva Mire, Mount Zhayolm or Wajaom Woodlands."] = "Busca una Warhorse Hoofprint y examínala para obtener el key item Dark Rider hoofprint. Aparece en el widescan y puede estar en Bhaflau Thickets, Caedarva Mire, Mount Zhayolm o Wajaom Woodlands.",
    ["Find a player who matches the description and make a party with them. Then return to Halver while in the same party as the match. Having a female character in the party does not force Halver to ask for that character; the choice is random."] = "Encuentra a un jugador que coincida con la descripción y forma grupo con él. Luego vuelve con Halver estando en el mismo grupo que esa persona. Tener un personaje femenino en el grupo no obliga a Halver a pedir ese personaje; la elección es aleatoria.",
    ["Find an NPC who tells you the switch order without talking to others who call the guards on your Mithra and Tarutaru friends. Folzen (ground floor, Galka kid by the Blacksmiths' Guild) tells you the number of switches; Darha (ground floor, Galka near Home Point #2), Helmut (ground floor, old Hume near Home Point #2), Hungry Wolf (upper floor, Craftsmen's Eatery, south of Cid's Lab) and Striking Snake (upper floor, Gunpowder Room, north of Cid's Lab) give the order, which can differ. Costume kit pieces: Knitted hat for Folzen, Spectacles for Helmut, Heels for the others."] = "Busca un NPC que te diga el orden de los interruptores sin hablar con otros que llaman a los guardias contra tus amigos Mithra y Tarutaru. Folzen (planta baja, niño Galka junto al Blacksmiths' Guild) te dice el número de interruptores; Darha (planta baja, Galka cerca del Home Point #2), Helmut (planta baja, Hume anciano cerca del Home Point #2), Hungry Wolf (planta superior, Craftsmen's Eatery, al sur del Cid's Lab) y Striking Snake (planta superior, Gunpowder Room, al norte del Cid's Lab) te dan el orden, que puede variar. Piezas del Costume kit: Knitted hat para Folzen, Spectacles para Helmut, Heels para los demás.",
    ["Find and open the Treasure Coffer in Kuftal Tunnel to obtain the Large trick box."] = "Busca y abre el Treasure Coffer de Kuftal Tunnel para obtener la Large trick box.",
    ["Find his father, Exoroche, in Southern San d'Oria at (K-7) in Helbort's Blade."] = "Encuentra a su padre, Exoroche, en Southern San d'Oria en (K-7), en Helbort's Blade.",
    ["Find the ??? at the southwest corner of (H-10) in the middle of the valley and trade it your Pickaxe for a cutscene and your reward, the Rogue's Poulaines. Other types of pickaxe do not work."] = "Busca la ??? en la esquina suroeste de (H-10), en medio del valle, y entrégale tu Pickaxe para una escena y tu recompensa, las Rogue's Poulaines. Otros tipos de pico no sirven.",
    ["Find the ??? hidden beneath the stairs on the southern boat at (H-10) to receive the key item Antique automaton. This is not the ??? used for the Corsair quest, and you don't need a Lamian Fang Key to reach it."] = "Busca la ??? escondida bajo las escaleras del barco del sur en (H-10) para recibir el key item Antique automaton. No es la ??? de la quest de Corsair, y no necesitas una Lamian Fang Key para llegar.",
    ["Find the ??? in Dangruf Wadi to get a Dangruf Stone. The monsters around the ??? are level 90 to 95; only the Goblins are aggressive, and they can be avoided with just Invisible since they do not have pets. You lose Invisible when riding the geyser at (I-8) in Dangruf Wadi, so Field Support from the Grounds Tome will fail."] = "Encuentra la ??? en Dangruf Wadi para conseguir una Dangruf Stone. Los monstruos alrededor de la ??? son de nivel 90 a 95; solo los Goblins son agresivos, y se pueden evitar con solo Invisible ya que no tienen mascotas. Pierdes Invisible al montar el geyser en (I-8) de Dangruf Wadi, así que el Field Support del Grounds Tome fallará.",
    ["Find the Warhorse Hoofprint and click on it to place the Quartz transmitter. The Warhorse Hoofprint is visible on Widescan and is found in four different zones: Bhaflau Thickets, Caedarva Mire, Mount Zhayolm and Wajaom Woodlands."] = "Busca la Warhorse Hoofprint y haz clic en ella para colocar el Quartz transmitter. La Warhorse Hoofprint es visible con Widescan y se encuentra en cuatro zonas distintas: Bhaflau Thickets, Caedarva Mire, Mount Zhayolm y Wajaom Woodlands.",
    ["Find the cave at (E-7) in Xarcabard and examine the ???: after a cutscene a Koenigstiger appears. Defeat it. Everyone needs their own cutscene and kill; it respawns in about 3 minutes."] = "Busca la cueva de (E-7) en Xarcabard y examina la ???: tras una escena aparece un Koenigstiger. Derrótalo. Cada uno necesita su propia escena y su propia muerte; reaparece en unos 3 minutos.",
    ["Find the piece of the old floorplans in the Sacrarium and bring it back to Nivorajean for your reward, the Map of the Sacrarium."] = "Encuentra el trozo de los planos antiguos en Sacrarium y llévaselo a Nivorajean por tu recompensa, el Map of the Sacrarium.",
    ["First Rubious Crystal:"] = "Primer Rubious Crystal:",
    ["First enter any Promyvion area, and return to Harith in the Grand Duke's house in Ru'Lude Gardens (H-5) without erasing your memory at the Large Apparatus."] = "Primero entra en cualquier zona de Promyvion y vuelve con Harith a la casa del Grand Duke en Ru'Lude Gardens (H-5) sin borrar tu memoria en el Large Apparatus.",
    ["First envelope: in Sauromugue Champaign, examine the ??? at the towers (G-6, G/H-8, I/J-7, J/K-8, K-9 and I-9/10) until Climbpix Highrise appears; the tower is random. The right spots say it is impossible to climb the wall with bare hands. The I-9/10 tower is reached with the Survival Guide, the Voidwatch warp, the Cavernous Maw in Sauromugue Champaign (S), or through the third Banishing Gate of Garlaige Citadel."] = "Primer sobre: en Sauromugue Champaign, examina la ??? de las torres (G-6, G/H-8, I/J-7, J/K-8, K-9 e I-9/10) hasta que aparezca Climbpix Highrise; la torre es aleatoria. Los puntos correctos dicen que es imposible escalar la pared con las manos desnudas. A la torre de I-9/10 se llega con la Survival Guide, el warp de Voidwatch, el Cavernous Maw de Sauromugue Champaign (S) o por la tercera Banishing Gate de Garlaige Citadel.",
    ["First go to the second floor of the house at (G-7) in Southern San d'Oria and read the diary there until you have read up to Page 4. This quest requires the Chains of Promathia pack, and follows A Squire's Test II."] = "Primero ve al segundo piso de la casa en (G-7) de Southern San d'Oria y lee el diario hasta llegar a la Page 4. Esta quest requiere el pack Chains of Promathia y sigue a A Squire's Test II.",
    ["First goblin, Saltvix (Rock Salt): at the ??? in the western part of the room at G-7 (the ??? is in F-7)."] = "Primer goblin, Saltvix (Rock Salt): en la ??? de la parte oeste de la sala de G-7 (la ??? está en F-7).",
    ["First head to Rabao and talk to Rudolfo (J-7). You need to have completed Promathia Mission 2-1 and have the Chains of Promathia pack. A young cargo hauler named Sanctia has suddenly left Rabao, and Zoriboh wants you to find her; she has probably headed for Norg to board a ship bound for the Tavnazian Marquisate."] = "Primero ve a Rabao y habla con Rudolfo (J-7). Debes haber completado Promathia Mission 2-1 y tener el pack Chains of Promathia. Una joven transportista llamada Sanctia se ha ido de pronto de Rabao, y Zoriboh quiere que la encuentres; probablemente se ha dirigido a Norg para embarcar en un barco con destino al Tavnazian Marquisate.",
    ["First start Voidwatch Ops: Border Crossing with Kieran in Norg and receive the key item Ashen Stratum Abyssite."] = "Empieza primero Voidwatch Ops: Border Crossing con Kieran en Norg y recibe el key item Ashen Stratum Abyssite.",
    ["Fish a Ripped Cap out of the water and trade it to Paytah."] = "Pesca una Ripped Cap del agua y entrégala a Paytah.",
    ["Fish for Paladin Lobster at (G-10), Scutum Crab at (J-7), and Lance Fish at (H-9)."] = "Pesca Paladin Lobster en (G-10), Scutum Crab en (J-7) y Lance Fish en (H-9).",
    ["Fish in Castle Oztroja with a rod used for catching big fish, using the Giant Shell Bug as bait. Bring more than one Giant Shell Bug."] = "Pesca en Castle Oztroja con una caña para pescar peces grandes, usando el Giant Shell Bug como cebo. Lleva más de un Giant Shell Bug.",
    ["Fish up 60 different types of fish, with any rod. Fish caught before the quest count, and Katsunaga in Mhaura (H-9) can tell you how many you have. If you already have 60, Jourdenaux moves on to the next step."] = "Pesca 60 tipos de peces distintos, con cualquier caña. Los peces pescados antes de la quest cuentan, y Katsunaga en Mhaura (H-9) te puede decir cuántos tienes. Si ya tienes 60, Jourdenaux pasa al siguiente paso.",
    ["Fish up the Hydrogauge in Al Zahbi, Aht Urhgan Whitegate, Nashmau or on the Nashmau - Al Zahbi ferry, with any rod and bait (it gives the normal item message). A big-fish rod such as the S.H. Fishing Rod with Insect Balls in Whitegate works well, since few fish there get in the way."] = "Pesca el Hydrogauge en Al Zahbi, Aht Urhgan Whitegate, Nashmau o en el ferry Nashmau - Al Zahbi, con cualquier caña y cebo (da el mensaje normal de objeto). Una caña para peces grandes como la S.H. Fishing Rod con Insect Balls en Whitegate va bien, ya que allí hay pocos peces que estorben.",
    ["Fishing tip: with a Lu Shang's Fishing Rod you can do this at fishing skill 32. Fishing in Nashmau with Minnow, Sinking Minnow and Crayfish Balls eventually gives 4 of the 5 fish, and the Istavrit can be fished in Talacca Cove with a Sinking Minnow. You can also catch 4 of the 5 in Talacca Cove and the Istiridye in Nashmau."] = "Consejo de pesca: con una Lu Shang's Fishing Rod puedes hacerlo con habilidad de pesca 32. Pescando en Nashmau con Minnow, Sinking Minnow y Crayfish Balls acabas consiguiendo 4 de los 5 pescados, y el Istavrit se puede pescar en Talacca Cove con un Sinking Minnow. También puedes pescar 4 de los 5 en Talacca Cove y el Istiridye en Nashmau.",
    ["Fjalar in Attohwa Chasm: rifts at (I-9), (K-7) and (K-10)."] = "Fjalar en Attohwa Chasm: rifts en (I-9), (K-7) y (K-10).",
    ["Floor 1: password #1 is in the room at (H-9). At the Brass Door at (I-8), pull a lever and run back (50% chance of a trap door); try the other lever if needed. The stairs at (J-8) lead to map 2."] = "Piso 1: la contraseña n.º 1 está en la sala de (H-9). En la Brass Door de (I-8), tira de una palanca y vuelve corriendo (50% de probabilidad de trampilla); prueba la otra palanca si hace falta. Las escaleras de (J-8) llevan al mapa 2.",
    ["Floor 2: turn right at the first intersection and run west to (G-7) (map 6), then north to map 7 for password #2 at (H-9). Back at the first intersection, go south to the fork at (H-10) and turn left; a hidden door in the east wall at (I-10) shows the lever pattern. Password #3 is in the room at the north-west corner of (I-8). Open the Brass Door at (G-8) with the levers; beyond it, enemies get tougher. Continue to (G-9) and map 3."] = "Piso 2: gira a la derecha en el primer cruce y corre al oeste hasta (G-7) (mapa 6), luego al norte al mapa 7 para la contraseña n.º 2 en (H-9). De vuelta en el primer cruce, ve al sur hasta la bifurcación de (H-10) y gira a la izquierda; una puerta oculta en la pared este en (I-10) muestra el patrón de palancas. La contraseña n.º 3 está en la sala de la esquina noroeste de (I-8). Abre la Brass Door de (G-8) con las palancas; más allá, los enemigos son más duros. Continúa hasta (G-9) y el mapa 3.",
    ["Floor 3: follow the path up the stairs to (H-11), avoiding the leech pool (they aggro by sound)."] = "Piso 3: sigue el camino escaleras arriba hasta (H-11), evitando el estanque de sanguijuelas (detectan por sonido).",
    ["Floor 4: light any torch in the corner rooms at (G-7), (G-8), (H-7) or (H-8) to open the Brass Door at (H-7) and run through before it closes (Reraise helps; a Thief can Hide). Enter the three passwords at the Brass Statue in any order, with proper capitalization; a wrong one is reported immediately. Release your Trusts first, or they may not fall with you (/returntrust all, or relog)."] = "Piso 4: enciende cualquier antorcha de las salas de las esquinas en (G-7), (G-8), (H-7) o (H-8) para abrir la Brass Door de (H-7) y cruza corriendo antes de que se cierre (Reraise ayuda; un Thief puede usar Hide). Introduce las tres contraseñas en la Brass Statue en cualquier orden, con las mayúsculas correctas; una incorrecta se avisa al instante. Despide antes a tus Trusts, o puede que no caigan contigo (/returntrust all, o reconecta).",
    ["Follow the Gate Guard's instructions and return to Prince Trion in Prince's Royal Room (G/H-7)."] = "Sigue las instrucciones del Gate Guard y vuelve con Prince Trion en la Prince's Royal Room (G/H-7).",
    ["Follow the hallway to the next Stone Door."] = "Sigue el pasillo hasta la siguiente Stone Door.",
    ["Follow the path north to (I-8), then stand on the geyser in the southeastern corner until it carries you onto the ledge."] = "Sigue el camino al norte hasta (I-8), luego colócate sobre el géiser de la esquina sureste hasta que te lleve a la cornisa.",
    ["Follow the right wall until the path turns north, then take the left path at the three-way intersection to reach the bridge."] = "Sigue la pared derecha hasta que el camino gire al norte, luego toma el camino de la izquierda en la intersección de tres vías para llegar al puente.",
    ["Follow the route to the transporter at (G-12)."] = "Sigue la ruta hasta el transportador en (G-12).",
    ["Follow the surface path south past the Mute at (F-9), under the bridge and past the second Afflictor, then east around the giant smokestacks at (G-9)/(H-9). When it's raining, a ??? appears near the base of the smokestacks; examine it for the key item Corrupted dirt."] = "Sigue el camino de superficie al sur pasando a The Mute en (F-9), bajo el puente y pasando al segundo Afflictor, y luego al este rodeando las enormes chimeneas de (G-9)/(H-9). Cuando llueve aparece una ??? cerca de la base de las chimeneas; examínala para obtener el key item Corrupted dirt.",
    ["Follow the trail: examine the ??? next to Noam (G-9, second floor) to receive the Shaded Cruse, then the ??? up the ramp to the north (G-7), the one by the open doors on the left (G-8), the one in the hallway (H-8), and the last one in the bottom right corner of (H-8)."] = "Sigue el rastro: examina la ??? junto a Noam (G-9, segundo piso) para recibir el Shaded Cruse, luego la ??? subiendo la rampa al norte (G-7), la de junto a las puertas abiertas a la izquierda (G-8), la del pasillo (H-8) y la última en la esquina inferior derecha de (H-8).",
    ["For The Curious Case of Melvien you can get the Gladiatorial Writ of Summons from any of the Suspicious NPCs (choose Belligerency). If you only want it for the Mog Garden, return the writ afterwards, or you stay flagged for Belligerency in its zones."] = "Para The Curious Case of Melvien puedes conseguir el Gladiatorial Writ of Summons de cualquiera de los NPCs Suspicious (elige Belligerency). Si solo lo quieres para el Mog Garden, devuelve el writ después, o seguirás marcado para Belligerency en sus zonas.",
    ["For the battle you need an Imperial Silver Piece, Remnants Permit or Captain Wildcat badge; the area can only be reached this way. Take the Home Point to Caedarva Mire, or go west out of Nashmau, then go to (E-11) and speak with Nasheefa to enter the Alzadaal Undersea Ruins."] = "Para la batalla necesitas una Imperial Silver Piece, un Remnants Permit o una Captain Wildcat badge; solo se puede llegar a la zona así. Toma el Home Point a Caedarva Mire, o sal de Nashmau por el oeste, luego ve a (E-11) y habla con Nasheefa para entrar en Alzadaal Undersea Ruins.",
    ["For the last crumb, go back to the sack room and take the north-west tunnel (not the scorpion dead end), through the green glow and up the hill into a new sack room, take the west-south-west tunnel, turn right at the ledge (don't drop) and left into the dead-end room: ??? at (G-10), map 2, among the Exorays."] = "Para la última miga, vuelve a la sala de los sacos y toma el túnel del noroeste (no el callejón sin salida de los escorpiones), atraviesa el brillo verde y sube la colina hasta otra sala de sacos, toma el túnel oeste-suroeste, gira a la derecha en la cornisa (no te dejes caer) y a la izquierda hacia la sala sin salida: ??? en (G-10), mapa 2, entre los Exorays.",
    ["For the repeat you also need a Light Ore: trade it to the Qu'Hau Spring during a full moon between 18:00 and 06:00 for the key item Moonlight ore (each player needs their own, and only after accepting the quest). A used Ark Pentasphere doesn't work again, so trade a new Illuminink and Parchment separately; if you trade all three together you only get the Moonlight ore."] = "Para repetirla también necesitas un Light Ore: entrégalo a la Qu'Hau Spring durante la luna llena entre las 18:00 y las 06:00 para obtener el key item Moonlight ore (cada jugador necesita el suyo, y solo tras aceptar la quest). Una Ark Pentasphere usada no vuelve a servir, así que entrega por separado un nuevo Illuminink y un Parchment; si entregas los tres juntos solo obtienes el Moonlight ore.",
    ["Form a party of two, yourself and one other player, with the same allegiance, then speak with him again to complete the quest."] = "Forma un grupo de dos, tú y otro jugador, con la misma allegiance, y luego habla de nuevo con él para completar la quest.",
    ["Form a party of two, yourself and one other player, with the same job, then speak with him again to complete the quest."] = "Forma un grupo de dos, tú y otro jugador, con el mismo trabajo, y luego habla de nuevo con él para completar la quest.",
    ["Form a party of two, yourself and one other player, with the same race, then speak with him again to complete the quest."] = "Forma un grupo de dos, tú y otro jugador, con la misma raza, y luego habla de nuevo con él para completar la quest.",
    ["Form a party with at least two people who are level 40 or lower. Trusts and Adventuring Fellows don't count, but Level Sync works."] = "Forma un grupo con al menos dos personas de nivel 40 o inferior. Los Trusts y los Adventuring Fellows no cuentan, pero Level Sync sí funciona.",
    ["From Yhoator Jungle, follow the path to the T-intersection, head north and exit the Temple. Faster: the Voidwatch warp puts you outside the Temple (exit 1, map 1), and the Survival Guide warp inside it (exit 2); from either, follow the left wall to the granite door at (J-7), go through and on to (K-3) to exit the Temple (exit 4)."] = "Desde Yhoator Jungle, sigue el camino hasta el cruce en T, ve al norte y sal del Temple. Más rápido: el warp de Voidwatch te deja fuera del Temple (salida 1, mapa 1) y el warp de la Survival Guide dentro (salida 2); desde cualquiera de los dos, sigue la pared izquierda hasta la puerta de granito en (J-7), crúzala y continúa hasta (K-3) para salir del Temple (salida 4).",
    ["From here on you can be any job. At this point you can commission Dhima Polevhia to craft three Artifact pieces."] = "A partir de aquí puedes ir con cualquier job. En este punto puedes encargar a Dhima Polevhia que fabrique tres piezas de Artifact.",
    ["From the Fly Agaric room, take the southwest passage (to Point C, G-6/H-6) to reach map 2, and proceed to the large room at (G-7)."] = "Desde la sala de los Fly Agaric, toma el pasaje suroeste (hacia Point C, G-6/H-6) para llegar al mapa 2 y avanza hasta la sala grande en (G-7).",
    ["From the Temple of Uggalepih's main entrance, take every right turn to exit at (F-5), then hug the left wall in Yhoator Jungle to re-enter the temple at (H-11)."] = "Desde la entrada principal del Temple of Uggalepih, toma todos los giros a la derecha para salir por (F-5), luego pégate a la pared izquierda en Yhoator Jungle para volver a entrar en el templo por (H-11).",
    ["From there go west and south as you can until you come to the tunnel at (F-8) that leads back to the surface; you pass one Afflictor that curses you as you proceed."] = "Desde allí ve al oeste y al sur según puedas hasta llegar al túnel en (F-8) que vuelve a la superficie; pasas junto a un Afflictor que te maldice al avanzar.",
    ["From there head south and you will go into a cave that leads down. Take it down until it exits at (H-7) on the lower map."] = "Desde allí ve al sur y entrarás en una cueva que baja. Bájala hasta que salga en (H-7) del mapa inferior.",
    ["Garlaige route: go south and east through the first Banishing Gate, run round the outside of the square room to the east, down the stairs and hug the left wall to a wide room: ??? at (I-8). Go north-west to the next room: ??? at (H-7). Continue north, turn left down a hallway, and past the third Banishing Gate the last ??? is on your right in the first room at (G-6). Don't fall in the holes in the floor."] = "Ruta de Garlaige: ve al sur y al este por la primera Banishing Gate, rodea por fuera la sala cuadrada del este, baja las escaleras y pégate a la pared izquierda hasta una sala amplia: ??? en (I-8). Ve al noroeste a la sala siguiente: ??? en (H-7). Sigue al norte, gira a la izquierda por un pasillo y, pasada la tercera Banishing Gate, la última ??? está a tu derecha en la primera sala, en (G-6). No caigas por los agujeros del suelo.",
    ["Gather all 5 pieces, a Mannequin Body, Feet, Hands, Head and Legs, and trade them to Fyi Chalmwoh. They can also be bought from player bazaars."] = "Reúne las 5 piezas, Mannequin Body, Feet, Hands, Head y Legs, y entrégaselas a Fyi Chalmwoh. También se pueden comprar en bazares de jugadores.",
    ["Gather those items and trade them to Amaura to receive the key item Cold medicine."] = "Reúne esos objetos y entrégaselos a Amaura para recibir el key item Cold medicine.",
    ["General Afkaam is to inspect Leujaoam Sanctum. Mission orders: remove all threats. The recommended level is 50."] = "General Afkaam va a inspeccionar Leujaoam Sanctum. Órdenes de la misión: eliminar todas las amenazas. El nivel recomendado es 50.",
    ["Generals Karazahm and Umarid of the Imperial Army's Arrapago division have disappeared from camp headquarters while on a mission on Sharug Isle. Mission orders: locate the generals."] = "Los Generals Karazahm y Umarid de la división Arrapago del Imperial Army han desaparecido del cuartel del campamento durante una misión en Sharug Isle. Órdenes de la misión: localizar a los generales.",
    ["Get 3 Slabs of Plumbago from the Auction House, from Trolls in Mount Zhayolm or by mining. Examine the Acid-eaten Door at the north-west corner of (I-9) in Mount Zhayolm, past the Gates of Halvung near the Halvung Staging Point (opening those gates needs a Cast metal plate), for Megomak's shopping list."] = "Consigue 3 Slabs of Plumbago en la Auction House, de los Trolls de Mount Zhayolm o minando. Examina la Acid-eaten Door de la esquina noroeste de (I-9) en Mount Zhayolm, pasadas las Gates of Halvung cerca del Halvung Staging Point (abrir esas puertas requiere una Cast metal plate), para obtener la lista de la compra de Megomak.",
    ["Get a Block of Yagudo Glue from Yagudo Pipers, Lutenists, Chanters, Conductors or Drummers in a Shadowreign zone; Castle Oztroja (S), via the Meriphataud Mountains (S) Survival Guide, is easiest."] = "Consigue un Block of Yagudo Glue de los Yagudo Pipers, Lutenists, Chanters, Conductors o Drummers de una zona de Shadowreign; Castle Oztroja (S), mediante la Survival Guide de Meriphataud Mountains (S), es lo más fácil.",
    ["Get a Kuftal Coffer Key in Kuftal Tunnel, or buy one from the Curio Vendor Moogle. Quickest: the Survival Guide from Vollbow, or the Unity Warp (level 125) to Kuftal Tunnel."] = "Consigue una Kuftal Coffer Key en Kuftal Tunnel, o compra una al Curio Vendor Moogle. Lo más rápido: la Survival Guide desde Vollbow, o el Unity Warp (nivel 125) a Kuftal Tunnel.",
    ["Get a Lamian Fang Key. Free once per game day: in Caedarva Mire map 1, examine the ??? west of the southern pool at (I-7). From the Arrapago Reef Survival Guide, zone out to Caedarva Mire at (I-6) and walk south; on foot, take Nashmau's north exit into Caedarva Mire. The key also drops from Lamiae and Draugers in Arrapago Reef (about 16 minute respawn, 5 possible ones before the gate), but the free one is easier."] = "Consigue una Lamian Fang Key. Gratis una vez por día de juego: en el mapa 1 de Caedarva Mire, examina la ??? al oeste del estanque sur en (I-7). Desde la Survival Guide de Arrapago Reef, sal a Caedarva Mire por (I-6) y camina al sur; a pie, toma la salida norte de Nashmau hacia Caedarva Mire. La llave también la sueltan las Lamiae y los Draugers de Arrapago Reef (reaparecen cada 16 minutos aproximadamente, 5 posibles antes de la puerta), pero la gratuita es más fácil.",
    ["Get a Lamian Fang Key: from the ??? near a pond a short way from the Arrapago Reef entrance at (I-6) in Caedarva Mire (beware of the green swamp water there), from Lamia and Draugar inside the reef, or pick the Iron Gate's lock as a Thief. The Survival Guide to Arrapago Reef is the quickest start: zone out to fetch the key and come back in from (I-6)."] = "Consigue una Lamian Fang Key: de la ??? junto a un estanque, a poca distancia de la entrada de Arrapago Reef en (I-6) de Caedarva Mire (cuidado con el agua verde de la ciénaga), de las Lamia y los Draugar dentro del arrecife, o forzando la cerradura de la Iron Gate como Thief. La Survival Guide a Arrapago Reef es el inicio más rápido: sal para buscar la llave y vuelve a entrar por (I-6).",
    ["Get a Pickaxe from the Auction House or a merchant; Numa (E-7), in the shop down the stairs in front of the Steaming Sheep, sells them."] = "Consigue un Pickaxe en la Auction House o de un mercader; Numa (E-7), en la tienda bajando las escaleras frente al Steaming Sheep, los vende.",
    ["Get a Pickaxe. If you have the La Theine Plateau Proto-Waypoint, you can warp to the valley and skip the cave route below, but zone into Ordelle's Caves and back out first or you will not be able to trade the pickaxe."] = "Consigue un Pickaxe. Si tienes el Proto-Waypoint de La Theine Plateau, puedes teletransportarte al valle y saltarte la ruta por la cueva de abajo, pero entra en Ordelle's Caves y vuelve a salir antes, o no podrás entregar el pico.",
    ["Get a pair of Moccasins: buy them at the Auction House, get them as a drop from various enemies, or craft them (Leathercraft level 59)."] = "Consigue un par de Moccasins: cómpralos en la Auction House, consíguelos como drop de varios enemigos o fabrícalos (Leathercraft nivel 59).",
    ["Get the Opal Silk and Saber Shoot by trading Liks and Gugrusauruses to Zaldon in Selbina (about a 0.5% chance each)."] = "Consigue la Opal Silk y el Saber Shoot entregando Liks y Gugrusauruses a Zaldon en Selbina (alrededor del 0.5% cada uno).",
    ["Get two cutscenes in the Alzadaal Undersea Ruins: take the Runic Portal to the Nyzul Isle Staging Point and use the north exit. Step on the north-east teleporter at (H-8) (toward Silver Sea Remnants), take the east teleporter in the next room, then the west one. Arriving at (H-9), walk toward the exit for the first cutscene."] = "Consigue dos escenas en Alzadaal Undersea Ruins: toma el Runic Portal al Nyzul Isle Staging Point y usa la salida norte. Pisa el teletransportador noreste de (H-8) (hacia Silver Sea Remnants), toma el teletransportador este de la sala siguiente y luego el oeste. Al llegar a (H-9), camina hacia la salida para la primera escena.",
    ["Give the Purple Ribbon to Kerutoto in the northern Rhinostery building in Windurst Waters South (J-8) for 3,600 gil."] = "Entrega la Purple Ribbon a Kerutoto en el edificio norte de la Rhinostery en Windurst Waters South (J-8) por 3,600 gil.",
    ["Give the flower to Moari-Kaaori to receive your reward: an Iron Sword the first time and 400 gil on later completions."] = "Entrega la flor a Moari-Kaaori para recibir tu recompensa: una Iron Sword la primera vez y 400 gil en las siguientes.",
    ["Go around the left side of the lake in the large room to the ??? at its north-west corner, on a rock near the tunnel going west (not by the water). Examine it for a cutscene and the key item Forgotten hexagun."] = "Rodea por la izquierda el lago de la sala grande hasta la ??? de su esquina noroeste, sobre una roca cerca del túnel que va al oeste (no junto al agua). Examínala para una escena y el key item Forgotten hexagun.",
    ["Go back and speak with Balasiel to receive your reward."] = "Vuelve y habla con Balasiel para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Go back and speak with Brutus to receive your reward, the Decimation weapon skill."] = "Vuelve y habla con Brutus para recibir tu recompensa, el weapon skill Decimation.",
    ["Go back and speak with Cid to receive your reward, the Detonator weapon skill."] = "Vuelve y habla con Cid para recibir tu recompensa, el weapon skill Detonator.",
    ["Go back and speak with Curilla to receive your reward."] = "Vuelve y habla con Curilla para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Go back and speak with Deraquien."] = "Vuelve y habla con Deraquien.",
    ["Go back and speak with Gumbah to receive your reward, the Ground Strike weapon skill."] = "Vuelve y habla con Gumbah para recibir tu recompensa, el weapon skill Ground Strike.",
    ["Go back and speak with Iron Eater to receive your reward, the Steel Cyclone weapon skill."] = "Vuelve y habla con Iron Eater para recibir tu recompensa, el weapon skill Steel Cyclone.",
    ["Go back and speak with Jaucribaix to receive your reward, the weapon skill Tachi: Kasha."] = "Vuelve y habla con Jaucribaix para recibir tu recompensa, el weapon skill Tachi: Kasha.",
    ["Go back and speak with Kuroido-Moido to receive your reward, the Black Halo weapon skill."] = "Vuelve y habla con Kuroido-Moido para recibir tu recompensa, el weapon skill Black Halo.",
    ["Go back and speak with Novalmauge to receive your reward."] = "Vuelve y habla con Novalmauge para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Go back and speak with Oggbi to receive your Temple Gaiters."] = "Vuelve y habla con Oggbi para recibir tus Temple Gaiters.",
    ["Go back and speak with Oggbi to receive your reward."] = "Vuelve y habla con Oggbi para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Go back and speak with Perih Vashai to receive your reward, the Empyreal Arrow weapon skill."] = "Vuelve y habla con Perih Vashai para recibir tu recompensa, el weapon skill Empyreal Arrow.",
    ["Go back and speak with Ryoma to receive your reward, the weapon skill Blade: Ku."] = "Vuelve y habla con Ryoma para recibir tu recompensa, el weapon skill Blade: Ku.",
    ["Go back and speak with Shantotto to receive your reward, the Retribution weapon skill."] = "Vuelve a hablar con Shantotto para recibir tu recompensa, el weapon skill Retribution.",
    ["Go back to Gantineux, who gives you the key item Gantineux's letter and tells you to deliver it to Eperdur."] = "Vuelve con Gantineux, que te da el key item Gantineux's letter y te dice que se la entregues a Eperdur.",
    ["Go back to Imasuke, who tells you to find someone who can translate the ring."] = "Vuelve con Imasuke, que te dice que busques a alguien que pueda traducir el anillo.",
    ["Go back to Iruki-Waraki in Aht Urhgan Whitegate to receive your Turbo Animator."] = "Vuelve con Iruki-Waraki en Aht Urhgan Whitegate para recibir tu Turbo Animator.",
    ["Go back to Kazham and talk to Etteh Sulaej."] = "Vuelve a Kazham y habla con Etteh Sulaej.",
    ["Go back to Wahid and trade the Siren's Tear to complete the quest and receive 150 gil. If you are doing this quest for a Vana'Bout objective and have already completed it once, you do not need to speak to Wahid again to start it."] = "Vuelve con Wahid y entrega la Siren's Tear para completar la quest y recibir 150 gil. Si haces esta quest para un objetivo de Vana'Bout y ya la completaste una vez, no necesitas hablar de nuevo con Wahid para empezarla.",
    ["Go back to Windurst Woods and speak with Nanaa Mihgo. The correct answer is \"Blank\", but any answer progresses the quest."] = "Vuelve a Windurst Woods y habla con Nanaa Mihgo. La respuesta correcta es \"Blank\", pero cualquier respuesta hace avanzar la quest.",
    ["Go back to the Tavnazian Safehold and talk to Enaremand again for your reward, the Mannequin Pumps."] = "Vuelve a Tavnazian Safehold y habla de nuevo con Enaremand por tu recompensa, el Mannequin Pumps.",
    ["Go north to the Acolyte Hostel (K-6) and interact with each of the six doors on the ground floor to play Quiz de Vana'diel. Answer a question correctly, then go to another door, until you have 4 to 6 correct answers."] = "Ve al norte hasta el Acolyte Hostel (K-6) e interactúa con cada una de las seis puertas de la planta baja para jugar a Quiz de Vana'diel. Responde correctamente una pregunta y luego ve a otra puerta, hasta tener de 4 a 6 respuestas correctas.",
    ["Go past the Silver Door at (N-14): examine the door three times and trade it a Silver Beastcoin to get through. You keep the Silver Beastcoin."] = "Pasa la Silver Door de (N-14): examina la puerta tres veces y entrégale una Silver Beastcoin para pasar. Te quedas con la Silver Beastcoin.",
    ["Go through Banishing Gate #1 at (I-9) on map 1, then Banishing Gate #2 at (H-10) on map 2."] = "Atraviesa la Banishing Gate #1 en (I-9) del mapa 1 y luego la Banishing Gate #2 en (H-10) del mapa 2.",
    ["Go through Banishing Gate #1 to Map 2: examine the ??? west of the intersection at (F-9), then the one across the hall to the east at (F/G-9), then go back toward the gate for the one at (G-8/9), and round the edge of the large room (avoid the holes in the middle) to the one at (G-7)."] = "Cruza la Banishing Gate #1 al mapa 2: examina la ??? al oeste del cruce en (F-9), luego la del otro lado del pasillo al este en (F/G-9), vuelve hacia la puerta para la de (G-8/9) y rodea el borde de la sala grande (evita los agujeros del centro) hasta la de (G-7).",
    ["Go to (D-4) and examine the north-east sarcophagus (clear the room first if you are low level) to spawn two tigers, Taifun and Trombe, and a hound, Sturm. Only Sturm has to be defeated, and the tigers can be charmed to help you."] = "Ve a (D-4) y examina el sarcófago del noreste (limpia antes la sala si eres de nivel bajo) para hacer aparecer dos tigres, Taifun y Trombe, y un sabueso, Sturm. Solo hay que derrotar a Sturm, y los tigres se pueden encantar para que te ayuden.",
    ["Go to (G-8) and examine the Iron Box while wearing the coif to spawn the Goblin Preceptor (RDM) with Grimoire Guru Grimogek, Dread Dealing Dredodak and four Bugbear Portermen. Only the Goblin Preceptor has to be defeated; the others then disappear."] = "Ve a (G-8) y examina la Iron Box llevando la cofia para hacer aparecer al Goblin Preceptor (RDM) con Grimoire Guru Grimogek, Dread Dealing Dredodak y cuatro Bugbear Portermen. Solo hay que derrotar al Goblin Preceptor; los demás desaparecen entonces.",
    ["Go to (G-8) on the first map of the Temple of Uggalepih and hang the picture at the Stone Picture Frame, on the south wall of the Paintbrush Room, to spawn the Golem NM Trompe L'Oeil. The Temple of Uggalepih Survival Guide warp puts you a short distance from the Stone Frame."] = "Ve a (G-8) del primer mapa del Temple of Uggalepih y cuelga el cuadro en el Stone Picture Frame, en la pared sur de la Paintbrush Room, para invocar al NM Golem Trompe L'Oeil. El warp de la Survival Guide del Temple of Uggalepih te deja a poca distancia del Stone Frame.",
    ["Go to (G-9) and examine the Gravestone for another cutscene. The Magicked astrolabe lets you get there solo."] = "Ve a (G-9) y examina la Gravestone para otra escena. El Magicked astrolabe te permite llegar tú solo.",
    ["Go to (G-9) in Aht Urhgan Whitegate and talk to Eunheem."] = "Ve a (G-9) en Aht Urhgan Whitegate y habla con Eunheem.",
    ["Go to (H-8) on map 1 to reach map 2."] = "Ve a (H-8) del mapa 1 para llegar al mapa 2.",
    ["Go to (I-10) on map 2 and examine the ??? to spawn three Wyrmfly (Fly NMs)."] = "Ve a (I-10) del mapa 2 y examina la ??? para invocar a tres Wyrmfly (Fly NMs).",
    ["Go to (I-5) in Jugner Forest (S), near the Batallia Downs (S) zone line (Survival Guide there, the Cavernous Maw, or Recall-Jugner). Examine the glowing pebbles spot by the shore for a cutscene and the key item Stardust pebble. It doesn't actually glow: target around (I-5) and watch the target names."] = "Ve a (I-5) en Jugner Forest (S), cerca del límite de zona de Batallia Downs (S) (allí hay Survival Guide, el Cavernous Maw o Recall-Jugner). Examina el punto de los guijarros brillantes junto a la orilla para una escena y el key item Stardust pebble. En realidad no brilla: apunta alrededor de (I-5) y fíjate en los nombres de objetivo.",
    ["Go to (I-5) in Port Bastok and speak with Ensetsu."] = "Ve a (I-5) de Port Bastok y habla con Ensetsu.",
    ["Go to (J-8) and examine the ??? that is not glowing (there are two side by side) for a cutscene that spawns Magic Sludge, a Dark Elemental NM. It is highly resistant to physical damage and somewhat to magic. Only the person who started the cutscene gets credit, and another can only be spawned 3 minutes after it dies."] = "Ve a (J-8) y examina la ??? que no brilla (hay dos una al lado de otra) para una escena que hace aparecer a Magic Sludge, un NM Dark Elemental. Es muy resistente al daño físico y algo a la magia. Solo quien inició la escena obtiene el crédito, y no se puede hacer aparecer otro hasta 3 minutos después de que muera.",
    ["Go to (K-9) in Behemoth's Dominion and examine the ??? to spawn three Goblin NMs: Doglix Muttsnout (Lv.58 WHM), Moxnix Nightgoggle (Lv.58 RNG) and Picklix Longindex (Lv.60 THF). All three use Bomb Toss often. They can be spawned once per game day (\"It is too blurry to read\" means wait), and the fight can be done on any job once the quest is active."] = "Ve a (K-9) en Behemoth's Dominion y examina la ??? para hacer aparecer tres NMs Goblin: Doglix Muttsnout (Lv.58 WHM), Moxnix Nightgoggle (Lv.58 RNG) y Picklix Longindex (Lv.60 THF). Los tres usan Bomb Toss a menudo. Se pueden hacer aparecer una vez por día de juego (\"It is too blurry to read\" significa que hay que esperar), y la pelea puede hacerse con cualquier job una vez activa la quest.",
    ["Go to Arrapago Reef (H-10), map 1, and examine the ??? (the same one as in Luck of the Draw) for a cutscene. You end up in the right area after finishing Against All Odds."] = "Ve a Arrapago Reef (H-10), mapa 1, y examina la ??? (la misma que en Luck of the Draw) para una escena. Acabas en la zona correcta tras terminar Against All Odds.",
    ["Go to Arrapago Reef. Use the Arrapago Reef Survival Guide to get there quickly; if you do not have it, you can get it by walking from Nashmau or take the long way using the Azouph Isle Staging Point from Aht Urhgan Whitegate. You need a Lamian Fang Key to get to the ???."] = "Ve a Arrapago Reef. Usa la Survival Guide de Arrapago Reef para llegar rápido; si no la tienes, puedes conseguirla andando desde Nashmau o tomar el camino largo con el Azouph Isle Staging Point desde Aht Urhgan Whitegate. Necesitas una Lamian Fang Key para llegar a la ???.",
    ["Go to Balrahn Way for another cutscene. When presented an option, choose \"Where have you been\"."] = "Ve a Balrahn Way para otra escena. Cuando te den una opción, elige \"Where have you been\".",
    ["Go to Bastok Markets (Home Point #1) and look for Michea at (F-10), upstairs inside Brunhilde the Armorer's shop."] = "Ve a Bastok Markets (Home Point #1) y busca a Michea en (F-10), arriba dentro de la tienda de Brunhilde the Armorer.",
    ["Go to Bastok Markets (S) and speak with Raginmund near Harmodio's Music Shop (L-10)."] = "Ve a Bastok Markets (S) y habla con Raginmund cerca de Harmodio's Music Shop (L-10).",
    ["Go to Bastok Markets and speak with Shamarhaan at (F-9) for a cutscene and the key item Valkeng's memory chip. He asks you to retrieve an item from Mount Zhayolm."] = "Ve a Bastok Markets y habla con Shamarhaan en (F-9) para una escena y el key item Valkeng's memory chip. Te pide recuperar un objeto de Mount Zhayolm.",
    ["Go to Bastok Metalworks and speak with Naji (J-8) in front of the President's Office for a cutscene. You may need to speak with him several times to get the right cutscene."] = "Ve a Bastok Metalworks y habla con Naji (J-8) frente al President's Office para una escena. Puede que tengas que hablar con él varias veces para ver la escena correcta.",
    ["Go to Bastok Metalworks and speak with Naji (J-8) in front of the President's Office to begin the embassy mission."] = "Ve a Bastok Metalworks y habla con Naji (J-8) frente al President's Office para empezar la misión de embajada.",
    ["Go to Bastok Metalworks and speak with Naji (J-8) in front of the President's Office."] = "Ve a Bastok Metalworks y habla con Naji (J-8) frente al President's Office.",
    ["Go to Bastok Mines and speak with Pavvke in his residence on the lower level (I-7) for a cutscene that completes the quest and gives you your reward."] = "Ve a Bastok Mines y habla con Pavvke en su residencia del nivel inferior (I-7) para una escena que completa la quest y te da tu recompensa.",
    ["Go to Bastok Mines and speak with Virnage at (I-5) for a cutscene. Agree to his proposal and you receive the Dawn talisman."] = "Ve a Bastok Mines y habla con Virnage en (I-5) para una escena. Acepta su propuesta y recibes el Dawn talisman.",
    ["Go to Beadeaux and open a Treasure Coffer with a Beadeaux Coffer Key, or pick the lock as a Thief. The Curio Vendor Moogle sells the key. You don't need to be on White Mage for this; you receive the key item Old gauntlets."] = "Ve a Beadeaux y abre un Treasure Coffer con una Beadeaux Coffer Key, o fuerza la cerradura como Thief. El Curio Vendor Moogle vende la llave. No necesitas ser White Mage para esto; recibes el key item Old gauntlets.",
    ["Go to Beadeaux and proceed to one of the sets of machines. You need to visit an Afflictor, which curses whoever comes near it unless they are currently silenced, and a Mute, which silences whoever touches it. So get cursed first by coming near the Afflictor, then touch the Mute to become silenced."] = "Ve a Beadeaux y dirígete a uno de los conjuntos de máquinas. Debes visitar un Afflictor, que maldice a quien se acerque a menos que esté silenciado, y un Mute, que silencia a quien lo toque. Así que primero maldícete acercándote al Afflictor y luego toca el Mute para quedar silenciado.",
    ["Go to Beadeaux and steal from Garnet Quadav, Silver Quadav, Zircon Quadav and Bronze Quadav until you obtain the Quadav Stew."] = "Ve a Beadeaux y roba a Garnet Quadav, Silver Quadav, Zircon Quadav y Bronze Quadav hasta obtener el Quadav Stew.",
    ["Go to Bibiki Bay and take the Manaclipper to Purgonorgo Isle (Map 2), or use the Voidwatch teleport, which is the fastest way."] = "Ve a Bibiki Bay y toma el Manaclipper a Purgonorgo Isle (mapa 2), o usa el teletransporte de Voidwatch, que es lo más rápido.",
    ["Go to Bibiki Bay and take the Manaclipper to Purgonorgo Isle. Buy a ticket from Tswe Panipahr, and ask Fheli Lapatzuo (H-7) at the docks which boat is the right one. If you have Bismarck access, the Voidwatch teleport also works."] = "Ve a Bibiki Bay y toma el Manaclipper a Purgonorgo Isle. Compra un billete a Tswe Panipahr y pregunta a Fheli Lapatzuo (H-7) en los muelles qué barco es el correcto. Si tienes acceso a Bismarck, el teletransporte de Voidwatch también sirve.",
    ["Go to Bibiki Bay and take the Manaclipper tour to Purgonorgo Isle."] = "Ve a Bibiki Bay y toma el tour del Manaclipper a Purgonorgo Isle.",
    ["Go to Boneyard Gully through Attohwa Chasm, which you enter from the Maze of Shakhrami. Cross the bridge to the east side, go into the caves at (I-8) and follow the tunnel up to the surface at (F-7); the next tunnel at (F-6) leads to Boneyard Gully (the Attohwa Chasm Home Point is just before it)."] = "Ve a Boneyard Gully pasando por Attohwa Chasm, a la que se entra desde Maze of Shakhrami. Cruza el puente al lado este, entra en las cuevas de (I-8) y sigue el túnel hasta la superficie en (F-7); el siguiente túnel, en (F-6), lleva a Boneyard Gully (el Home Point de Attohwa Chasm está justo antes).",
    ["Go to Carpenters' Landing, entering from Jugner Forest (J-8) (the Carpenters' Landing Survival Guide puts you one square east). At (I-10), touch the ??? on a red mushroom near the south-west corner to spawn the Orc NM Bullheaded Grosvez."] = "Ve a Carpenters' Landing, entrando desde Jugner Forest (J-8) (la Survival Guide de Carpenters' Landing te deja una casilla al este). En (I-10), toca la ??? de una seta roja cerca de la esquina suroeste para hacer aparecer al NM Orc Bullheaded Grosvez.",
    ["Go to Castle Oztroja and defeat the Yagudo Parasite in the pond on the third floor (H-9) for a Parasite Skin."] = "Ve a Castle Oztroja y derrota al Yagudo Parasite en el estanque del tercer piso (H-9) para obtener una Parasite Skin.",
    ["Go to Castle Oztroja and head to the door at (I-8) on the first map."] = "Ve a Castle Oztroja y dirígete a la puerta en (I-8) del primer mapa.",
    ["Go to Castle Zvahl Baileys and defeat Demon Generals, Magistrates, Chancellors or Commanders for a Whine Cellar Key. They are at the bottom of the four corner areas of Map 3; fall from Map 2 to get there. If Borghertz's Sorcerous Hands is still unfinished, take it up to its Castle Zvahl Baileys part to save a trip."] = "Ve a Castle Zvahl Baileys y derrota Demon Generals, Magistrates, Chancellors o Commanders para obtener una Whine Cellar Key. Están al fondo de las cuatro zonas de las esquinas del mapa 3; déjate caer desde el mapa 2 para llegar. Si Borghertz's Sorcerous Hands sigue sin terminar, avánzala hasta su parte de Castle Zvahl Baileys para ahorrarte un viaje.",
    ["Go to Castle Zvahl Baileys and open a Treasure Coffer with a Zvahl Coffer Key, or pick the lock as a Thief. The Curio Vendor Moogle sells the key. You don't need to be on Bard for this; you receive the key item Old gauntlets."] = "Ve a Castle Zvahl Baileys y abre un Treasure Coffer con una Zvahl Coffer Key, o fuerza la cerradura como Thief. El Curio Vendor Moogle vende la llave. No necesitas ser Bard para esto; recibes el key item Old gauntlets.",
    ["Go to Chateau d'Oraguille and examine Trion's door (Prince Royal's Room, H-7) to receive the Gallant Leggings."] = "Ve a Chateau d'Oraguille y examina la puerta de Trion (Prince Royal's Room, H-7) para recibir las Gallant Leggings.",
    ["Go to Chateau d'Oraguille and speak with Halver. If you have just cleared The Voracious Resurgence, you will have to rezone after the cutscene and speak with him again."] = "Ve a Chateau d'Oraguille y habla con Halver. Si acabas de completar The Voracious Resurgence, tendrás que cambiar de zona tras la escena y hablar de nuevo con él.",
    ["Go to Cirdas Caverns (M-8/9) and examine the Overgrown Grave for a cutscene (Augural Conveyor, or the Yorcia Weald Frontier Station; clear any Colonization Reive in the way)."] = "Ve a Cirdas Caverns (M-8/9) y examina la Overgrown Grave para una escena (Augural Conveyor, o la Frontier Station de Yorcia Weald; despeja cualquier Colonization Reive que bloquee el camino).",
    ["Go to Crawlers' Nest and open a Treasure Coffer with a Nest Coffer Key, or pick the lock as a Thief. The Curio Vendor Moogle sells the key. You don't need to be on Beastmaster for this; you receive the key item Old gauntlets."] = "Ve a Crawlers' Nest y abre un Treasure Coffer con una Nest Coffer Key, o fuerza la cerradura como Thief. El Curio Vendor Moogle vende la llave. No necesitas ser Beastmaster para esto; recibes el key item Old gauntlets.",
    ["Go to Crawlers' Nest and open a Treasure Coffer with a Nest Coffer Key, or pick the lock as a Thief. The Curio Vendor Moogle sells the key. You don't need to be on Monk for this; you receive the key item Old gauntlets."] = "Ve a Crawlers' Nest y abre un Treasure Coffer con una Nest Coffer Key, o fuerza la cerradura como Thief. El Curio Vendor Moogle vende la llave. No necesitas ser Monk para esto; recibes el key item Old gauntlets.",
    ["Go to Davoi and defeat Purpleflash Brukdok (BLM) at (E-9)/(F-9) to obtain a Davoi Storage Key. It drops one key and respawns after about 10 minutes; each Red Mage doing the quest needs a key. To get there, enter the creek from the broken bridge at (I-8) or the ramp at (J-10), take the west fork at (I-9) and follow it to the ramp out at (D-8). Bring Sneak and Invisible; some enemies on the way aggro even at level 99."] = "Ve a Davoi y derrota a Purpleflash Brukdok (BLM) en (E-9)/(F-9) para obtener una Davoi Storage Key. Suelta una llave y reaparece tras unos 10 minutos; cada Red Mage que haga la quest necesita una llave. Para llegar, entra en el arroyo desde el puente roto de (I-8) o la rampa de (J-10), toma el ramal oeste en (I-9) y síguelo hasta la rampa de salida en (D-8). Lleva Sneak e Invisible; algunos enemigos del camino atacan incluso a nivel 99.",
    ["Go to Davoi and examine the Hide Flap at (K-9)/(K-10) to spawn Barakbok and Gavotvut."] = "Ve a Davoi y examina la Hide Flap en (K-9)/(K-10) para hacer aparecer a Barakbok y Gavotvut.",
    ["Go to Davoi, enter the Monastic Cavern and open a Treasure Coffer with a Davoi Coffer Key, or pick the lock as a Thief. The Curio Vendor Moogle sells the key. You don't need to be on Thief for this; you receive the key item Old gauntlets."] = "Ve a Davoi, entra en el Monastic Cavern y abre un Treasure Coffer con una Davoi Coffer Key, o fuerza la cerradura como Thief. El Curio Vendor Moogle vende la llave. No necesitas ser Thief para esto; recibes el key item Old gauntlets.",
    ["Go to Eldieme Necropolis and defeat Dark Stalker enemies until a Tavnazia Bell drops. There are 4 spawn points near the Hume Bones from the drop at (G-8) in the center of map 2, and 4 more at the B and C drops on map 1."] = "Ve a Eldieme Necropolis y derrota enemigos Dark Stalker hasta que suelten una Tavnazia Bell. Hay 4 puntos de aparición cerca de los Hume Bones de la caída en (G-8), en el centro del mapa 2, y otros 4 en las caídas B y C del mapa 1.",
    ["Go to Fei'Yin and defeat Miser Murphy for an Antique Coin. He appears at (H-8) on map 1 if the quest is active, with a 10 minute respawn."] = "Ve a Fei'Yin y derrota a Miser Murphy para obtener una Antique Coin. Aparece en (H-8) del mapa 1 si la quest está activa, y reaparece cada 10 minutos.",
    ["Go to Garlaige Citadel and open a Treasure Coffer with a Garlaige Coffer Key, or pick the lock as a Thief. The Curio Vendor Moogle sells the key. You don't need to be on Black Mage for this; you receive the key item Old gauntlets."] = "Ve a Garlaige Citadel y abre un Treasure Coffer con una Garlaige Coffer Key, o fuerza la cerradura como Thief. El Curio Vendor Moogle vende la llave. No necesitas ser Black Mage para esto; recibes el key item Old gauntlets.",
    ["Go to Garlaige Citadel and open a Treasure Coffer with a Garlaige Coffer Key, or pick the lock as a Thief. The Curio Vendor Moogle sells the key. You don't need to be on Ranger for this; you receive the key item Old gauntlets."] = "Ve a Garlaige Citadel y abre un Treasure Coffer con una Garlaige Coffer Key, o fuerza la cerradura como Thief. El Curio Vendor Moogle vende la llave. No necesitas ser Ranger para esto; recibes el key item Old gauntlets.",
    ["Go to Garlaige Citadel through the main entrance (the Survival Guide is easiest). You must examine several ??? in the ceiling in a set order, choosing \"Yes\" to use the Bomb incense each time. First-person view and locking on make them easier to target."] = "Ve a Garlaige Citadel por la entrada principal (la Survival Guide es lo más fácil). Debes examinar varias ??? del techo en un orden fijo, eligiendo \"Yes\" para usar el Bomb incense cada vez. La vista en primera persona y fijar el objetivo facilitan seleccionarlas.",
    ["Go to Garlaige Citadel, pass the first Banishing Gate to Map 2 and examine the Oaken Box in the first room on the left (G-8) to spawn the Guardian Statue. If it says something feels wrong but nothing happens, remove Sneak."] = "Ve a Garlaige Citadel, pasa la primera Banishing Gate hasta el mapa 2 y examina la Oaken Box de la primera sala a la izquierda (G-8) para hacer aparecer la Guardian Statue. Si dice que algo no va bien pero no pasa nada, quítate Sneak.",
    ["Go to Garlaige Citadel."] = "Ve a Garlaige Citadel.",
    ["Go to Garlaige Citadel. As soon as you zone in you get a cutscene, after which the NPC Wanzo-Unzozo appears. You can summon Trusts, but zoning in with an Adventuring Fellow makes the escort NPC disappear."] = "Ve a Garlaige Citadel. En cuanto entras en la zona recibes una escena, tras la cual aparece el NPC Wanzo-Unzozo. Puedes invocar Trusts, pero entrar con un Adventuring Fellow hace desaparecer al NPC escoltado.",
    ["Go to Ghelsba Outpost and enter the battlefield at the Hut Door (F-10/G-10); Domenic in Lower Jeuno is the quickest way there. Only people who have reached this point in the quest, or who have already completed it, may enter the battlefield. You fight a level ~40 Wyvern NM, and Trusts can't be summoned."] = "Ve a Ghelsba Outpost y entra en el campo de batalla por la Hut Door (F-10/G-10); Domenic en Lower Jeuno es la forma más rápida de llegar. Solo pueden entrar quienes hayan llegado a este punto de la quest o ya la hayan completado. Luchas contra un NM Wyvern de nivel ~40 y no se pueden invocar Trusts.",
    ["Go to Giddeus and speak with Quu Bokye, then trade a Silver Beastcoin to receive \"Art for Everyone\"."] = "Ve a Giddeus y habla con Quu Bokye, luego entrega una Silver Beastcoin para recibir \"Art for Everyone\".",
    ["Go to Grauberg (S) and, as a Dancer, examine the ??? in Witchfire Glen at (F-5) for a cutscene. It is in the middle of three closely packed trees just north-west of the Veridical Conflux; quickest is a Lightsworm at any Cavernous Maw to the Walk of Echoes, then out by the conflux."] = "Ve a Grauberg (S) y, como Dancer, examina la ??? de Witchfire Glen en (F-5) para una escena. Está en medio de tres árboles muy juntos, justo al noroeste de la Veridical Conflux; lo más rápido es un Lightsworm en cualquier Cavernous Maw hasta el Walk of Echoes y salir por la conflux.",
    ["Go to Gusgen Mines and trade the Chaosbringer to the ??? at (J-7) on map 1 to receive your reward, the Deathbringer. It is the same ??? used in Bastok Mission 3-2 to spawn the NM Blind Moby."] = "Ve a Gusgen Mines y entrega el Chaosbringer a la ??? en (J-7) del mapa 1 para recibir tu recompensa, el Deathbringer. Es la misma ??? que se usa en la Bastok Mission 3-2 para invocar al NM Blind Moby.",
    ["Go to Heavens Tower and speak with Kupipi. If this is not your first Trust quest, you are finished here and receive the key item Windurst Trust permit."] = "Ve a Heavens Tower y habla con Kupipi. Si no es tu primera quest de Trust, terminas aquí y recibes el key item Windurst Trust permit.",
    ["Go to Ifrit's Cauldron (quickest: the Unity Warp (level 122) to Yhoator Jungle, then hug the right wall; or the Elshimo Uplands Outpost warp or Survival Guide) and open a Treasure Coffer with a Cauldron Coffer Key, or pick the lock as a Thief. The Curio Vendor Moogle sells the key. You don't need to be on Ninja for this; you receive the key item Old gauntlets."] = "Ve a Ifrit's Cauldron (lo más rápido: el Unity Warp (nivel 122) a Yhoator Jungle y luego pegado a la pared derecha; o el warp del Elshimo Uplands Outpost o la Survival Guide) y abre un Treasure Coffer con una Cauldron Coffer Key, o fuerza la cerradura como Thief. El Curio Vendor Moogle vende la llave. No necesitas ser Ninja para esto; recibes el key item Old gauntlets.",
    ["Go to King Ranperre's Tomb (I-10) on the first map."] = "Ve a King Ranperre's Tomb (I-10) en el primer mapa.",
    ["Go to Kuftal Tunnel (coffers spawn at (H-7) and (H-6) on Map 1 and (K-11), (G-9), (H-9), (J-7), (J-8), (I-4), (F-6) and (D-9) on Map 2) and open a Treasure Coffer with a Kuftal Coffer Key, or pick the lock as a Thief. The Curio Vendor Moogle sells the key. You don't need to be on Samurai for this; you receive the key item Old gauntlets."] = "Ve a Kuftal Tunnel (los cofres aparecen en (H-7) y (H-6) del mapa 1 y en (K-11), (G-9), (H-9), (J-7), (J-8), (I-4), (F-6) y (D-9) del mapa 2) y abre un Treasure Coffer con una Kuftal Coffer Key, o fuerza la cerradura como Thief. El Curio Vendor Moogle vende la llave. No necesitas ser Samurai para esto; recibes el key item Old gauntlets.",
    ["Go to La Theine Plateau (G-6) and trade the Carbuncle's Ruby to the ??? for a cutscene that completes the quest."] = "Ve a La Theine Plateau (G-6) y entrega el Carbuncle's Ruby a la ??? para una escena que completa la quest.",
    ["Go to La Theine Plateau and speak with Narvecaint (F-7) at the entrance to Ordelle's Caves for another cutscene (the Ordelle's Caves Voidwatch warp puts you right next to him)."] = "Ve a La Theine Plateau y habla con Narvecaint (F-7) en la entrada de Ordelle's Caves para otra escena (el warp de Voidwatch de Ordelle's Caves te deja justo a su lado).",
    ["Go to Lower Jeuno (G-10) and speak with Yatniel on the top floor. He asks for Quake Grenade x4: trade them to him for a clue. You can skip this and still get the Bomb incense, but you must turn in the Quake Grenades to clear the key item from Nanaa Mihgo, or she will not let you finish the quest."] = "Ve a Lower Jeuno (G-10) y habla con Yatniel en el último piso. Te pide Quake Grenade x4: entrégaselas para obtener una pista. Puedes saltártelo y aun así conseguir el Bomb incense, pero debes entregar las Quake Grenades para quitar el key item de Nanaa Mihgo, o no te dejará terminar la quest.",
    ["Go to Lower Jeuno and speak with Harnek inside the Tenshodo at (J-7) for a cutscene. You receive the key item Tenshodo envelope."] = "Ve a Lower Jeuno y habla con Harnek dentro del Tenshodo en (J-7) para una escena. Recibes el key item Tenshodo envelope.",
    ["Go to Lower Jeuno and speak with Ruslan (I-8) in the Merry Minstrel tavern."] = "Ve a Lower Jeuno y habla con Ruslan (I-8) en la taberna Merry Minstrel.",
    ["Go to Mhaura (H-8) and speak with Hagain in one of the upstairs rooms of the Sailor's Stay to receive the key item Bomb incense."] = "Ve a Mhaura (H-8) y habla con Hagain en una de las habitaciones de arriba del Sailor's Stay para recibir el key item Bomb incense.",
    ["Go to Mhaura and speak with Kotan-Purutan at (I-9), near the ferry ticket area, after 18:00 Vana'diel time to obtain a Small bag."] = "Ve a Mhaura y habla con Kotan-Purutan en (I-9), cerca de la zona de billetes del ferry, después de las 18:00 hora de Vana'diel para obtener una Small bag.",
    ["Go to Mhaura and speak with Ripapa (I-9) to obtain a Lightning Pendulum."] = "Ve a Mhaura y habla con Ripapa (I-9) para obtener un Lightning Pendulum.",
    ["Go to Mhaura and talk with Fyi Chalmwoh at (G-8)."] = "Ve a Mhaura y habla con Fyi Chalmwoh en (G-8).",
    ["Go to Misareaux Coast and examine the ??? at (I-6), near the end of the river, for the Mire incense."] = "Ve a Misareaux Coast y examina la ??? en (I-6), cerca del final del río, para obtener el Mire incense.",
    ["Go to Morimar Basalt Fields (J-8), Bivouac #1, and speak with Dabnorrin to receive the key item Vessel of summoning."] = "Ve a Morimar Basalt Fields (J-8), Bivouac #1, y habla con Dabnorrin para recibir el key item Vessel of summoning.",
    ["Go to Norg (K-8) and trade all three foods to Comitolus for a cutscene that sends you to the Rhinostery researchers in Beaucedine Glacier."] = "Ve a Norg (K-8) y entrega las tres comidas a Comitolus para una escena que te envía a los investigadores de la Rhinostery en Beaucedine Glacier.",
    ["Go to Northern San d'Oria and speak with Eperdur (M-7) upstairs in the Cathedral to complete the quest and receive a Scroll of Teleport-Mea."] = "Ve a Northern San d'Oria y habla con Eperdur (M-7) arriba en la Cathedral para completar la quest y recibir un Scroll of Teleport-Mea.",
    ["Go to Oldton Movalpolos and speak with Brakobrik at (K-10). The closest warp is the Proto-Waypoint to the Geomagnetic Fount at (K-11), if you have it."] = "Ve a Oldton Movalpolos y habla con Brakobrik en (K-10). El warp más cercano es el Proto-Waypoint al Geomagnetic Fount en (K-11), si lo tienes.",
    ["Go to Oldton Movalpolos and speak with Rakorok at (K-10) (the Proto-Waypoint at the Geomagnetic Fount (K-11) is closest). This spawns the NM Bugallug, which must be defeated. It has around 5,000 HP and uses the standard Bugbear attacks (Earthshock, Heavy Whisk, Flying Hip Press, etc.)."] = "Ve a Oldton Movalpolos y habla con Rakorok en (K-10) (el Proto-Waypoint de la Geomagnetic Fount (K-11) es el más cercano). Esto hace aparecer al NM Bugallug, al que hay que derrotar. Tiene unos 5,000 HP y usa los ataques habituales de Bugbear (Earthshock, Heavy Whisk, Flying Hip Press, etc.).",
    ["Go to Oldton Movalpolos for a cutscene upon zoning."] = "Ve a Oldton Movalpolos para una escena al entrar en la zona.",
    ["Go to Ondieulix (I-7, second floor, near Home Point #1) for your reward, the Gramary Cape."] = "Ve con Ondieulix (I-7, segundo piso, cerca del Home Point #1) para tu recompensa, la Gramary Cape.",
    ["Go to Ordelle's Caves and obtain an Ordelle Chest Key from the monsters inside. Certain monsters in the cave drop it; to reach that area take path D on map 1, drop into the southeastern hole shown on map 2, then take path E. The high-level monsters Buds Bunny, Swagger Spruce and Targe Beetle do not aggro."] = "Ve a Ordelle's Caves y obtén una Ordelle Chest Key de los monstruos del interior. Ciertos monstruos de la cueva la sueltan; para llegar a esa zona toma el camino D del mapa 1, déjate caer por el agujero sureste que aparece en el mapa 2 y luego toma el camino E. Los monstruos de nivel alto Buds Bunny, Swagger Spruce y Targe Beetle no atacan.",
    ["Go to Ordelle's Caves. You can use the Abyssea La Theine Plateau warp and enter from La Theine Plateau (H-7), or the Survival Guide if you have picked it up."] = "Ve a Ordelle's Caves. Puedes usar el Abyssea La Theine Plateau warp y entrar desde La Theine Plateau (H-7), o la Survival Guide si la has conseguido.",
    ["Go to Palborough Mines and work your way to the top floor (Home Point #1 is very close; Domenic's teleport to Waughroon Shrine also lands next to it). Examine the ??? at (G-10) in a dead-end room to spawn Ni'Ghu Nestfender, and defeat it for a Mottled Quadav Egg. It can be spawned again 3 minutes later."] = "Ve a Palborough Mines y abre camino hasta el piso superior (el Home Point #1 está muy cerca; el teletransporte de Domenic a Waughroon Shrine también te deja al lado). Examina la ??? en (G-10), en una sala sin salida, para hacer aparecer a Ni'Ghu Nestfender, y derrótalo para obtener un Mottled Quadav Egg. Se puede volver a hacer aparecer 3 minutos después.",
    ["Go to Phomiuna Aqueducts, find a Wooden Ladder at (C-9) on the second map, and climb the ladder for a cutscene."] = "Ve a Phomiuna Aqueducts, busca una Wooden Ladder en (C-9) del segundo mapa y sube la escalera para una escena.",
    ["Go to Phomiuna Aqueducts. Map 1: climb the ladder at (F-6), follow the path and turn right at the T intersection. Map 2: go to (M-8) and climb the ladder; the Iron Gate at (J-6) needs a Bronze Key, or a Thief with several Thief's Tools."] = "Ve a Phomiuna Aqueducts. Mapa 1: sube por la escalera de (F-6), sigue el camino y gira a la derecha en el cruce en T. Mapa 2: ve a (M-8) y sube por la escalera; la Iron Gate de (J-6) necesita una Bronze Key, o un Thief con varias Thief's Tools.",
    ["Go to Port Bastok and speak with Ravorara at (E-7), outside the Steaming Sheep Restaurant, for a cutscene. If Fallen Comrades is active, finish it first."] = "Ve a Port Bastok y habla con Ravorara en (E-7), fuera del Steaming Sheep Restaurant, para una escena. Si Fallen Comrades está activa, termínala primero.",
    ["Go to Pso'Xja Home Point #1. Alternatively, travel to Beaucedine Glacier (H-8) and enter Pso'Xja; the Beaucedine Glacier Survival Guide brings you to (H-9), just south of the entrance."] = "Ve al Home Point #1 de Pso'Xja. Como alternativa, viaja a Beaucedine Glacier (H-8) y entra en Pso'Xja; la Survival Guide de Beaucedine Glacier te lleva a (H-9), justo al sur de la entrada.",
    ["Go to Rabao and speak with Agado-Pugado (G-9) to receive a Wind Pendulum."] = "Ve a Rabao y habla con Agado-Pugado (G-9) para recibir un Wind Pendulum.",
    ["Go to Rala Waterways (M-6), entering from Eastern Adoulin (F-7). Speak with Yeggha Dolashi and examine the door behind her to enter Rala Waterways (U)."] = "Ve a Rala Waterways (M-6), entrando desde Eastern Adoulin (F-7). Habla con Yeggha Dolashi y examina la puerta de detrás de ella para entrar en Rala Waterways (U).",
    ["Go to Ranpi-Monpi in the northern part of Windurst Waters (D-9) and trade him Woozyshroom x3 to receive the key item Ranpi-Monpi's special stew."] = "Ve a Ranpi-Monpi en la parte norte de Windurst Waters (D-9) y entrégale Woozyshroom x3 para recibir el key item Ranpi-Monpi's special stew.",
    ["Go to Sea Serpent Grotto. Quickest is the Unity Warp (level 125) to Map 4 (L-5), in front of the Gold Door: open it, go north along the left wall to the Mythril Door, examine it until it mentions mythril dust and trade it a Mythril Beastcoin. The Proto-Waypoint to (J-5) on Map 3 also puts you behind the Mythril Door. Open a Treasure Coffer there with a Grotto Coffer Key, or pick the lock as a Thief. The Curio Vendor Moogle sells the key. You don't need to be on Summoner for this; you receive the key item Old gauntlets."] = "Ve a Sea Serpent Grotto. Lo más rápido es el Unity Warp (nivel 125) al mapa 4 (L-5), frente a la Gold Door: ábrela, ve al norte por la pared izquierda hasta la Mythril Door, examínala hasta que mencione polvo de mithril y entrégale una Mythril Beastcoin. El Proto-Waypoint a (J-5) en el mapa 3 también te deja detrás de la Mythril Door. Abre allí un Treasure Coffer con una Grotto Coffer Key, o fuerza la cerradura como Thief. El Curio Vendor Moogle vende la llave. No necesitas ser Summoner para esto; recibes el key item Old gauntlets.",
    ["Go to Southern San d'Oria (G-6) and speak with Amaura. She needs certain ingredients to brew the medicine and gives you Amaura's formula, which lists them: 1 Insect Wing, 1 Malboro Vine and 1 Zinc Ore."] = "Ve a Southern San d'Oria (G-6) y habla con Amaura. Necesita ciertos ingredientes para preparar la medicina y te da Amaura's formula, que los enumera: 1 Insect Wing, 1 Malboro Vine y 1 Zinc Ore.",
    ["Go to Southern San d'Oria and speak with Hae Jakhya (G-9) to receive the overdue library book, \"A Song of Love\". She is on top of the wall, so take the passage at (F-8) to get up there."] = "Ve a Southern San d'Oria y habla con Hae Jakhya (G-9) para recibir el libro atrasado de la biblioteca, \"A Song of Love\". Está encima del muro, así que toma el pasaje en (F-8) para subir.",
    ["Go to Southern San d'Oria and speak with Sharzalion in the Lion Springs Tavern (K-6)."] = "Ve a Southern San d'Oria y habla con Sharzalion en la Lion Springs Tavern (K-6).",
    ["Go to Tahrongi Canyon (F-6) and examine the Tahrongi Cacti there to get a Tahrongi Cactus."] = "Ve a Tahrongi Canyon (F-6) y examina los Tahrongi Cacti de allí para conseguir un Tahrongi Cactus.",
    ["Go to Talacca Cove; its entrance is next to the Caedarva Mire Home Point (or take the west exit from Nashmau). Examine the Rock Slab to the north-west for a cutscene and the battlefield: up to 6 people, 30 minutes, Trusts allowed."] = "Ve a Talacca Cove; su entrada está junto al Home Point de Caedarva Mire (o toma la salida oeste de Nashmau). Examina la Rock Slab del noroeste para una escena y el campo de batalla: hasta 6 personas, 30 minutos, se permiten Trusts.",
    ["Go to The Boyahda Tree and open a Treasure Coffer with a Boyahda Coffer Key, or pick the lock as a Thief. The Curio Vendor Moogle sells the key. You don't need to be on Dragoon for this; you receive the key item Old gauntlets."] = "Ve a The Boyahda Tree y abre un Treasure Coffer con una Boyahda Coffer Key, o fuerza la cerradura como Thief. El Curio Vendor Moogle vende la llave. No necesitas ser Dragoon para esto; recibes el key item Old gauntlets.",
    ["Go to The Eldieme Necropolis (the Magicked astrolabe, 10,000 gil from Churano-Shurano in Windurst Waters (F-8), lets you open its doors solo) and open a Treasure Coffer with an Eldieme Coffer Key, or pick the lock as a Thief. The Curio Vendor Moogle sells the key. You don't need to be on Dark Knight for this; you receive the key item Old gauntlets."] = "Ve a The Eldieme Necropolis (el Magicked astrolabe, 10,000 gil a Churano-Shurano en Windurst Waters (F-8), te permite abrir sus puertas tú solo) y abre un Treasure Coffer con una Eldieme Coffer Key, o fuerza la cerradura como Thief. El Curio Vendor Moogle vende la llave. No necesitas ser Dark Knight para esto; recibes el key item Old gauntlets.",
    ["Go to The Eldieme Necropolis (the Magicked astrolabe, 10,000 gil from Churano-Shurano in Windurst Waters (F-8), lets you open its doors solo) and open a Treasure Coffer with an Eldieme Coffer Key, or pick the lock as a Thief. The Curio Vendor Moogle sells the key. You don't need to be on Paladin for this; you receive the key item Old gauntlets."] = "Ve a The Eldieme Necropolis (el Magicked astrolabe, 10,000 gil a Churano-Shurano en Windurst Waters (F-8), te permite abrir sus puertas tú solo) y abre un Treasure Coffer con una Eldieme Coffer Key, o fuerza la cerradura como Thief. El Curio Vendor Moogle vende la llave. No necesitas ser Paladin para esto; recibes el key item Old gauntlets.",
    ["Go to The Eldieme Necropolis (the Magicked astrolabe, 10,000 gil from Churano-Shurano in Windurst Waters (F-8), lets you open its doors solo) and open a Treasure Coffer with an Eldieme Coffer Key, or pick the lock as a Thief. The Curio Vendor Moogle sells the key. You don't need to be on Red Mage for this; you receive the key item Old gauntlets."] = "Ve a The Eldieme Necropolis (el Magicked astrolabe, 10,000 gil a Churano-Shurano en Windurst Waters (F-8), te permite abrir sus puertas tú solo) y abre un Treasure Coffer con una Eldieme Coffer Key, o fuerza la cerradura como Thief. El Curio Vendor Moogle vende la llave. No necesitas ser Red Mage para esto; recibes el key item Old gauntlets.",
    ["Go to The Eldieme Necropolis (the Magicked astrolabe, 10,000 gil from Churano-Shurano in Windurst Waters (F-8), lets you open its doors solo) and open a Treasure Coffer with an Eldieme Coffer Key. The coffer may be in the north-west part of map 2 (exit 7), on a ledge normally reached from Beaucedine Glacier via Batallia Downs; examining the Lycopodium in Batallia Downs (S) unlocks a Sparkling Light shortcut to it, or pick the lock as a Thief. The Curio Vendor Moogle sells the key. You don't need to be on Warrior for this; you receive the key item Old gauntlets."] = "Ve a The Eldieme Necropolis (el Magicked astrolabe, 10,000 gil a Churano-Shurano en Windurst Waters (F-8), te permite abrir sus puertas tú solo) y abre un Treasure Coffer con una Eldieme Coffer Key. El cofre puede estar en la parte noroeste del mapa 2 (salida 7), en una cornisa a la que normalmente se llega desde Beaucedine Glacier pasando por Batallia Downs; examinar el Lycopodium de Batallia Downs (S) desbloquea un atajo de Sparkling Light hasta allí, o fuerza la cerradura como Thief. El Curio Vendor Moogle vende la llave. No necesitas ser Warrior para esto; recibes el key item Old gauntlets.",
    ["Go to The Eldieme Necropolis and look for a ??? that spawns in one of four locations. It can be reached via Beaucedine Glacier, the Lycopodium warps or the Unity warp to the zone."] = "Ve a The Eldieme Necropolis y busca una ??? que aparece en una de cuatro ubicaciones. Se puede llegar por Beaucedine Glacier, los warps de Lycopodium o el Unity warp a la zona.",
    ["Go to The Eldieme Necropolis from Batallia Downs (J-10), or by Survival Guide. You need a Magicked astrolabe or a friend on the switches. Go straight to the intersection at (J-8), turn left and follow the path west to Titan's Gate at (G-8), go north through it and step on the square of bones to fall to map 2 (L-10). Go east to the Hume Bones at (M-10)."] = "Ve a The Eldieme Necropolis desde Batallia Downs (J-10) o con la Survival Guide. Necesitas un Magicked astrolabe o un amigo en los interruptores. Ve directo al cruce de (J-8), gira a la izquierda y sigue el camino al oeste hasta Titan's Gate en (G-8), crúzala hacia el norte y pisa el cuadro de huesos para caer al mapa 2 (L-10). Ve al este hasta los Hume Bones en (M-10).",
    ["Go to Toraimarai Canal and open a Coffer there to obtain the Joker card. Various enemies in the zone drop the Toraimarai Coffer Key, or you can buy one from the Curio Vendor Moogle for 5,000 gil."] = "Ve a Toraimarai Canal y abre un Coffer allí para obtener la Joker card. Varios enemigos de la zona sueltan la Toraimarai Coffer Key, o puedes comprar una al Curio Vendor Moogle por 5,000 gil.",
    ["Go to Toraimarai Canal on Black Mage (Manafont is needed) and examine the two ??? on Map 1. Stand right in front of each one; from too far away or the other side of the grate you only get a message that you cannot examine further."] = "Ve a Toraimarai Canal como Black Mage (hace falta Manafont) y examina las dos ??? del mapa 1. Colócate justo delante de cada una; desde demasiado lejos o desde el otro lado de la reja solo recibes un mensaje de que no puedes examinar más.",
    ["Go to Wajaom Woodlands (C-8) to enter Halvung. Go to (H-11) and examine the ??? to acquire a Lilac ribbon. The fastest way is the Wajaom Woodlands Survival Guide."] = "Ve a Wajaom Woodlands (C-8) para entrar en Halvung. Ve a (H-11) y examina la ??? para conseguir una Lilac ribbon. La forma más rápida es la Survival Guide de Wajaom Woodlands.",
    ["Go to West Sarutabaruta and defeat Crawler enemies there until one drops a Meteorite."] = "Ve a West Sarutabaruta y derrota allí a enemigos Crawler hasta que uno suelte un Meteorite.",
    ["Go to Windurst Walls (G-3) and check the door of the House of the Hero."] = "Ve a Windurst Walls (G-3) y revisa la puerta de la House of the Hero.",
    ["Go to Windurst Walls (G-3) and examine the door of the House of the Hero for a cutscene."] = "Ve a Windurst Walls (G-3) y examina la puerta de la House of the Hero para una escena.",
    ["Go to Windurst Waters South (a short walk away, or use Home Point #3) and speak with Honoi-Gomoi (E-7) for a cutscene. He is upstairs in his house, reached by a back stairway."] = "Ve a Windurst Waters South (a poca distancia, o usa el Home Point #3) y habla con Honoi-Gomoi (E-7) para una escena. Está arriba en su casa, a la que se llega por una escalera trasera.",
    ["Go to Windurst Waters and speak with Chamama at (F-10) (Home Point #4). She asks for Saruta Cotton x4 to make a Fake moustache."] = "Ve a Windurst Waters y habla con Chamama en (F-10) (Home Point #4). Pide Saruta Cotton x4 para hacer un Fake moustache.",
    ["Go to a Gate Sentry in an area that your nation controls and speak with him. A Reinforcement appears and follows you. Escort it to the outpost of that zone."] = "Ve a un Gate Sentry de una zona que controle tu nación y habla con él. Aparece un Reinforcement que te sigue. Escóltalo hasta el puesto avanzado de esa zona.",
    ["Go to any Telepoint and trade a synthesis crystal to receive a Faded Crystal."] = "Ve a cualquier Telepoint y entrega un synthesis crystal para recibir un Faded Crystal.",
    ["Go to one of these Ergon Loci: Flourishing Island, Ceizak Battlegrounds (K-10, Frontier Station); Bud of the Swarm, Ceizak Battlegrounds (I-8, Bivouac #2); Immutable Boulder, Yahse Hunting Grounds (F-6, Bivouac #2). You get the message \"You are assaulted by an uncanny sensation.\""] = "Ve a uno de estos Ergon Loci: Flourishing Island, Ceizak Battlegrounds (K-10, Frontier Station); Bud of the Swarm, Ceizak Battlegrounds (I-8, Bivouac #2); Immutable Boulder, Yahse Hunting Grounds (F-6, Bivouac #2). Recibes el mensaje \"You are assaulted by an uncanny sensation.\"",
    ["Go to the Azouph Isle Staging Point in Caedarva Mire (K-9). Assault Orders do not let you travel to Runic Portals you have not already visited."] = "Ve al Azouph Isle Staging Point en Caedarva Mire (K-9). Las Assault Orders no te dejan viajar a Runic Portals que no hayas visitado ya.",
    ["Go to the Boat Docks at (H-8), board one of the boats and interact with the Dock Lever for a cutscene with Zeid. Make sure you have a free inventory space: at the end you receive the Chaosbringer."] = "Ve a los Boat Docks de (H-8), sube a uno de los botes y usa la Dock Lever para una escena con Zeid. Asegúrate de tener un hueco libre en el inventario: al final recibes la Chaosbringer.",
    ["Go to the Cathedral in Northern San d'Oria and speak with Pagisalis in the basement (the stairs are on the left as you enter). He asks for a Velvet Cloth: trade him one to receive the Old boots in exchange for the Old pocket watch."] = "Ve a la Cathedral de Northern San d'Oria y habla con Pagisalis en el sótano (las escaleras están a la izquierda al entrar). Te pide una Velvet Cloth: entrégale una para recibir las Old boots a cambio del Old pocket watch.",
    ["Go to the Cloister of Frost in Fei'Yin (Home Point #2 is closest). On a first visit, enter Fei'Yin from Beaucedine Glacier (J-4) (or the Unity warp), go downstairs at (G-9) on map 1, and zone into the Cloister at (I-5) on map 2."] = "Ve al Cloister of Frost en Fei'Yin (el Home Point #2 es el más cercano). En una primera visita, entra en Fei'Yin desde Beaucedine Glacier (J-4) (o con el Unity warp), baja las escaleras de (G-9) en el mapa 1 y entra en el Cloister por (I-5) en el mapa 2.",
    ["Go to the Dvucca Isle Staging Point in Caedarva Mire (I-9). Assault Orders do not let you travel to Runic Portals you have not already visited."] = "Ve al Dvucca Isle Staging Point en Caedarva Mire (I-9). Las Assault Orders no te dejan viajar a Runic Portals que no hayas visitado ya.",
    ["Go to the Empyreal Paradox and examine the Transcendental Radiance for a cutscene. With the Home Point Lumoria > The Garden of Ru'Hmet > #1, zone out to the Grand Palace of Hu'Xzoi, warp there and descend."] = "Ve al Empyreal Paradox y examina la Transcendental Radiance para una escena. Con el Home Point Lumoria > The Garden of Ru'Hmet > #1, sal al Grand Palace of Hu'Xzoi, teletranspórtate allí y desciende.",
    ["Go to the Firebloom Tree Roots in Yuhtunga Jungle (H-9), northeast of the Survival Guide and the Outpost. Examine the roots on each side of the tree to obtain the Northern, Eastern, Southern and Western Vine. The Western Vine is in the tunnel. No hatchet is needed."] = "Ve a las Firebloom Tree Roots de Yuhtunga Jungle (H-9), al noreste de la Survival Guide y el Outpost. Examina las raíces de cada lado del árbol para obtener la Northern, Eastern, Southern y Western Vine. La Western Vine está en el túnel. No hace falta hacha.",
    ["Go to the Frontier Station in Morimar Basalt Fields (K-10) and speak with Vestavius."] = "Ve a la Frontier Station de Morimar Basalt Fields (K-10) y habla con Vestavius.",
    ["Go to the Full Moon Fountain. It helps to home point at Toraimarai Canal #1 beforehand, or you can warp to Toraimarai Canal with the Survival Guide."] = "Ve a la Full Moon Fountain. Ayuda registrar el home point en Toraimarai Canal #1 antes, o puedes teletransportarte a Toraimarai Canal con la Survival Guide.",
    ["Go to the Giwahb Watchtower in Wajaom Woodlands (F-5) and trade the Frayed Arrow to the door for a cutscene that completes the quest and gives you 500 Imperial Standing."] = "Ve a la Giwahb Watchtower en Wajaom Woodlands (F-5) y entrega la Frayed Arrow a la puerta para una escena que completa la quest y te da 500 Imperial Standing.",
    ["Go to the Halvung Staging Point inside Mount Zhayolm. Assault Orders do not let you travel to Runic Portals you have not already visited."] = "Ve al Halvung Staging Point dentro de Mount Zhayolm. Las Assault Orders no te dejan viajar a Runic Portals que no hayas visitado ya.",
    ["Go to the Ilrusi Atoll Staging Point in Arrapago Reef (G-5). Assault Orders do not let you travel to Runic Portals you have not already visited."] = "Ve al Ilrusi Atoll Staging Point en Arrapago Reef (G-5). Las Assault Orders no te dejan viajar a Runic Portals que no hayas visitado ya.",
    ["Go to the Leypoint in Wajaom Woodlands (G-8) and trade the Rusty Medal for a cutscene that completes the quest and gives you 500 Imperial Standing."] = "Ve al Leypoint de Wajaom Woodlands (G-8) y entrega la Rusty Medal para una escena que completa la quest y te da 500 Imperial Standing.",
    ["Go to the Mamool Ja Staging Point inside Bhaflau Thickets. Assault Orders do not let you travel to Runic Portals you have not already visited."] = "Ve al Mamool Ja Staging Point dentro de Bhaflau Thickets. Las Assault Orders no te dejan viajar a Runic Portals que no hayas visitado ya.",
    ["Go to the Maze of Shakhrami and defeat Wight enemies to obtain a Rusty Key."] = "Ve a Maze of Shakhrami y derrota a enemigos Wight para obtener una Rusty Key.",
    ["Go to the Maze of Shakhrami and speak with Ahko Mhalijikhari (C-9) to receive the level cap status. The level cap is 25, Trust magic is usable and buffs do not wear off."] = "Ve a Maze of Shakhrami y habla con Ahko Mhalijikhari (C-9) para recibir el estado de límite de nivel. El límite es 25, la Trust magic se puede usar y los buffs no desaparecen.",
    ["Go to the Maze of Shakhrami and trade a Pickaxe to an Excavation Point to receive a Wyvern Egg. Fossil Rocks are unrelated to this quest."] = "Ve a Maze of Shakhrami y entrega un Pickaxe a un Excavation Point para recibir un Wyvern Egg. Las Fossil Rocks no tienen relación con esta quest.",
    ["Go to the Maze of Shakhrami."] = "Ve a Maze of Shakhrami.",
    ["Go to the Metalworks in Bastok and speak with Vladinek (H-8), in the Craftsmen's Eatery on the upper floor, for a long cutscene."] = "Ve a Metalworks en Bastok y habla con Vladinek (H-8), en la Craftsmen's Eatery del piso superior, para una escena larga.",
    ["Go to the Nyzul Isle Staging Point in Alzadaal Undersea Ruins. Assault Orders do not let you travel to Runic Portals you have not already visited."] = "Ve al Nyzul Isle Staging Point en Alzadaal Undersea Ruins. Las Assault Orders no te dejan viajar a Runic Portals que no hayas visitado ya.",
    ["Go to the Riverbed in Grauberg (S) (F-13); the campaign warp to Grauberg is fastest."] = "Ve al Riverbed de Grauberg (S) (F-13); el warp de campaña a Grauberg es lo más rápido.",
    ["Go to the Shararat Teahouse (J-12) for another cutscene."] = "Ve a la Shararat Teahouse (J-12) para otra escena.",
    ["Go to the Shararat Teahouse (K-12), on the upper level, and talk to either Ulamaal or Qutiba for another cutscene."] = "Ve a la Shararat Teahouse (K-12), en el nivel superior, y habla con Ulamaal o con Qutiba para otra escena.",
    ["Go to the Tavnazian Safehold and speak with Quelveuiat (I-10), on the first floor near the Altar of the Dawn, for a cutscene."] = "Ve a Tavnazian Safehold y habla con Quelveuiat (I-10), en el primer piso cerca del Altar of the Dawn, para una escena.",
    ["Go to the Temple of Uggalepih (the Survival Guide is quickest) with at least one Dragoon whose wyvern is out; the NMs don't spawn without it. Everyone else can be on any job and still gets the reward."] = "Ve al Temple of Uggalepih (la Survival Guide es lo más rápido) con al menos un Dragoon con su wyvern fuera; los NMs no aparecen sin ella. Los demás pueden ir con cualquier job y aun así reciben la recompensa.",
    ["Go to the Throne Room in Castle Zvahl Keep for a cutscene at the door, then trade the Scholar's Testimony to the door to start the fight. All buffs are lost on entry and your support job is disabled; Trust magic is allowed if you have the key item Rhapsody in Umber."] = "Ve a la Throne Room de Castle Zvahl Keep para una escena en la puerta y luego entrega el Scholar's Testimony a la puerta para empezar la pelea. Pierdes todos los buffs al entrar y tu support job queda desactivado; se permite la Trust magic si tienes el key item Rhapsody in Umber.",
    ["Go to the Twinkle Tree near the Starfall Hillock in West Sarutabaruta (I-6), a rounded tree with a blue firefly-like glow at night."] = "Ve al Twinkle Tree cerca del Starfall Hillock en West Sarutabaruta (I-6), un árbol redondeado con un brillo azul como de luciérnagas por la noche.",
    ["Go to the base of the waterfall at (F-4) in Misareaux Coast and examine the ??? for a cutscene."] = "Ve a la base de la cascada de (F-4) en Misareaux Coast y examina la ??? para una escena.",
    ["Go to the basement of Crawlers' Nest and obtain a Bag of Seeds, which drops from a Fire Elemental or a Water Elemental. The Elementals only appear during fire or water weather, which Crawlers' Nest shares with Rolanberry Fields (ask Appollonia in Upper Jeuno (G-6) for the forecast). They spawn in the \"donut room\" with the Strange Apparatus on Map 3: from the entrance go west until you drop into the central hub (I/J-9), then south through passage B at (J-10) to Map 3, and west to the room's entrance at (H-8)."] = "Ve al sótano de Crawlers' Nest y consigue una Bag of Seeds, que suelta un Fire Elemental o un Water Elemental. Los Elementals solo aparecen con clima de fuego o de agua, que Crawlers' Nest comparte con Rolanberry Fields (pide el pronóstico a Appollonia en Upper Jeuno (G-6)). Aparecen en la \"sala del dónut\" con el Strange Apparatus del mapa 3: desde la entrada ve al oeste hasta caer al centro (I/J-9), luego al sur por el pasaje B de (J-10) al mapa 3 y al oeste hasta la entrada de la sala en (H-8).",
    ["Go to the cave at (D-8) in Konschtat Highlands and trade the Oriental Steel to the ??? inside to spawn Forger, a level ~33 Bomb NM. The level 99 Unity warp (Sleepy Mabel) puts you close, at (G-7)."] = "Ve a la cueva de (D-8) en Konschtat Highlands y entrega el Oriental Steel a la ??? de dentro para hacer aparecer a Forger, un NM Bomb de nivel ~33. El Unity warp de nivel 99 (Sleepy Mabel) te deja cerca, en (G-7).",
    ["Go to the crag nearest your home nation and examine the Ergon Locus ??? beneath the stairs up to the Telepoint for the key item Fistful of homeland soil: San d'Oria, La Theine Plateau (K-8); Bastok, Konschtat Highlands; Windurst, Tahrongi Canyon (I-6)."] = "Ve al crag más cercano a tu nación y examina la ??? Ergon Locus bajo las escaleras que suben al Telepoint para obtener el key item Fistful of homeland soil: San d'Oria, La Theine Plateau (K-8); Bastok, Konschtat Highlands; Windurst, Tahrongi Canyon (I-6).",
    ["Go to the dead end at (E-10) in Davoi and examine the Disused Well to receive the Knight's soul. To get there, follow the river west from (J-10), then head south after reaching (D-8)."] = "Ve al callejón sin salida en (E-10) de Davoi y examina el Disused Well para recibir el Knight's soul. Para llegar, sigue el río al oeste desde (J-10) y luego ve al sur al llegar a (D-8).",
    ["Go to the lower level of Aht Urhgan Whitegate (J-10) to trigger a cutscene, near the NPC Hajaom."] = "Ve al nivel inferior de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (J-10) para activar una escena, cerca del NPC Hajaom.",
    ["Go to the oasis in Western Altepa Desert at (E-9), in the south-west. The Unity Warp (level 125) gets you closest; the Rabao or Quicksand Caves #1 Home Points, the Survival Guide and the Voidwatch warp also work."] = "Ve al oasis de Western Altepa Desert en (E-9), al suroeste. El Unity Warp (nivel 125) es lo que más te acerca; los Home Points de Rabao o Quicksand Caves #1, la Survival Guide y el warp de Voidwatch también sirven.",
    ["Go to the pond at (E-5) and defeat Evil Weapon enemies until you get a Pinch of Glittersand. High-level Goblins (88+) are on the way; lower-level Rangers should go around them or use Invisible."] = "Ve al estanque de (E-5) y derrota enemigos Evil Weapon hasta conseguir un Pinch of Glittersand. Hay Goblins de nivel alto (88+) en el camino; los Rangers de nivel más bajo deberían rodearlos o usar Invisible.",
    ["Go to the three spots on the treasure map in Yuhtunga Jungle, (F-7), (H-10) and (I-12), and examine the Blue Rafflesia at each for a Rafflesia Nectar."] = "Ve a los tres puntos del mapa del tesoro en Yuhtunga Jungle, (F-7), (H-10) y (I-12), y examina la Blue Rafflesia de cada uno para obtener un Rafflesia Nectar.",
    ["Go to the tower at Beaucedine Glacier (I-7) and speak with Torino-Samarino twice, choosing the first option, for the temporary key item Shantotto's new spell."] = "Ve a la torre de Beaucedine Glacier (I-7) y habla dos veces con Torino-Samarino, eligiendo la primera opción, para obtener el key item temporal Shantotto's new spell.",
    ["Go upstairs and examine the Audience Chamber."] = "Sube las escaleras y examina la Audience Chamber.",
    ["Go west again and drop down hole H at the end of the path. You may meet the NM Juggler Hecatomb here (a Records of Eminence target)."] = "Ve de nuevo al oeste y déjate caer por el agujero H al final del camino. Puede que te encuentres aquí con el NM Juggler Hecatomb (un objetivo de Records of Eminence).",
    ["Gorget + chip, plus Yovra Organs: Red 10 Phuabo/5 Xzomit/1 Yovra, Yellow 10 Xzomit/5 Aern/1, Blue 10 Aern/5 Hpemde/1, Green 10 Phuabo/5 Hpemde/1, Clear 10 Phuabo/5 Aern/1, Purple 10 Xzomit/5 Hpemde/1, White 7 Aern/3 Phuabo/3 Hpemde/2 Yovra, Black 7 Hpemde/3 Phuabo/3 Aern/2 Yovra."] = "Gorget + chip, más Yovra Organs: Red 10 Phuabo/5 Xzomit/1 Yovra, Yellow 10 Xzomit/5 Aern/1, Blue 10 Aern/5 Hpemde/1, Green 10 Phuabo/5 Hpemde/1, Clear 10 Phuabo/5 Aern/1, Purple 10 Xzomit/5 Hpemde/1, White 7 Aern/3 Phuabo/3 Hpemde/2 Yovra, Black 7 Hpemde/3 Phuabo/3 Aern/2 Yovra.",
    ["Gray Chip: Diremite (42-48) on many maps; Diremite Assaulter (57-59) from the (F-7) tower two floors down (drop at (I-8)), or across the first map from the (H-8) tower; Diremite Stalker (63-68) from the (G-9) tower two floors down (drop in the lower right of (H-9), then the long hallway on the right); Diremite Dominator (74-77) from the (F-7) tower three floors down."] = "Gray Chip: Diremite (42-48) en muchos mapas; Diremite Assaulter (57-59) desde la torre de (F-7) dos pisos más abajo (déjate caer en (I-8)), o cruzando el primer mapa desde la torre de (H-8); Diremite Stalker (63-68) desde la torre de (G-9) dos pisos más abajo (déjate caer en la parte inferior derecha de (H-9) y luego el pasillo largo de la derecha); Diremite Dominator (74-77) desde la torre de (F-7) tres pisos más abajo.",
    ["Grin shows you a picture of an NPC that you must memorize."] = "Grin te muestra una imagen de un NPC que debes memorizar.",
    ["Guide and protect Professor Clavauert B Chanoix to the room at (J-5) or (G-9)."] = "Guía y protege al Professor Clavauert B Chanoix hasta la sala de (J-5) o (G-9).",
    ["Guslam cannot repair the gauntlets. If this is your first artifact armor from these quests, speak with Deadly Minnow inside the Durable Shields shop, then go to the Tenshodo in Lower Jeuno, speak with Yin Pocanakhu (J-8) and trade him 1,000 gil."] = "Guslam no puede reparar los guanteletes. Si es tu primera armadura de artefacto de estas quests, habla con Deadly Minnow dentro de la tienda Durable Shields, luego ve al Tenshodo de Lower Jeuno, habla con Yin Pocanakhu (J-8) y entrégale 1,000 gil.",
    ["Habaneros can be bought at the Auction House (Food, Ingredients) or from regional vendors, grown from Herb Seeds in your Mog Garden, or farmed from Mantrap enemies in Misareaux Coast."] = "Los Habaneros se pueden comprar en la Auction House (Food, Ingredients) o a vendedores regionales, cultivarse con Herb Seeds en tu Mog Garden o farmearse de enemigos Mantrap en Misareaux Coast.",
    ["Hand out the 15 Magicmart Flyers, only to townsfolk and not to adventurers. While the quest is active, when you come close to an NPC who should get a flyer, a message in /say tells you that the NPC looks over curiously for a moment."] = "Reparte los 15 Magicmart Flyers, solo a los habitantes del pueblo y no a aventureros. Mientras la quest está activa, cuando te acercas a un NPC que debe recibir un folleto, un mensaje en /say te indica que el NPC mira con curiosidad por un momento.",
    ["Harvest at the ??? at (E-5) to obtain the Blazing Pepper."] = "Cosecha en la ??? en (E-5) para obtener el Blazing Pepper.",
    ["Having Windurst Mission 2-1 active prevents you from starting this quest. Nanaa Mihgo is involved in several quests and missions, so you may have to speak with her several times to trigger the cutscene that starts it."] = "Tener activa la Windurst Mission 2-1 te impide empezar esta quest. Nanaa Mihgo participa en varias quests y misiones, así que puede que tengas que hablar con ella varias veces para activar la escena que la inicia.",
    ["He also accepts a Snobby Letter. In total the quest pays between 120 and 5,500 gil, depending on the item."] = "También acepta una Snobby Letter. En total la quest paga entre 120 y 5,500 gil, según el objeto.",
    ["He asks for a few items from this list: Chocobo Bedding, Counterfeit Gil, Dart, Eastern Paper, Fernan's Diaries, Goblin Bread, Goblin Doll, Goblin Mushpot, Goblin Pie, Kaiserin Cosmetics, Kongou Inaho, My First Magic Kit, Naphille Pochette, Nyumomo Doll, Shuriken, Silver Obi, Snoll Gelato, Sphene Earring, Tonosama Rice Ball, Turquoise Ring."] = "Pide algunos objetos de esta lista: Chocobo Bedding, Counterfeit Gil, Dart, Eastern Paper, Fernan's Diaries, Goblin Bread, Goblin Doll, Goblin Mushpot, Goblin Pie, Kaiserin Cosmetics, Kongou Inaho, My First Magic Kit, Naphille Pochette, Nyumomo Doll, Shuriken, Silver Obi, Snoll Gelato, Sphene Earring, Tonosama Rice Ball, Turquoise Ring.",
    ["He asks for one of three items: a Rabbit Hide, a Lizard Tail or a Two-Leaf Mandragora Bud. The Bog Bunnies just north of him drop Rabbit Hides."] = "Te pide uno de tres objetos: una Rabbit Hide, una Lizard Tail o un Two-Leaf Mandragora Bud. Los Bog Bunnies justo al norte de él sueltan Rabbit Hides.",
    ["He asks you to arrange a meeting with the thief in Nashmau. Head to Nashmau and seek out Dnegan at (H-6), on the second floor. Do not choose \"Ask about the automaton.\" (that ends the cutscene and costs a game day); choose either of the other first dialogue options to continue."] = "Te pide concertar una reunión con el ladrón en Nashmau. Ve a Nashmau y busca a Dnegan en (H-6), en el segundo piso. No elijas \"Ask about the automaton.\" (termina la escena y cuesta un día de juego); elige cualquiera de las otras primeras opciones de diálogo para continuar.",
    ["He asks you to go to Nashmau and search for the culprit. Once in Nashmau, proceed to (H-6) (second floor) and speak with Dnegan, who saw a Puppetmaster recently and lost his gil pouch in Caedarva Mire."] = "Te pide ir a Nashmau a buscar al culpable. En Nashmau, ve a (H-6) (segundo piso) y habla con Dnegan, que vio hace poco a un Puppetmaster y perdió su bolsa de gil en Caedarva Mire.",
    ["He offers a divination for 1,000 gil and asks ten questions. Upon success, Waoud mentions seeing all five serpent symbols; if he mentions only one, you can try again the next game day."] = "Ofrece una adivinación por 1,000 gil y hace diez preguntas. Si sale bien, Waoud dice haber visto los cinco símbolos de serpiente; si solo menciona uno, puedes volver a intentarlo al día de juego siguiente.",
    ["He sends you to three people, in any order. Fuepepe is in the east Aurastery building in Windurst Waters (North) (L-6); you may need to speak with him several times, as he repeats unrelated text before the line that continues the quest."] = "Te envía a ver a tres personas, en cualquier orden. Fuepepe está en el edificio este de la Aurastery en Windurst Waters (North) (L-6); puede que tengas que hablar con él varias veces, ya que repite texto sin relación antes de la frase que continúa la quest.",
    ["Head back to Chateau d'Oraguille and speak with Prince Trion for your reward."] = "Vuelve a Chateau d'Oraguille y habla con Prince Trion para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Head back to Horatius to trade the Dangruf Stone and receive your reward, 400 gil."] = "Vuelve con Horatius para entregar la Dangruf Stone y recibir tu recompensa, 400 gil.",
    ["Head back to Kubhe Ijyuhla, who started the quest, for another cutscene."] = "Vuelve con Kubhe Ijyuhla, que empezó la quest, para otra escena.",
    ["Head back to Norg and speak with Ryoma to complete the quest and receive your reward, Anju and Zushio."] = "Vuelve a Norg y habla con Ryoma para completar la quest y recibir tu recompensa, Anju y Zushio.",
    ["Head back to Oldton Movalpolos and speak with Koblakiq to complete the quest and receive your Jaguar Mantle."] = "Vuelve a Oldton Movalpolos y habla con Koblakiq para completar la quest y recibir tu Jaguar Mantle.",
    ["Head back to the Stone Monument in Riverne - Site #A01 and check it for a cutscene. Examine it again to spawn the NM Arcane Phantasm."] = "Vuelve al Stone Monument de Riverne - Site #A01 y revísalo para una escena. Examínalo de nuevo para invocar al NM Arcane Phantasm.",
    ["Head east from Bivouac #2 to the north-west corner of (J-6) in Morimar Basalt Fields and examine the Ergon Locus ??? south of the giant rock (it doesn't sparkle) for a cutscene and the key item Silver luopan. Party members helping without the key item get a one-time Bayld reward that grows with the party size."] = "Ve al este desde el Bivouac #2 hasta la esquina noroeste de (J-6) en Morimar Basalt Fields y examina la ??? Ergon Locus al sur de la roca gigante (no brilla) para una escena y el key item Silver luopan. Los miembros del grupo que ayuden sin el key item reciben una recompensa única de Bayld que aumenta con el tamaño del grupo.",
    ["Head north a short way and examine the Blank Target at (G/H-11) for a cutscene, then again for how to get an Ark Pentasphere. You must flag it there, or you get no credit and need another Ark Pentasphere. Divine Might now appears in your Outlands quests log."] = "Ve un poco al norte y examina el Blank Target de (G/H-11) para una escena, y de nuevo para saber cómo conseguir una Ark Pentasphere. Debes activarlo allí, o no obtendrás crédito y necesitarás otra Ark Pentasphere. Divine Might aparece ya en tu registro de quests de Outlands.",
    ["Head north up the ramp, then take the first left and continue west-northwest toward (H-10)."] = "Ve al norte subiendo la rampa, luego toma la primera a la izquierda y continúa al oeste-noroeste hacia (H-10).",
    ["Head north, down the stairs, and hit the lever to go through the middle door at (H-6). Then north again, down the stairs, and hit the lever for the left door this time."] = "Ve al norte, baja las escaleras y golpea la palanca para pasar por la puerta del medio en (H-6). Luego al norte de nuevo, baja las escaleras y golpea la palanca de la puerta izquierda esta vez.",
    ["Head northwest to (E-8) and check the Viscous Liquid for a cutscene."] = "Ve al noroeste hasta (E-8) y revisa el Viscous Liquid para una escena.",
    ["Head south to enter a large square room and trade Gerwitz's Sword to the ??? at (H-10) to spawn Gerwitz's Soul."] = "Ve al sur para entrar en una gran sala cuadrada y entrega Gerwitz's Sword a la ??? en (H-10) para invocar a Gerwitz's Soul.",
    ["Head south to the cave at (E-8) and examine the ??? there for another cutscene, then examine it again for 99 Ice Arrows."] = "Ve al sur hasta la cueva de (E-8) y examina allí la ??? para otra escena, y examínala de nuevo para obtener 99 Ice Arrows.",
    ["Head south to zone out of Mount Zhayolm, then zone back in."] = "Ve al sur para salir de Mount Zhayolm y vuelve a entrar.",
    ["Head to (B-8), the Secret Beach, in Valkurm Dunes. The Survival Guide teleport to Gustav Tunnel, then walking out, leaves you right next to the spawn point."] = "Ve a (B-8), la Secret Beach, en Valkurm Dunes. El teletransporte de la Survival Guide a Gustav Tunnel, y luego salir caminando, te deja justo al lado del punto de aparición.",
    ["Head to (G-8) in Wajaom Woodlands and trade the Hydrogauge to the Leypoint (an Olduum Ring or the Survival Guide gets you close). Wait one minute, then examine the Leypoint again."] = "Ve a (G-8) en Wajaom Woodlands y entrega el Hydrogauge al Leypoint (un Olduum Ring o la Survival Guide te dejan cerca). Espera un minuto y examina de nuevo el Leypoint.",
    ["Head to (H-6) to find a ???. It is on the top floor; do not go down the stairs. It is advised to clear the area around the ???."] = "Ve a (H-6) para encontrar una ???. Está en el piso superior; no bajes las escaleras. Se aconseja eliminar a los enemigos de alrededor de la ???.",
    ["Head to (I-8) and trade the Quadav Charm to the Jail Door, on the ground floor, for a cutscene and a Trader's sack."] = "Ve a (I-8) y entrega el Quadav Charm a la Jail Door, en la planta baja, para una escena y un Trader's sack.",
    ["Head to (K-6); the entrance is at (J-6) and leads to an area not shown on the map. Examine the Primordial Convergence from the south or west to spawn Burgeoning Flames, a Fire Elemental."] = "Ve a (K-6); la entrada está en (J-6) y lleva a una zona que no aparece en el mapa. Examina la Primordial Convergence desde el sur o el oeste para hacer aparecer a Burgeoning Flames, un Fire Elemental.",
    ["Head to Aht Urhgan Whitegate and talk to Iruki-Waraki (K-9, top floor)."] = "Ve a Aht Urhgan Whitegate y habla con Iruki-Waraki (K-9, piso superior).",
    ["Head to Beadeaux and kill a De'Vyu Headhunter to obtain a Quadav Charm."] = "Ve a Beadeaux y mata a un De'Vyu Headhunter para obtener un Quadav Charm.",
    ["Head to Boneyard Gully (Attohwa Chasm Home Point #1 is fastest) and select \"Tango with a Tracker\" at the Dark Miasma to enter a battlefield."] = "Ve a Boneyard Gully (el Home Point #1 de Attohwa Chasm es lo más rápido) y elige \"Tango with a Tracker\" en el Dark Miasma para entrar en un campo de batalla.",
    ["Head to Boneyard Gully and select \"Requiem of Sin\" at the Dark Miasma to enter a battlefield."] = "Ve a Boneyard Gully y elige \"Requiem of Sin\" en el Dark Miasma para entrar en un campo de batalla.",
    ["Head to Caedarva Mire and click the ??? at (K-8)."] = "Ve a Caedarva Mire y haz clic en la ??? en (K-8).",
    ["Head to Castle Oztroja and go to the Brass Door at (I-8)."] = "Ve a Castle Oztroja y dirígete a la Brass Door en (I-8).",
    ["Head to Castle Zvahl Baileys and fight Blood Demons and Demon Generals until you obtain a Demon Pen."] = "Ve a Castle Zvahl Baileys y lucha contra Blood Demons y Demon Generals hasta que obtengas una Demon Pen.",
    ["Head to Chateau d'Oraguille and speak with Chalvatot at (F-7) to receive the Moon ring."] = "Ve a Chateau d'Oraguille y habla con Chalvatot en (F-7) para recibir el Moon ring.",
    ["Head to Crawlers' Nest and open a Treasure Chest with a Nest Chest Key to obtain the key item Crawler blood. The chest has a 3 minute respawn time."] = "Ve a Crawlers' Nest y abre un Treasure Chest con una Nest Chest Key para obtener el key item Crawler blood. El cofre reaparece a los 3 minutos.",
    ["Head to Eldieme Necropolis from Batallia Downs (I-10). As soon as you zone in you receive a cutscene, after which the NPC Cannau appears. You can summon Trusts, but zoning in with an Adventuring Fellow makes the escort NPC disappear."] = "Ve a Eldieme Necropolis desde Batallia Downs (I-10). En cuanto entras en la zona recibes una escena, tras la cual aparece el NPC Cannau. Puedes invocar Trusts, pero entrar con un Adventuring Fellow hace desaparecer al NPC escoltado.",
    ["Head to Gusgen Mines and speak with Degga (H-9). Your level will be restricted to 25."] = "Ve a Gusgen Mines y habla con Degga (H-9). Tu nivel quedará limitado a 25.",
    ["Head to Horlais Peak by going through Yughott Grotto."] = "Ve a Horlais Peak pasando por Yughott Grotto.",
    ["Head to Ifrit's Cauldron using the entrance from (G-6) in Yhoator Jungle. The Survival Guide can also bring you there."] = "Ve a Ifrit's Cauldron por la entrada de (G-6) en Yhoator Jungle. La Survival Guide también te puede llevar.",
    ["Head to Jade Sepulcher and click the battlefield entrance (Ornamental Door) for a cutscene. The Home Point #1 warp from Aht Urhgan Whitegate to Bhaflau Thickets makes this fast."] = "Ve a Jade Sepulcher y haz clic en la entrada del campo de batalla (Ornamental Door) para una escena. El warp del Home Point #1 de Aht Urhgan Whitegate a Bhaflau Thickets lo hace rápido.",
    ["Head to Jugner Forest through King Ranperre's Tomb. If you have access to the Proto-Waypoint, it is the fastest way to reach the location."] = "Ve a Jugner Forest por King Ranperre's Tomb. Si tienes acceso al Proto-Waypoint, es la forma más rápida de llegar al lugar.",
    ["Head to Korroloka Tunnel and fill the flask at four Giant Clams: (F-10) on map 1 as you enter from Zeruhn Mines, (K-6) on map 3, (G-11) on map 5 and (I-10) on map 2. Washu's flask turns into a Flask of clam water."] = "Ve a Korroloka Tunnel y llena el frasco en cuatro Giant Clams: (F-10) en el mapa 1 al entrar desde Zeruhn Mines, (K-6) en el mapa 3, (G-11) en el mapa 5 e (I-10) en el mapa 2. El Washu's flask se convierte en un Flask of clam water.",
    ["Head to Kuftal Tunnel and examine the ??? just inside the entrance for a cutscene; the whole party must be close by, or you see nothing out of the ordinary. The Survival Guide is right at this entrance; otherwise a chocobo from Rabao gets you across the desert. The only monsters near the ??? are Sand Lizards, which don't aggro."] = "Ve a Kuftal Tunnel y examina la ??? justo al pasar la entrada para una escena; todo el grupo debe estar cerca, o no verás nada fuera de lo normal. La Survival Guide está justo en esta entrada; si no, un chocobo desde Rabao te lleva por el desierto. Los únicos monstruos cerca de la ??? son Sand Lizards, que no atacan.",
    ["Head to La Theine Plateau and check the Chocobo Tracks at the far northwest corner of (E-5), just south of the sliver of map in (E-4)."] = "Ve a La Theine Plateau y revisa las Chocobo Tracks en la esquina noroeste de (E-5), justo al sur del trocito de mapa en (E-4).",
    ["Head to Mamook using the (E-12) entrance in Wajaom Woodlands."] = "Ve a Mamook por la entrada (E-12) de Wajaom Woodlands.",
    ["Head to Metalworks, Home Point #1 (J-8), and speak with Naji."] = "Ve a Metalworks, Home Point #1 (J-8), y habla con Naji.",
    ["Head to Mount Zhayolm and click on the Sprightly Footsteps at (L-7) between 18:00 and 06:00. The Voidwatch teleport takes you to the exact location; casting Escape from inside Halvung puts you at (L-7), just north of it. Starting after 05:00 may not leave you time for the next cutscene before the hour changes."] = "Ve a Mount Zhayolm y pulsa los Sprightly Footsteps en (L-7) entre las 18:00 y las 06:00. El teletransporte de Voidwatch te lleva al lugar exacto; lanzar Escape dentro de Halvung te deja en (L-7), justo al norte. Si empiezas después de las 05:00, puede que no te dé tiempo a la siguiente escena antes de que cambie la hora.",
    ["Head to Norg and talk to Sohyon (J-8). Then talk to Washu to receive the key item Washu's flask."] = "Ve a Norg y habla con Sohyon (J-8). Luego habla con Washu para recibir el key item Washu's flask.",
    ["Head to Northern San d'Oria and speak with Mulaujeant at (E-5), on the second floor near the Blacksmithing Guild."] = "Ve a Northern San d'Oria y habla con Mulaujeant en (E-5), en el segundo piso cerca del Blacksmithing Guild.",
    ["Head to Oldton Movalpolos and defeat Moblin Ashman and Moblin Gurneyman enemies until one drops a Moblin Hotrok. Alternatively, go to Newton Movalpolos and defeat Moblin Groundman enemies."] = "Ve a Oldton Movalpolos y derrota a enemigos Moblin Ashman y Moblin Gurneyman hasta que uno suelte un Moblin Hotrok. Como alternativa, ve a Newton Movalpolos y derrota a enemigos Moblin Groundman.",
    ["Head to Qufim Island and kill Dancing Weapon enemies until you obtain a Kaiser Sword. Kaiser Swords can also sometimes be found at the Auction House."] = "Ve a Qufim Island y mata enemigos Dancing Weapon hasta conseguir una Kaiser Sword. A veces también se pueden encontrar Kaiser Swords en la Auction House.",
    ["Head to Rabao and talk to Zoriboh (F-6) to complete the quest and receive your reward, the Venerer Ring and 4,000 gil."] = "Ve a Rabao y habla con Zoriboh (F-6) para completar la quest y recibir tu recompensa, el Venerer Ring y 4,000 gil.",
    ["Head to Salaheem's Sentinels in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10) for a cutscene with Abquhbah, who redirects you to Hagakoff at (K-10)."] = "Ve a Salaheem's Sentinels en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10) para una escena con Abquhbah, que te redirige a Hagakoff en (K-10).",
    ["Head to Southern San d'Oria and speak with Sharzalion, and then with Daggao, who is in the bar as well. Optional: Curilla has extra dialogue at this point."] = "Ve a Southern San d'Oria y habla con Sharzalion y luego con Daggao, que también está en el bar. Opcional: Curilla tiene diálogo extra en este punto.",
    ["Head to Uleguerand Range. At (F-9) a slope leads all the way down to the zone entrance: slide down the southern slope (the one you see as you zone in) and aim for the ledge on your left; if you miss it, climb back up and try again. On the ledge, go into the hole to the ???."] = "Ve a Uleguerand Range. En (F-9) una pendiente baja hasta la entrada de la zona: deslízate por la pendiente sur (la que ves al entrar) y apunta a la cornisa de tu izquierda; si fallas, vuelve a subir e inténtalo otra vez. En la cornisa, entra en el agujero hasta la ???.",
    ["Head to Upper Jeuno and speak with Brutus at (G-7). This quest starts the first time you speak to him, together with Chocobo's Wounds."] = "Ve a Upper Jeuno y habla con Brutus en (G-7). Esta quest empieza la primera vez que le hablas, junto con Chocobo's Wounds.",
    ["Head to Wajaom Woodlands (D-9) and zone into Aydeewa Subterrane. Reach (G-10) on map 3 for a cutscene."] = "Ve a Wajaom Woodlands (D-9) y entra en Aydeewa Subterrane. Llega a (G-10) del mapa 3 para una escena.",
    ["Head to Wajaom Woodlands (K-7) and check the ??? at night (after 20:00 game time) for a cutscene."] = "Ve a Wajaom Woodlands (K-7) y revisa la ??? de noche (después de las 20:00 hora del juego) para una escena.",
    ["Head to West Ronfaure and look for Esca inside a tower at (F-6). She demands evidence."] = "Ve a West Ronfaure y busca a Esca dentro de una torre en (F-6). Te exige pruebas.",
    ["Head to the (G/H-10) boundary and exit into Wajaom Woodlands through the Ironbound Gate. As you zone, you watch a cutscene."] = "Ve al límite (G/H-10) y sal a Wajaom Woodlands por la Ironbound Gate. Al cambiar de zona, ves una escena.",
    ["Head to the Alchemy Guild at (G-5) for a cutscene."] = "Ve al Alchemy Guild en (G-5) para una escena.",
    ["Head to the Ashu Talif cutter in Arrapago Reef. Quickest: the Arrapago Ring (100 Imperial Standing accolades) teleports you in front of it, or from the Caedarva Mire Survival Guide go west out of the tunnel, then south into Arrapago Reef right beside it. Otherwise travel to the Dvucca Isle Staging Point and leave it, which puts you in Caedarva Mire (Map 2)."] = "Ve al cúter Ashu Talif en Arrapago Reef. Lo más rápido: el Arrapago Ring (100 accolades de Imperial Standing) te teletransporta frente a él, o desde la Survival Guide de Caedarva Mire sal del túnel hacia el oeste y luego al sur a Arrapago Reef, justo a su lado. Si no, viaja al Dvucca Isle Staging Point y sal, lo que te deja en Caedarva Mire (mapa 2).",
    ["Head to the Dilapidated Gate in Misareaux Coast at (F-7)."] = "Dirígete a la Dilapidated Gate en Misareaux Coast, en (F-7).",
    ["Head to the island in Batallia Downs (J-11). The only way to get there is through The Eldieme Necropolis: enter it from (I-10) in Batallia Downs. The Survival Guide puts you in the correct part of the Eldieme for this quest."] = "Ve a la isla de Batallia Downs (J-11). La única forma de llegar es por The Eldieme Necropolis: entra desde (I-10) en Batallia Downs. La Survival Guide te deja en la parte correcta de la Eldieme para esta quest.",
    ["Head to the island in Batallia Downs at (I-11). The only way there is through The Eldieme Necropolis: enter at (I-10) in Batallia Downs (or use the Survival Guide), hug the south side to the large room at (G-9) (you need someone to work the gates, or the Magicked astrolabe), drop through the grave at its center (point D) to map 2, then take point E to map 3 and follow the path south back out to Batallia Downs. Enemies in this section aggro by sound even at level 99."] = "Ve a la isla de Batallia Downs en (I-11). Solo se llega a través de The Eldieme Necropolis: entra por (I-10) en Batallia Downs (o usa la Survival Guide), pégate al lado sur hasta la sala grande de (G-9) (necesitas a alguien que accione las puertas, o el Magicked astrolabe), déjate caer por la tumba de su centro (punto D) al mapa 2, luego toma el punto E al mapa 3 y sigue el camino al sur de vuelta a Batallia Downs. Los enemigos de esta sección detectan por sonido incluso a nivel 99.",
    ["Head to the monument at the top of Zegham Hill in North Gustaberg (J-7). Fastest: the Oldton Movalpolos Survival Guide, then exit to North Gustaberg and climb from the middle of (I-6). Or use the Port Bastok exit near Home Point #1 and climb from the patch of trees at the (H-8)/(I-8) border."] = "Ve al monumento de la cima de Zegham Hill en North Gustaberg (J-7). Lo más rápido: la Survival Guide de Oldton Movalpolos, luego sal a North Gustaberg y sube desde el centro de (I-6). O usa la salida de Port Bastok cerca del Home Point #1 y sube desde el grupo de árboles en el límite entre (H-8) e (I-8).",
    ["Head to the room at (H-9) and mine in it until you find one of three key items: Electrocell, Electropot or Electrolocomotive. This is the same room where you finish the Blue Mage flag quest."] = "Ve a la sala en (H-9) y mina en ella hasta encontrar uno de tres key items: Electrocell, Electropot o Electrolocomotive. Es la misma sala donde terminas la quest de flag de Blue Mage.",
    ["Head towards Sea Serpent Grotto; you get another cutscene shortly before you reach the zone line."] = "Dirígete a Sea Serpent Grotto; verás otra escena poco antes de llegar a la línea de zona.",
    ["Head up to the third floor of the safehold and examine the ??? behind the pillar at (K-9), near the Walnut Door (maybe twice). You obtain the Alabaster hairpin."] = "Sube al tercer piso del refugio y examina la ??? detrás de la columna de (K-9), cerca de la Walnut Door (quizá dos veces). Obtienes el Alabaster hairpin.",
    ["Head west to (F-9) and zone into Arrapago Reef through entrance 3. Head north to (H-8) to find the Cutter."] = "Ve al oeste hasta (F-9) y entra en Arrapago Reef por la entrada 3. Ve al norte hasta (H-8) para encontrar el Cutter.",
    ["Help the chocobo leave when prompted."] = "Ayuda al chocobo a marcharse cuando se te pida.",
    ["Hieronymus sends you to the Quartermaster at (H-9) in Bastok Markets (S). Obtain the supplies that he requests, either by gathering them or by buying them at the Auction House, and hand them over."] = "Hieronymus te envía al Quartermaster at (H-9) in Bastok Markets (S). Consigue los suministros que pide, ya sea recolectándolos o comprándolos en la Auction House, y entrégaselos.",
    ["Holy Moly in Yuhtunga Jungle: rifts at (F-11), (G-6) and (J-7)."] = "Holy Moly en Yuhtunga Jungle: rifts en (F-11), (G-6) y (J-7).",
    ["Hunt Orcish Fodders in East or West Ronfaure for an Orcish Axe."] = "Caza Orcish Fodders en East o West Ronfaure para conseguir un Orcish Axe.",
    ["Huu Xalmo the Savage drops the Xalmo Feather. Trade the feather to Ayame for your Temple Hose."] = "Huu Xalmo the Savage suelta la Xalmo Feather. Entrega la pluma a Ayame por tus Temple Hose.",
    ["If Suldiran is taken prisoner during Besieged, this quest is unavailable until he is rescued. This quest requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Si Suldiran es hecho prisionero durante Besieged, esta quest no está disponible hasta que sea rescatado. Esta quest requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["If Wings of the Goddess has not been started, receive Lightsworm here."] = "Si Wings of the Goddess no se ha empezado, recibe Lightsworm aquí.",
    ["If Wings of the Goddess is complete, examine the sparkling ??? beside a Cavernous Maw in Batallia Downs, Rolanberry Fields, or Sauromugue Champaign."] = "Si Wings of the Goddess está completo, examina la ??? reluciente junto a un Cavernous Maw en Batallia Downs, Rolanberry Fields o Sauromugue Champaign.",
    ["If Wings of the Goddess is incomplete, progress to at least In the Name of the Father and zone into Southern San d'Oria (S)."] = "Si Wings of the Goddess está incompleto, avanza al menos hasta In the Name of the Father y entra en Southern San d'Oria (S).",
    ["If Zayhi-Bauhi speaks normally instead of coughing, speak with Kalupa-Tawalupa and Rutango-Botango in front of him to receive the quest."] = "Si Zayhi-Bauhi habla con normalidad en lugar de toser, habla con Kalupa-Tawalupa y Rutango-Botango delante de él para recibir la quest.",
    ["If the Southern San d'Oria (S) event does not occur, first examine the sparkling ??? beside a present-day Cavernous Maw."] = "Si no se produce el evento de Southern San d'Oria (S), examina primero la ??? reluciente junto a un Cavernous Maw actual.",
    ["If the opening dialogue does not occur, proceed to the Captain's Chamber and speak with Gilgamesh (L-8) there."] = "Si no se produce el diálogo inicial, ve a la Captain's Chamber y habla allí con Gilgamesh (L-8).",
    ["If the opening event does not occur, examine a Tales' Beginning at one of those locations."] = "Si no se produce el evento inicial, examina un Tales' Beginning en una de esas ubicaciones.",
    ["If the quest Class Reunion is active, finish it first: you cannot start this quest until it is complete."] = "Si la quest Class Reunion está activa, termínala primero: no puedes empezar esta quest hasta completarla.",
    ["If the relevant rank missions were already completed, speak with Halver at Chateau d'Oraguille (I-9) for Cipher: Halver's Alter Ego."] = "Si las rank missions relevantes ya estaban completadas, habla con Halver en Chateau d'Oraguille (I-9) para Cipher: Halver's Alter Ego.",
    ["If the relevant rank missions were already completed, speak with Kupipi in Heavens Tower for Cipher: Semih's Alter Ego."] = "Si las rank missions relevantes ya estaban completadas, habla con Kupipi en Heavens Tower para Cipher: Semih's Alter Ego.",
    ["If the rod does not drop, rezone without touching the Hume Bones and repeat the quest from the beginning for another chance."] = "Si la vara no cae, cambia de zona sin tocar los Hume Bones y repite la quest desde el principio para otra oportunidad.",
    ["If the yellow Seed Afterglow is not at its usual location, check the circular room around (H-9)/(I-9)."] = "Si el Seed Afterglow amarillo no está en su sitio habitual, revisa la sala circular cerca de (H-9)/(I-9).",
    ["If there is weather when you attempt the quest, you have to wait for it to clear up to find the ???."] = "Si hay clima cuando intentas la quest, tienes que esperar a que despeje para encontrar la ???.",
    ["If this is not your first Trust quest, you are finished with the quest at this point and receive the Bastok Trust permit."] = "Si no es tu primera quest de Trust, terminas la quest en este punto y recibes el Bastok Trust permit.",
    ["If this is your first Magicite mission, speak with Paya-Sabya."] = "Si es tu primera misión de Magicite, habla con Paya-Sabya.",
    ["If this is your first Trust quest, you must use the Trust spell Kupipi in West Sarutabaruta or East Sarutabaruta, then return to Kupipi to receive the Windurst Trust permit."] = "Si es tu primera quest de Trust, debes usar el hechizo de Trust Kupipi en West Sarutabaruta o East Sarutabaruta, y luego volver con Kupipi para recibir el Windurst Trust permit.",
    ["If this is your first Trust quest, you must use the Trust spell Naji in South Gustaberg or North Gustaberg. After that, return to Naji to receive the Bastok Trust permit."] = "Si es tu primera quest de Trust, debes usar el hechizo de Trust Naji en South Gustaberg o North Gustaberg. Después, vuelve con Naji para recibir el Bastok Trust permit.",
    ["If this is your first time heading to Xarcabard, you may use the Unity level 125 warp to Xarcabard."] = "Si es la primera vez que vas a Xarcabard, puedes usar el warp de Unity de nivel 125 a Xarcabard.",
    ["If you answer all the questions correctly, you are sent after a Tahrongi Cactus."] = "Si respondes bien todas las preguntas, te envían a buscar un Tahrongi Cactus.",
    ["If you are doing this quest for a Vana'Bout objective and have already completed it once, you do not need to speak with Tapoh Lihzeh again: just trade her the items."] = "Si haces esta quest para un objetivo de Vana'Bout y ya la completaste una vez, no necesitas hablar de nuevo con Tapoh Lihzeh: solo entrégale los objetos.",
    ["If you are on the mission The Horutoto Ruins Experiment, complete it first. If you are on Saintly Invitation, finish the fight against the Yagudo first, or the quest will not start."] = "Si estás en la misión The Horutoto Ruins Experiment, complétala primero. Si estás en Saintly Invitation, termina primero la pelea contra los Yagudo, o la quest no empezará.",
    ["If you called for help during the battle, wait about one minute and examine the target again."] = "Si pediste ayuda durante la batalla, espera aproximadamente un minuto y examina de nuevo el objetivo.",
    ["If you choose correctly, you are given 500 gil. If you choose incorrectly, you fail the quest."] = "Si eliges bien, te dan 500 gil. Si eliges mal, fallas la quest.",
    ["If you choose correctly, you receive 500 gil. If you choose incorrectly, you fail the quest."] = "Si eliges bien, recibes 500 gil. Si eliges mal, fallas la quest.",
    ["If you chose the wrong earring or want a different one, drop your earring and proceed to the Empyreal Paradox (it must be dropped before you zone into the Empyreal Paradox). The fastest way is the Home Point warp: Lumoria, The Garden of Ru'Hmet, #1, and descend."] = "Si elegiste el pendiente equivocado o quieres uno distinto, suelta tu pendiente y ve al Empyreal Paradox (debe soltarse antes de entrar en la zona Empyreal Paradox). La forma más rápida es el warp del Home Point: Lumoria, The Garden of Ru'Hmet, #1, y descender.",
    ["If you did not originally watch the extra scene for completing An Empty Vessel, you need to speak to him again after zoning. Choose \"Gaze away\", then \"I have\" in the cutscene (\"..\" doesn't start the quest and means waiting a game day to try again). The quest log says you have the quest from Raubahn, even though Waoud acts as your contact."] = "Si no viste en su momento la escena extra por completar An Empty Vessel, tienes que volver a hablar con él tras cambiar de zona. Elige \"Gaze away\" y luego \"I have\" en la escena (\"..\" no empieza la quest y obliga a esperar un día de juego para volver a intentarlo). El registro de quests dice que tienes la quest de Raubahn, aunque Waoud hace de contacto.",
    ["If you do not examine the Tiger Bones soon enough after its death, you must examine them again and watch it die naturally once more."] = "Si no examinas los Tiger Bones lo bastante pronto tras su muerte, debes examinarlos de nuevo y mirar cómo muere de forma natural otra vez.",
    ["If you do not have a Delkfutt Key, climb the tower normally until you reach the 10th floor."] = "Si no tienes una Delkfutt Key, sube la torre normalmente hasta llegar al piso 10.",
    ["If you do not read the note: proceed to Zeruhn Mines and locate Zelman at (I-8). He tells you that he is busy and to tell Tami. Return to Tami for your reward of 10 gil. You can then repeat the quest."] = "Si no lees la nota: ve a Zeruhn Mines y localiza a Zelman en (I-8). Te dice que está ocupado y que se lo digas a Tami. Vuelve con Tami por tu recompensa de 10 gil. Después puedes repetir la quest.",
    ["If you don't unequip your weapons, the tear isn't collected and the ??? moves somewhere else."] = "Si no te quitas las armas, la lágrima no se recoge y la ??? se mueve a otro sitio.",
    ["If you drop the Carbuncle's Ruby before completing the quest, you do not lose progress; simply obtain another one."] = "Si sueltas el Carbuncle's Ruby antes de completar la quest, no pierdes progreso; simplemente consigue otro.",
    ["If you drop your Olduum Ring, speak to Dkhaaya to repeat the quest."] = "Si tiras tu Olduum Ring, habla con Dkhaaya para repetir la quest.",
    ["If you entered from La Theine Plateau (H-7) you arrive on map 1 (K-3): head to (I-5), a room with Fly Agaric enemies. If you used the Survival Guide you arrive on map 2 (G-2): go to map 1 (Point A, G-4), then to (I-5)."] = "Si entraste desde La Theine Plateau (H-7) llegas al mapa 1 (K-3): ve a (I-5), una sala con enemigos Fly Agaric. Si usaste la Survival Guide llegas al mapa 2 (G-2): ve al mapa 1 (Point A, G-4) y luego a (I-5).",
    ["If you entered the Hall of the Gods from Ru'Aun Gardens, return to Ro'Maeve and enter the Hall of the Gods again."] = "Si entraste en la Hall of the Gods desde Ru'Aun Gardens, vuelve a Ro'Maeve y entra de nuevo en la Hall of the Gods.",
    ["If you fail, return to the Stone Circle in La Theine Plateau at (G-6) and obtain another Breath of the avatars."] = "Si fallas, vuelve al Stone Circle en La Theine Plateau, en (G-6), y obtén otro Breath of the avatars.",
    ["If you forget how far you are, talk to the Opo-opos on the list: those already given the right item say \"Opopopopo!\" and bow. Wide scan lists them in the right order if you can get all 10 in one scan."] = "Si olvidas por dónde vas, habla con los Opo-opos de la lista: los que ya recibieron el objeto correcto dicen \"Opopopopo!\" y hacen una reverencia. El widescan los muestra en el orden correcto si consigues los 10 en un mismo escaneo.",
    ["If you get a cutscene about a Shikaree tracker, that is for Tango with a Tracker: go talk to Despachiaire at (K-10), behind a Walnut Door, then return to Parelbriaux and talk to him twice more for a cutscene with Chemioue."] = "Si ves una escena sobre un rastreador Shikaree, es de Tango with a Tracker: habla con Despachiaire en (K-10), tras una Walnut Door, y luego vuelve con Parelbriaux y habla con él dos veces más para una escena con Chemioue.",
    ["If you get the A Moogle Kupo d'Etat cutscene instead, speak to him again. If an item that gives weekly conquest rewards (such as an Aurum Coffer) is in your layout, you may need to remove it to trigger the quest."] = "Si en su lugar ves la escena de A Moogle Kupo d'Etat, vuelve a hablar con él. Si tienes en la distribución un objeto que da recompensas semanales de conquest (como un Aurum Coffer), puede que tengas que quitarlo para activar la quest.",
    ["If you get the message \"Someone has been digging here\", you forgot to speak to Curilla after trading the Velvet Cloth."] = "Si recibes el mensaje \"Someone has been digging here\", olvidaste hablar con Curilla tras entregar la Velvet Cloth.",
    ["If you have a Delkfutt Key, go to (E-8), pass through the Cermet Door, and continue to the next Cermet Door at (J-8)."] = "Si tienes una Delkfutt Key, ve a (E-8), atraviesa la Cermet Door y continúa hasta la siguiente Cermet Door en (J-8).",
    ["If you have any other Borghertz's Hands quest active, you must complete that one before you can start this quest."] = "Si tienes activa cualquier otra quest de Borghertz's Hands, debes completarla antes de poder empezar esta quest.",
    ["If you have attuned to them, the Runic Portal at (L-7) in Whitegate is quickest: 200 Imperial Standing per warp (one Copper Voucher gives the 1,000 for all five), free under Assault orders for that area or at rank Captain."] = "Si te has sintonizado con ellos, el Runic Portal de (L-7) en Whitegate es lo más rápido: 200 Imperial Standing por warp (un Copper Voucher da los 1,000 de los cinco), gratis con órdenes de Assault para esa zona o con rango Captain.",
    ["If you have just completed Blue Ribbon Blues, zone first."] = "Si acabas de completar Blue Ribbon Blues, cambia de zona primero.",
    ["If you have just completed Teak Me to the Stars, you must zone before starting this quest. You need Bastok fame level 4."] = "Si acabas de completar Teak Me to the Stars, debes cambiar de zona antes de empezar esta quest. Necesitas el nivel 4 de fama de Bastok.",
    ["If you have not returned the item before the airship lands, you keep it and must give it back to Swift before you can take the quest again."] = "Si no has devuelto el objeto antes de que aterrice la aeronave, te lo quedas y debes devolvérselo a Swift antes de poder volver a aceptar la quest.",
    ["If you have not yet completed the quest The Rumor, you can speak to Novalmauge a second time to accept it. You no longer need to complete The Rumor before advancing the job quest."] = "Si aún no has completado la quest The Rumor, puedes hablar una segunda vez con Novalmauge para aceptarla. Ya no necesitas completar The Rumor antes de avanzar la quest de trabajo.",
    ["If you have not yet gained access to Aht Urhgan Whitegate through the quest The Road to Aht Urhgan, you may trade your Testimony afterwards under the advanced path option and complete the quest."] = "Si aún no has accedido a Aht Urhgan Whitegate mediante la quest The Road to Aht Urhgan, puedes entregar tu Testimony después en la opción de camino avanzado y completar la quest.",
    ["If you just finished Ghosts of the Past, you must zone before beginning this quest. You must be on Monk."] = "Si acabas de terminar Ghosts of the Past, debes cambiar de zona antes de empezar esta quest. Debes ser Monk.",
    ["If you leave Grauberg (S), you lose any gold dust you have acquired and have to start over."] = "Si sales de Grauberg (S), pierdes el polvo de oro que hayas conseguido y tendrás que empezar de nuevo.",
    ["If you lose the Purple Ribbon, you must wait until the next Conquest Tally to get it back. If several party members need the quest, wait 5 minutes after the defeat between each spawn."] = "Si pierdes la Purple Ribbon, debes esperar al siguiente Conquest Tally para recuperarla. Si varios miembros del grupo necesitan la quest, espera 5 minutos tras la derrota entre cada aparición.",
    ["If you lose the Well Water, touch the tombstone in King Ranperre's Tomb to receive a Tomb Waterskin, then trade it to the water well in Southern San d'Oria (F-6) to get a new Well Water."] = "Si pierdes el Well Water, toca la tombstone de King Ranperre's Tomb para recibir un Tomb Waterskin y entrégalo al water well de Southern San d'Oria (F-6) para obtener un Well Water nuevo.",
    ["If you lose, speak with Masad twice to try again."] = "Si pierdes, habla con Masad dos veces para intentarlo de nuevo.",
    ["If you need the recipe, speak with Kuroido-Moido (E-7) in Port Windurst, or with Faulpie in Southern San d'Oria or Abd-al-Raziq in Bastok Mines."] = "Si necesitas la receta, habla con Kuroido-Moido (E-7) en Port Windurst, con Faulpie en Southern San d'Oria o con Abd-al-Raziq en Bastok Mines.",
    ["If you need to re-apply the scent for The Opo-opo and I, you can check the three Rafflesia flowers in Yuhtunga Jungle once per game day until you get the scent back."] = "Si necesitas volver a ponerte el olor para The Opo-opo and I, puedes revisar las tres flores Rafflesia de Yuhtunga Jungle una vez por día de juego hasta recuperarlo.",
    ["If you read the note: proceed to Zeruhn Mines and locate Zelman at (I-8), then go to the Bat's Lair Inn at (H-5) in Bastok Mines and buy a Meat Jerky from Griselda."] = "Si lees la nota: ve a Zeruhn Mines y localiza a Zelman en (I-8), luego ve al Bat's Lair Inn en (H-5) de Bastok Mines y compra un Meat Jerky a Griselda.",
    ["If you say yes, he asks you to get the floor plans back from the Orcs: Orcish Serjeants in Fort Ghelsba, Davoi and Yughott Grotto can drop the Castle Floor Plans. You can flag the next quest by fame alone, but this one is only marked complete once you turn in the plans."] = "Si dices que sí, te pide recuperar los planos de manos de los Orcs: los Orcish Serjeants de Fort Ghelsba, Davoi y Yughott Grotto pueden soltar los Castle Floor Plans. Puedes activar la siguiente quest solo con fama, pero esta solo se marca como completada al entregar los planos.",
    ["If you spoke to Apururu in that cutscene instead, return to the Manustery in Windurst Woods (Home Point #3)."] = "Si en esa escena hablaste en cambio con Apururu, vuelve a la Manustery de Windurst Woods (Home Point #3).",
    ["If you spoke to Joker during the previous cutscene, return to the House of the Hero for your reward."] = "Si hablaste con Joker durante la escena anterior, vuelve a la House of the Hero por tu recompensa.",
    ["If you still need the Yagudo Torch, speak with Paya-Sabya at (I-8) in Upper Jeuno, then speak with Muckvix at (H-9) in Lower Jeuno."] = "Si aún necesitas la Yagudo Torch, habla con Paya-Sabya en (I-8) en Upper Jeuno, luego habla con Muckvix en (H-9) en Lower Jeuno.",
    ["If you trade her the wrong flower, such as one meant for the other two Mog House exit quests, she keeps it and you will have to get another."] = "Si le entregas la flor equivocada, como una destinada a las otras dos quests de salida del Mog House, se la queda y tendrás que conseguir otra.",
    ["If you trade her the wrong flower, such as one meant for the other two Mog House exit quests, she takes it and you will have to get another."] = "Si le entregas la flor equivocada, como una destinada a las otras dos quests de salida del Mog House, se la queda y tendrás que conseguir otra.",
    ["If your Windurst fame is level 4 or higher, you are assigned Let Sleeping Dogs Lie instead, and you cannot start this quest until you complete that one."] = "Si tu fama de Windurst es nivel 4 o superior, te asignan Let Sleeping Dogs Lie en su lugar, y no puedes empezar esta quest hasta completar aquella.",
    ["Ildebrann in Ifrit's Cauldron: rifts on Map 3 at (F-9), and on Map 5 at (F-9) and (I-6). The closest teleport is the Unity Warp (level 125) to Map 5."] = "Ildebrann en Ifrit's Cauldron: rifts en el mapa 3 en (F-9), y en el mapa 5 en (F-9) e (I-6). El teletransporte más cercano es el Unity Warp (nivel 125) al mapa 5.",
    ["In Arrapago Reef you arrive at (I-11). With Sneak and Invisible (Silent Oil and Prism Powder, or a Dancer subjob), go to the Iron Gate at (J-10) and trade it the Lamian Fang Key."] = "En Arrapago Reef llegas a (I-11). Con Sneak e Invisible (Silent Oil y Prism Powder, o Dancer como support job), ve a la Iron Gate de (J-10) y entrégale la Lamian Fang Key.",
    ["In Bastok Markets: Horatius (I-9), Arawn (J-10), Harmodios (K-10), Pavel (E-11) and Ken (E-10)."] = "En Bastok Markets: Horatius (I-9), Arawn (J-10), Harmodios (K-10), Pavel (E-11) y Ken (E-10).",
    ["In Beadeaux, go down at (H-7) into the tunnels and out at (F-8). The Afflictors curse anyone nearby (Cursna or Holy Water) unless you're silenced: touch The Mute in the north of (G-7) first (Echo Drops or Silena remove the silence)."] = "En Beadeaux, baja en (H-7) a los túneles y sal por (F-8). Los Afflictors maldicen a cualquiera que esté cerca (Cursna o Holy Water) salvo que estés silenciado: toca antes a The Mute en el norte de (G-7) (Echo Drops o Silena quitan el silencio).",
    ["In Bibiki Bay - Purgonorgo Isle, fish up a Lancet Jagil (Minnows seem to work as bait) and defeat it until one drops a Cleanly Snapped Rod."] = "En Bibiki Bay - Purgonorgo Isle, pesca un Lancet Jagil (los Minnows parecen servir como cebo) y derrótalo hasta que uno suelte una Cleanly Snapped Rod.",
    ["In Buburimu Peninsula, go to the beach just west of Mhaura via the ramp at (H-9), head to its south-west corner and into the water; a tunnel leads to the next beach. Examine the Song Runes there at (G-9) for a cutscene."] = "En Buburimu Peninsula, ve a la playa justo al oeste de Mhaura por la rampa de (H-9), dirígete a su esquina suroeste y entra en el agua; un túnel lleva a la playa siguiente. Examina allí las Song Runes en (G-9) para una escena.",
    ["In Castle Oztroja, go through the Brass Door at (I-8) on Map 1 (watch out for the trapdoor lever), take exit (F) at (G-7) on Map 2, then (I) to Map 7, and fish in the pond in the middle of the big square room at (H-8)/(H-9). Fishing skill is not needed; a Clothespole or a Composite Fishing Rod works well."] = "En Castle Oztroja, cruza la Brass Door de (I-8) en el mapa 1 (cuidado con la palanca de la trampilla), toma la salida (F) en (G-7) del mapa 2, luego la (I) al mapa 7, y pesca en el estanque del centro de la gran sala cuadrada de (H-8)/(H-9). No hace falta skill de pesca; una Clothespole o una Composite Fishing Rod funcionan bien.",
    ["In Castle Zvahl Baileys, examine the ??? at (I-8), behind the gate where Dark Spark spawns, to spawn Marquis Andrealphus with 2 Demon Bannerets and 2 Demon Secretaries (sleepable). Nearby demons link. Only the Marquis must die; the extras then die too. He can Escape whoever has hate back to Xarcabard, unless only one party member is left in the zone or you're solo."] = "En Castle Zvahl Baileys, examina la ??? de (I-8), detrás de la puerta donde aparece Dark Spark, para hacer aparecer a Marquis Andrealphus con 2 Demon Bannerets y 2 Demon Secretaries (se pueden dormir). Los demonios cercanos se enlazan. Solo hay que matar al Marquis; los demás mueren entonces también. Puede usar Escape para mandar a Xarcabard a quien tenga el odio, salvo que solo quede un miembro del grupo en la zona o vayas solo.",
    ["In Castle Zvahl Keep (S), locate Rikke at (G-7) northwest, Rakke at (G-10) southwest, and Rokke at (H-10) southeast."] = "En Castle Zvahl Keep (S), localiza a Rikke en (G-7) al noroeste, a Rakke en (G-10) al suroeste y a Rokke en (H-10) al sureste.",
    ["In Cirdas Caverns (M-8/9), examine the Overgrown Grave on the ground, to the right of the Ergon Locus, for a cutscene. The Augural Conveyor to Cirdas Caverns is quickest, otherwise the Yorcia Weald Frontier Station; a Colonization Reive at (M-8) may block the way."] = "En Cirdas Caverns (M-8/9), examina la Overgrown Grave del suelo, a la derecha del Ergon Locus, para una escena. El Augural Conveyor a Cirdas Caverns es lo más rápido; si no, la Frontier Station de Yorcia Weald; una Colonization Reive en (M-8) puede bloquear el paso.",
    ["In Crawlers' Nest, trade the right berry to the baskets in the circular rooms. Each trade has a chance to spawn an NM crawler at one of the room's exits; it walks to the basket and then attacks you, and always drops the upgraded berry. Bring several stacks for the higher tiers."] = "En Crawlers' Nest, entrega la baya correcta a las cestas de las salas circulares. Cada entrega tiene una probabilidad de hacer aparecer un NM crawler en una de las salidas de la sala; camina hasta la cesta y luego te ataca, y siempre suelta la baya mejorada. Lleva varios montones para los niveles más altos.",
    ["In Dangruf Wadi, beat three more Goblins at dice, in order. Trade each one their favorite item before every roll; it is used up win or lose, and losing makes the next game easier."] = "En Dangruf Wadi, gana a los dados a tres Goblins más, en orden. Entrega a cada uno su objeto favorito antes de cada tirada; se gasta ganes o pierdas, y perder hace más fácil la siguiente partida.",
    ["In Dangruf Wadi, the ??? is at the (I-5)/(J-5) boundary during sunny weather (the default, with no weather icon). Choose the option to check the area to receive the Dangruf Stone."] = "En Dangruf Wadi, la ??? está en el límite entre (I-5) y (J-5) con clima soleado (el normal, sin icono de clima). Elige la opción de registrar la zona para recibir la Dangruf Stone.",
    ["In Davoi, examine the Village Well at (G-9) to spawn Three-eyed Prozpuz (RNG) and One-eyed Gwajboj (PLD). Gwajboj drops the Well Weight; only one drops per fight, so each extra Paladin waits 3 minutes for another fight."] = "En Davoi, examina el Village Well de (G-9) para hacer aparecer a Three-eyed Prozpuz (RNG) y One-eyed Gwajboj (PLD). Gwajboj suelta el Well Weight; solo cae uno por pelea, así que cada Paladin adicional espera 3 minutos para otra pelea.",
    ["In Davoi, find the Hide Flap on one of the huts around (F-7)/(G-7) and examine it to spawn Deloknok (PLD) and Bilopdop (MNK)."] = "En Davoi, busca la Hide Flap en una de las chozas de (F-7)/(G-7) y examínala para hacer aparecer a Deloknok (PLD) y Bilopdop (MNK).",
    ["In Davoi, trade the Treasury Gold to the ??? at (J-11) to spawn Hematic Cyst. Defeat it and examine the ??? again for a cutscene."] = "En Davoi, entrega el Treasury Gold a la ??? en (J-11) para hacer aparecer a Hematic Cyst. Derrótalo y examina de nuevo la ??? para una escena.",
    ["In Fei'Yin (Home Point #2 is fastest), go to the basement (map 2) at (F-6) and examine the north-western Cermet Door for a cutscene with Rukususu. If you kill too many monsters while carrying the spell, it breaks into Shantotto's ex-spell; get another from Torino-Samarino."] = "En Fei'Yin (el Home Point #2 es lo más rápido), ve al sótano (mapa 2) en (F-6) y examina la Cermet Door del noroeste para una escena con Rukususu. Si matas demasiados monstruos llevando el hechizo, se rompe y se convierte en Shantotto's ex-spell; consigue otro de Torino-Samarino.",
    ["In Fei'Yin, defeat Shadows until one drops Treasury Gold (one per party is enough)."] = "En Fei'Yin, derrota Shadows hasta que uno suelte Treasury Gold (con uno por grupo basta).",
    ["In Foret de Hennetiel, go to the secret beach at (J-11), south of Bivouac #2, and examine the Bloodstained Glove on the shoreline for a cutscene."] = "En Foret de Hennetiel, ve a la playa secreta de (J-11), al sur del Bivouac #2, y examina el Bloodstained Glove de la orilla para una escena.",
    ["In Gusgen Mines, go straight ahead and down the staircase, and use the west switch to open the door to map 2. Take the ramp down at (F-5) to map 3 and trade the Pickaxe to the ??? at (G-7) to spawn the Wandering Ghost (about 3 minutes between spawns)."] = "En Gusgen Mines, sigue recto y baja la escalera, y usa el interruptor oeste para abrir la puerta al mapa 2. Baja por la rampa de (F-5) al mapa 3 y entrega el Pickaxe a la ??? en (G-7) para hacer aparecer al Wandering Ghost (unos 3 minutos entre apariciones).",
    ["In Jugner Forest, head for the Maiden's Spring at (E-6); a cutscene starts as you get close."] = "En Jugner Forest, dirígete al Maiden's Spring en (E-6); al acercarte empieza una escena.",
    ["In Jugner Forest, speak with Alexius at the very top of (I-6) near the lake. He saw the creature, and says Semih Lafihna was looking for it at the south end of the lake during a full moon (no full moon is needed)."] = "En Jugner Forest, habla con Alexius en lo más alto de (I-6), cerca del lago. Vio a la criatura y dice que Semih Lafihna la buscaba en el extremo sur del lago durante una luna llena (no hace falta luna llena).",
    ["In Kazham, trade 10,000 gil to Magriffon (I-7), in Celodehki's Bed & Breakfast, for the key items Letter from Magriffon and Providence pot."] = "En Kazham, entrega 10,000 gil a Magriffon (I-7), en Celodehki's Bed & Breakfast, para obtener los key items Letter from Magriffon y Providence pot.",
    ["In Korroloka Tunnel, go to (K-8) on Map 5. The quickest entrance is from Western Altepa Desert (M-8) via the Survival Guide, which puts you straight onto Map 5; the Zeruhn Mines Survival Guide is also close. Click on the ??? to spawn 3 Korroloka Leech enemies. They link with any Thread Leech enemies nearby. If the leeches do not appear after you click the ???, try relogging."] = "En Korroloka Tunnel, ve a (K-8) en el mapa 5. La entrada más rápida es desde Western Altepa Desert (M-8) con la Survival Guide, que te deja directamente en el mapa 5; la Survival Guide de Zeruhn Mines también está cerca. Pulsa la ??? para hacer aparecer 3 enemigos Korroloka Leech. Se enlazan con los enemigos Thread Leech cercanos. Si las sanguijuelas no aparecen tras pulsar la ???, prueba a reconectar.",
    ["In Lower Jeuno, trade the garlic to Muckvix in Muckvix's Junk Shop (Goblins' Goblet, H-10) for a long cutscene, 2,000 gil and the key item Letter from Muckvix."] = "En Lower Jeuno, entrega el ajo a Muckvix en Muckvix's Junk Shop (Goblins' Goblet, H-10) para una escena larga, 2,000 gil y el key item Letter from Muckvix.",
    ["In Lufaise Meadows, examine the ??? at (G-6) during foggy weather (most often early morning) to spawn the NM Baumesel. Defeat it and examine the ??? again."] = "En Lufaise Meadows, examina la ??? en (G-6) con niebla (sobre todo a primera hora de la mañana) para hacer aparecer al NM Baumesel. Derrótalo y examina de nuevo la ???.",
    ["In Lufaise Meadows, examine the ??? at (I-8) to spawn Blackbone Frazdiz (DRK) and Rainbringer Vjatvot (BLM). Both can be slept briefly, and nearby Orcs link."] = "En Lufaise Meadows, examina la ??? en (I-8) para hacer aparecer a Blackbone Frazdiz (DRK) y Rainbringer Vjatvot (BLM). Ambos se pueden dormir un poco, y los Orcs cercanos se enlazan.",
    ["In Marjami Ravine, go to the ??? at the base of the waterfall east of Bivouac #2 (I-8), use Ignis three times, then examine it for a cutscene and the key item Vial of vivid rainbow extract. If nothing happens, go back to Gaddiux and repeat his dialogue."] = "En Marjami Ravine, ve a la ??? de la base de la cascada al este del Bivouac #2 (I-8), usa Ignis tres veces y luego examínala para una escena y el key item Vial of vivid rainbow extract. Si no pasa nada, vuelve con Gaddiux y repite su diálogo.",
    ["In Maze of Shakhrami map 2, examine the Iron Door in the room in the north-west corner of (K-9) to spawn Lost Soul (any job). Closest is the Unity Warp (level 119) to Buburimu Peninsula, or the Abyssea - Attohwa warp or Buburimu Survival Guide and the zone line at (F-6); then take exit H to map 2. From the start of map 1: exit C to map 2, F to map 1, H to map 2."] = "En el mapa 2 de Maze of Shakhrami, examina la Iron Door de la sala de la esquina noroeste de (K-9) para hacer aparecer a Lost Soul (cualquier job). Lo más cercano es el Unity Warp (nivel 119) a Buburimu Peninsula, o el warp de Abyssea - Attohwa o la Survival Guide de Buburimu y el límite de zona de (F-6); luego toma la salida H al mapa 2. Desde el inicio del mapa 1: salida C al mapa 2, F al mapa 1, H al mapa 2.",
    ["In Metalworks: Romualdo (K-9), in the southeastern Cannonry, and Elayne (G-8), at the entrance to the Temple of the Goddess. In Port Bastok: Ehrhard (G-5), in the northeast corner outside Warehouse #1, and Latifah (J-8), north of the drawbridge."] = "En Metalworks: Romualdo (K-9), en el Cannonry sureste, y Elayne (G-8), en la entrada del Temple of the Goddess. En Port Bastok: Ehrhard (G-5), en la esquina noreste fuera del Warehouse #1, y Latifah (J-8), al norte del puente levadizo.",
    ["In Mhaura, speak twice with Koh Lenbalalako (F-9) for a cutscene. She asks you for a Gold Earring."] = "En Mhaura, habla dos veces con Koh Lenbalalako (F-9) para una escena. Te pide un Gold Earring.",
    ["In Misareaux Coast, get a Misareaux Garlic from the Orcs."] = "En Misareaux Coast, consigue un Misareaux Garlic de los Orcs.",
    ["In Moh Gates (K-8), trade an Ifritite to the Molten Rift for a cutscene. The Morimar Frontier Station waypoint is quickest (or Yahse Bivouac #1); you must get past a Colonization Reive at (I-7). In a group, everyone trades their Ifritite before the NM is spawned."] = "En Moh Gates (K-8), entrega una Ifritite a la Molten Rift para una escena. El waypoint de la Frontier Station de Morimar es lo más rápido (o el Bivouac #1 de Yahse); debes pasar una Colonization Reive en (I-7). En grupo, todos entregan su Ifritite antes de hacer aparecer al NM.",
    ["In Mount Zhayolm, examine the ??? on a round steam vent at (L-8) for the key item Toggle switch. The Voidwatch warp is easiest: head north, then turn left toward the south part of the map."] = "En Mount Zhayolm, examina la ??? sobre un respiradero de vapor redondo en (L-8) para obtener el key item Toggle switch. El warp de Voidwatch es lo más fácil: ve al norte y luego gira a la izquierda hacia la parte sur del mapa.",
    ["In Nashmau, speak with Sajhra at (H-9) in the docks for another cutscene."] = "En Nashmau, habla con Sajhra en (H-9), en los muelles, para otra escena.",
    ["In Ordelle's Caves (enter from La Theine Plateau at (F-7) or use the Survival Guide): take the east path at (H-3) to the next map, then the path at (H-9) back to the first map, and drop down the hole at (H-11/12). Go east through the tunnel at (I-11), careful not to fall off the cliff, follow the stairs to the intersection at (I-6), go left (south), and take the tunnel west at (H-9), where you see Napalms, to come out in La Theine Plateau."] = "En Ordelle's Caves (entra desde La Theine Plateau por (F-7) o usa la Survival Guide): toma el camino este de (H-3) al mapa siguiente, luego el camino de (H-9) de vuelta al primer mapa y déjate caer por el agujero de (H-11/12). Ve al este por el túnel de (I-11), con cuidado de no caer por el acantilado, sigue las escaleras hasta el cruce de (I-6), ve a la izquierda (sur) y toma el túnel oeste de (H-9), donde ves Napalms, para salir a La Theine Plateau.",
    ["In Palborough Mines, trade a Pickaxe to a Mythril Seam to obtain Mine Gravel."] = "En Palborough Mines, entrega una Pickaxe a una Mythril Seam para obtener Mine Gravel.",
    ["In Port Bastok, speak with Kagetora (F-6), then trade 5 Eastern Gems to Patient Wheel (F-5). They drop from Riparian Sahagin behind the silver door in Sea Serpent Grotto."] = "En Port Bastok, habla con Kagetora (F-6) y luego entrega 5 Eastern Gems a Patient Wheel (F-5). Las sueltan los Riparian Sahagin tras la puerta de plata de Sea Serpent Grotto.",
    ["In Port Bastok: Paujean (F-6), Kaede (J-5), Tilian (F-8), Hilda (E-6) and Patient Wheel (F-5). In Metalworks: Manilam (G-7), Invincible Shield (G-8), Ayame (K-7) and Kaela (I-8)."] = "En Port Bastok: Paujean (F-6), Kaede (J-5), Tilian (F-8), Hilda (E-6) y Patient Wheel (F-5). En Metalworks: Manilam (G-7), Invincible Shield (G-8), Ayame (K-7) y Kaela (I-8).",
    ["In Port Jeuno, examine the ??? by the crates near the Auction House and the Jeuno Duty-Free Shop (H-8) for a cutscene."] = "En Port Jeuno, examina la ??? junto a las cajas cerca de la Auction House y la Jeuno Duty-Free Shop (H-8) para una escena.",
    ["In Port Windurst (E-7), speak with Ohruru at the back of the Orastery, use Ignis, then speak with her twice more for a cutscene."] = "En Port Windurst (E-7), habla con Ohruru al fondo de la Orastery, usa Ignis y luego habla con ella dos veces más para una escena.",
    ["In Port Windurst, speak with Yujuju (M-6), Choyi Totlihpa (F-6), Yaman-Hachuman (E-7), Kunchichi (E-7) and Three of Clubs (G-7)."] = "En Port Windurst, habla con Yujuju (M-6), Choyi Totlihpa (F-6), Yaman-Hachuman (E-7), Kunchichi (E-7) y Three of Clubs (G-7).",
    ["In Pso'Xja, collect a Carmine Chip, a Gray Chip and a Cyan Chip from the monsters below. The chips aren't Rare, so you can gather several sets, but the reward is."] = "En Pso'Xja, consigue un Carmine Chip, un Gray Chip y un Cyan Chip de los monstruos indicados abajo. Los chips no son Rare, así que puedes reunir varios juegos, pero la recompensa sí lo es.",
    ["In Qulun Dome, go through the door on the right (this needs the Magicite key items). Ruby Quadav, a level 71-73 True-Sound NM, guards the first room; run past if it's on the far side. In the main room, hug the south wall and examine the ??? on the west wall in the northern part of (I-7) for the Quadav crest; don't drop off the ledge. If you pull too much, zone out to the left."] = "En Qulun Dome, cruza la puerta de la derecha (requiere los key items de Magicite). Ruby Quadav, un NM con True-Sound de nivel 71-73, vigila la primera sala; pasa corriendo si está en el lado opuesto. En la sala principal, pégate a la pared sur y examina la ??? de la pared oeste en la parte norte de (I-7) para obtener el Quadav crest; no te caigas de la cornisa. Si atraes demasiados, sal de la zona por la izquierda.",
    ["In Rabao, speak with Leodarion at (F-7), on the west side of the lake near the windmill."] = "En Rabao, habla con Leodarion en (F-7), en el lado oeste del lago, cerca del molino.",
    ["In Rabao, speak with Leodarion at (F-8), on the west side of the lake near the windmill. He asks for an Oak Pole."] = "En Rabao, habla con Leodarion en (F-8), en el lado oeste del lago, cerca del molino. Te pide un Oak Pole.",
    ["In Rala Waterways (E-10), in the Arboretum (closest entrance is near the Western Adoulin Mog House), examine the Tomato Vantage Point for a cutscene with Jerra Ndala. Ask about the Rune saber and trade a Sowilo Claymore or an Elixir for the key item Rune saber."] = "En Rala Waterways (E-10), en el Arboretum (la entrada más cercana está junto a la Mog House de Western Adoulin), examina el Tomato Vantage Point para una escena con Jerra Ndala. Pregunta por el Rune saber y entrega una Sowilo Claymore o un Elixir para obtener el key item Rune saber.",
    ["In Riverne - Site #A01 the ??? is on the island at (E-8) that holds the zone to Monarch Linn. Two Giant Scales are required, and the Home Point warp places you at (I-9)."] = "En Riverne - Site #A01 la ??? está en la isla de (E-8) que contiene la zona a Monarch Linn. Hacen falta dos Giant Scales, y el warp de Home Point te coloca en (I-9).",
    ["In Riverne - Site #A01, go through the portals to the island at (I-11) for a cutscene, then trade the Copper Key to the Trunk there for another cutscene."] = "En Riverne - Site #A01, cruza los portales hasta la isla de (I-11) para una escena y luego entrega la Copper Key al Trunk de allí para otra escena.",
    ["In Riverne - Site #B01 the ??? is on the island at (E-7), just before the final Stable Displacement heading toward Monarch Linn. One Giant Scale, or the Home Point warp, is required."] = "En Riverne - Site #B01 la ??? está en la isla de (E-7), justo antes del último Stable Displacement hacia Monarch Linn. Hace falta una Giant Scale, o el warp de Home Point.",
    ["In Selbina, speak with Abelard (G-9). Then take the Swirling Vortex in the Valkurm Dunes cave at (I-9) to Lufaise Meadows for a cutscene as you zone in."] = "En Selbina, habla con Abelard (G-9). Luego toma el Swirling Vortex de la cueva de Valkurm Dunes en (I-9) hasta Lufaise Meadows para una escena al entrar.",
    ["In Upper Jeuno, speak with Baudin at (G-8) and trade him Coeurl Meat for the Crest of Davoi."] = "En Upper Jeuno, habla con Baudin en (G-8) y entrégale Coeurl Meat a cambio del Crest of Davoi.",
    ["In Wajaom Woodlands, kill Aht Urhgan Attercops (spiders) until you get a Frayed Arrow. Three are at the Giwahb Watchtower, with more at (F-6) and (E-8). The Wajaom Woodlands Survival Guide is fastest; the long way is the Aht Urhgan Whitegate exit at (G-10)."] = "En Wajaom Woodlands, mata Aht Urhgan Attercops (arañas) hasta conseguir una Frayed Arrow. Hay tres en la Giwahb Watchtower y más en (F-6) y (E-8). La Survival Guide de Wajaom Woodlands es lo más rápido; el camino largo es la salida de Aht Urhgan Whitegate en (G-10).",
    ["In Wajaom Woodlands, kill Wajaom Tigers (they spawn near (E-8), (F-7) and (K-9)) until you get a Rusty Medal. The Wajaom Woodlands Survival Guide is fastest; the long way is the Aht Urhgan Whitegate exit at (G-10)."] = "En Wajaom Woodlands, mata Wajaom Tigers (aparecen cerca de (E-8), (F-7) y (K-9)) hasta conseguir una Rusty Medal. La Survival Guide de Wajaom Woodlands es lo más rápido; el camino largo es la salida de Aht Urhgan Whitegate en (G-10).",
    ["In Western Adoulin (I-4), examine the Inconspicuous Barrel in the alley near the Adoulin Waterfront waypoint. Yestin-Ovestin asks for a Rune saber and a Frost-encrusted flame gem."] = "En Western Adoulin (I-4), examina el Inconspicuous Barrel del callejón cerca del waypoint de Adoulin Waterfront. Yestin-Ovestin pide un Rune saber y una Frost-encrusted flame gem.",
    ["In Windurst Walls, speak with Yoriri (J-11), Moan-Maon (J-6), Shantotto (K-7), Chomomo (H-3) and Naih Arihmepp (F-5)."] = "En Windurst Walls, habla con Yoriri (J-11), Moan-Maon (J-6), Shantotto (K-7), Chomomo (H-3) y Naih Arihmepp (F-5).",
    ["In Windurst Waters North, enter the Timbre Timbers tavern (F-10) and speak with Yuli Yaam, then Yung Yaam, then Jatan-Paratan."] = "En Windurst Waters North, entra en la taberna Timbre Timbers (F-10) y habla con Yuli Yaam, luego con Yung Yaam y luego con Jatan-Paratan.",
    ["In Windurst Waters North, speak with Npopo (G-4), Amagusa-Chigurusa (G-9), Funpo-Shipo (F-9), Kyume-Romeh (F-10) and Lago-Charago (F-8)."] = "En Windurst Waters North, habla con Npopo (G-4), Amagusa-Chigurusa (G-9), Funpo-Shipo (F-9), Kyume-Romeh (F-10) y Lago-Charago (F-8).",
    ["In Windurst Woods, speak with Umumu (I-5), Cayu Pensharhumi (I-10), Nanaa Mihgo (J-3), Etsa Rhuyuli (J-13) and Soni-Muni (H-10)."] = "En Windurst Woods, habla con Umumu (I-5), Cayu Pensharhumi (I-10), Nanaa Mihgo (J-3), Etsa Rhuyuli (J-13) y Soni-Muni (H-10).",
    ["In Yahse Hunting Grounds (K-7), examine the Yahse Wildflower at the northern end of the three beaches for the key item Yahse wildflower petal."] = "En Yahse Hunting Grounds (K-7), examina la Yahse Wildflower del extremo norte de las tres playas para obtener el key item Yahse wildflower petal.",
    ["In Yuhtunga Jungle (K-7), find the ??? overlooking Gemini Falls; reach that side through the tunnel at (I-7) (no need to go through Ifrit's Cauldron). The cutscene spawns 5 Nasus, easy at level 75. Only one player at a time gets the cutscene; others wait 3 minutes after the Nasus die to spawn their own."] = "En Yuhtunga Jungle (K-7), busca la ??? que da a Gemini Falls; llega a ese lado por el túnel de (I-7) (no hace falta pasar por Ifrit's Cauldron). La escena hace aparecer 5 Nasus, fáciles a nivel 75. Solo un jugador a la vez ve la escena; los demás esperan 3 minutos tras la muerte de los Nasus para hacer aparecer los suyos.",
    ["In any other weather, even clear but cloudy, Enu says it has to be a starry night and you have to wait."] = "Con cualquier otro clima, incluso despejado pero nublado, Enu dice que tiene que ser una noche estrellada y tienes que esperar.",
    ["In some cases the quest ends here, with a cutscene and your reward. The exact trigger is unknown; it seems related to your progress in the Windurst missions or to having the key item Old ring."] = "En algunos casos la quest termina aquí, con una escena y tu recompensa. El disparador exacto se desconoce; parece relacionado con tu progreso en las misiones de Windurst o con tener el key item Old ring.",
    ["In the Den of Rancor, hug the right wall to the Altar of Rancor at (D/E-5) and trade it the Unlit Lanterns for Rancor Flames. Take them to the other Altar of Rancor at (I/J-13) and trade them; after the fourth lantern is lit, the bomb NM Rancor Torch appears."] = "En Den of Rancor, pégate a la pared derecha hasta el Altar of Rancor de (D/E-5) y entrégale las Unlit Lanterns para obtener Rancor Flames. Llévalas al otro Altar of Rancor de (I/J-13) y entrégaselas; tras encender el cuarto farolillo aparece el NM bomba Rancor Torch.",
    ["In the Grand Palace of Hu'Xzoi, examine the entrance to The Garden of Ru'Hmet (Gate of the Gods) for a cutscene."] = "En el Grand Palace of Hu'Xzoi, examina la entrada a The Garden of Ru'Hmet (Gate of the Gods) para una escena.",
    ["In the Lion Springs Tavern in Southern San d'Oria (K-6), speak with Valderotaux at the bar and dance for him (any choice on stage gives the same result). Home Point #3 is near the tavern."] = "En la Lion Springs Tavern de Southern San d'Oria (K-6), habla con Valderotaux en la barra y baila para él (cualquier opción en el escenario da el mismo resultado). El Home Point #3 está cerca de la taberna.",
    ["In the Navukgo Execution Chamber, examine the Decorative Bronze Gate to start a battlefield fight (any job). Up to 18 people can enter, but more people cause more Immortal Flans to spawn. Trust Magic is allowed."] = "En la Navukgo Execution Chamber, examina la Decorative Bronze Gate para empezar una pelea de campo de batalla (cualquier job). Pueden entrar hasta 18 personas, pero cuantas más haya, más Immortal Flans aparecen. Se permite la Trust Magic.",
    ["In the cutscene you choose whether to return the Faded ruby. Return to the ??? in La Theine Plateau (G-6): returning it gives the title Disturber of Slumber, keeping it Interrupter of Dreams."] = "En la escena eliges si devolver el Faded ruby. Vuelve a la ??? de La Theine Plateau (G-6): devolverlo da el título Disturber of Slumber, y quedártelo, Interrupter of Dreams.",
    ["In the main area of the assault there are many Mamool Ja Trainers (blue mages) and Recruits (orange melees) that must be avoided. Refer to the map for the locations of the treasure coffers."] = "En la zona principal del assault hay muchos Mamool Ja Trainers (magos azules) y Recruits (cuerpo a cuerpo naranjas) que hay que evitar. Consulta el mapa para ver dónde están los cofres del tesoro.",
    ["Indigo (snow): Beaucedine Glacier or Xarcabard (extremely common; not Uleguerand Range). Violet (thunder): Pashhow Marshlands, The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah (very common), Konschtat Highlands, Jugner Forest, Sauromugue Champaign (not Qufim Island or Behemoth's Dominion)."] = "Índigo (nieve): Beaucedine Glacier o Xarcabard (extremadamente común; no Uleguerand Range). Violeta (tormenta): Pashhow Marshlands, The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah (muy común), Konschtat Highlands, Jugner Forest, Sauromugue Champaign (no Qufim Island ni Behemoth's Dominion).",
    ["Inside the Den, head south and turn east as the room opens up, take the north tunnel, go east at the intersection and follow it into a large room; go south through it to the ??? at (I-13)."] = "Dentro del Den, ve al sur y gira al este cuando la sala se abra, toma el túnel norte, ve al este en el cruce y síguelo hasta una sala grande; crúzala hacia el sur hasta la ??? en (I-13).",
    ["Inside the Monastic Cavern from (J-9), stick to the west wall to avoid the True-Sight NMs and examine the ??? at (J-6), among cave-flower-like stalks before the cliff (don't fall off), for the Orcish crest."] = "Dentro del Monastic Cavern desde (J-9), pégate a la pared oeste para evitar los NMs con True-Sight y examina la ??? en (J-6), entre tallos parecidos a flores de cueva antes del acantilado (no te caigas), para obtener el Orcish crest.",
    ["Inside there are several chests, and three of them hold coins that depict the constellations. The correct coins are Odin to the north, Alexander to the northeast, Shiva to the east and Garuda to the southeast."] = "Dentro hay varios cofres, y tres de ellos contienen monedas que representan las constelaciones. Las monedas correctas son Odin al norte, Alexander al noreste, Shiva al este y Garuda al sureste.",
    ["Inside, defeat Fallen Evacuee enemies in the small rooms near the entrance until one drops a Garlaige Key."] = "Dentro, derrota a enemigos Fallen Evacuee en las salas pequeñas cerca de la entrada hasta que uno suelte una Garlaige Key.",
    ["Inside, defeat Galgalim (level 56). It has Fire Spikes and uses Poison and Paralyze; Trusts can be summoned."] = "Dentro, derrota a Galgalim (nivel 56). Tiene Fire Spikes y usa Poison y Paralyze; se pueden invocar Trusts.",
    ["Inside, take the north path to (J-8) on the first map, open the door there and head to the tunnel at (I-6). Go east through it, take the southern route at the fork and follow it until you zone out into Caedarva Mire."] = "Dentro, toma el camino norte hasta (J-8) en el primer mapa, abre allí la puerta y ve al túnel de (I-6). Crúzalo hacia el este, toma la ruta sur en la bifurcación y síguela hasta salir a Caedarva Mire.",
    ["Ipupu accepts it and gives you the key item Note from Ipupu in return."] = "Ipupu la acepta y te da a cambio el key item Note from Ipupu.",
    ["Irmilant repairs the rod and you receive the Lu Shang's Fishing Rod and the title The Immortal Fisher, Lu Shang. You do not need to have completed The Competition or The Rivalry to have your rod fixed. You can repeat the quest."] = "Irmilant repara la caña y recibes la Lu Shang's Fishing Rod y el título The Immortal Fisher, Lu Shang. No hace falta haber completado The Competition ni The Rivalry para que te arreglen la caña. Puedes repetir la quest.",
    ["Isarukitsck in the Uleguerand Range: rifts at (G-11), (G-10) and (J-10/11)."] = "Isarukitsck en Uleguerand Range: rifts en (G-11), (G-10) y (J-10/11).",
    ["It is no longer possible to flag the original quest. Speak to a Synergy Engineer to obtain a Synergy Crucible if you did not activate this quest before March 27, 2012."] = "Ya no es posible activar la quest original. Habla con un Synergy Engineer para obtener un Synergy Crucible si no activaste esta quest antes del 27 de marzo de 2012.",
    ["It takes 6 feeding attempts to complete the quest. The first 2 attempts automatically fail and do not consume a grass."] = "Hacen falta 6 intentos de alimentación para completar la quest. Los 2 primeros intentos fallan automáticamente y no consumen hierba.",
    ["Join an offensive campaign battle in a territory that the beastmen control."] = "Participa en una batalla de campaña ofensiva en un territorio que controlen las bestias.",
    ["Keep talking to as many other NPCs as you can: too few gives no credit, and the reward grows with the number you speak to."] = "Sigue hablando con todos los demás NPCs que puedas: demasiado pocos no dan crédito, y la recompensa crece con el número de personas con las que hables.",
    ["Ken's messages show where he is on his fixed route: at 1 (\"..being watched\") and 6 (\"What was that sound\") he stops and turns round; at 3 he spins round and runs to the pond in the big room; at 4 (\"A dead end\") he turns back, so hide behind the southern rock; at 5 he takes readings at the hot spring; at 7 he runs in circles in the first room, so stay well away from its edge."] = "Los mensajes de Ken indican dónde está en su ruta fija: en 1 (\"..being watched\") y 6 (\"What was that sound\") se para y se da la vuelta; en 3 gira sobre sí mismo y corre al estanque de la sala grande; en 4 (\"A dead end\") se da la vuelta, así que escóndete tras la roca del sur; en 5 toma mediciones en la fuente termal; en 7 corre en círculos en la primera sala, así que mantente bien lejos de su borde.",
    ["Kill Aydeewa Diremite enemies until you get a Colorful Hair. You can find them around (I-9) after you take the (I-7) entrance from Bhaflau Thickets and slide down at (H-8). Circle back up to farm the item, then slide back down. The Voidwatch warp, if you have it, is a quick shortcut."] = "Mata enemigos Aydeewa Diremite hasta conseguir un Colorful Hair. Los encuentras cerca de (I-9) tras tomar la entrada (I-7) desde Bhaflau Thickets y deslizarte en (H-8). Da la vuelta hacia arriba para farmear el objeto y vuelve a deslizarte. El warp de Voidwatch, si lo tienes, es un atajo rápido.",
    ["Kill Bahamut for a cutscene."] = "Mata a Bahamut para una escena.",
    ["Kill Goblin Robber enemies to get a Sack of Fish Bait, a common drop."] = "Mata enemigos Goblin Robber para conseguir un Sack of Fish Bait, un drop común.",
    ["Kill Pugils just outside in East Sarutabaruta if there are no scales on the Auction House. (The Starfall Tear itself is sometimes on the Auction House, under Other.)"] = "Mata Pugils justo fuera, en East Sarutabaruta, si no hay escamas en la Auction House. (La propia Starfall Tear a veces está en la Auction House, en Other.)",
    ["Kill monsters on the 7th to 10th floors of Upper Delkfutt's Tower until you get a Delkfutt Chest Key; the Gigas, Evil Spirits, Magic Urns and Light and Thunder Elementals drop it. Alternatively, you can buy one from the Curio Vendor Moogle."] = "Mata monstruos en los pisos 7 a 10 de Upper Delkfutt's Tower hasta conseguir una Delkfutt Chest Key; la sueltan los Gigas, Evil Spirits, Magic Urns y los Elementals de Light y Thunder. También puedes comprar una al Curio Vendor Moogle.",
    ["Kill the Rancor Torch, then head back to Kazham and talk to the Chieftainess for your reward, 11,000 gil."] = "Mata al Rancor Torch, vuelve a Kazham y habla con la Chieftainess para recibir tu recompensa, 11,000 gil.",
    ["Killing the Casanova makes all the other frogs disappear and ends the battle. Mikilulu cannot be killed but can be brought down to 1% HP. You only have to fight it once for it to count for the rest of your party if they are at that stage of the quest."] = "Matar al Casanova hace desaparecer a todas las demás ranas y termina la batalla. Mikilulu no se puede matar, pero se le puede bajar hasta el 1% de HP. Solo tienes que luchar una vez para que cuente para el resto de tu grupo si están en ese punto de la quest.",
    ["Kindred's Seals come from any normal monster of level 50-69 that checks as Easy Prey or higher, from Shemo at 3 other seals for 1 (2 for 1 during some campaigns), or from the Greeter Moogle for 5 login points each when that's offered. New Worlds Await needs 5 more, so you may want 9 at once. Don't confuse them with Kindred's Crests."] = "Los Kindred's Seals los sueltan monstruos normales de nivel 50-69 que se consideren Easy Prey o más, Shemo los da a 3 sellos de otro tipo por 1 (2 por 1 en algunas campañas), o el Greeter Moogle por 5 login points cada uno cuando se ofrece. New Worlds Await necesita 5 más, así que quizá quieras 9 de una vez. No los confundas con los Kindred's Crests.",
    ["Lamian Fang Keys drop from Lamia and Drauger enemies in the area, and you can also receive one from a ??? spot in Caedarva Mire (I-7), map 1, once every game day. Use the key on the Iron Gate at (J-10), then go west on the small map to another Iron Gate, which is unlocked."] = "Las Lamian Fang Keys las sueltan los enemigos Lamia y Drauger de la zona, y también puedes recibir una de un lugar ??? en Caedarva Mire (I-7), mapa 1, una vez por día de juego. Usa la llave en la Iron Gate de (J-10), luego ve al oeste en el mapa pequeño hasta otra Iron Gate, que está abierta.",
    ["Lamian Fang Keys drop from Lamia and Drauger enemies in the area. You can also receive one from a ??? spot in Caedarva Mire (I-7), map 1 (southern part of the block); you can obtain a new key from there once every game day."] = "Las Lamian Fang Keys las sueltan los enemigos Lamia y Drauger de la zona. También puedes recibir una de un lugar ??? en Caedarva Mire (I-7), mapa 1 (parte sur del bloque); puedes obtener una llave nueva allí una vez por día de juego.",
    ["Leave Aht Urhgan Whitegate and return after the required transition."] = "Sal de Aht Urhgan Whitegate y vuelve tras la transición requerida.",
    ["Leave Bastok Markets (S) for North Gustaberg (S) at (G-4) and obtain the Clump of Animal Hair."] = "Sal de Bastok Markets (S) hacia North Gustaberg (S) en (G-4) y obtén el Clump of Animal Hair.",
    ["Leave Nashmau by the east gate into Caedarva Mire. On the island in the lake just outside at (I-10), reached from the east side across the lily pads, examine the ??? in the center of the marsh (not the one on the outside) to spawn Caedarva Toad. Stay near the lake; Chigoes roam further out."] = "Sal de Nashmau por la puerta este hacia Caedarva Mire. En la isla del lago justo fuera, en (I-10), a la que se llega desde el lado este por los nenúfares, examina la ??? del centro de la ciénaga (no la de fuera) para hacer aparecer a Caedarva Toad. Quédate cerca del lago; los Chigoes deambulan más lejos.",
    ["Leave Oldton Movalpolos and enter again through the (K-6) entrance while wearing Choplix's Coif for a cutscene and a Gold Beastcoin. You earn the title Moblin Kinsman. The quest can be repeated once per Conquest tally."] = "Sal de Oldton Movalpolos y vuelve a entrar por la entrada de (K-6) llevando el Choplix's Coif para una escena y una Gold Beastcoin. Obtienes el título Moblin Kinsman. La quest se puede repetir una vez por Conquest tally.",
    ["Leave Rosel's Armour Shop and head west into Victory Square. Head north through Victory Arch into Northern San d'Oria, then straight north towards Chateau d'Oraguille."] = "Sal de Rosel's Armour Shop y ve al oeste hasta Victory Square. Ve al norte por el Victory Arch hasta Northern San d'Oria y luego sigue recto al norte hacia Chateau d'Oraguille.",
    ["Leave Windurst Woods, then return after one Earth minute and speak with Kororo again."] = "Sal de Windurst Woods, vuelve tras un minuto terrestre y habla de nuevo con Kororo.",
    ["Leave the Monastic Cavern and enter again while wearing Gadzradd's Helm for a cutscene and a Gold Beastcoin. You earn the title Orcish Serjeant. The quest is repeatable."] = "Sal del Monastic Cavern y vuelve a entrar llevando el Gadzradd's Helm para una escena y una Gold Beastcoin. Obtienes el título Orcish Serjeant. La quest es repetible.",
    ["Leave the Qulun Dome and enter again while wearing Da'Vhu's Barbut for a cutscene and a Gold Beastcoin. You earn the title Bronze Quadav. The quest is repeatable."] = "Sal de Qulun Dome y vuelve a entrar llevando el Da'Vhu's Barbut para una escena y una Gold Beastcoin. Obtienes el título Bronze Quadav. La quest es repetible.",
    ["Leave the area and return to Louxiard (G-7)."] = "Sal de la zona y vuelve con Louxiard (G-7).",
    ["Leave the area and return to Salaheem's Sentinels after the required transition."] = "Sal de la zona y vuelve con los Salaheem's Sentinels tras la transición requerida.",
    ["Leave the area and return, then speak with Rholont (E-7) again."] = "Sal de la zona y vuelve, luego habla de nuevo con Rholont (E-7).",
    ["Leave the area and speak with Rholont (E-7) again."] = "Sal de la zona y habla de nuevo con Rholont (E-7).",
    ["Leepe-Hoppe needs 3 items, all of which must be farmed in Chains of Promathia areas."] = "Leepe-Hoppe necesita 3 objetos, todos ellos se deben farmear en zonas de Chains of Promathia.",
    ["Listen to his instructions and travel to Monastic Cavern via Davoi (H-11)."] = "Escucha sus instrucciones y viaja a Monastic Cavern por Davoi (H-11).",
    ["Locate Hilda at (E-6) and speak with her. You can interact with her through the floor if you stand under her, near the bar, while she is upstairs."] = "Localiza a Hilda en (E-6) y habla con ella. Puedes interactuar con ella a través del suelo si te pones debajo de ella, cerca de la barra, mientras está arriba.",
    ["Locate and defeat Orcish Turret at approximately (H-10) on Map 15 within 30 minutes."] = "Localiza y derrota a Orcish Turret aproximadamente en (H-10) del Map 15 en 30 minutos.",
    ["Long way, with Silent Oil: from The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah (J-12) enter the Tree, follow the path to the large room around (I-8), go north-west to (G-7) and drop off the ledge, continue north-west to the tunnel at (C-4), follow it south to the tunnel at (A-6), and cross the waterfall area (Korrigan, Elder Goobbue) south to the (G-10) tunnel; the ??? is just inside."] = "Camino largo, con Silent Oil: desde The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah (J-12) entra en el Tree, sigue el camino hasta la sala grande de (I-8), ve al noroeste hasta (G-7) y déjate caer de la cornisa, sigue al noroeste hasta el túnel de (C-4), síguelo al sur hasta el túnel de (A-6) y cruza la zona de la cascada (Korrigan, Elder Goobbue) hacia el sur hasta el túnel de (G-10); la ??? está justo dentro.",
    ["Look at the other patrol members' reports (reports 1 and 2 from Mengrenaux, 3 and 4 from Chemioue), then return to Tressia and say where each was gathered: report 1 (I-8), report 2 (H-8), report 3 (G-9), report 4 (J-7)."] = "Mira los informes de los demás miembros de la patrulla (informes 1 y 2 de Mengrenaux, 3 y 4 de Chemioue) y vuelve con Tressia para decir dónde se reunió cada uno: informe 1 (I-8), informe 2 (H-8), informe 3 (G-9), informe 4 (J-7).",
    ["Look for Andelain in East Ronfaure at (J-11) and give him the peas."] = "Busca a Andelain en East Ronfaure en (J-11) y dale los guisantes.",
    ["Look for the NM Silk Caterpillar. It spawns when an airship goes by, about every 11 to 14 minutes."] = "Busca al NM Silk Caterpillar. Aparece cuando pasa una airship, más o menos cada 11 a 14 minutos.",
    ["Look for the guard Guilerme near the bridge into the Chateau. He takes the receipt but cannot read the intended recipient: tell him which prince it is for, Pieuje or Trion, and he runs into the Chateau to deliver it."] = "Busca al guardia Guilerme cerca del puente que entra al Chateau. Coge el recibo pero no puede leer el destinatario: dile para qué príncipe es, Pieuje o Trion, y corre al Chateau para entregarlo.",
    ["Lord of Ulbuka: in Cirdas Caverns at the exit to Yorcia Weald, with a Dwarf Pugil or Rotten Meat. First you must have caught a Remora (Woh Gates pond, J-11, Minnow), an Ancient Carp (Moh Gates pond, L-6/7, Insect Ball), a Tusoteuthis Longa (Dho Gates Map 1, F/G-12, Minnow) and a Cameroceras (Sih Gates Map 2, Minnow)."] = "Lord of Ulbuka: en Cirdas Caverns, en la salida a Yorcia Weald, con un Dwarf Pugil o Rotten Meat. Antes debes haber pescado una Remora (estanque de Woh Gates, J-11, Minnow), un Ancient Carp (estanque de Moh Gates, L-6/7, Insect Ball), un Tusoteuthis Longa (Dho Gates mapa 1, F/G-12, Minnow) y un Cameroceras (Sih Gates mapa 2, Minnow).",
    ["Maat asks for a Bomb Coal, an Exoray Mold and an Ancient Papyrus, in any order. Each drops from monsters, or three key-item pieces from ??? spots combine into it. If you already hold one of the finished items in any inventory, that zone's ??? says \"There is nothing out of the ordinary here.\""] = "Maat pide un Bomb Coal, un Exoray Mold y un Ancient Papyrus, en cualquier orden. Cada uno lo sueltan monstruos, o se forma combinando tres key items de puntos ???. Si ya tienes uno de los objetos terminados en cualquier inventario, la ??? de esa zona dice \"There is nothing out of the ordinary here.\"",
    ["Make sure Let Sleeping Dogs Lie and Teacher's Pet are not active, and zone first if you have just finished one of them."] = "Asegúrate de que Let Sleeping Dogs Lie y Teacher's Pet no estén activas, y cambia de zona antes si acabas de terminar una de ellas.",
    ["Make sure you are wearing a body armor piece, or the quest cannot start."] = "Asegúrate de llevar una pieza de armadura de cuerpo, o la quest no puede empezar.",
    ["Make sure you have one free inventory slot. Unequip all weapons and shield in the Main and Sub slots, then examine the ??? and you receive the message that you have obtained a Siren's Tear."] = "Asegúrate de tener un hueco libre en el inventario. Desequipa todas las armas y el escudo de los slots Main y Sub, luego examina la ??? y recibes el mensaje de que has obtenido una Siren's Tear.",
    ["Make sure you have two free slots in your active inventory. Speak with Regine in Port San d'Oria (J-8) to begin the quest, and choose the option to look for work. You receive 15 Magicmart Flyers."] = "Asegúrate de tener dos huecos libres en tu inventario activo. Habla con Regine en Port San d'Oria (J-8) para empezar la quest y elige la opción de buscar trabajo. Recibes 15 Magicmart Flyers.",
    ["Make sure you pick up a few Pickaxes before leaving, since they can break. This quest requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Asegúrate de llevar varios Pickaxes antes de irte, porque se pueden romper. Esta quest requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Make sure your main job is Dragoon, level 40 or higher, when you speak with Miaux in Northern San d'Oria (E-6). She asks you to obtain an Altepa polishing stone. After speaking to her you can change to another job to do the rest of the quest."] = "Asegúrate de que tu trabajo principal sea Dragoon, nivel 40 o superior, cuando hables con Miaux en Northern San d'Oria (E-6). Te pide que obtengas una Altepa polishing stone. Tras hablar con ella puedes cambiar a otro trabajo para hacer el resto de la quest.",
    ["Make your way through Quicksand Caves to the Cloister of Tremors. Home Point #2 is at the entrance. If it is your first visit, enter Quicksand Caves via Eastern Altepa Desert at (K-7) and walk to (C-9), taking the right two one-way drops on the way."] = "Avanza por Quicksand Caves hasta el Cloister of Tremors. El Home Point #2 está en la entrada. Si es tu primera visita, entra en Quicksand Caves por Eastern Altepa Desert en (K-7) y camina hasta (C-9), tomando por el camino las dos caídas de un solo sentido de la derecha.",
    ["Malleator Maurok in the Quicksand Caves: rift on Map 3 at (G-9)/(F-9). Use the Unity Warp (level 125) in the Western Altepa Desert, then take Entrance 2 of the Quicksand Caves."] = "Malleator Maurok en Quicksand Caves: rift en el mapa 3 en (G-9)/(F-9). Usa el Unity Warp (nivel 125) de Western Altepa Desert y luego toma la Entrance 2 de Quicksand Caves.",
    ["Manage the Goblin Effluvial Grenade attacks and poison effects during the battle."] = "Gestiona los ataques de Goblin Effluvial Grenade y los efectos de veneno durante la batalla.",
    ["Map 1: the first ??? is at (I-9), just south of Banishing Gate #1. Head west, take the first left, and examine the next one at (H-9)."] = "Mapa 1: la primera ??? está en (I-9), justo al sur de la Banishing Gate #1. Ve al oeste, toma el primer desvío a la izquierda y examina la siguiente en (H-9).",
    ["Map 3: take the south corridor and examine the ??? at the north-east corner of (J-9), behind the ladder against the bookcase, to open the secret door. In the hidden hallway, examine the second Ornate Gate at (K-8) for a cutscene."] = "Mapa 3: toma el pasillo sur y examina la ??? de la esquina noreste de (J-9), detrás de la escalera apoyada en la librería, para abrir la puerta secreta. En el pasillo oculto, examina la segunda Ornate Gate de (K-8) para una escena.",
    ["Marchelute drops a Tavnazia Pass."] = "Marchelute suelta un Tavnazia Pass.",
    ["Match the male Lebros Apkallu up to the female Lebros Apkallu. You only need to match up one pair to win, but you receive reduced points for every pair fewer than 8."] = "Empareja al Lebros Apkallu macho con la Lebros Apkallu hembra. Solo necesitas emparejar una pareja para ganar, pero recibes menos puntos por cada pareja que falte hasta 8.",
    ["Matsya: at the East Bridges in Vunkerl Inlet (S), with a Dwarf Pugil."] = "Matsya: en los East Bridges de Vunkerl Inlet (S), con un Dwarf Pugil.",
    ["Mhaura: choose the first dialogue option, \"You're searching for adventurers?\""] = "Mhaura: elige la primera opción de diálogo, \"You're searching for adventurers?\"",
    ["Mhaura: examine Oaken Door (K-8) in Norg."] = "Mhaura: examina la Oaken Door (K-8) en Norg.",
    ["Mhaura: obtain 3 Mandragora Dewdrops from Pygmaioi in Tahrongi Canyon, or purchase them from the Auction House."] = "Mhaura: obtén 3 Mandragora Dewdrops de los Pygmaioi de Tahrongi Canyon, o cómpralas en la Auction House.",
    ["Mhaura: return to Mhaura and trade all 3 Mandragora Dewdrops to Ekokoko."] = "Mhaura: vuelve a Mhaura y entrega las 3 Mandragora Dewdrops a Ekokoko.",
    ["Mhaura: speak with Numi Adaligo at (F-9) in the Governor's House."] = "Mhaura: habla con Numi Adaligo en (F-9), en la Governor's House.",
    ["Mhaura: speak with Tonasav at (H-9) to travel to Norg."] = "Mhaura: habla con Tonasav en (H-9) para viajar a Norg.",
    ["Michea asks for a Mythril Ingot. Trade it to her, then zone out of Bastok Markets once."] = "Michea pide un Mythril Ingot. Entrégaselo y luego sal de Bastok Markets una vez.",
    ["Mimic King in Ro'Maeve: rifts at (E-7), (I-9) and (K-7)."] = "Mimic King en Ro'Maeve: rifts en (E-7), (I-9) y (K-7).",
    ["Mine up an Orichalcum Ore from the mining points scattered around the map."] = "Extrae un Orichalcum Ore de los puntos de minería repartidos por el mapa.",
    ["Mission orders: become a test subject."] = "Órdenes de la misión: convertirte en sujeto de pruebas.",
    ["Modron in The Boyahda Tree: rifts on Map 1 at (G-5), (K-8) and (L-9), and on Map 2 at (F-7), very close to the Unity Warp (level 125)."] = "Modron en The Boyahda Tree: rifts en el mapa 1 en (G-5), (K-8) y (L-9), y en el mapa 2 en (F-7), muy cerca del Unity Warp (nivel 125).",
    ["Mog House"] = "Mog House",
    ["Mute is inflicted through the additional effect of the weapon of Eight of Cups in the Outer Horutoto Ruins (enter from (F-11) in West Sarutabaruta), and pays 1,000 gil."] = "Mute se inflige mediante el efecto adicional del arma de Eight of Cups en las Outer Horutoto Ruins (entra desde (F-11) en West Sarutabaruta), y paga 1,000 gil.",
    ["Mutton Tortilla can be bought at the Auction House (Food, Meals, Breads & Rice), or from Taajiji at the Timbre Timbers Tavern in Windurst Waters North if Windurst is at least 2nd place in Conquest."] = "La Mutton Tortilla se puede comprar en la Auction House (Food, Meals, Breads & Rice), o a Taajiji en la Timbre Timbers Tavern de Windurst Waters North si Windurst está al menos en 2nd lugar en Conquest.",
    ["Naja requires you to successfully complete three mini-games. If you fail any portion, wait one real-life minute and speak to Naja again. After each one you may need to wait a game day to find out whether you passed; if you failed, you repeat that mini-game."] = "Naja te exige completar con éxito tres minijuegos. Si fallas alguna parte, espera un minuto real y habla de nuevo con Naja. Tras cada uno puede que tengas que esperar un día de juego para saber si lo superaste; si fallaste, repites ese minijuego.",
    ["Neith in the Temple of Uggalepih: rifts on Map 1 at (I-9) and (K-6), and on Map 2 at (G-8)."] = "Neith en el Temple of Uggalepih: rifts en el mapa 1 en (I-9) y (K-6), y en el mapa 2 en (G-8).",
    ["Next, Roropp (H-9) Sands of Silence (Demon Magistrate/Chancellor, Castle Zvahl Baileys: from the Survival Guide go west to map 2 and down the stairs at (H-6) or (H-10), or fall through the big holes); Popopp (H-9) a Wandering Bulb (Utukku, Fei'Yin: downstairs at (G-9) and north, or south from Home Point #2, in the small rooms with doors); Bubupp (I-8) Giant Fish Bones (Tonberry Stalker)."] = "Después, a Roropp (H-9) Sands of Silence (Demon Magistrate/Chancellor, Castle Zvahl Baileys: desde la Survival Guide ve al oeste al mapa 2 y baja las escaleras de (H-6) o (H-10), o déjate caer por los grandes agujeros); a Popopp (H-9) un Wandering Bulb (Utukku, Fei'Yin: abajo en (G-9) y al norte, o al sur desde el Home Point #2, en las salas pequeñas con puertas); a Bubupp (I-8) Giant Fish Bones (Tonberry Stalker).",
    ["Next, head to Castle Oztroja and kill the monsters to find an Oztroja Chest Key, or buy one from the Curio Vendor Moogle."] = "Después, ve a Castle Oztroja y mata monstruos hasta encontrar una Oztroja Chest Key, o compra una al Curio Vendor Moogle.",
    ["Next, speak with Esca in West Ronfaure (F-6)."] = "Después, habla con Esca en West Ronfaure (F-6).",
    ["Next, speak with Tehf Kimasnahya at (F-8) on Balrahn Way, who explains the whole thing."] = "Después, habla con Tehf Kimasnahya en (F-8) de Balrahn Way, que lo explica todo.",
    ["Northern Fur x4 pays 1,500 gil and drops from Giant Hunter enemies in Qufim Island, and from Giant Lobber enemies in Lower Delkfutt's Tower or Middle Delkfutt's Tower. Southern Mummy x4 pays 3,000 gil and drops from Lich enemies in Western Altepa Desert."] = "Northern Fur x4 paga 1,500 gil y lo sueltan los enemigos Giant Hunter de Qufim Island y los Giant Lobber de Lower Delkfutt's Tower o Middle Delkfutt's Tower. Southern Mummy x4 paga 3,000 gil y lo sueltan los enemigos Lich de Western Altepa Desert.",
    ["Northern San d'Oria: Guilberdrier (F-3), in front of the Carpenters' Guild; Villion (F-3), on the guild's 2nd-floor balcony; Capiria (F-6), near the Laborman's Way arch above the sluice gates; Boncort (F-8), Phoenix Perch Inn 2nd floor; Coullene (M-6), in the Cathedral."] = "Northern San d'Oria: Guilberdrier (F-3), frente al Carpenters' Guild; Villion (F-3), en el balcón del 2.º piso del gremio; Capiria (F-6), cerca del arco de Laborman's Way sobre las compuertas; Boncort (F-8), 2.º piso de la Phoenix Perch Inn; Coullene (M-6), en la Cathedral.",
    ["Now you must complete Cook-a-roon? to get a Nashmau Stew. Buying one from the Auction House will not work, and keeping one from a previous repeat of Cook-a-roon? will not work either."] = "Ahora debes completar Cook-a-roon? para conseguir un Nashmau Stew. Comprar uno en la Auction House no sirve, y conservar uno de una repetición anterior de Cook-a-roon? tampoco sirve.",
    ["Objective: allied scholars have determined that an unseen barrier is preventing direct damage to the walls of Castle Zvahl, greatly impeding our siege effort."] = "Objetivo: los eruditos aliados han determinado que una barrera invisible impide dañar directamente los muros de Castle Zvahl, lo que entorpece mucho nuestro asedio.",
    ["Objective: ambush one of the enemy's supply caravans."] = "Objetivo: emboscar una de las caravanas de suministros del enemigo.",
    ["Objective: assist in devising a plan to secure safe supply transport."] = "Objetivo: ayudar a idear un plan para asegurar el transporte seguro de suministros.",
    ["Objective: attack and defeat any suppliers, seize the cargo and return it."] = "Objetivo: atacar y derrotar a cualquier proveedor, capturar la carga y devolverla.",
    ["Objective: bomb an enemy stronghold."] = "Objetivo: bombardear una fortaleza enemiga.",
    ["Objective: bring supplies to a stronghold of your nation."] = "Objetivo: llevar suministros a una fortaleza de tu nación.",
    ["Objective: carry hazardous materials to the stronghold."] = "Objetivo: llevar materiales peligrosos a la fortaleza.",
    ["Objective: escort a Reinforcement to the outpost."] = "Objetivo: escoltar a un Reinforcement hasta el puesto avanzado.",
    ["Objective: fend off a beastman siege against one of your nation's strongholds."] = "Objetivo: rechazar un asedio de las bestias contra una de las fortalezas de tu nación.",
    ["Objective: find a Suspicious Object in Bastok."] = "Objetivo: encontrar un Suspicious Object en Bastok.",
    ["Objective: find a Suspicious Object in San d'Oria."] = "Objetivo: encontrar un Suspicious Object en San d'Oria.",
    ["Objective: find a Suspicious Object in Windurst."] = "Objetivo: encontrar un Suspicious Object en Windurst.",
    ["Objective: fortify strongholds against siege turrets."] = "Objetivo: fortificar las fortalezas contra las torretas de asedio.",
    ["Objective: gather intelligence from an enemy fortress."] = "Objetivo: reunir información de una fortaleza enemiga.",
    ["Objective: give needed supplies to Bastok."] = "Objetivo: entregar los suministros que necesita Bastok.",
    ["Objective: give needed supplies to San d'Oria."] = "Objetivo: entregar los suministros que necesita San d'Oria.",
    ["Objective: give needed supplies to Windurst."] = "Objetivo: entregar los suministros que necesita Windurst.",
    ["Objective: infiltrate an enemy stronghold and gather as much data as possible."] = "Objetivo: infiltrarte en una fortaleza enemiga y reunir todos los datos posibles.",
    ["Objective: join a campaign battle and assist in your nation's siege of a beastman stronghold."] = "Objetivo: unirte a una batalla de campaña y ayudar en el asedio de tu nación a una fortaleza bestia.",
    ["Objective: join a campaign battle and assist in your nation's siege of the Northlands."] = "Objetivo: unirte a una batalla de campaña y ayudar en el asedio de tu nación a las Northlands.",
    ["Objective: lend your crafting knowledge to crafting adepts."] = "Objetivo: poner tu conocimiento de artesanía al servicio de artesanos expertos.",
    ["Objective: lend your crafting knowledge to unskilled crafters."] = "Objetivo: poner tu conocimiento de artesanía al servicio de artesanos sin experiencia.",
    ["Objective: patrol local territories and eliminate any immediate threats."] = "Objetivo: patrullar los territorios locales y eliminar cualquier amenaza inmediata.",
    ["Objective: travel to La Vaule and defeat Darkheir Grradhod."] = "Objetivo: viajar a La Vaule y derrotar a Darkheir Grradhod.",
    ["Objective: travel to Vunkerl Inlet (J-7) and obliterate the beastmen campground in Everbloom Hollow."] = "Objetivo: viajar a Vunkerl Inlet (J-7) y arrasar el campamento de las bestias en Everbloom Hollow.",
    ["Objective: travel to the area named by the operation and obliterate the beastmen campground there."] = "Objetivo: viajar a la zona que indica la operación y arrasar allí el campamento de las bestias.",
    ["Obtain 1 Scream Fungus and 1 Land Crab Meat and trade them to Valgeir."] = "Consigue 1 Scream Fungus y 1 Land Crab Meat y entrégaselos a Valgeir.",
    ["Obtain 10 Rusty Leggings (they are fished up or come from a Goblin Box) and trade them to Heizo. You do not have to trade all 10 at the same time, as he remembers how many you have traded."] = "Consigue 10 Rusty Leggings (se pescan o salen de un Goblin Box) y entrégaselos a Heizo. No hace falta entregar los 10 a la vez, porque él recuerda cuántos le has entregado.",
    ["Obtain 10 Rusty Subligar (they are fished up) and trade them to Heiji. You do not have to trade all 10 at the same time, as he remembers how many you have traded."] = "Consigue 10 Rusty Subligar (se pescan) y entrégaselos a Heiji. No hace falta entregar los 10 a la vez, porque él recuerda cuántos le has entregado.",
    ["Obtain 2 Cluster Cores, a fairly common drop from Cluster-type monsters."] = "Consigue 2 Cluster Cores, un drop bastante común de los monstruos Cluster-type.",
    ["Obtain 2 Dhalmel Meat and trade them to Rycharde to complete the quest. You receive 1,500 gil and the title Purveyor in Training."] = "Consigue 2 Dhalmel Meat y entrégaselos a Rycharde para completar la quest. Recibes 1,500 gil y el título Purveyor in Training.",
    ["Obtain 2 Hippogryph Tailfeathers (from Hippogryphs in Riverne - Site #A01 and #B01, or the Auction House under Clothcraft) and trade them to Ferchinne for your reward, the Mistmelt. You can repeat the quest."] = "Consigue 2 Hippogryph Tailfeathers (de los Hippogryphs de Riverne - Site #A01 y #B01, o en la Auction House en Clothcraft) y entrégaselas a Ferchinne para tu recompensa, el Mistmelt. Puedes repetir la quest.",
    ["Obtain 2 Lufet Salts from River Crabs in West Ronfaure."] = "Obtén 2 Lufet Salts de los River Crabs de West Ronfaure.",
    ["Obtain 3 Acuex Ore and trade them to Sylvie. Buy them at the Auction House (Materials > Smithing) or get them from Putrid Acuex and Flatus Acuex in Cirdas Caverns."] = "Consigue 3 Acuex Ore y entrégaselos a Sylvie. Cómpralos en la Auction House (Materials > Smithing) o consíguelos de los Putrid Acuex y Flatus Acuex de Cirdas Caverns.",
    ["Obtain 3 Black Tiger Hides."] = "Obtén 3 Black Tiger Hides.",
    ["Obtain 3 Lizard Skins. They can be bought from Cletae in Southern San d'Oria (D-8) for 600 gil, but only with Leathercraft Recruit rank or higher."] = "Obtén 3 Lizard Skins. Se pueden comprar a Cletae en Southern San d'Oria (D-8) por 600 gil, pero solo con rango Leathercraft Recruit o superior.",
    ["Obtain 3 Sheepskins; Cletae, in the building right behind Hanaa Punaa, sells them."] = "Consigue 3 Sheepskins; Cletae, en el edificio justo detrás de Hanaa Punaa, las vende.",
    ["Obtain 4 Ladybug Wings."] = "Obtén 4 Ladybug Wings.",
    ["Obtain Astragalos x4 and trade them to Koru-Moru. Astragalos can be bought from Shih Tayuun at the Bonecraft Guild in Windurst Woods (H-13), but it is only restocked if players sell it to the guild."] = "Consigue Astragalos x4 y entrégaselos a Koru-Moru. Se pueden comprar a Shih Tayuun en el Bonecraft Guild de Windurst Woods (H-13), pero solo se reponen si los jugadores se los venden al gremio.",
    ["Obtain Bat Wing x2."] = "Obtén Bat Wing x2.",
    ["Obtain Beehive Chip x3 or Remi Shell x2. Beehive Chip can be bought for 40 gil from Odoba at the Alchemy Guild in Bastok Mines (K-6)."] = "Obtén Beehive Chip x3 o Remi Shell x2. El Beehive Chip se puede comprar por 40 gil a Odoba en el Alchemy Guild de Bastok Mines (K-6).",
    ["Obtain Beeswax x2."] = "Obtén Beeswax x2.",
    ["Obtain Black Tiger Fang x3. It can be found at the Auction House (Materials, Bonecraft) or bought from Retto-Marutto in Windurst Woods (H-13) for 2,000 gil."] = "Obtén Black Tiger Fang x3. Se puede encontrar en la Auction House (Materials, Bonecraft) o comprar a Retto-Marutto en Windurst Woods (H-13) por 2,000 gil.",
    ["Obtain Bone Chip x2 and a Bomb Ash; both can be bought from NPCs."] = "Obtén Bone Chip x2 y un Bomb Ash; ambos se pueden comprar a NPCs.",
    ["Obtain Darksteel Ore x2 from the Auction House, Mog Garden, mining or other sources."] = "Obtén Darksteel Ore x2 en la Auction House, en el Mog Garden, minando u otras fuentes.",
    ["Obtain Flint Stone x4. It can be found at the Auction House (Materials, Goldsmithing) or dropped by worm enemies such as Tunnel Worm in East Ronfaure, West Ronfaure, North Gustaberg and South Gustaberg."] = "Obtén Flint Stone x4. Se puede encontrar en la Auction House (Materials, Goldsmithing) o la sueltan enemigos gusano como Tunnel Worm en East Ronfaure, West Ronfaure, North Gustaberg y South Gustaberg.",
    ["Obtain Flint Stone x4. It drops from worm type enemies such as Tunnel Worm, Carrion Worm and Stone Eater, and can also be found at the Auction House (Materials, Goldsmithing)."] = "Obtén Flint Stone x4. La sueltan enemigos de tipo gusano como Tunnel Worm, Carrion Worm y Stone Eater, y también se puede encontrar en la Auction House (Materials, Goldsmithing).",
    ["Obtain Gausebit Grass x4. Buy them at the Auction House (Weapons > Ammo & Misc. > Pet Items), or farm Crane Fly enemies in northern Meriphataud Mountains (near the outpost and Survival Guide, or the Castle Oztroja entrance) or Wadi Hare enemies in Dangruf Wadi. Gysahl Greens from the stables don't work."] = "Consigue Gausebit Grass x4. Cómpralas en la Auction House (Weapons > Ammo & Misc. > Pet Items) o farmea enemigos Crane Fly en el norte de Meriphataud Mountains (cerca del puesto avanzado y la Survival Guide, o de la entrada a Castle Oztroja) o enemigos Wadi Hare en Dangruf Wadi. Las Gysahl Greens de los establos no sirven.",
    ["Obtain Hare Meat x5. For low-level players, Wild Rabbit and Forest Hare enemies can be defeated for experience points and have a chance to drop it."] = "Obtén Hare Meat x5. Para jugadores de nivel bajo, los enemigos Wild Rabbit y Forest Hare se pueden derrotar para obtener experiencia y tienen posibilidad de soltarla.",
    ["Obtain Honey x5. It drops from Maneating Hornet enemies in North Gustaberg and South Gustaberg, or can be bought from Chomo Jinjahl in Windurst Waters North (E-8) for 200 gil with Cooking Guild Recruit rank or higher."] = "Obtén Honey x5. Cae de Maneating Hornet en North Gustaberg y South Gustaberg, o se puede comprar a Chomo Jinjahl en Windurst Waters North (E-8) por 200 gil con rango Cooking Guild Recruit o superior.",
    ["Obtain Jody's Acid from Ameretats in Bhaflau Thickets or Wajaom Woodlands."] = "Obtén Jody's Acid de los Ameretats de Bhaflau Thickets o Wajaom Woodlands.",
    ["Obtain Laminated Ram Leather, Sheep Leather, and Silk Thread and trade them to Kipopo."] = "Obtén Laminated Ram Leather, Sheep Leather y Silk Thread y entrégaselos a Kipopo.",
    ["Obtain Lufet Salt x3."] = "Obtén Lufet Salt x3.",
    ["Obtain Rock Salt, Gausebit Grass and Lizard Egg. You may need several of each."] = "Obtén Rock Salt, Gausebit Grass y Lizard Egg. Puede que necesites varios de cada uno.",
    ["Obtain Shaman Garlic x2, which drops from Orcish Cursemaker enemies."] = "Obtén Shaman Garlic x2, que cae de enemigos Orcish Cursemaker.",
    ["Obtain Shell Bug x3 from Quadav enemies or at the Auction House, and trade them to Ronan. Shell Bug can also be obtained from the Green Thumb Moogle if you have a Baby eft memento."] = "Obtén Shell Bug x3 de enemigos Quadav o en la Auction House y entrégalos a Ronan. El Shell Bug también se puede obtener del Green Thumb Moogle si tienes un Baby eft memento.",
    ["Obtain Silk Thread x3 or Crawler Calculus x3. Both drop from Crawler enemies in East Sarutabaruta and West Sarutabaruta."] = "Obtén Silk Thread x3 o Crawler Calculus x3. Ambos los sueltan enemigos Crawler en East Sarutabaruta y West Sarutabaruta.",
    ["Obtain Sleepshroom, Treant Bulb or Wild Onion and trade it to her depending on the time of day. Sleepshroom pays 200 gil from 18:00 to 5:59, Treant Bulb 200 gil from 6:00 to 11:59, and Wild Onion 350 gil from 12:00 to 17:59. If you trade an item that does not match the time of day, you only receive 100 gil."] = "Obtén Sleepshroom, Treant Bulb o Wild Onion y entrégaselo según la hora del día. Sleepshroom paga 200 gil de 18:00 a 5:59, Treant Bulb 200 gil de 6:00 a 11:59 y Wild Onion 350 gil de 12:00 a 17:59. Si entregas un objeto que no corresponde a la hora, solo recibes 100 gil.",
    ["Obtain Wild Onion x4 and trade them to him."] = "Obtén Wild Onion x4 y entrégaselos.",
    ["Obtain Yagudo Necklace x4."] = "Obtén Yagudo Necklace x4.",
    ["Obtain Zinc Ore x4. It can be bought from Teerth in Bastok Markets for 200 gil, from Celestina in Mhaura for 200 gil, or at the Auction House, or you can mine it from a Mineral Vein."] = "Obtén Zinc Ore x4. Se puede comprar a Teerth en Bastok Markets por 200 gil, a Celestina en Mhaura por 200 gil, o en la Auction House, o minarlo de una Mineral Vein.",
    ["Obtain a Bal Shell by using a Pickaxe at an Excavation Point in Korroloka Tunnel. Angelica's path: trade it to Angelica on the top floor of the Rarab Tail Hostelry in Windurst Waters (North) (F-10). Umberto's path: trade it to Umberto in Bastok Markets (L-10), then speak with Diederik again."] = "Consigue una Bal Shell usando un Pickaxe en un Excavation Point de Korroloka Tunnel. Camino de Angelica: entrégasela a Angelica en el último piso del Rarab Tail Hostelry en Windurst Waters (North) (F-10). Camino de Umberto: entrégasela a Umberto en Bastok Markets (L-10) y luego habla de nuevo con Diederik.",
    ["Obtain a Beehive Chip and a Dhalmel Meat and trade them to Rycharde to complete the quest. You receive between 1,000 and 1,500 gil and the title One-Star Purveyor."] = "Consigue un Beehive Chip y un Dhalmel Meat y entrégaselos a Rycharde para completar la quest. Recibes entre 1,000 y 1,500 gil y el título One-Star Purveyor.",
    ["Obtain a Beetle Shell and a Hecteyes Eye."] = "Obtén una Beetle Shell y un Hecteyes Eye.",
    ["Obtain a Bird Feather. It can be bought at the Auction House, or dropped by Carrion Crow enemies outside Windurst."] = "Obtén una Bird Feather. Se puede comprar en la Auction House, o la sueltan enemigos Carrion Crow fuera de Windurst.",
    ["Obtain a Bloody Robe, a Dhalmel Saliva and a Wild Rabbit Tail and bring them to Vera."] = "Consigue un Bloody Robe, un Dhalmel Saliva y un Wild Rabbit Tail y llévaselos a Vera.",
    ["Obtain a Blue Mage's Testimony from Mamool Ja Mimicker enemies."] = "Consigue un Blue Mage's Testimony de los enemigos Mamool Ja Mimicker.",
    ["Obtain a Boarding Permit through The Road to Aht Urhgan or the Rhapsodies of Vana'diel progression."] = "Obtén un Boarding Permit mediante The Road to Aht Urhgan o la progresión de Rhapsodies of Vana'diel.",
    ["Obtain a Bomb Ash from the Auction House, from Tenshodo or Alchemy vendors, or by farming Lantern and Bomb type monsters."] = "Obtén un Bomb Ash de la Auction House, de vendedores de Tenshodo o de Alchemy, o farmeando monstruos de tipo Lantern y Bomb.",
    ["Obtain a Bone Chip from the Auction House or by farming Skeleton type monsters."] = "Obtén un Bone Chip en la Auction House o farmeando monstruos de tipo Skeleton.",
    ["Obtain a Brass Hairpin. It can be bought at the Auction House, or crafted."] = "Obtén una Brass Hairpin. Se puede comprar en la Auction House o fabricar.",
    ["Obtain a Bruised Starfruit, which drops from Cursed Weapon enemies (levels 43-45) in Xarcabard or can be bought at the Auction House."] = "Consigue una Bruised Starfruit, que sueltan los enemigos Cursed Weapon (niveles 43-45) de Xarcabard o que se puede comprar en la Auction House.",
    ["Obtain a Carbuncle's Ruby from a Leech enemy. The drop rate is low (about 1%, 3%+ with Treasure Hunter 3), so a Thief helps. Poison Leeches in Buburimu Peninsula are probably easiest; Bloodsuckers in Toraimarai Canal (H-9 and J-9 on map 1) may have the best rate; Acrophies on Qufim Island also work."] = "Consigue un Carbuncle's Ruby de un enemigo Leech. La tasa de drop es baja (alrededor del 1%, 3%+ con Treasure Hunter 3), así que un Thief ayuda. Las Poison Leeches de Buburimu Peninsula son probablemente las más fáciles; los Bloodsuckers de Toraimarai Canal (H-9 y J-9 en el mapa 1) quizá tengan la mejor tasa; los Acrophies de Qufim Island también sirven.",
    ["Obtain a Cathedral Tapestry. It drops from Orcish Fighter enemies in Fort Ghelsba or the Yughott Grotto. Trade it to Sobane."] = "Obtén un Cathedral Tapestry. Cae de enemigos Orcish Fighter en Fort Ghelsba o Yughott Grotto. Entrégaselo a Sobane.",
    ["Obtain a Cold Bone, which can be bought at the Auction House or dropped by Doom Soldier enemies that appear at night in Cape Teriggan."] = "Obtén un Cold Bone, que se puede comprar en la Auction House o que sueltan enemigos Doom Soldier que aparecen de noche en Cape Teriggan.",
    ["Obtain a Copper Ingot from the Auction House, Goldsmithing guild shops, or by crafting it. To buy the Copper Ore for crafting at a guild shop, visit Teerth or Visala in Bastok Markets (H-8), or Yabby Tanmikey or Celestina in Mhaura (G-8)."] = "Obtén un Copper Ingot en la Auction House, en las tiendas del Goldsmithing guild o fabricándolo. Para comprar el Copper Ore para fabricar en una tienda del guild, visita a Teerth o Visala en Bastok Markets (H-8), o a Yabby Tanmikey o Celestina en Mhaura (G-8).",
    ["Obtain a Copper Key, which drops from Riverne Vultures in Riverne - Site #A01. You also need a Giant Scale (from a Firedrake) to pass through the Unstable Displacements."] = "Consigue una Copper Key, que sueltan los Riverne Vultures de Riverne - Site #A01. También necesitas una Giant Scale (de un Firedrake) para cruzar los Unstable Displacements.",
    ["Obtain a Copper Ring, either at the Auction House, from merchants (Carmelide or Raghd in Bastok Markets) or by crafting it."] = "Obtén un Copper Ring, en la Auction House, de mercaderes (Carmelide o Raghd en Bastok Markets) o fabricándolo.",
    ["Obtain a Damselfly Worm, a Magicked Skull and a Crab Apron and bring them to Isacio."] = "Consigue un Damselfly Worm, un Magicked Skull y un Crab Apron y llévaselos a Isacio.",
    ["Obtain a Darksteel Ingot from the Auction House or by crafting it. One is enough for multiple people doing the quest."] = "Obtén un Darksteel Ingot en la Auction House o fabricándolo. Uno basta para varias personas que hagan la quest.",
    ["Obtain a Derfland Humus. It drops from Doom Scorpion enemies in Crawlers' Nest, and can also be purchased at the Auction House."] = "Obtén un Derfland Humus. Cae de enemigos Doom Scorpion en Crawlers' Nest y también se puede comprar en la Auction House.",
    ["Obtain a Desert Venom, which drops from Doom Scorpion enemies in Eastern Altepa Desert and Tulwar Scorpion enemies in Western Altepa Desert, or buy one at the Auction House."] = "Consigue un Desert Venom, que sueltan los enemigos Doom Scorpion de Eastern Altepa Desert y los Tulwar Scorpion de Western Altepa Desert, o cómpralo en la Auction House.",
    ["Obtain a Dog Collar, either at the Auction House or by farming Black Wolf enemies in North Gustaberg and South Gustaberg at night (game time 20:00 to 04:00)."] = "Obtén un Dog Collar, en la Auction House o farmeando enemigos Black Wolf en North Gustaberg y South Gustaberg de noche (hora del juego 20:00 a 04:00).",
    ["Obtain a Fei'Yin Chest Key by defeating Shadow, Underworld Bat and Ore Golem enemies in that area."] = "Obtén una Fei'Yin Chest Key derrotando a enemigos Shadow, Underworld Bat y Ore Golem de esa zona.",
    ["Obtain a Flame Degen. It can be purchased at the Auction House, purchased with Sparks of Eminence, crafted, or it rarely drops from Napalm enemies."] = "Obtén una Flame Degen. Se puede comprar en la Auction House, comprar con Sparks of Eminence, fabricar, o la sueltan raramente los enemigos Napalm.",
    ["Obtain a Garnet."] = "Consigue una Garnet.",
    ["Obtain a Giant Sheep Meat from the Auction House or from Ornery Sheep in South Gustaberg."] = "Obtén una Giant Sheep Meat en la Auction House o de los Ornery Sheep de South Gustaberg.",
    ["Obtain a Ginger Cookie, sold by the Curio Vendor Moogle or by Valeriano in Port Bastok, and trade it to Deidogg. The quest is not flagged in your log until after you trade the Ginger Cookie, and from then on it is active."] = "Obtén una Ginger Cookie, que vende el Curio Vendor Moogle o Valeriano en Port Bastok, y entrégala a Deidogg. La quest no queda marcada en tu log hasta que entregas la Ginger Cookie, y desde entonces está activa.",
    ["Obtain a Gold Earring. It can be obtained for free by completing the Records of Eminence objective Conflict: Xarcabard for the first time."] = "Obtén un Gold Earring. Se puede conseguir gratis completando por primera vez el objetivo de Records of Eminence Conflict: Xarcabard.",
    ["Obtain a Hare Meat."] = "Obtén un Hare Meat.",
    ["Obtain a Heavy Quadav Chestplate and Heavy Quadav Backplate."] = "Obtén un Heavy Quadav Chestplate y un Heavy Quadav Backplate.",
    ["Obtain a Kuftal Coffer Key and use it to open any coffer in Kuftal Tunnel (the Survival Guide is quickest). This gives you the key item Challenge to the Royal Knights."] = "Consigue una Kuftal Coffer Key y úsala para abrir cualquier cofre de Kuftal Tunnel (la Survival Guide es lo más rápido). Esto te da el key item Challenge to the Royal Knights.",
    ["Obtain a Lamian Fang Key. You can get one from a ??? in Caedarva Mire at (I-7), in a small crevice behind a Jnun, or it can drop from a Reserve Draugar in Caedarva Mire. Otherwise, obtain it from Merrow enemies inside Arrapago Reef."] = "Consigue una Lamian Fang Key. Puedes conseguir una de una ??? en Caedarva Mire en (I-7), en una pequeña grieta detrás de un Jnun, o puede caer de un Reserve Draugar en Caedarva Mire. Si no, consíguela de los enemigos Merrow dentro de Arrapago Reef.",
    ["Obtain a Lilac. It can be bought at the Auction House, or from Areebah in Upper Jeuno (H-6) for 120 gil."] = "Obtén un Lilac. Se puede comprar en la Auction House, o a Areebah en Upper Jeuno (H-6) por 120 gil.",
    ["Obtain a Lizard Egg."] = "Obtén un Lizard Egg.",
    ["Obtain a Luminicloth, a Revival Tree Root and a Wolf Hide. All three are on the Auction House, or farm them in The Eldieme Necropolis at any time of day: Luminicloth (rare) from ghosts, Revival Tree Root from undead, Wolf Hide from hounds."] = "Consigue una Luminicloth, una Revival Tree Root y una Wolf Hide. Las tres están en la Auction House, o farméalas en The Eldieme Necropolis a cualquier hora: Luminicloth (rara) de los fantasmas, Revival Tree Root de los no-muertos, Wolf Hide de los sabuesos.",
    ["Obtain a Marguerite. It can be bought at the Auction House, or from Areebah in Upper Jeuno (H-6) for 120 gil."] = "Obtén una Marguerite. Se puede comprar en la Auction House o a Areebah en Upper Jeuno (H-6) por 120 gil.",
    ["Obtain a Mary's Milk. It drops from Stray Mary in Konschtat Highlands, and can also be bought at the Auction House."] = "Obtén un Mary's Milk. Cae de Stray Mary en Konschtat Highlands y también se puede comprar en la Auction House.",
    ["Obtain a Muddy Siredon. It is fished up in the Newt Pool area of the Phanauet Channel, but one bought from the Auction House works just as well."] = "Consigue un Muddy Siredon. Se pesca en la zona de Newt Pool del Phanauet Channel, pero uno comprado en la Auction House sirve igual.",
    ["Obtain a Mythril Sallet from the Auction House (Armor, Head) or for 437 Sparks."] = "Obtén un Mythril Sallet de la Auction House (Armor, Head) o por 437 Sparks.",
    ["Obtain a Palborough Chest Key. It drops from Scimitar Scorpion, Brass Quadav, Copper Quadav and Old Quadav enemies in Palborough Mines, or can be bought from the Curio Vendor Moogle for 2,500 gil if you have the key item Rhapsody in White."] = "Obtén una Palborough Chest Key. La sueltan enemigos Scimitar Scorpion, Brass Quadav, Copper Quadav y Old Quadav en Palborough Mines, o se puede comprar al Curio Vendor Moogle por 2,500 gil si tienes el key item Rhapsody in White.",
    ["Obtain a Papaka Grass."] = "Obtén una Papaka Grass.",
    ["Obtain a Parchment from the Auction House (Leathercraft), by crafting it, or from Pikini-Mikini in the Mhaura warehouse (G-9) for just over 2,000 gil."] = "Consigue un Parchment en la Auction House (Leathercraft), fabricándolo o comprándolo a Pikini-Mikini en el almacén de Mhaura (G-9) por algo más de 2,000 gil.",
    ["Obtain a Parchment, which Pikini-Mikini sells in Mhaura (G-9) for 2,019 gil, and a Black Ink, which Maymunah sells in Bastok Mines (K-7) for 570 gil."] = "Consigue un Parchment, que vende Pikini-Mikini en Mhaura (G-9) por 2,019 gil, y una Black Ink, que vende Maymunah en Bastok Mines (K-7) por 570 gil.",
    ["Obtain a Philosopher's Stone."] = "Obtén una Philosopher's Stone.",
    ["Obtain a Puffball and trade it to Rycharde to complete the quest. You receive 2,100 gil and the title Two-Star Purveyor."] = "Consigue un Puffball y entrégaselo a Rycharde para completar la quest. Recibes 2,100 gil y el título Two-Star Purveyor.",
    ["Obtain a Punch Bug from Lou Carcolhs, Ancient Quadavs, Vajra Quadavs, or Gold Quadavs in Pashhow Marshlands [S] or Beadeaux [S]."] = "Obtén un Punch Bug de Lou Carcolhs, Ancient Quadavs, Vajra Quadavs o Gold Quadavs en Pashhow Marshlands [S] o Beadeaux [S].",
    ["Obtain a Puppetmaster's Testimony (Pup. Testimony). It drops from Troll Surveillant enemies in Bhaflau Thickets (F-8, northern map) and from Troll Engraver enemies in Halvung. It can be used for up to three fight attempts before you need a new one."] = "Obtén un Puppetmaster's Testimony (Pup. Testimony). Lo sueltan enemigos Troll Surveillant en Bhaflau Thickets (F-8, mapa norte) y enemigos Troll Engraver en Halvung. Se puede usar para hasta tres intentos de combate antes de necesitar uno nuevo.",
    ["Obtain a Quadav Backplate, either at the Auction House or by farming Amethyst Quadav enemies in North Gustaberg, South Gustaberg, Palborough Mines or Konschtat Highlands."] = "Obtén un Quadav Backplate, ya sea en la Auction House o farmeando enemigos Amethyst Quadav en North Gustaberg, South Gustaberg, Palborough Mines o Konschtat Highlands.",
    ["Obtain a Quadav Backscale from Quadavs in Palborough Mines."] = "Obtén un Quadav Backscale de los Quadavs de Palborough Mines.",
    ["Obtain a Quadav Helm. It only drops from Old Quadav enemies in Beadeaux; Old Quadav in other areas do not drop the same items. It can also be bought at the Auction House (Others, Beast-made)."] = "Obtén un Quadav Helm. Solo lo sueltan enemigos Old Quadav en Beadeaux; los Old Quadav de otras zonas no sueltan los mismos objetos. También se puede comprar en la Auction House (Others, Beast-made).",
    ["Obtain a Rabbit Hide, a Two-Leaf Mandragora Bud and an Insect Wing."] = "Obtén una Rabbit Hide, un Two-Leaf Mandragora Bud y un Insect Wing.",
    ["Obtain a Rain Lily."] = "Consigue una Rain Lily.",
    ["Obtain a Rampaging Horn and a Lumbering Horn."] = "Obtén un Rampaging Horn y un Lumbering Horn.",
    ["Obtain a Rarab Tail. It can be bought from the Sarutabaruta regional vendor, for example Baehu-Faehu in Windurst Waters North (G-5), for about 22 gil."] = "Obtén una Rarab Tail. Se puede comprar al vendedor regional de Sarutabaruta, por ejemplo Baehu-Faehu en Windurst Waters North (G-5), por unos 22 gil.",
    ["Obtain a Red Oven Mitt from Copper Quadav and Onyx Quadav enemies in Grauberg (S) (two of each in the (J-5/6) corridor, near the Campaign Arbiter and Survival Guide) or North Gustaberg (S) (one Copper Quadav south of the Survival Guide)."] = "Consigue un Red Oven Mitt de los enemigos Copper Quadav y Onyx Quadav de Grauberg (S) (dos de cada en el pasillo de (J-5/6), cerca del Campaign Arbiter y la Survival Guide) o de North Gustaberg (S) (un Copper Quadav al sur de la Survival Guide).",
    ["Obtain a Revival Tree Root. It can be bought at the Auction House (Materials, Alchemy) or dropped by Ghost-type enemies, and it does not need to come from King Ranperre's Tomb."] = "Obtén una Revival Tree Root. Se puede comprar en la Auction House (Materials, Alchemy) o la sueltan enemigos Ghost-type, y no tiene que venir de King Ranperre's Tomb.",
    ["Obtain a Rolanberry 874, either at the Auction House (Food, Ingredients) or by defeating the Drone Crawler (G) in Crawlers' Nest (Survival Guide, Derfland Region)."] = "Obtén un Rolanberry 874, en la Auction House (Food, Ingredients) o derrotando al Drone Crawler (G) en Crawlers' Nest (Survival Guide, Derfland Region).",
    ["Obtain a Rose Wand, an Oak Staff and a Mythril Rod. All three can be bought with sparks: the Oak Staff and the Mythril Rod are in the level 30-39 category, the Rose Wand in the level 40-49 category."] = "Obtén una Rose Wand, un Oak Staff y una Mythril Rod. Los tres se pueden comprar con sparks: el Oak Staff y la Mythril Rod están en la categoría de nivel 30-39, la Rose Wand en la de nivel 40-49.",
    ["Obtain a Royal Jelly. Death Jacket enemies are common near the main entrance of Crawlers' Nest."] = "Obtén una Royal Jelly. Los enemigos Death Jacket son comunes cerca de la entrada principal de Crawlers' Nest.",
    ["Obtain a Sahagin Key."] = "Obtén una Sahagin Key.",
    ["Obtain a Sand Bat Fang. It can be bought at the Auction House (Materials, Bonecraft) or taken from Sand Bat enemies found in the tunnels of Valkurm Dunes. It is also a Records of Eminence objective: Combat (Wide Area), Combat (Spoils) 2, Spoils (Sand Bat Fang)."] = "Obtén un Sand Bat Fang. Se puede comprar en la Auction House (Materials, Bonecraft) o conseguir de enemigos Sand Bat en los túneles de Valkurm Dunes. También es un objetivo de Records of Eminence: Combat (Wide Area), Combat (Spoils) 2, Spoils (Sand Bat Fang).",
    ["Obtain a Sand Charm, which drops from Crossbones on the Ferry between Mhaura and Selbina. Crossbones appear on the ferry only when pirates attack, which is a rare occurrence."] = "Consigue una Sand Charm, que sueltan los Crossbones del Ferry entre Mhaura y Selbina. Los Crossbones aparecen en el ferry solo cuando atacan piratas, algo poco frecuente.",
    ["Obtain a Scholar's Testimony, which drops from Orcs such as the Orcish Stonechucker, Orcish Fodder and Orcish Mesmerizer in East Ronfaure (S)."] = "Consigue un Scholar's Testimony, que sueltan Orcs como el Orcish Stonechucker, el Orcish Fodder y el Orcish Mesmerizer de East Ronfaure (S).",
    ["Obtain a Scorpion Stinger. It drops from Labyrinth Scorpion and Maze Scorpion enemies in the Maze of Shakhrami, and from Diplopod enemies in Kuftal Tunnel."] = "Obtén un Scorpion Stinger. Lo sueltan enemigos Labyrinth Scorpion y Maze Scorpion en Maze of Shakhrami, y enemigos Diplopod en Kuftal Tunnel.",
    ["Obtain a Shell Shield, either at the Auction House or from Young Quadav enemies in North Gustaberg, South Gustaberg, Palborough Mines or Konschtat Highlands. Only level 7 or higher WAR, RDM, PLD, BST and SAM can equip it."] = "Obtén un Shell Shield, ya sea en la Auction House o de enemigos Young Quadav en North Gustaberg, South Gustaberg, Palborough Mines o Konschtat Highlands. Solo WAR, RDM, PLD, BST y SAM de nivel 7 o superior pueden equiparlo.",
    ["Obtain a Silver Ingot from the Auction House or by crafting it. This quest follows The Elvaan Goldsmith."] = "Obtén un Silver Ingot en la Auction House o fabricándolo. Esta quest sigue a The Elvaan Goldsmith.",
    ["Obtain a Silver Name Tag. It can be bought at the Auction House, or dropped by Onyx Quadav and Greater Quadav enemies in Palborough Mines. Since the tags are rare, you can only turn in one at a time."] = "Obtén una Silver Name Tag. Se puede comprar en la Auction House, o la sueltan enemigos Onyx Quadav y Greater Quadav en Palborough Mines. Como las placas son raras, solo puedes entregar una a la vez.",
    ["Obtain a Slime Oil and a Frost Turnip."] = "Obtén un Slime Oil y un Frost Turnip.",
    ["Obtain a Smooth Stone, which drops from Crawler enemies in East Sarutabaruta and West Sarutabaruta."] = "Obtén una Smooth Stone, que sueltan enemigos Crawler en East Sarutabaruta y West Sarutabaruta.",
    ["Obtain a Soiled Letter and trade it to Koblakiq to complete the quest and receive 4,000 gil."] = "Consigue una Soiled Letter y entrégasela a Koblakiq para completar la quest y recibir 4,000 gil.",
    ["Obtain a Star Spinel from Spelunking Sabotender enemies in Quicksand Caves. Enter from Western Altepa Desert at (G-5); they are in the passageway near (F-7), and a couple spawn by Home Point #1. Sneak is required even at level 99. The weight sensors need one Galka or any two of Hume, Elvaan or Mithra."] = "Obtén un Star Spinel de enemigos Spelunking Sabotender en Quicksand Caves. Entra desde Western Altepa Desert en (G-5); están en el pasaje cerca de (F-7), y un par aparecen junto al Home Point #1. Se requiere Sneak incluso a nivel 99. Los sensores de peso necesitan un Galka o dos cualesquiera de Hume, Elvaan o Mithra.",
    ["Obtain a Steam Clock. You can buy one at the Auction House, or defeat Bubbly Bernie: get a Quus (a fish), from the Auction House or by fishing, travel to the lighthouse in South Gustaberg (M-10) and look for a ???, then trade the Quus to the ??? and Bubbly Bernie appears. Defeat him and loot his corpse for a Steam Clock."] = "Obtén un Steam Clock. Puedes comprar uno en la Auction House, o derrotar a Bubbly Bernie: consigue un Quus (un pez), en la Auction House o pescando, viaja al faro de South Gustaberg (M-10) y busca una ???, luego entrega el Quus a la ??? y aparece Bubbly Bernie. Derrótalo y saquea su cadáver para obtener un Steam Clock.",
    ["Obtain a Sutlac and head off to Nashmau."] = "Consigue un Sutlac y parte hacia Nashmau.",
    ["Obtain a Tavnazian Liver from the Orcs in Lufaise Meadows or the Tavnazian Sheep in Lufaise Meadows or Misareaux Coast, and trade it to Odeya."] = "Consigue un Tavnazian Liver de los Orcs de Lufaise Meadows o de las Tavnazian Sheep de Lufaise Meadows o Misareaux Coast, y entrégaselo a Odeya.",
    ["Obtain a Tonberry Board. It drops from Tonberry Pursuer enemies in the Temple of Uggalepih, Tonberry Shadower enemies in Yhoator Jungle and Tonberry Trailer enemies in the Den of Rancor."] = "Consigue un Tonberry Board. Lo sueltan los enemigos Tonberry Pursuer del Temple of Uggalepih, los Tonberry Shadower de Yhoator Jungle y los Tonberry Trailer del Den of Rancor.",
    ["Obtain a Twinstone Earring. It can be found at the Auction House, or farmed from Hill Lizard enemies in Meriphataud Mountains."] = "Obtén un Twinstone Earring. Se puede encontrar en la Auction House, o farmear de enemigos Hill Lizard en Meriphataud Mountains.",
    ["Obtain a Two-Leaf Mandragora Bud, which only drops from Mandragora enemies such as Tiny Mandragora in East and West Sarutabaruta."] = "Obtén un Two-Leaf Mandragora Bud, que solo sueltan enemigos Mandragora como Tiny Mandragora en East y West Sarutabaruta.",
    ["Obtain a Valkurm Sunsand, either at the Auction House or by traveling to Valkurm Dunes."] = "Obtén una Valkurm Sunsand, en la Auction House o viajando a Valkurm Dunes.",
    ["Obtain a Warm Egg, which can be bought at the Auction House or dropped by Anemone enemies in Yhoator Jungle."] = "Obtén un Warm Egg, que se puede comprar en la Auction House o que sueltan enemigos Anemone en Yhoator Jungle.",
    ["Obtain a Wild Pamamas, which drops from Young Opo-opo enemies in Yuhtunga Jungle and can sometimes be found at the Auction House. On later repeats a Wild Melon also works. Despite what the NPC says, you do not need to bring Ice Clusters, as there are no Flame Spouts on the path."] = "Consigue una Wild Pamamas, que suelta los enemigos Young Opo-opo de Yuhtunga Jungle y a veces se encuentra en la Auction House. En repeticiones posteriores también sirve una Wild Melon. Aunque lo diga el NPC, no necesitas llevar Ice Clusters, porque en el camino no hay Flame Spouts.",
    ["Obtain a Yagudo Caulk from Yagudos in Giddeus."] = "Obtén un Yagudo Caulk de los Yagudos de Giddeus.",
    ["Obtain a Yagudo Cherry from a vendor or the Auction House. One is enough for multiple people doing the quest."] = "Obtén una Yagudo Cherry de un vendedor o de la Auction House. Una basta para varias personas que hagan la quest.",
    ["Obtain a Zinc Ore. Monsters in Gustaberg are known to drop it."] = "Obtén un Zinc Ore. Se sabe que los monstruos de Gustaberg lo sueltan.",
    ["Obtain a Zvahl Coffer Key and trade it to a Treasure Coffer in Castle Zvahl Baileys to get the key item Mique's paintbrush. You can buy the key from the Curio Vendor Moogle for 5,000 gil if you have the key item Rhapsody in Umber. It also drops from Ahriman, Abyssal Demon, Arch Demon, Blood Demon and Doom Demon, or a Thief can pick the coffer's lock with Thief's Tools, a Living Key or a Skeleton Key."] = "Obtén una Zvahl Coffer Key y entrégala a un Treasure Coffer de Castle Zvahl Baileys para obtener el key item Mique's paintbrush. Puedes comprar la llave al Curio Vendor Moogle por 5,000 gil si tienes el key item Rhapsody in Umber. También la sueltan Ahriman, Abyssal Demon, Arch Demon, Blood Demon y Doom Demon, o un Thief puede forzar la cerradura del cofre con Thief's Tools, una Living Key o una Skeleton Key.",
    ["Obtain an Ahriman Lens and trade it to Ropunono."] = "Obtén un Ahriman Lens y entrégalo a Ropunono.",
    ["Obtain an Amaryllis. It can be bought at the Auction House, or from Areebah in Upper Jeuno (H-6)."] = "Obtén una Amaryllis. Se puede comprar en la Auction House o a Areebah en Upper Jeuno (H-6).",
    ["Obtain an Animal Glue."] = "Obtén un Animal Glue.",
    ["Obtain an Arnica Root if you have not already."] = "Consigue una Arnica Root si aún no la tienes.",
    ["Obtain an Attohwa Ginseng, which drops from Gallinipper, Ogrefly and Monarch Ogrefly enemies in Attohwa Chasm."] = "Obtén un Attohwa Ginseng, que cae de enemigos Gallinipper, Ogrefly y Monarch Ogrefly en Attohwa Chasm.",
    ["Obtain an Elixir."] = "Obtén un Elixir.",
    ["Obtain an Elshimo Marble, which drops from Ivory Lizard enemies in Yuhtunga Jungle."] = "Consigue un Elshimo Marble, que sueltan los enemigos Ivory Lizard de Yuhtunga Jungle.",
    ["Obtain an Imperial Army I.D. Tag from Rytaal in the Commissions Agency of Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). This assault is offered to mercenaries of the rank Chief Sergeant or higher, and it requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Consigue un Imperial Army I.D. Tag de Rytaal en la Commissions Agency de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). Este assault se ofrece a mercenarios del rango Chief Sergeant o superior, y requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Obtain an Imperial Army I.D. Tag from Rytaal in the Commissions Agency of Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). This assault is offered to mercenaries of the rank Corporal or higher, and it requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Consigue un Imperial Army I.D. Tag de Rytaal en la Commissions Agency de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). Este assault se ofrece a mercenarios del rango Corporal o superior, y requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Obtain an Imperial Army I.D. Tag from Rytaal in the Commissions Agency of Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). This assault is offered to mercenaries of the rank First Lieutenant or higher, and it requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Consigue un Imperial Army I.D. Tag de Rytaal en la Commissions Agency de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). Este assault se ofrece a mercenarios del rango First Lieutenant o superior, y requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Obtain an Imperial Army I.D. Tag from Rytaal in the Commissions Agency of Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). This assault is offered to mercenaries of the rank Lance Corporal or higher, and it requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Consigue un Imperial Army I.D. Tag de Rytaal en la Commissions Agency de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). Este assault se ofrece a mercenarios del rango Lance Corporal o superior, y requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Obtain an Imperial Army I.D. Tag from Rytaal in the Commissions Agency of Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). This assault is offered to mercenaries of the rank Private First Class or higher, and it requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Consigue un Imperial Army I.D. Tag de Rytaal en la Commissions Agency de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). Este assault se ofrece a mercenarios del rango Private First Class o superior, y requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Obtain an Imperial Army I.D. Tag from Rytaal in the Commissions Agency of Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). This assault is offered to mercenaries of the rank Private Second Class or higher, and it requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Consigue un Imperial Army I.D. Tag de Rytaal en la Commissions Agency de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). Este assault se ofrece a mercenarios del rango Private Second Class o superior, y requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Obtain an Imperial Army I.D. Tag from Rytaal in the Commissions Agency of Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). This assault is offered to mercenaries of the rank Second Lieutenant or higher, and it requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Consigue un Imperial Army I.D. Tag de Rytaal en la Commissions Agency de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). Este assault se ofrece a mercenarios del rango Second Lieutenant o superior, y requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Obtain an Imperial Army I.D. Tag from Rytaal in the Commissions Agency of Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). This assault is offered to mercenaries of the rank Sergeant Major or higher, and it requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Consigue un Imperial Army I.D. Tag de Rytaal en la Commissions Agency de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). Este assault se ofrece a mercenarios del rango Sergeant Major o superior, y requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Obtain an Imperial Army I.D. Tag from Rytaal in the Commissions Agency of Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). This assault is offered to mercenaries of the rank Sergeant or higher, and it requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Consigue un Imperial Army I.D. Tag de Rytaal en la Commissions Agency de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). Este assault se ofrece a mercenarios del rango Sergeant o superior, y requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Obtain an Imperial Army I.D. Tag from Rytaal in the Commissions Agency of Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). This assault is offered to mercenaries of the rank Superior Private or higher, and it requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Consigue un Imperial Army I.D. Tag de Rytaal en la Commissions Agency de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). Este assault se ofrece a mercenarios del rango Superior Private o superior, y requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Obtain an Imperial Army I.D. Tag from Rytaal in the Commissions Agency of Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). This assault requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Consigue un Imperial Army I.D. Tag de Rytaal en la Commissions Agency de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). Este assault requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Obtain an Ordrynite. Enter Pso'Xja from Beaucedine Glacier (G-9) and defeat Cryptonberry Plaguer or Cryptonberry Stalker enemies for it. You can use an Outpost Warp or the Survival Guide to Beaucedine Glacier, then go to (G-9), or use Home Point #1 in Pso'Xja, Escape and go to (G-9). With Rank 10 Chocobo Digging you can probably get 10 in a day, although they are Rare, so you have to turn each one in."] = "Obtén un Ordrynite. Entra en Pso'Xja desde Beaucedine Glacier (G-9) y derrota a enemigos Cryptonberry Plaguer o Cryptonberry Stalker para conseguirlo. Puedes usar un Outpost Warp o la Survival Guide a Beaucedine Glacier y luego ir a (G-9), o usar el Home Point #1 en Pso'Xja, Escape y ir a (G-9). Con Rank 10 de Chocobo Digging probablemente consigas 10 en un día, aunque son Rare, así que tienes que entregar cada uno.",
    ["Obtain four Rancor Flames to pass through the Sacrificial Chamber entrance unless its Home Point is already unlocked."] = "Obtén cuatro Rancor Flames para pasar por la entrada de la Sacrificial Chamber, salvo que su Home Point ya esté desbloqueado.",
    ["Obtain one Giant Scale if necessary."] = "Obtén una Giant Scale si es necesario.",
    ["Obtain some pickaxes, then go to the third floor of Palborough Mines."] = "Obtén algunas pickaxes y ve al tercer piso de Palborough Mines.",
    ["Obtain the Dark Sap crystal at (F-8), Map 1."] = "Obtén el Dark Sap crystal en (F-8), Map 1.",
    ["Obtain the Earth Sap crystal at (J-8) or (H-7), Map 1."] = "Obtén el Earth Sap crystal en (J-8) o (H-7), Map 1.",
    ["Obtain the Fire Sap crystal at (J-9), Map 1, or (F-10)/(J-8), Map 2."] = "Obtén el Fire Sap crystal en (J-9), Map 1, o en (F-10)/(J-8), Map 2.",
    ["Obtain the Ice Sap crystal at (I-8) or (H-7), Map 2."] = "Obtén el Ice Sap crystal en (I-8) o (H-7), Map 2.",
    ["Obtain the Light Sap crystal at (G-8), Map 2; there are two possible positions."] = "Obtén el Light Sap crystal en (G-8), Map 2; hay dos posiciones posibles.",
    ["Obtain the Lightning Sap crystal at (H-7), Map 1, or (G-10/G-11), Map 2."] = "Obtén el Lightning Sap crystal en (H-7), Map 1, o en (G-10/G-11), Map 2.",
    ["Obtain the Loadstone from the Open Sesame quest if entering the weight doors solo."] = "Obtén el Loadstone de la quest Open Sesame si entras solo en las puertas de peso.",
    ["Obtain the Opalescent Stone from Castle Oztroja. Go through the Brass Door at (I-8) to Map 2, take the exit at (I-9) to Map 6, and examine the Brass Door at (I-8) there for a cutscene, then again to enter."] = "Consigue la Opalescent Stone en Castle Oztroja. Cruza la Brass Door de (I-8) al mapa 2, toma la salida de (I-9) al mapa 6 y examina allí la Brass Door de (I-8) para una escena, y de nuevo para entrar.",
    ["Obtain the Test Answers: they drop from Wendigos in Inner Horutoto Ruins past the Three Mage Gate (shown as \"Pile of answer sheets\" in the log), or can sometimes be bought at the Auction House."] = "Consigue los Test Answers: los sueltan los Wendigos de Inner Horutoto Ruins pasada la Three Mage Gate (aparecen como \"Pile of answer sheets\" en el registro), o a veces se pueden comprar en la Auction House.",
    ["Obtain the Vunkerl Herb from the Leafy Patch."] = "Obtén la Vunkerl Herb del Leafy Patch.",
    ["Obtain the Water Sap crystal at (H-7) or (J-9), Map 1."] = "Obtén el Water Sap crystal en (H-7) o (J-9), Map 1.",
    ["Obtain the Wind Sap crystal at (H-9) or (J-9), Map 2."] = "Obtén el Wind Sap crystal en (H-9) o (J-9), Map 2.",
    ["Obtain the five fish he asks for: Ahtapot, Istakoz, Istavrit, Istiridye and Mercanbaligi. You can buy them at the Auction House or fish them up in the Treasures of Aht Urhgan zones."] = "Consigue los cinco pescados que pide: Ahtapot, Istakoz, Istavrit, Istiridye y Mercanbaligi. Puedes comprarlos en la Auction House o pescarlos en las zonas de Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Obtain the seven items by choosing them as your reward from the Prime Avatar fights: Trial by Fire (Ifrit) for Egil's Torch, Trial by Ice (Shiva) for Rust 'B' Gone, Trial by Wind (Garuda) for Bubbly Water, Trial by Earth (Titan) for Desert Light, Trial by Lightning (Ramuh) for Elder Branch, Trial by Water (Leviathan) for Eye of Nept, and The Moonlit Path (Fenrir) for Ancients' Key."] = "Consigue los siete objetos eligiéndolos como recompensa en las peleas contra los Prime Avatars: Trial by Fire (Ifrit) para Egil's Torch, Trial by Ice (Shiva) para Rust 'B' Gone, Trial by Wind (Garuda) para Bubbly Water, Trial by Earth (Titan) para Desert Light, Trial by Lightning (Ramuh) para Elder Branch, Trial by Water (Leviathan) para Eye of Nept y The Moonlit Path (Fenrir) para Ancients' Key.",
    ["On Dancer, speak with Laila in Upper Jeuno for a cutscene and your Dancer's Tights."] = "Como Dancer, habla con Laila en Upper Jeuno para una escena y tus Dancer's Tights.",
    ["On Map 2 of Crawlers' Nest at (I-10), examine the ??? and choose to bury the Old boots and the Crawler blood."] = "En el mapa 2 de Crawlers' Nest, en (I-10), examina la ??? y elige enterrar las Old boots y la Crawler blood.",
    ["On a Full Moon cycle, at night, board the Jeuno to San d'Oria airship."] = "En un ciclo de Full Moon, de noche, sube a la airship de Jeuno a San d'Oria.",
    ["On the North map, talk to Clais near the bridge to the Rarab's Tail Hostelery (G-10), Kyume-Romeh in the Timbre Timbers Tavern (F-10), Tosuka-Porika in the east Optistery (G-8), Pechiru-Mashiru in the east Aurastery (L-6) and Machitata near the Mog House (L-11)."] = "En el mapa North, habla con Clais cerca del puente al Rarab's Tail Hostelery (G-10), Kyume-Romeh en la Timbre Timbers Tavern (F-10), Tosuka-Porika en el Optistery este (G-8), Pechiru-Mashiru en el Aurastery este (L-6) y Machitata cerca del Mog House (L-11).",
    ["On the first map of the Den of Rancor (Map C), drop down the hole at (J-7) to the sixth map (Map D) and enter the Cloister of Tides at (I-7)."] = "En el primer mapa del Den of Rancor (Map C), déjate caer por el agujero de (J-7) al sexto mapa (Map D) y entra en la Cloister of Tides en (I-7).",
    ["On the isle, examine the ??? at (H-9) to spawn 6 Peerifools (Mandragora that use Dream Flower and link with other Mandragora). Defeat them and examine the ??? again for the key item Deed to Purgonorgo Isle."] = "En la isla, examina la ??? de (H-9) para hacer aparecer 6 Peerifools (Mandragoras que usan Dream Flower y se enlazan con otras Mandragoras). Derrótalos y examina de nuevo la ??? para obtener el key item Deed to Purgonorgo Isle.",
    ["On the next map, go to (G-7) and through the exit onto a ledge; walk north along it to Daa Bola the Seer at (I-7) and trade him the Arnica Root."] = "En el mapa siguiente, ve a (G-7) y cruza la salida a una cornisa; camina por ella hacia el norte hasta Daa Bola the Seer en (I-7) y entrégale la Arnica Root.",
    ["On the second floor of Vemalpeau's house, examine the ??? on the painting, look behind it and read the letter to get the key item Strange sheet of paper."] = "En el segundo piso de la casa de Vemalpeau, examina la ??? del cuadro, mira detrás y lee la carta para obtener el key item Strange sheet of paper.",
    ["On the third floor, trade the Gravel to the Refiner, pull the lever, drop to the second floor, pull the second lever, and obtain Mythril Sand."] = "En el tercer piso, entrega la Gravel al Refiner, tira de la palanca, déjate caer al segundo piso, tira de la segunda palanca y obtén Mythril Sand.",
    ["On the top floor, don't go through the timed gate: in the H-shaped room before it, trade the Yagudo Drink to the ??? on a torch at (H-8) to spawn Huu Xalmo the Savage (3 minutes between spawns)."] = "En el piso superior, no cruces la puerta temporizada: en la sala con forma de H anterior, entrega la Yagudo Drink a la ??? de una antorcha en (H-8) para hacer aparecer a Huu Xalmo the Savage (3 minutos entre apariciones).",
    ["Once all 10 are traded you receive your reward, the Scroll of Dokumori: Ichi, and the title Looks Good in Leggings."] = "Cuando hayas entregado los 10 recibes tu recompensa, el Scroll of Dokumori: Ichi, y el título Looks Good in Leggings.",
    ["Once all 10 are traded you receive your reward, the Scroll of Kurayami: Ichi, and the title Looks Sublime in a Subligar."] = "Cuando hayas entregado los 10 recibes tu recompensa, el Scroll of Kurayami: Ichi, y el título Looks Sublime in a Subligar.",
    ["Once all 15 Magicmart Flyers have been distributed, return to Regine and speak with her to end the quest."] = "Cuando hayas repartido los 15 Magicmart Flyers, vuelve con Regine y habla con ella para terminar la quest.",
    ["Once all parcels are delivered, speak with Fontoumant again for your reward."] = "Cuando hayas entregado todos los paquetes, vuelve a hablar con Fontoumant para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Once all the switches are off, return to the ??? in the Temple of the Goddess for a cutscene and your reward."] = "Cuando todos los interruptores estén desactivados, vuelve a la ??? del Temple of the Goddess para una escena y tu recompensa.",
    ["Once both are defeated, click the ??? again for a cutscene."] = "Cuando hayas derrotado a ambos, pulsa de nuevo la ??? para una escena.",
    ["Once everyone has seen the cutscene, examine the Bloodstained Glove again to spawn Insidio (any job; Trusts allowed). This Orobon uses Mayhem Lantern (area Charm) and takes less physical damage each time it does, so bring magic damage and skillchains, or let Trusts hold hate while you stay out of Charm range; Tenebrae with Pflug and other Magic Evasion buffs also helps. Everyone on the quest gets Insidio's extinguished lantern; helpers who have never assisted get up to 10,000 Bayld."] = "Cuando todos hayan visto la escena, examina de nuevo el Bloodstained Glove para hacer aparecer a Insidio (cualquier job; se permiten Trusts). Este Orobon usa Mayhem Lantern (Charm de área) y recibe menos daño físico cada vez que lo usa, así que lleva daño mágico y skillchains, o deja que los Trusts mantengan el odio mientras tú te quedas fuera del alcance del Charm; Tenebrae con Pflug y otros buffs de Magic Evasion también ayudan. Todos los que tengan la quest obtienen la Insidio's extinguished lantern; los ayudantes que nunca hayan ayudado reciben hasta 10,000 Bayld.",
    ["Once in Davoi you need to locate a Jar that contains the Power Sandals. The jar can spawn at (I-8), (K-9), (J-8), (H-8), (F-6), (J-9), (F-9), (G-9), (H-9) and (F-7)."] = "Una vez en Davoi, debes localizar un Jar que contiene las Power Sandals. La jarra puede aparecer en (I-8), (K-9), (J-8), (H-8), (F-6), (J-9), (F-9), (G-9), (H-9) y (F-7).",
    ["Once in Horlais Peak, go to the Hot Springs and check them to fill the bottle. The name does not change, so to confirm you filled it, read the description of the item under Temporary Items: it should say it is full of water from the hot spring that flows from Horlais Peak."] = "Una vez en Horlais Peak, ve a los Hot Springs y examínalos para llenar la botella. El nombre no cambia, así que para confirmar que la llenaste, lee la descripción del objeto en Temporary Items: debe decir que está llena de agua de la fuente termal que fluye de Horlais Peak.",
    ["Once in Mhaura, take the ferry to Selbina so that you are traveling at nighttime. Suitable ferry departure times for this quest leave Mhaura at 16:00 and 0:00. On the ferry that departs at 16:00, you must wait until night time at 20:00 for the event to appear."] = "Una vez en Mhaura, toma el ferry a Selbina para viajar de noche. Los horarios de salida adecuados desde Mhaura son 16:00 y 0:00. En el ferry que sale a las 16:00, debes esperar a la noche, a las 20:00, para que aparezca el evento.",
    ["Once in the temple, head to (I-10) and defeat the Temple Guardian to open the door."] = "Una vez en el templo, ve a (I-10) y derrota al Temple Guardian para abrir la puerta.",
    ["Once inside Ifrit's Cauldron, take the left path at the fork and continue until you find the Altar of Ashes at (I-9) on map 2, a black pillar near the edge of the path. Alternatively, use the Unity 125 teleport to map 3 and take exit G, then A, then B to reach (I-9) of map 2."] = "Dentro de Ifrit's Cauldron, toma el camino de la izquierda en la bifurcación y sigue hasta encontrar el Altar of Ashes en (I-9) del mapa 2, un pilar negro cerca del borde del camino. También puedes usar el teletransporte de Unity 125 al mapa 3 y tomar la salida G, luego A y luego B para llegar a (I-9) del mapa 2.",
    ["Once inside Sea Serpent Grotto, head to (K-6), where you find a ???. Check the ??? to spawn Glyryvilu."] = "Una vez dentro de Sea Serpent Grotto, ve a (K-6), donde encuentras una ???. Revisa la ??? para invocar a Glyryvilu.",
    ["Once inside, find a Toad's Footprint at (J-7) and click it for another cutscene."] = "Una vez dentro, encuentra una Toad's Footprint en (J-7) y haz clic en ella para otra escena.",
    ["Once inside, go to the point where (I-9) and (J-8) meet and check the mushroom patch to find a mature Scourshroom (a key item). Then check the mushroom patch at (I-9)/(J-9) to plant it. Repeat the process at (E-7)."] = "Una vez dentro, ve al punto donde se juntan (I-9) y (J-8) y revisa la mata de hongos para encontrar un Scourshroom maduro (un key item). Luego revisa la mata de hongos en (I-9)/(J-9) para plantarlo. Repite el proceso en (E-7).",
    ["Once inside, hug the south side until you reach a large room at (G-9), and fall through the grave in the center of the room. To reach the room at (G-9) you need someone to operate the gates for you, or the Magicked astrolabe."] = "Una vez dentro, pégate al lado sur hasta llegar a una sala grande en (G-9) y cae por la tumba del centro de la sala. Para llegar a la sala de (G-9) necesitas que alguien te abra las puertas, o el Magicked astrolabe.",
    ["Once inside, the displacement sequence is red, purple, red, purple (you lose all buffs, Trusts included, at each one). Take the elevator down, go north, then west at the intersection, and use the Stone Gate with your Pso'Xja pass. The Home Point is just past the gate on the left; head down the steps into The Shrouded Maw."] = "Una vez dentro, la secuencia de desplazamientos es rojo, morado, rojo, morado (pierdes todos los buffs, Trusts incluidos, en cada uno). Baja en el ascensor, ve al norte, luego al oeste en el cruce, y usa la Stone Gate con tu Pso'Xja pass. El Home Point está justo pasada la puerta, a la izquierda; baja los escalones hasta The Shrouded Maw.",
    ["Once prepared, examine the ??? at (I-7), northwest of Bloodlet Spring, to spawn 3 Sahagin NMs: Kappa Akuso (Monk), Kappa Biwa (Bard) and Kappa Bonze (White Mage)."] = "Una vez preparado, examina la ??? de (I-7), al noroeste de Bloodlet Spring, para invocar a 3 NMs Sahagin: Kappa Akuso (Monk), Kappa Biwa (Bard) y Kappa Bonze (White Mage).",
    ["Once the NM is defeated, check the ??? again to receive the key item Whispering conch."] = "Cuando el NM esté derrotado, revisa la ??? de nuevo para recibir el key item Whispering conch.",
    ["Once the Old Sabertooth has died on its own, examine the Tiger Bones to get the key item Old tiger's fang."] = "Cuando el Old Sabertooth haya muerto por sí solo, examina los Tiger Bones para obtener el key item Old tiger's fang.",
    ["Once the chocobo has eaten the Gausebit Grass x4, you are presented with a Chocobo license."] = "Cuando el chocobo haya comido las Gausebit Grass x4, te dan una Chocobo license.",
    ["Once the leeches are defeated and their bodies despawn, click on the ??? to receive the key item Strangely shaped coral. Several players can do this at the same time: have one member spawn the leeches and, after they despawn, have the others select the ??? before the player who spawned them. If the player who spawned them is KO'd, do not raise them until the Korroloka Leeches are defeated, or the leeches respawn immediately."] = "Cuando las leeches estén derrotadas y sus cuerpos desaparezcan, haz clic en la ??? para recibir el key item Strangely shaped coral. Varios jugadores pueden hacerlo a la vez: que un miembro invoque las leeches y, cuando desaparezcan, que los demás seleccionen la ??? antes que quien las invocó. Si quien las invocó queda KO'd, no lo levantes hasta que los Korroloka Leeches estén derrotados, o las leeches reaparecen de inmediato.",
    ["Once the quest is complete, she removes the status ailment from you."] = "Una vez completa la quest, te quita el estado alterado.",
    ["Once you accept, obtain Rusty Bucket x5, either by fishing for them or by buying them at the Auction House or from Kahah Hobichai in Al Zahbi."] = "Una vez aceptada, obtén Rusty Bucket x5, pescándolos o comprándolos en la Auction House o a Kahah Hobichai en Al Zahbi.",
    ["Once you bring him the item, you are given the option to choose a Fewell element. He crafts it for you while explaining the crafting process."] = "Cuando le traes el objeto, te dan la opción de elegir un elemento de Fewell. Te lo fabrica mientras te explica el proceso de fabricación.",
    ["Once you get the cutscene in Kuftal Tunnel, return to Datta for your reward, 8,000 gil, and the title Kuftal Tourist. You can watch the cutscene again with the Goblin Footprint after returning to Datta."] = "Cuando veas la escena en Kuftal Tunnel, vuelve con Datta por tu recompensa, 8,000 gil, y el título Kuftal Tourist. Puedes volver a ver la escena con el Goblin Footprint después de volver con Datta.",
    ["Once you have all 7 colors, Carbuncle appears in a cutscene and sends you to La Theine Plateau."] = "Cuando tengas los 7 colores, Carbuncle aparece en una escena y te envía a La Theine Plateau.",
    ["Once you have finished Even More Gullible's Travels and received the scent, speak with Lulupp in Kazham (G-7) for a cutscene. The Opo-opo in Kazham love your new fragrance: bring them what they want, in the correct order, and they make you their king."] = "Cuando hayas terminado Even More Gullible's Travels y recibido el olor, habla con Lulupp en Kazham (G-7) para una escena. Los Opo-opo de Kazham adoran tu nueva fragancia: tráeles lo que quieren, en el orden correcto, y te harán su rey.",
    ["Once you have finished the battle, return to the Blank Target in The Shrine of Ru'Avitau to choose your reward: the key items Shard of Apathy, Shard of Arrogance, Shard of Cowardice, Shard of Envy and Shard of Rage, and one of the following earrings: Abyssal Earring, Beastly Earring, Bushinomimi, Knight's Earring or Suppanomimi."] = "Cuando termines la batalla, vuelve al Blank Target de The Shrine of Ru'Avitau para elegir tu recompensa: los key items Shard of Apathy, Shard of Arrogance, Shard of Cowardice, Shard of Envy y Shard of Rage, y uno de estos pendientes: Abyssal Earring, Beastly Earring, Bushinomimi, Knight's Earring o Suppanomimi.",
    ["Once you have fished up a Hydrogauge, trade it to Leleroon in Nashmau (G-7)."] = "Cuando hayas pescado un Hydrogauge, entrégaselo a Leleroon en Nashmau (G-7).",
    ["Once you have one, trade it to Yazan for your reward, 350 gil."] = "Cuando tengas uno, entrégalo a Yazan para recibir tu recompensa, 350 gil.",
    ["Once you have spoken to all 20 people, return to Alib-Mufalib. He takes your Blue Sentinel badge and gives you a Blue invitation card."] = "Cuando hayas hablado con las 20 personas, vuelve con Alib-Mufalib. Se queda tu Blue Sentinel badge y te da una Blue invitation card.",
    ["Once you have spoken to all 20 people, return to Amutiyaal, who takes your Red Sentinel badge and gives you a Red invitation card."] = "Cuando hayas hablado con las 20 personas, vuelve con Amutiyaal, que se queda tu Red Sentinel badge y te da una Red invitation card.",
    ["Once you have spoken to all 20 people, return to Ibwam, who takes your Green Sentinel badge and gives you a Green invitation card."] = "Cuando hayas hablado con las 20 personas, vuelve con Ibwam, que se queda tu Green Sentinel badge y te da una Green invitation card.",
    ["Once you have the Cotton Gloves, trade them to Romilda to finish the quest and receive 2,000 gil."] = "Cuando tengas los Cotton Gloves, entrégaselos a Romilda para terminar la quest y recibir 2,000 gil.",
    ["Once you have the Rivernewort, return to Rouva for your reward, a Page from Miratete's Memoirs. Like other Experience Points scroll quests, it can be completed once per Conquest tally."] = "Cuando tengas el Rivernewort, vuelve con Rouva por tu recompensa, un Page from Miratete's Memoirs. Como otras quests de scrolls de Experience Points, se puede completar una vez por Conquest tally.",
    ["Once you have used a Rancor Flame, talk to Jakoh Wahcondalo in Kazham (J-9), who tells you to leave her village. The other NPCs in the room tell you to go to the Den of Rancor and Temple of Uggalepih complex to be cleansed and then come back. You get the title Excommunicate of Kazham as soon as the quest becomes active."] = "Una vez usada una Rancor Flame, habla con Jakoh Wahcondalo en Kazham (J-9), que te dice que abandones su aldea. Los demás NPCs de la sala te dicen que vayas al complejo del Den of Rancor y el Temple of Uggalepih para purificarte y luego vuelvas. Recibes el título Excommunicate of Kazham en cuanto la quest se activa.",
    ["Once you trade the Testimony to Maat, he asks if you are ready."] = "Cuando entregas el Testimony a Maat, te pregunta si estás listo.",
    ["One Mammet-800 appears per 2 alliance members (up to 9). They have the abilities of Mammet-19 Epsilon from Promathia Mission 2-5, scaled up; Yellow Liquid (0-3 drop from each) still locks one into its current form. They change stance when someone enters the grassy arena and attack a minute later. The fight ends when the last one dies."] = "Aparece un Mammet-800 por cada 2 miembros de la alianza (hasta 9). Tienen las habilidades del Mammet-19 Epsilon de la Promathia Mission 2-5, potenciadas; el Yellow Liquid (cada uno suelta de 0 a 3) sigue bloqueando a uno en su forma actual. Cambian de postura cuando alguien entra en la arena de hierba y atacan un minuto después. La pelea termina cuando muere el último.",
    ["Only one of them needs to be killed, so a recommended strategy is to zone to Den of Rancor and fight one while the others despawn."] = "Solo hace falta matar a uno, así que una estrategia recomendada es cambiar de zona a Den of Rancor y luchar contra uno mientras los otros desaparecen.",
    ["Open Oaken Door (K-8) and speak with Gilgamesh (L-8) about the Mithra carrying a mysterious crystal."] = "Abre la Oaken Door (K-8) y habla con Gilgamesh (L-8) sobre la Mithra que lleva un cristal misterioso.",
    ["Open a treasure chest using either the key or Thief's Tools to obtain the key item Fei'Yin magic tome."] = "Abre un treasure chest con la llave o con Thief's Tools para obtener el key item Fei'Yin magic tome.",
    ["Open the Door: Prince Regent's Rm in Chateau d'Oraguille at (H-8) to start the quest. You can continue as any job from this point."] = "Abre la Door: Prince Regent's Rm en Chateau d'Oraguille en (H-8) para empezar la quest. Desde este punto puedes continuar con cualquier trabajo.",
    ["Open the main menu and select Quests. Under Records of Eminence, go to Objective List > Tutorial > Basics and set the objective First Step Forward."] = "Abre el menú principal y elige Quests. En Records of Eminence, ve a Objective List > Tutorial > Basics y fija el objetivo First Step Forward.",
    ["Optional hints: Luuh Koplehn, Bonchacha and Maan-Pokuun outside; Maan-Pokuun sends you to Yoran-Oran, and once Tokaka (fishing guild) says Yoran-Oran had one, Yoran-Oran names the Maze of Shakhrami."] = "Pistas opcionales: Luuh Koplehn, Bonchacha y Maan-Pokuun fuera; Maan-Pokuun te envía a Yoran-Oran, y cuando Tokaka (gremio de pesca) dice que Yoran-Oran tenía uno, Yoran-Oran menciona Maze of Shakhrami.",
    ["Optional: Guslam mentions more armor scattered about Vana'diel. With Bard as your main job, open the Treasure Coffer in Crawlers' Nest for the Choral Roundlet, and the one in Castle Oztroja for the Choral Cannions, each with that zone's coffer key. The quest must be active or completed, but these are not needed to complete it."] = "Opcional: Guslam menciona más armadura repartida por Vana'diel. Con Bard como job principal, abre el Treasure Coffer de Crawlers' Nest para el Choral Roundlet y el de Castle Oztroja para los Choral Cannions, cada uno con la coffer key de esa zona. La quest debe estar activa o completada, pero no son necesarios para completarla.",
    ["Optional: Guslam mentions more armor scattered about Vana'diel. With Beastmaster as your main job, open the Treasure Coffer in Garlaige Citadel for the Beast Helm, and the one in Beadeaux for the Beast Jackcoat, each with that zone's coffer key. The quest must be active or completed, but these are not needed to complete it."] = "Opcional: Guslam menciona más armadura repartida por Vana'diel. Con Beastmaster como job principal, abre el Treasure Coffer de Garlaige Citadel para el Beast Helm y el de Beadeaux para el Beast Jackcoat, cada uno con la coffer key de esa zona. La quest debe estar activa o completada, pero no son necesarios para completarla.",
    ["Optional: Guslam mentions more armor scattered about Vana'diel. With Black Mage as your main job, open the Treasure Coffer in Davoi's Monastic Cavern for the Wizard's Coat, and the one in The Eldieme Necropolis for the Wizard's Tonban, each with that zone's coffer key. The quest must be active or completed, but these are not needed to complete it."] = "Opcional: Guslam menciona más armadura repartida por Vana'diel. Con Black Mage como job principal, abre el Treasure Coffer de Davoi's Monastic Cavern para el Wizard's Coat y el de The Eldieme Necropolis para el Wizard's Tonban, cada uno con la coffer key de esa zona. La quest debe estar activa o completada, pero no son necesarios para completarla.",
    ["Optional: Guslam mentions more armor scattered about Vana'diel. With Dark Knight as your main job, open the Treasure Coffer in Davoi's Monastic Cavern for the Chaos Flanchard, and the one in Castle Oztroja for the Chaos Cuirass, each with that zone's coffer key. The quest must be active or completed, but these are not needed to complete it."] = "Opcional: Guslam menciona más armadura repartida por Vana'diel. Con Dark Knight como job principal, abre el Treasure Coffer de Davoi's Monastic Cavern para el Chaos Flanchard y el de Castle Oztroja para el Chaos Cuirass, cada uno con la coffer key de esa zona. La quest debe estar activa o completada, pero no son necesarios para completarla.",
    ["Optional: Guslam mentions more armor scattered about Vana'diel. With Dragoon as your main job, open the Treasure Coffer in Ifrit's Cauldron for the Drachen Mail, and the one in Quicksand Caves for the Drachen Greaves, each with that zone's coffer key. The quest must be active or completed, but these are not needed to complete it."] = "Opcional: Guslam menciona más armadura repartida por Vana'diel. Con Dragoon como job principal, abre el Treasure Coffer de Ifrit's Cauldron para el Drachen Mail y el de Quicksand Caves para las Drachen Greaves, cada uno con la coffer key de esa zona. La quest debe estar activa o completada, pero no son necesarios para completarla.",
    ["Optional: Guslam mentions more armor scattered about Vana'diel. With Monk as your main job, open the Treasure Coffer in Garlaige Citadel for the Temple Crown, and the one in Beadeaux for the Temple Cyclas, each with that zone's coffer key. The quest must be active or completed, but these are not needed to complete it."] = "Opcional: Guslam menciona más armadura repartida por Vana'diel. Con Monk como job principal, abre el Treasure Coffer de Garlaige Citadel para la Temple Crown y el de Beadeaux para la Temple Cyclas, cada uno con la coffer key de esa zona. La quest debe estar activa o completada, pero no son necesarios para completarla.",
    ["Optional: Guslam mentions more armor scattered about Vana'diel. With Ninja as your main job, open the Treasure Coffer in Sea Serpent Grotto for the Ninja Kyahan, and the one in The Boyahda Tree for the Ninja Hatsuburi, each with that zone's coffer key. The quest must be active or completed, but these are not needed to complete it. The Sea Serpent Grotto coffers are all past the Mythril Door, on Map 3: examine the door until it mentions mythril dust in the indentation, then trade it a Mythril Beastcoin. The Grotto Coffer Key drops from enemies past that door, and the Boyahda Coffer Key from enemies in The Boyahda Tree."] = "Opcional: Guslam menciona más armadura repartida por Vana'diel. Con Ninja como job principal, abre el Treasure Coffer de Sea Serpent Grotto para el Ninja Kyahan y el de The Boyahda Tree para el Ninja Hatsuburi, cada uno con la coffer key de esa zona. La quest debe estar activa o completada, pero no son necesarios para completarla. Los cofres de Sea Serpent Grotto están todos pasada la Mythril Door, en el mapa 3: examina la puerta hasta que mencione polvo de mithril en la hendidura y entrégale una Mythril Beastcoin. La Grotto Coffer Key la sueltan los enemigos tras esa puerta, y la Boyahda Coffer Key los enemigos de The Boyahda Tree.",
    ["Optional: Guslam mentions more armor scattered about Vana'diel. With Paladin as your main job, open the Treasure Coffer in Garlaige Citadel for the Gallant Coronet, and the one in Beadeaux for the Gallant Breeches, each with that zone's coffer key. The quest must be active or completed, but these are not needed to complete it."] = "Opcional: Guslam menciona más armadura repartida por Vana'diel. Con Paladin como job principal, abre el Treasure Coffer de Garlaige Citadel para el Gallant Coronet y el de Beadeaux para los Gallant Breeches, cada uno con la coffer key de esa zona. La quest debe estar activa o completada, pero no son necesarios para completarla.",
    ["Optional: Guslam mentions more armor scattered about Vana'diel. With Ranger as your main job, open the Treasure Coffer in Crawlers' Nest for the Hunter's Braccae, and the one in Davoi's Monastic Cavern for the Hunter's Jerkin, each with that zone's coffer key. The quest must be active or completed, but these are not needed to complete it."] = "Opcional: Guslam menciona más armadura repartida por Vana'diel. Con Ranger como job principal, abre el Treasure Coffer de Crawlers' Nest para las Hunter's Braccae y el de Davoi's Monastic Cavern para el Hunter's Jerkin, cada uno con la coffer key de esa zona. La quest debe estar activa o completada, pero no son necesarios para completarla.",
    ["Optional: Guslam mentions more armor scattered about Vana'diel. With Red Mage as your main job, open the Treasure Coffer in Garlaige Citadel for the Warlock's Tights, and the one in Castle Oztroja for the Warlock's Tabard, each with that zone's coffer key. The quest must be active or completed, but these are not needed to complete it. In Castle Oztroja the four-lever Brass Gate combination changes every game day."] = "Opcional: Guslam menciona más armadura repartida por Vana'diel. Con Red Mage como job principal, abre el Treasure Coffer de Garlaige Citadel para las Warlock's Tights y el de Castle Oztroja para el Warlock's Tabard, cada uno con la coffer key de esa zona. La quest debe estar activa o completada, pero no son necesarios para completarla. En Castle Oztroja la combinación de las cuatro palancas de la Brass Gate cambia cada día de juego.",
    ["Optional: Guslam mentions more armor scattered about Vana'diel. With Samurai as your main job, open the Treasure Coffer in the Temple of Uggalepih for the Myochin Domaru, and the one in Quicksand Caves for the Myochin Haidate, each with that zone's coffer key. The quest must be active or completed, but these are not needed to complete it."] = "Opcional: Guslam menciona más armadura repartida por Vana'diel. Con Samurai como job principal, abre el Treasure Coffer del Temple of Uggalepih para el Myochin Domaru y el de Quicksand Caves para el Myochin Haidate, cada uno con la coffer key de esa zona. La quest debe estar activa o completada, pero no son necesarios para completarla.",
    ["Optional: Guslam mentions more armor scattered about Vana'diel. With Summoner as your main job, open the Treasure Coffer in the Temple of Uggalepih for the Evoker's Doublet, and the one in Toraimarai Canal for the Evoker's Pigaches, each with that zone's coffer key. The quest must be active or completed, but these are not needed to complete it."] = "Opcional: Guslam menciona más armadura repartida por Vana'diel. Con Summoner como job principal, abre el Treasure Coffer del Temple of Uggalepih para el Evoker's Doublet y el de Toraimarai Canal para los Evoker's Pigaches, cada uno con la coffer key de esa zona. La quest debe estar activa o completada, pero no son necesarios para completarla.",
    ["Optional: Guslam mentions more armor scattered about Vana'diel. With Thief as your main job, open the Treasure Coffer in Castle Oztroja for the Rogue's Culottes, and the one in Castle Zvahl Baileys for the Rogue's Vest, each with that zone's coffer key. The quest must be active or completed, but these are not needed to complete it."] = "Opcional: Guslam menciona más armadura repartida por Vana'diel. Con Thief como job principal, abre el Treasure Coffer de Castle Oztroja para los Rogue's Culottes y el de Castle Zvahl Baileys para el Rogue's Vest, cada uno con la coffer key de esa zona. La quest debe estar activa o completada, pero no son necesarios para completarla.",
    ["Optional: Guslam mentions more armor scattered about Vana'diel. With Warrior as your main job, open the Treasure Coffer in Crawlers' Nest for the Fighter's Mask, and the one in Castle Zvahl Baileys for the Fighter's Cuisses, each with that zone's coffer key. The quest must be active or completed, but these are not needed to complete it."] = "Opcional: Guslam menciona más armadura repartida por Vana'diel. Con Warrior como job principal, abre el Treasure Coffer de Crawlers' Nest para la Fighter's Mask y el de Castle Zvahl Baileys para los Fighter's Cuisses, cada uno con la coffer key de esa zona. La quest debe estar activa o completada, pero no son necesarios para completarla.",
    ["Optional: Guslam mentions more armor scattered about Vana'diel. With White Mage as your main job, open the Treasure Coffer in Garlaige Citadel for the Healer's Cap, and the one in Crawlers' Nest for the Healer's Pantaloons, each with that zone's coffer key. The quest must be active or completed, but these are not needed to complete it."] = "Opcional: Guslam menciona más armadura repartida por Vana'diel. Con White Mage como job principal, abre el Treasure Coffer de Garlaige Citadel para el Healer's Cap y el de Crawlers' Nest para los Healer's Pantaloons, cada uno con la coffer key de esa zona. La quest debe estar activa o completada, pero no son necesarios para completarla.",
    ["Optional: after completing the quest you may trade Quelveuiat a Sealion Crest Key and a Coral Crest Key to obtain a Temple Knight key, which lets you open the large door to the inner part of Sacrarium at (H-7) solo."] = "Opcional: tras completar la quest puedes entregar a Quelveuiat una Sealion Crest Key y una Coral Crest Key para obtener una Temple Knight key, que te permite abrir tú solo la gran puerta de la parte interior de Sacrarium en (H-7).",
    ["Optional: examine the Bloodstained Glove again after the fight."] = "Opcional: examina de nuevo el Bloodstained Glove tras la pelea.",
    ["Optional: go through the Sealed Portal at the Three Mage Gate in Inner Horutoto Ruins and examine the Gate of Earth at (I-7) for a cutscene. Quickest is the Toraimarai Canal Survival Guide, which puts you right outside that part of the ruins by the Gate of Earth (a Rhinostery Certificate also lets you through the Canal)."] = "Opcional: cruza el Sealed Portal de la Three Mage Gate en Inner Horutoto Ruins y examina la Gate of Earth en (I-7) para una escena. Lo más rápido es la Survival Guide de Toraimarai Canal, que te deja justo fuera de esa parte de las ruinas, junto a la Gate of Earth (un Rhinostery Certificate también te deja cruzar el Canal).",
    ["Optional: look to the sky around the Crag of Holla for the rainbow that appears when someone unlocks Summoner (if it's raining, it appears when the rain stops)."] = "Opcional: mira al cielo alrededor del Crag of Holla para ver el arcoíris que aparece cuando alguien desbloquea Summoner (si llueve, aparece cuando para la lluvia).",
    ["Optional: sell the Pungent providence pot to Ravorara in Port Bastok for 1,000 gil and a final cutscene."] = "Opcional: vende la Pungent providence pot a Ravorara en Port Bastok por 1,000 gil y una última escena.",
    ["Optional: show the Tattered test sheet to Chomoro-Kyotoro and Kirarara on top of the Windurst Waters Aurastery for extra dialogue."] = "Opcional: muestra la Tattered test sheet a Chomoro-Kyotoro y Kirarara en lo alto de la Aurastery de Windurst Waters para diálogo extra.",
    ["Optional: speak with Ardea again to try to get the stone back."] = "Opcional: habla de nuevo con Ardea para intentar recuperar la piedra.",
    ["Optional: speak with Cha Lebagta and Bopa Greso, just south of Nanaa Mihgo at (J-4), for a couple of clues."] = "Opcional: habla con Cha Lebagta y Bopa Greso, justo al sur de Nanaa Mihgo en (J-4), para un par de pistas.",
    ["Optional: speak with Furakku-Norakku again at Orn's request."] = "Opcional: habla de nuevo con Furakku-Norakku a petición de Orn.",
    ["Optional: speak with Gaddiux at the Inventors' Coalition in Western Adoulin (J-10) about the blacksmith."] = "Opcional: habla con Gaddiux en la Inventors' Coalition de Western Adoulin (J-10) sobre el herrero.",
    ["Optional: speak with Hikkuku, Ewchichi, Bebibi, Yakuku, Damama and Abobo in the tower basement to hear their concerns about the trees, or with Shantotto in her mansion in Windurst Walls (K-7) for a reminder."] = "Opcional: habla con Hikkuku, Ewchichi, Bebibi, Yakuku, Damama y Abobo en el sótano de la torre para oír sus preocupaciones sobre los árboles, o con Shantotto en su mansión de Windurst Walls (K-7) para un recordatorio.",
    ["Optional: speak with Kaede afterwards for some closing dialogue."] = "Opcional: habla con Kaede después para un diálogo de cierre.",
    ["Optional: speak with Kupipi in Heavens Tower to receive an Earthen Charm."] = "Opcional: habla con Kupipi en Heavens Tower para recibir un Earthen Charm.",
    ["Optional: speak with Kuu Mohzolhi in Northern San d'Oria (F-8). She does not say it at first, but she would like a Marguerite."] = "Opcional: habla con Kuu Mohzolhi en Northern San d'Oria (F-8). Al principio no lo dice, pero le gustaría una Marguerite.",
    ["Optional: speak with Laityn in Ru'Lude Gardens (G-9) for a story cutscene and a hint on where to go."] = "Opcional: habla con Laityn en Ru'Lude Gardens (G-9) para una escena de la historia y una pista de adónde ir.",
    ["Optional: speak with Mataligeat for some extra dialogue about Lewenhart."] = "Opcional: habla con Mataligeat para un diálogo extra sobre Lewenhart.",
    ["Optional: speak with Mengrenaux and Chemioue, also in the Patrol HQ (J-6, third floor)."] = "Opcional: habla con Mengrenaux y Chemioue, también en el Patrol HQ (J-6, tercer piso).",
    ["Optional: speak with Nonterene (I-10) at the Parade Grounds near Victory Arch."] = "Opcional: habla con Nonterene (I-10) en el Parade Grounds cerca del Victory Arch.",
    ["Optional: speak with Offa in Bastok Markets (F-10), on the second floor behind the door on the left, for instructions on how to make the sausage."] = "Opcional: habla con Offa en Bastok Markets (F-10), en el segundo piso tras la puerta de la izquierda, para saber cómo hacer la salchicha.",
    ["Optional: speak with Ojha Rhawash in Windurst Walls (C-13). She does not say it at first, but she would like a Lilac."] = "Opcional: habla con Ojha Rhawash en Windurst Walls (C-13). Al principio no lo dice, pero le gustaría un Lilac.",
    ["Optional: speak with Otto and then Carmelo in the Steaming Sheep Restaurant, Port Bastok (E-6), for hints about the tear."] = "Opcional: habla con Otto y luego con Carmelo en el Steaming Sheep Restaurant, Port Bastok (E-6), para pistas sobre la lágrima.",
    ["Optional: speak with Ratihb again to start The Die Is Cast, which passes through the same key-locked area."] = "Opcional: habla de nuevo con Ratihb para empezar The Die Is Cast, que pasa por la misma zona cerrada con llave.",
    ["Optional: speak with Shalott in Upper Jeuno (G-7), outside the Chocobo Stables next to Mapitoto, for a cutscene."] = "Opcional: habla con Shalott en Upper Jeuno (G-7), fuera de los Chocobo Stables junto a Mapitoto, para una escena.",
    ["Optional: speak with Valah Molkot in Port Bastok (J-12). She does not say it at first, but she would like an Amaryllis."] = "Opcional: habla con Valah Molkot en Port Bastok (J-12). Al principio no lo dice, pero le gustaría una Amaryllis.",
    ["Optional: speak with Yoran-Oran (E-5) about the author of the thesis on alchemy, and with Shantotto (K-7) about alchemy."] = "Opcional: habla con Yoran-Oran (E-5) sobre el autor de la tesis de alquimia y con Shantotto (K-7) sobre alquimia.",
    ["Optional: speak with Zurko-Bazurko in Mhaura by the Proto-Waypoint for an extra cutscene; he asks for the Runic kinegraver."] = "Opcional: habla con Zurko-Bazurko en Mhaura, junto al Proto-Waypoint, para una escena extra; te pide el Runic kinegraver.",
    ["Optional: three more apparatuses give a Stone of unknown runic origins for three runes in order: Fei'Yin map 1 (G-6) Ignis, Tellus, Tenebrae; Ranguemont Pass (E-4) Flabra, Ignis, Lux; King Ranperre's Tomb map 2 (E-7) Gelus, Sulpor, Unda. These don't count toward the three. Each Stone adds 2,000 Bayld to your reward."] = "Opcional: otros tres aparatos dan una Stone of unknown runic origins con tres runas en orden: Fei'Yin mapa 1 (G-6) Ignis, Tellus, Tenebrae; Ranguemont Pass (E-4) Flabra, Ignis, Lux; King Ranperre's Tomb mapa 2 (E-7) Gelus, Sulpor, Unda. No cuentan para los tres. Cada Stone añade 2,000 Bayld a tu recompensa.",
    ["Optional: trade the Torn Epistle to Koru-Moru for 50 gil, although it is not necessary."] = "Opcional: entrega la Torn Epistle a Koru-Moru por 50 gil, aunque no es necesario.",
    ["Optional: visiting the Merchant's House in Lower Jeuno from now on gives a brief scene of their appreciation."] = "Opcional: a partir de ahora, visitar la Merchant's House de Lower Jeuno muestra una breve escena de agradecimiento.",
    ["Optional: you can try trading the button to Altiret. Guards and bystanders comment on the thief, but only these give hints: Crilde, Rielle and Avandale in Port San d'Oria, and Pepigort, Maurinne, Gilipese and Rodaillece in Northern San d'Oria."] = "Opcional: puedes intentar entregarle el botón a Altiret. Los guardias y los transeúntes comentan lo del ladrón, pero solo estos dan pistas: Crilde, Rielle y Avandale en Port San d'Oria, y Pepigort, Maurinne, Gilipese y Rodaillece en Northern San d'Oria.",
    ["Orange (clear skies): any outdoor area that isn't cloudy. Yellow (dust/sand): Konschtat Highlands, Tahrongi Canyon, Western/Eastern Altepa Desert (very common), Meriphataud Mountains, Valkurm Dunes, Sauromugue Champaign. Green (wind): La Theine Plateau (often right after rain), Tahrongi Canyon, Buburimu Peninsula, Cape Teriggan. Blue (rain): Pashhow Marshlands (very common), La Theine Plateau, Jugner Forest, Buburimu Peninsula, Yuhtunga/Yhoator Jungle (not Carpenters' Landing)."] = "Naranja (cielo despejado): cualquier zona exterior que no esté nublada. Amarillo (polvo/arena): Konschtat Highlands, Tahrongi Canyon, Western/Eastern Altepa Desert (muy común), Meriphataud Mountains, Valkurm Dunes, Sauromugue Champaign. Verde (viento): La Theine Plateau (a menudo justo después de llover), Tahrongi Canyon, Buburimu Peninsula, Cape Teriggan. Azul (lluvia): Pashhow Marshlands (muy común), La Theine Plateau, Jugner Forest, Buburimu Peninsula, Yuhtunga/Yhoator Jungle (no Carpenters' Landing).",
    ["Orcish crest: in Davoi, enter the Monastic Cavern at (H-11), exit it at (I-8), and go to the Wall of Banishing at the (J-9) entrance. A Crimson orb opens it (a partner's orb lets everyone through). Orcs near the wall aggro once Invisible drops and interrupt the prompt."] = "Orcish crest: en Davoi, entra en el Monastic Cavern por (H-11), sal por (I-8) y ve al Wall of Banishing de la entrada de (J-9). Un Crimson orb lo abre (el orbe de un compañero deja pasar a todos). Los Orcs junto al muro atacan en cuanto se va Invisible e interrumpen el mensaje.",
    ["Otherwise, bring Silent Oil, Prism Powder and a Paintbrush of Souls (yours or a party member's) to the Temple of Uggalepih. Go south at the first intersection, north at the next T-intersection and north again at the one after, which zones you into Yhoator Jungle; head west and south straight back into the Temple."] = "Si no, lleva Silent Oil, Prism Powder y un Paintbrush of Souls (tuyo o de un miembro del grupo) al Temple of Uggalepih. Ve al sur en el primer cruce, al norte en el siguiente cruce en T y de nuevo al norte en el siguiente, lo que te saca a Yhoator Jungle; ve al oeste y al sur directamente de vuelta al Temple.",
    ["Otherwise, go to the House of the Hero in Windurst Walls (G-3) and try to enter it for a cutscene."] = "Si no, ve a la House of the Hero en Windurst Walls (G-3) e intenta entrar para una escena.",
    ["Outside, follow the right wall north and then east to re-enter the Temple (exit 5, map 3), then follow the path south to the ??? at (G-9) to spawn Yallery Brown, a sapling weak to Fire and Dark. Defeat it and examine the ??? again for the key item Annals of Truth."] = "Fuera, sigue la pared derecha hacia el norte y luego al este para volver a entrar en el Temple (salida 5, mapa 3), y sigue el camino al sur hasta la ??? en (G-9) para hacer aparecer a Yallery Brown, un sapling débil a Fire y Dark. Derrótalo y examina de nuevo la ??? para obtener el key item Annals of Truth.",
    ["Participate in a Campaign battle at a stronghold of Bastok. The objective is complete when you receive an Objective Completed message and are told to report back."] = "Participa en una Campaign battle en una fortaleza de Bastok. El objetivo se completa cuando recibes el mensaje Objective Completed y te dicen que informes.",
    ["Participate in a Campaign battle at a stronghold of San d'Oria. The objective is complete when you receive an Objective Completed message and are told to report back."] = "Participa en una Campaign battle en una fortaleza de San d'Oria. El objetivo se completa cuando recibes el mensaje Objective Completed y te dicen que informes.",
    ["Participate in a Campaign battle at a stronghold of Windurst. The objective is complete when you receive an Objective Completed message and are told to report back."] = "Participa en una Campaign battle en una fortaleza de Windurst. El objetivo se completa cuando recibes el mensaje Objective Completed y te dicen que informes.",
    ["Pass the first brazier room (first ???) to an identical room down the hall (second ???), follow the only path west and north through the large grave room and up the stairs, to the last brazier room with the third ???."] = "Pasa la primera sala del brasero (primera ???) hasta una sala idéntica al fondo del pasillo (segunda ???), sigue el único camino al oeste y al norte por la gran sala de tumbas y sube las escaleras hasta la última sala del brasero, con la tercera ???.",
    ["Pass through the colored walls at (H-7) and (I-7) in this order: Red, Black/Purple, Red, Black/Purple."] = "Atraviesa las paredes de colores en (H-7) y (I-7) en este orden: Red, Black/Purple, Red, Black/Purple.",
    ["Pass through the eastern Cracked Wall and examine the Gate: Magical Gizmo for the event."] = "Atraviesa la Cracked Wall del este y examina la Gate: Magical Gizmo para el evento.",
    ["Pass through the first yellow door at (J-7), then continue west through the second yellow door to reach the room with the two Monoliths at (H-7)."] = "Atraviesa la primera puerta amarilla en (J-7), luego continúa al oeste por la segunda puerta amarilla hasta la sala de los dos Monoliths en (H-7).",
    ["Pass through the gate and continue to the shimmering light at the far end."] = "Atraviesa la puerta y continúa hasta la luz brillante del fondo.",
    ["Pass through the weighted door at (K-8) and continue to the next area."] = "Atraviesa la puerta de peso en (K-8) y continúa hasta la siguiente zona.",
    ["Past the gate she heads to (F-8) by the north or south path and stops there on her own. Speak with her quickly for the Completion certificate; if she disappears first, you get no credit."] = "Pasada la puerta va hacia (F-8) por el camino norte o el sur y se detiene allí sola. Habla con ella rápidamente para obtener el Completion certificate; si desaparece antes, no se te cuenta.",
    ["Past the guardian's door, head north to the paintings room at (I-7) and use a Paintbrush of souls to enter the Den of Rancor."] = "Pasada la puerta del guardián, ve al norte a la sala de los cuadros en (I-7) y usa un Paintbrush of souls para entrar en Den of Rancor.",
    ["Perform well to complete the quest and receive your Dancer's Casaque."] = "Actúa bien para completar la quest y recibir tu Dancer's Casaque.",
    ["Phantom Serpent: in Abyssea - Misareaux, at the seafront next to Veridical Conflux #08, with a Sea Dragon Liver (exclusive bait)."] = "Phantom Serpent: en Abyssea - Misareaux, en la costa junto a la Veridical Conflux #08, con un Sea Dragon Liver (cebo exclusivo).",
    ["Phomiuna Aqueducts: the libraries are the four rooms at (F-7), (F-9), (J-7) and (J-9) on the third map, with the ??? on the north or south bookshelf. From the entrance, open the iron door at (G-8) or (J-6) with a Bronze Key (or a Thief's tools), avoid the Taurus, and take the ladder at (E-8) or (M-8). Two True-Sight Taurus guard each hallway to the libraries, and their aggro can't be avoided in the narrow corridors."] = "Phomiuna Aqueducts: las bibliotecas son las cuatro salas de (F-7), (F-9), (J-7) y (J-9) del tercer mapa, con la ??? en la estantería norte o sur. Desde la entrada, abre la puerta de hierro de (G-8) o (J-6) con una Bronze Key (o las herramientas de un Thief), evita al Taurus y toma la escalera de (E-8) o (M-8). Dos Taurus con True-Sight vigilan cada pasillo hacia las bibliotecas, y en los pasillos estrechos no se puede evitar que te ataquen.",
    ["Place a Bronze Bed in your Mog House using the furniture Layout menu. You need Other fame level 3 (home nation fame). Wait one Earth minute, exit your Mog House, re-enter and speak to the Moogle. If you have enough fame, you receive a cutscene."] = "Coloca una Bronze Bed en tu Mog House con el menú Layout de mobiliario. Necesitas el nivel 3 de fama de Other (fama de tu nación de origen). Espera un minuto terrestre, sal de tu Mog House, vuelve a entrar y habla con el Moogle. Si tienes fama suficiente, recibes una escena.",
    ["Place a Mahogany Bed in your Mog House, zone out and back in, and speak to the Moogle (maybe twice). You need to have completed Give a Moogle a Break and have home nation fame level 5. If an item that gives weekly conquest rewards (such as an Aurum Coffer) is in your layout, you may need to remove it."] = "Coloca una Mahogany Bed en tu Mog House, sal y vuelve a entrar, y habla con el Moogle (quizá dos veces). Debes haber completado Give a Moogle a Break y tener fama de tu nación nivel 5. Si tienes en la distribución un objeto que da recompensas semanales de conquest (como un Aurum Coffer), puede que tengas que quitarlo.",
    ["Place a Noble's Bed in your Mog House, zone out and back in, wait one Earth minute and speak to your Moogle (maybe twice). You need to have completed The Moogle's Picnic! and have home nation fame level 7. Remove any weekly conquest-reward item (such as an Aurum Coffer) from your layout if it won't trigger."] = "Coloca una Noble's Bed en tu Mog House, sal y vuelve a entrar, espera un minuto real y habla con tu Moogle (quizá dos veces). Debes haber completado The Moogle's Picnic! y tener fama de tu nación nivel 7. Quita de la distribución cualquier objeto de recompensas semanales de conquest (como un Aurum Coffer) si no se activa.",
    ["Place the Gravel in the Refiner, operate the levers as required, and obtain Mythril Sand."] = "Coloca la Gravel en el Refiner, acciona las palancas según haga falta y obtén Mythril Sand.",
    ["Plague (1,500 gil) is inflicted by Bloodsucker enemies in Toraimarai Canal, by Deathmaw Orobon enemies in the Ceizak Battlegrounds with Vile Belch (which also inflicts Silence, so use an item or Echo Drops first if you plan to warp back to Ohruru), and by the Devouring Mosquito in Reisenjima with Infected Leech, which lasts 45 seconds. Many of these wear off quickly, so set your Home Point at Port Windurst #1."] = "Plague (1,500 gil) la provocan los enemigos Bloodsucker de Toraimarai Canal, los enemigos Deathmaw Orobon de Ceizak Battlegrounds con Vile Belch (que también provoca Silence, así que usa un objeto o Echo Drops antes si piensas teletransportarte de vuelta con Ohruru) y el Devouring Mosquito de Reisenjima con Infected Leech, que dura 45 segundos. Muchos se pasan rápido, así que fija tu Home Point en Port Windurst #1.",
    ["Plant the seeds to grow a Deathball or a Sobbing Fungus, or buy one at the Auction House. A Sobbing Fungus can also be bought from Soupox in Leafallia for 60 gil."] = "Planta las semillas para cultivar un Deathball o un Sobbing Fungus, o cómpralo en la Auction House. Un Sobbing Fungus también se puede comprar a Soupox en Leafallia por 60 gil.",
    ["Port San d'Oria: Answald (J-10), in front of the Mog House; Portaure (H-9), Cargo Room B; Miene (I-9), by the water; Prietta (H-9), up the stairs above the cargo rooms; Auvare (H-6), behind the Air Travel Agency."] = "Port San d'Oria: Answald (J-10), frente a la Mog House; Portaure (H-9), Cargo Room B; Miene (I-9), junto al agua; Prietta (H-9), subiendo las escaleras sobre las salas de carga; Auvare (H-6), detrás de la Air Travel Agency.",
    ["Prepare for the battle. Whenever you are ready, trade the tuning fork to Castilchat to be transported to the arena."] = "Prepárate para la batalla. Cuando estés listo, entrega el tuning fork a Castilchat para ser transportado a la arena.",
    ["Prepare for the battle. Whenever you are ready, trade the tuning fork to Ferrol to be transported to the arena."] = "Prepárate para la batalla. Cuando estés listo, entrega el tuning fork a Ferrol para ser transportado a la arena.",
    ["Proceed northwest while keeping to the right-hand wall."] = "Avanza al noroeste pegado a la pared derecha.",
    ["Proceed through the opened passage and examine Ornate Gate."] = "Atraviesa el pasaje abierto y examina la Ornate Gate.",
    ["Proceed to (H-8) and examine the ??? in the spiral staircase to reach the 10th floor."] = "Ve a (H-8) y examina la ??? de la escalera de caracol para llegar al piso 10.",
    ["Proceed to Map 2 and speak with Pecca-Pocca at (G-12) to receive the Sheaf of Handmade Incense."] = "Avanza al Map 2 y habla con Pecca-Pocca en (G-12) para recibir el Sheaf of Handmade Incense.",
    ["Proceed to Sealion's Den."] = "Dirígete a Sealion's Den.",
    ["Proceed to the Castle Gates in Eastern Adoulin."] = "Dirígete a las Castle Gates en Eastern Adoulin.",
    ["Proceed to the Cracked Wall at (H-9) and examine it to enter the passage."] = "Dirígete a la Cracked Wall en (H-9) y examínala para entrar en el pasaje.",
    ["Progress through the Promyvions by defeating Memory Receptacles and following the Memory Stream portals."] = "Avanza por las Promyvions derrotando a los Memory Receptacles y siguiendo los portales Memory Stream.",
    ["Purchase some Rolanberries."] = "Compra algunas Rolanberries.",
    ["Pygmalion shows you a picture of an NPC that you must memorize."] = "Pygmalion te muestra una imagen de un NPC que debes memorizar.",
    ["Qilin in The Shrine of Ru'Avitau: rifts at (F-6), (F-9) and (J-6) (the wikis disagree on whether this is Map 2 or Map 3)."] = "Qilin en The Shrine of Ru'Avitau: rifts en (F-6), (F-9) y (J-6) (las wikis no coinciden en si es el mapa 2 o el 3).",
    ["Quadav crest: bring Sneak (Silent Oil) but no Invisible is needed. In Beadeaux, take the tunnel at (H-7) (\"A\") to map 2 and get silenced by The Mute at (G-7), so The Afflictor at (G-8) can't curse you with a heavy gravity effect (the silence lasts about 10 minutes)."] = "Quadav crest: lleva Sneak (Silent Oil), pero no hace falta Invisible. En Beadeaux, toma el túnel de (H-7) (\"A\") al mapa 2 y deja que The Mute te silencie en (G-7), para que The Afflictor en (G-8) no pueda maldecirte con un fuerte efecto de gravedad (el silencio dura unos 10 minutos).",
    ["Quicksilver Blade: on the Silver Sea route to Nashmau or to Al Zahbi, with a Sardine Ball."] = "Quicksilver Blade: en la ruta del Silver Sea a Nashmau o a Al Zahbi, con una Sardine Ball.",
    ["Quiz answers: four-leaf Mandragora bud = AGI; after Firesday = Earthsday; Windurst kids love the Agatha Crystalie mystery series; airship pass = 500,000 gil; herb seeds can't grow a Marguerite; Bastok's constellation = Titan; Windurst Waters cardians = hearts; Curilla's hair covers her left eye; Delkfutt's Tower = thirteen floors; Bastok waterwheels facing north turn counter clockwise; Galka eat raw meat, Mithra raw fish; in Kazham you can't learn the weather in Sarutabaruta; Rabao Oasis = six springs; Karaha-Baruha = Minister of the Optistery; M & P's Market = Kazham or Upper Jeuno; Ayame's sister = Kaede; Iron Eater's master = Werei; Naji = the 5th Musketeer; not on Elshimo = Cloister of Storms; Prince Trion lost an entire company; Quadav lack a Quadav hand fetich; Autumn Hunt quarry = a Giant Sheep; Rukususu likes peanuts; San d'Oria's younger prince = Pieuje; archduke of Jeuno = Kam'lanaut; Bastok Markets armourer = Kulatz Bridge; Bastok auction house = 5 counters; constellation map = Lago-Charago; Balga's Dais dragon = Black Dragon; ex-Minister of the Manustery = Zonpa-Zippa; N. Gustaberg falls = Drachenfall; Galka who lived with Werei = Gumbah; red flower girl = Valah Molkot; Goldsmiths' Guild closed 23:00-8:00; most mythril = Palborough Mines; N. San d'Oria kid looks for Exoroche; Konschtat houses the Crag of Dem; lost San d'Oria kid wants a willow fishing rod; map of Mindartia = Enid Ironheart; Mithra chieftainness = Perih Vashai; monster that doesn't belong = Zu; far-left Norg auction clerk = Atrevaux; President of Bastok = Karst, sleeps in the Presidential Suite; Aurastery principal = Koru-Moru; Port Bastok restaurant = The Steaming Sheep; river near San d'Oria = Cheval River; delivery boy's mom has Davoi Fever; papsque = Shamonde P Grauche; Royal Knight general = Rahal; sea east of Mindartia = Gugru Blue; Tenshodo leader's cape = black; Troupe Valeriano = five members; war 20 years ago = Crystal War; Windurst flag = five stars; weapon shop greeting = Hohbiba-Mubiba; west of Zulkheim = Vollbow; crystal bass = Maiden's Spring."] = "Respuestas del examen: brote de Mandragora de cuatro hojas = AGI; después de Firesday = Earthsday; a los niños de Windurst les encanta la serie de misterio de Agatha Crystalie; pase de aeronave = 500,000 gil; con semillas de hierbas no crece una Marguerite; constelación de Bastok = Titan; cardians de Windurst Waters = corazones; el pelo de Curilla le tapa el ojo izquierdo; Delkfutt's Tower = trece pisos; las norias de Bastok que miran al norte giran en sentido antihorario; los Galka comen carne cruda, los Mithra pescado crudo; en Kazham no puedes saber el clima de Sarutabaruta; Rabao Oasis = seis manantiales; Karaha-Baruha = Minister of the Optistery; M & P's Market = Kazham o Upper Jeuno; hermana de Ayame = Kaede; maestro de Iron Eater = Werei; Naji = el 5.º mosquetero; no está en Elshimo = Cloister of Storms; Prince Trion perdió una compañía entera; los Quadav no tienen un Quadav hand fetich; presa del Autumn Hunt = una Giant Sheep; a Rukususu le gustan los cacahuetes; príncipe menor de San d'Oria = Pieuje; archiduque de Jeuno = Kam'lanaut; armero de Bastok Markets = Kulatz Bridge; casa de subastas de Bastok = 5 mostradores; mapa de constelaciones = Lago-Charago; dragón de Balga's Dais = Black Dragon; ex Minister of the Manustery = Zonpa-Zippa; cascadas de N. Gustaberg = Drachenfall; Galka que vivió con Werei = Gumbah; niña de la flor roja = Valah Molkot; Goldsmiths' Guild cerrado de 23:00 a 8:00; más mithril = Palborough Mines; el niño de N. San d'Oria busca a Exoroche; Konschtat alberga el Crag of Dem; el niño perdido de San d'Oria quiere una caña de sauce; mapa de Mindartia = Enid Ironheart; jefa Mithra = Perih Vashai; monstruo que no encaja = Zu; empleado de subastas más a la izquierda de Norg = Atrevaux; presidente de Bastok = Karst, duerme en la Presidential Suite; directora de la Aurastery = Koru-Moru; restaurante de Port Bastok = The Steaming Sheep; río cerca de San d'Oria = Cheval River; la madre del repartidor tiene Davoi Fever; papsque = Shamonde P Grauche; general de los Royal Knight = Rahal; mar al este de Mindartia = Gugru Blue; capa del líder del Tenshodo = negra; Troupe Valeriano = cinco miembros; guerra de hace 20 años = Crystal War; bandera de Windurst = cinco estrellas; saludo de la armería = Hohbiba-Mubiba; al oeste de Zulkheim = Vollbow; crystal bass = Maiden's Spring.",
    ["Quu Bokye is in the Treasure Room on the underground map of Giddeus: the northwest room at the end of a U-turn on the map."] = "Quu Bokye está en la Treasure Room del mapa subterráneo de Giddeus: la sala noroeste al final de un U-turn del mapa.",
    ["Rabbits are sending the shanarha grass, unique to Leujaoam Sanctum, to the verge of extinction. Mission orders: protect the vegetation."] = "Los conejos están llevando al borde de la extinción a la shanarha grass, exclusiva de Leujaoam Sanctum. Órdenes de la misión: proteger la vegetación.",
    ["Rasdinice sends you to the Quartermaster at (H-9) in Southern San d'Oria (S). Obtain the supplies that he requests, either by gathering them or by buying them at the Auction House, and hand them over."] = "Rasdinice te envía al Quartermaster at (H-9) in Southern San d'Oria (S). Consigue los suministros que pide, ya sea recolectándolos o comprándolos en la Auction House, y entrégaselos.",
    ["Re-enter Bastok Markets (S) from North Gustaberg (S)."] = "Vuelve a entrar en Bastok Markets (S) desde North Gustaberg (S).",
    ["Re-examine the ??? to obtain the Handful of crystal scales."] = "Vuelve a examinar la ??? para obtener el Handful of crystal scales.",
    ["Reach (H-8) and pass through the weighted door."] = "Llega a (H-8) y atraviesa la puerta de peso.",
    ["Reach ??? (J-11) near the Stone Monument and examine it to face Suparna and Suparna Fledgling."] = "Llega a la ??? (J-11) cerca del Stone Monument y examínala para enfrentarte a Suparna y Suparna Fledgling.",
    ["Reach Eschan Portal #15 (H-12)."] = "Llega al Eschan Portal #15 (H-12).",
    ["Reach Mamook by entering the cave at (D-12) on the Wajaom Woodlands map, or by using the Mamook Survival Guide warp."] = "Llega a Mamook entrando por la cueva en (D-12) del mapa de Wajaom Woodlands, o usando el warp de la Survival Guide de Mamook.",
    ["Reach Rank 3 in your home nation."] = "Alcanza el Rank 3 en tu nación de origen.",
    ["Reach Rank 6 in your home nation."] = "Alcanza el Rank 6 en tu nación de origen.",
    ["Reach level 10."] = "Alcanza el nivel 10.",
    ["Reach the Cheval River target at (H-5)."] = "Llega al objetivo Cheval River en (H-5).",
    ["Reach the Memory Flux around (J-8) on the third floor."] = "Llega al Memory Flux cerca de (J-8) en el tercer piso.",
    ["Reach the Spire of Dem and defeat Progenerator. Obtain the Light of Dem."] = "Llega a la Spire of Dem y derrota a Progenerator. Obtén la Light of Dem.",
    ["Reach the Spire of Holla and defeat Wreaker. Obtain the Light of Holla."] = "Llega a la Spire of Holla y derrota a Wreaker. Obtén la Light of Holla.",
    ["Reach the Spire of Mea and defeat Delver. Obtain the Light of Mea."] = "Llega a la Spire of Mea y derrota a Delver. Obtén la Light of Mea.",
    ["Reach the southern chamber at (G-9), fall through the center hole, and enter the northern room at (I-7)."] = "Llega a la cámara sur en (G-9), cae por el agujero central y entra en la sala norte en (I-7).",
    ["Reach the southern room and drop through the center hole at (G-9), then follow the route through Maps 2 and 3 and exit back to Batallia Downs at (J-9)."] = "Llega a la sala sur y déjate caer por el agujero central en (G-9), luego sigue la ruta por los Maps 2 y 3 y sal de nuevo a Batallia Downs en (J-9).",
    ["Read the Hastily scribbled note in Temporary Key Items."] = "Lee la Hastily scribbled note en los Temporary Key Items.",
    ["Read this before the last ???: at (I-6), examining the final ??? spawns the Bomb NM Chandelier. If it aggroes anyone before it is claimed (it detects sight and magic), it self-destructs at once and drops nothing. Use Hide or Spectral Jig right after the cutscene and claim it with a melee attack, not a spell."] = "Lee esto antes de la última ???: en (I-6), examinar la última ??? hace aparecer al NM Bomb Chandelier. Si ataca a alguien antes de ser reclamado (detecta por vista y magia), se autodestruye al instante y no suelta nada. Usa Hide o Spectral Jig justo tras la escena y reclámalo con un ataque cuerpo a cuerpo, no con un hechizo.",
    ["Receive Breath of the avatars."] = "Recibe Breath of the avatars.",
    ["Receive Cipher: Balamor's Alter Ego."] = "Recibe Cipher: Balamor's Alter Ego.",
    ["Receive Cipher: Iroha and Rhapsody in Ochre."] = "Recibe Cipher: Iroha y Rhapsody in Ochre.",
    ["Receive Cipher: Lilisette's Alter Ego II."] = "Recibe Cipher: Lilisette's Alter Ego II.",
    ["Receive Cipher: Nashmeira's Alter Ego II."] = "Recibe Cipher: Nashmeira's Alter Ego II.",
    ["Receive Cipher: Prishe's Alter Ego II."] = "Recibe Cipher: Prishe's Alter Ego II.",
    ["Receive Cipher: Zeid II."] = "Recibe Cipher: Zeid II.",
    ["Receive Lightsworm if your Wings of the Goddess progression requires it."] = "Recibe Lightsworm si tu progresión de Wings of the Goddess lo requiere.",
    ["Receive Most curious curio."] = "Recibe Most curious curio.",
    ["Receive Phoenix's blessing, Scintillating Rhapsody, and Cipher: Iroha II."] = "Recibe Phoenix's blessing, Scintillating Rhapsody y Cipher: Iroha II.",
    ["Receive Rhapsody in Azure."] = "Recibe Rhapsody in Azure.",
    ["Receive Rhapsody in Crimson."] = "Recibe Rhapsody in Crimson.",
    ["Receive Rhapsody in Mauve."] = "Recibe Rhapsody in Mauve.",
    ["Receive Rhapsody in Umber and Cipher: Lion's Alter Ego II."] = "Recibe Rhapsody in Umber y Cipher: Lion's Alter Ego II.",
    ["Receive Siren's plume and Rhapsody in Emerald."] = "Recibe Siren's plume y Rhapsody in Emerald.",
    ["Receive five Imperial Gold Pieces."] = "Recibe cinco Imperial Gold Pieces.",
    ["Receive the Adaman Ingot reward."] = "Recibe la recompensa Adaman Ingot.",
    ["Receive the Allied Council Summons."] = "Recibe la Allied Council Summons.",
    ["Receive the Behemoth key."] = "Recibe la Behemoth key.",
    ["Receive the Blue acidity tester."] = "Recibe el Blue acidity tester.",
    ["Receive the Ebon Key and Prismatic Key."] = "Recibe la Ebon Key y la Prismatic Key.",
    ["Receive the Glory Crown."] = "Recibe la Glory Crown.",
    ["Receive the Grimoire and Scholar job access."] = "Recibe el Grimoire y el acceso al trabajo Scholar.",
    ["Receive the Imperial Standard."] = "Recibe el Imperial Standard.",
    ["Receive the Mysterious Amulet."] = "Recibe el Mysterious Amulet.",
    ["Receive the Piece of Paper after completing the event at the Garden."] = "Recibe la Piece of Paper tras completar el evento en el Garden.",
    ["Receive the Pioneer's Badge, Map of Adoulin, and 1,000 Bayld."] = "Recibe la Pioneer's Badge, el Map of Adoulin y 1,000 Bayld.",
    ["Receive the Republican Silver Medal reward."] = "Recibe la recompensa Republican Silver Medal.",
    ["Receive the Tiny Memory Fragment."] = "Recibe el Tiny Memory Fragment.",
    ["Receive the Trainee Knife reward."] = "Recibe la recompensa Trainee Knife.",
    ["Recently there have been multiple reports of a three-headed beast attacking traders on the way to Al Zahbi. Travel to its rumored lair in Lebros Cavern and slay it. Mission orders: defeat Black Shuck."] = "Últimamente ha habido varios informes de una bestia de tres cabezas que ataca a comerciantes de camino a Al Zahbi. Viaja a su supuesta guarida en Lebros Cavern y mátala. Órdenes de la misión: derrotar a Black Shuck.",
    ["Recipes: Silver Earring + Black or White Chip, 5 Euvhi Organs, 5 Luminian Tissues. Silver Obi + chip, 7 + 3 organs and 3 Luminian Tissues: Red 7 Phuabo/3 Xzomit, Yellow 7 Hpemde/3 Aern, Blue 7 Hpemde/3 Phuabo, Green 7 Aern/3 Hpemde, Clear 7 Xzomit/3 Phuabo, Purple 7 Phuabo/3 Hpemde, White 7 Xzomit/3 Aern, Black 7 Aern/3 Xzomit."] = "Recetas: Silver Earring + Black o White Chip, 5 Euvhi Organs, 5 Luminian Tissues. Silver Obi + chip, 7 + 3 órganos y 3 Luminian Tissues: Red 7 Phuabo/3 Xzomit, Yellow 7 Hpemde/3 Aern, Blue 7 Hpemde/3 Phuabo, Green 7 Aern/3 Hpemde, Clear 7 Xzomit/3 Phuabo, Purple 7 Phuabo/3 Hpemde, White 7 Xzomit/3 Aern, Black 7 Aern/3 Xzomit.",
    ["Red (hot spells/heat waves) is the hardest: Western/Eastern Altepa Desert (rare, all year), Cape Teriggan (March to early November), Yuhtunga/Yhoator Jungle (late June to early September), Valkurm Dunes and Meriphataud Mountains (very rare). It is likelier around midday and on Firesday. Rabao shares the Altepa weather, so its Home Point #1 is a handy place to check it."] = "Rojo (calor/olas de calor) es el más difícil: Western/Eastern Altepa Desert (raro, todo el año), Cape Teriggan (de marzo a principios de noviembre), Yuhtunga/Yhoator Jungle (de finales de junio a principios de septiembre), Valkurm Dunes y Meriphataud Mountains (muy raro). Es más probable hacia mediodía y en Firesday. Rabao comparte el clima de Altepa, así que su Home Point #1 es un buen sitio para comprobarlo.",
    ["Register the Home Point immediately beyond the Stone Gate."] = "Registra el Home Point justo después de la Stone Gate.",
    ["Remove all main-hand and off-hand equipment."] = "Quítate todo el equipo de la mano principal y la secundaria.",
    ["Remove your weapon and shield."] = "Quítate el arma y el escudo.",
    ["Repeating this quest several times is the easiest way to improve your reputation in Bastok, San d'Oria, Jeuno, Selbina and Rabao. You can repeat the quest."] = "Repetir esta quest varias veces es la forma más fácil de mejorar tu reputación en Bastok, San d'Oria, Jeuno, Selbina y Rabao. Puedes repetir la quest.",
    ["Report to Lumomo to receive your reward."] = "Informa a Lumomo para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Rest (/heal) there to charge the Luopan; it can take up to 8 minutes, until you see \"You feel a mystical warmth welling up inside you!\""] = "Descansa (/heal) allí para cargar el Luopan; puede tardar hasta 8 minutos, hasta que veas \"You feel a mystical warmth welling up inside you!\"",
    ["Rest and prepare for the battlefield."] = "Descansa y prepárate para el campo de batalla.",
    ["Retrieve the Star ring (indecipherable) by examining the Perennial Snow."] = "Recupera el Star ring (indecipherable) examinando la Perennial Snow.",
    ["Retrieve the six Glowing Mana Orbs from the pedestals."] = "Recoge los seis Glowing Mana Orbs de los pedestales.",
    ["Return all seven items to Mamaulabion. They must be traded one at a time, and it is not necessary to turn in all seven at once."] = "Devuelve los siete objetos a Mamaulabion. Hay que entregarlos de uno en uno y no es necesario entregar los siete a la vez.",
    ["Return and speak with Chalvatot for your reward, the Choral Justaucorps, and to complete the quest."] = "Vuelve y habla con Chalvatot para recibir tu recompensa, el Choral Justaucorps, y completar la quest.",
    ["Return in 72 in-game hours (3 real-life hours) to receive your reward: the Mumeito and the ability to become a Samurai, with the title Bushido Blade."] = "Vuelve en 72 horas de juego (3 horas reales) para recibir tu recompensa: la Mumeito y la capacidad de convertirte en Samurai, con el título Bushido Blade.",
    ["Return the Dropped Item to the passenger you think is the owner. You only get one try: the right passenger gives you 500 gil, and the wrong one takes the item and you receive nothing."] = "Devuelve el Dropped Item al pasajero que creas que es el dueño. Solo tienes un intento: el pasajero correcto te da 500 gil, y el equivocado se queda el objeto y no recibes nada.",
    ["Return the Power Sandals to Devean before time runs out. You can also choose to keep the Power Sandals for yourself, but that means you fail the quest."] = "Devuelve las Power Sandals a Devean antes de que se acabe el tiempo. También puedes quedarte las Power Sandals, pero eso significa que fallas la quest.",
    ["Return the blue stone to Kocco Ehllek (H-8)."] = "Devuelve la piedra azul a Kocco Ehllek (H-8).",
    ["Return the book to Furakku-Norakku to complete the quest and receive 2,800 gil."] = "Devuelve el libro a Furakku-Norakku para completar la quest y recibir 2,800 gil.",
    ["Return the moss to Amaura, who gives you the Cough Medicine."] = "Devuelve el musgo a Amaura, que te da la Cough Medicine.",
    ["Return the repaired cap to Paytah to complete the quest and receive your reward."] = "Devuelve la gorra reparada a Paytah para completar la quest y recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Return the rod to Keshab-Menjab to complete the quest and receive 1,500 gil."] = "Devuelve la caña a Keshab-Menjab para completar la quest y recibir 1,500 gil.",
    ["Return the tablets to Abelard. When you finish them all you receive the Map of the Crawlers' Nest. You can repeat the quest."] = "Devuelve las tablillas a Abelard. Cuando las termines todas recibes el Map of the Crawlers' Nest. Puedes repetir la quest.",
    ["Return to Abelard."] = "Vuelve con Abelard.",
    ["Return to Abioleget for your reward."] = "Vuelve con Abioleget para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Return to Adelbrecht (E-9) to receive the Large Memory Fragment."] = "Vuelve con Adelbrecht (E-9) para recibir el Large Memory Fragment.",
    ["Return to Agado-Pugado with the whisper and she offers several reward options, including the ability to summon Garuda. You can only select one of the rewards at any time, and you may repeat this quest once per Earth day. You receive the title Heir of the Great Wind. You may also keep the whisper to meet the requirements of The Moonlit Path."] = "Vuelve con Agado-Pugado con el susurro y te ofrece varias opciones de recompensa, incluida la habilidad de invocar a Garuda. Solo puedes elegir una de las recompensas a la vez, y puedes repetir esta quest una vez por día terrestre. Recibes el título Heir of the Great Wind. También puedes guardar el susurro para cumplir los requisitos de The Moonlit Path.",
    ["Return to Agapito and speak to him to complete the quest and receive 2,100 gil."] = "Vuelve con Agapito y habla con él para completar la quest y recibir 2,100 gil.",
    ["Return to Aht Urhgan Whitegate and speak with Lathuya again to receive your reward, the Magus Charuqs."] = "Vuelve a Aht Urhgan Whitegate y habla de nuevo con Lathuya para recibir tu recompensa, el Magus Charuqs.",
    ["Return to Aht Urhgan Whitegate and speak with Ratihb for the final cutscene with Balajaha to complete the quest and receive your reward, the Random Ring."] = "Vuelve a Aht Urhgan Whitegate y habla con Ratihb para la escena final con Balajaha que completa la quest y te da tu recompensa, el Random Ring.",
    ["Return to Aht Urhgan Whitegate and speak with Waoud. You are given a Sealed Immortal envelope."] = "Vuelve a Aht Urhgan Whitegate y habla con Waoud. Te dan un Sealed Immortal envelope.",
    ["Return to Aht Urhgan Whitegate and talk to Maudaal again for the final cutscene and your reward, the Chanoix's Gorget."] = "Vuelve a Aht Urhgan Whitegate y habla de nuevo con Maudaal para la escena final y tu recompensa, el Chanoix's Gorget.",
    ["Return to Aht Urhgan Whitegate."] = "Vuelve a Aht Urhgan Whitegate.",
    ["Return to Ailbeche and speak with him again for a cutscene. You receive the Willow Fishing Rod as your reward."] = "Vuelve con Ailbeche y habla de nuevo con él para una escena. Recibes la Willow Fishing Rod como recompensa.",
    ["Return to Ailbeche and speak with him again."] = "Vuelve con Ailbeche y habla de nuevo con él.",
    ["Return to Ailbeche and trade him the Odontotyrannus."] = "Vuelve con Ailbeche y entrégale el Odontotyrannus.",
    ["Return to Ailbeche to end the quest and receive your reward."] = "Vuelve con Ailbeche para terminar la quest y recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Return to Alfesar, who gives you the Tablet of ancient magic and the Letter from Alfesar."] = "Vuelve con Alfesar, que te da la Tablet of ancient magic y la Letter from Alfesar.",
    ["Return to Andecia and trade her the Tomb Waterskin to complete the quest."] = "Vuelve con Andecia y entrégale el Tomb Waterskin para completar la quest.",
    ["Return to Anteurephiaux. Finally, speak with Equette to complete the quest and receive the Memento Muffler."] = "Vuelve con Anteurephiaux. Por último, habla con Equette para completar la quest y recibir el Memento Muffler.",
    ["Return to Apururu (H-9)."] = "Vuelve con Apururu (H-9).",
    ["Return to Aydeewa Subterrane (G-10, map 3) and check the ??? at the top of the damaged stairwell for a cutscene. Choose to look into Wawaroon's bag to receive a Map of Aydeewa Subterrane."] = "Vuelve a Aydeewa Subterrane (G-10, mapa 3) y revisa la ??? en lo alto de la escalera dañada para una escena. Elige mirar en la bolsa de Wawaroon para recibir un Map of Aydeewa Subterrane.",
    ["Return to Balasiel to complete the quest."] = "Vuelve con Balasiel para completar la quest.",
    ["Return to Baldric and trade him the Valkurm Sunsand to complete the quest and receive 300 gil."] = "Vuelve con Baldric y entrégale la Valkurm Sunsand para completar la quest y recibir 300 gil.",
    ["Return to Baren-Moren and choose \"Hang up your hat\" to complete the quest and receive your reward."] = "Vuelve con Baren-Moren y elige \"Hang up your hat\" para completar la quest y recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Return to Bastok Markets (S) and speak with Engelhart (K-10)."] = "Vuelve a Bastok Markets (S) y habla con Engelhart (K-10).",
    ["Return to Bastok Markets and Bastok Markets (S), speaking to Offa each time. In the longer path you go Bastok Markets, Bastok Markets (S), Bastok Markets, Bastok Markets (S), where you trade Offa the Fish Bones, then Bastok Markets, Bastok Markets (S) and Bastok Markets again; the last time he ends this part of the quest and gives you a Rolanberry. In the shorter path you trade the Fish Bones sooner, with fewer trips between the two zones."] = "Vuelve a Bastok Markets y a Bastok Markets (S), hablando con Offa cada vez. En el camino largo vas a Bastok Markets, Bastok Markets (S), Bastok Markets, Bastok Markets (S), donde entregas a Offa los Fish Bones, luego Bastok Markets, Bastok Markets (S) y de nuevo Bastok Markets; la última vez da por terminada esta parte de la quest y te da una Rolanberry. En el camino corto entregas los Fish Bones antes, con menos viajes entre las dos zonas.",
    ["Return to Bastok Markets and speak to Marin again to finish the quest and receive 1,500 gil."] = "Vuelve a Bastok Markets y habla de nuevo con Marin para terminar la quest y recibir 1,500 gil.",
    ["Return to Bastok Markets and speak with Shamarhaan for a cutscene; again, the answer doesn't matter."] = "Vuelve a Bastok Markets y habla con Shamarhaan para una escena; de nuevo, la respuesta da igual.",
    ["Return to Bastok Metalworks and speak with Cid (H-8)."] = "Vuelve a Bastok Metalworks y habla con Cid (H-8).",
    ["Return to Bastok Metalworks and speak with Naji (J-8) after completing both paths."] = "Vuelve a Bastok Metalworks y habla con Naji (J-8) tras completar ambos caminos.",
    ["Return to Bastok Metalworks and speak with Naji (J-8) for a final cutscene and your reward."] = "Vuelve a Bastok Metalworks y habla con Naji (J-8) para una última escena y tu recompensa.",
    ["Return to Bastok Metalworks and speak with Naji (J-8) to complete the mission."] = "Vuelve a Bastok Metalworks y habla con Naji (J-8) para completar la misión.",
    ["Return to Bastok Metalworks and speak with Naji (J-8)."] = "Vuelve a Bastok Metalworks y habla con Naji (J-8).",
    ["Return to Bastok Mines and speak with Roh Latteh at (H-7) to complete the quest and receive a Linen Robe."] = "Vuelve a Bastok Mines y habla con Roh Latteh en (H-7) para completar la quest y recibir un Linen Robe.",
    ["Return to Bastok Mines and speak with Virnage to complete the quest and receive 3,000 gil."] = "Vuelve a Bastok Mines y habla con Virnage para completar la quest y recibir 3,000 gil.",
    ["Return to Bastok again and trade the Parasite Skin to Deidogg."] = "Vuelve a Bastok y entrega la Parasite Skin a Deidogg.",
    ["Return to Bastok and speak with Alois (J-8)."] = "Vuelve a Bastok y habla con Alois (J-8).",
    ["Return to Bastok and speak with Carmelo with all three key items in your possession."] = "Vuelve a Bastok y habla con Carmelo con los tres key items en tu poder.",
    ["Return to Bastok and speak with Cid (H-8)."] = "Vuelve a Bastok y habla con Cid (H-8).",
    ["Return to Bastok and speak with Kagetora in Port Bastok at (F-6)."] = "Vuelve a Bastok y habla con Kagetora en Port Bastok en (F-6).",
    ["Return to Bastok and speak with Karst."] = "Vuelve a Bastok y habla con Karst.",
    ["Return to Bastok and speak with Naji (J-8) after completing both paths."] = "Vuelve a Bastok y habla con Naji (J-8) tras completar ambos caminos.",
    ["Return to Bastok and speak with Naji (J-8) to complete the mission."] = "Vuelve a Bastok y habla con Naji (J-8) para completar la misión.",
    ["Return to Bastok and speak with Naji (J-8)."] = "Vuelve a Bastok y habla con Naji (J-8).",
    ["Return to Bastok and speak with Patt-Pott (I-7)."] = "Vuelve a Bastok y habla con Patt-Pott (I-7).",
    ["Return to Bastok and speak with Raibaht to complete the quest and receive 3,000 gil."] = "Vuelve a Bastok y habla con Raibaht para completar la quest y recibir 3,000 gil.",
    ["Return to Bastok and trade all four Fetich pieces to any Gate Guard: Argus (Port Bastok L-7), Cleades (Bastok Markets D-11), Malduc (Metalworks J-8) or Rashid (Bastok Mines H-10)."] = "Vuelve a Bastok y entrega las cuatro piezas Fetich a cualquier Gate Guard: Argus (Port Bastok L-7), Cleades (Bastok Markets D-11), Malduc (Metalworks J-8) o Rashid (Bastok Mines H-10).",
    ["Return to Bastok and trade the Drachenfall Water to Black Mud to complete the quest and receive 2,000 gil."] = "Vuelve a Bastok y entrega el Drachenfall Water a Black Mud para completar la quest y recibir 2,000 gil.",
    ["Return to Bastok and trade the Mottled Quadav Egg to Deidogg."] = "Vuelve a Bastok y entrega el Mottled Quadav Egg a Deidogg.",
    ["Return to Beastman Ensign (J-7) and examine it again to enter the battlefield."] = "Vuelve al Beastman Ensign (J-7) y examínalo de nuevo para entrar en el campo de batalla.",
    ["Return to Belgidiveau to complete the quest."] = "Vuelve con Belgidiveau para completar la quest.",
    ["Return to Bki Tbujhja for your Choral Slippers."] = "Vuelve con Bki Tbujhja para tus Choral Slippers.",
    ["Return to Brutus (G-7) in Upper Jeuno one last time to complete the quest."] = "Vuelve con Brutus (G-7) en Upper Jeuno una última vez para completar la quest.",
    ["Return to Brutus for a cutscene."] = "Vuelve con Brutus para una escena.",
    ["Return to Brutus for your reward, the Beast Gaiters."] = "Vuelve con Brutus para tu recompensa, las Beast Gaiters.",
    ["Return to Brutus to receive your reward, the Barbaroi Axe."] = "Vuelve con Brutus para recibir tu recompensa, el Barbaroi Axe.",
    ["Return to Ceraulian for your reward."] = "Vuelve con Ceraulian para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Return to Chateau d'Oraguille and examine the Great Hall."] = "Vuelve a Chateau d'Oraguille y examina el Great Hall.",
    ["Return to Chateau d'Oraguille and speak with Halver (I-9) to complete the mission."] = "Vuelve a Chateau d'Oraguille y habla con Halver (I-9) para completar la misión.",
    ["Return to Chateau d'Oraguille and speak with Halver (I-9)."] = "Vuelve a Chateau d'Oraguille y habla con Halver (I-9).",
    ["Return to Chateau d'Oraguille and speak with Prince Trion in Prince's Royal Room (G/H-7)."] = "Vuelve a Chateau d'Oraguille y habla con Prince Trion en la Prince's Royal Room (G/H-7).",
    ["Return to Chipmy-Popmy for a cutscene; you may have to speak with him more than once."] = "Vuelve con Chipmy-Popmy para una escena; puede que tengas que hablar con él más de una vez.",
    ["Return to Chipmy-Popmy for another cutscene, 3,200 gil and 2,000 experience points."] = "Vuelve con Chipmy-Popmy para otra escena, 3,200 gil y 2,000 puntos de experiencia.",
    ["Return to Chumimi after the cutscene in the Keep. After another short sequence the quest is completed and you receive Wizard's Sabots."] = "Vuelve con Chumimi tras la escena en el Keep. Tras otra breve secuencia la quest se completa y recibes Wizard's Sabots.",
    ["Return to Chumimi and trade her the Bag of Seeds."] = "Vuelve con Chumimi y entrégale la Bag of Seeds.",
    ["Return to Chumimi for the final cutscene and your reward, Wizard's Petasos."] = "Vuelve con Chumimi para la escena final y tu recompensa, Wizard's Petasos.",
    ["Return to Chumimi to receive the key item Sluice Surveyor Mk. I."] = "Vuelve con Chumimi para recibir el key item Sluice Surveyor Mk. I.",
    ["Return to Cid (H-8) in the Metalworks after both paths are complete."] = "Vuelve con Cid (H-8) en Metalworks cuando ambos caminos estén completos.",
    ["Return to Cid (H-8)."] = "Vuelve con Cid (H-8).",
    ["Return to Cid and speak with him to complete the quest."] = "Vuelve con Cid y habla con él para completar la quest.",
    ["Return to Colossal Footprint (I-7) and submit the required key items."] = "Vuelve a la Colossal Footprint (I-7) y entrega los key items requeridos.",
    ["Return to Crystalline Field (H-11) and enter the Grand Palace of Hu'Xzoi."] = "Vuelve al Crystalline Field (H-11) y entra en el Grand Palace of Hu'Xzoi.",
    ["Return to Curilla for your reward."] = "Vuelve con Curilla para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Return to Dauperiat, who now asks you to do a second job for him. If you choose to keep helping him you lose fame; if you choose no, you can proceed to the next quest, The Setting Sun."] = "Vuelve con Dauperiat, que ahora te pide un segundo trabajo. Si eliges seguir ayudándolo pierdes fama; si eliges no, puedes pasar a la siguiente quest, The Setting Sun.",
    ["Return to Dehn Harzhapan for your reward."] = "Vuelve con Dehn Harzhapan por tu recompensa.",
    ["Return to Deraquien and speak with him again."] = "Vuelve con Deraquien y habla de nuevo con él.",
    ["Return to Despachiaire for your reward, the Elegant Ribbon."] = "Vuelve con Despachiaire para tu recompensa, el Elegant Ribbon.",
    ["Return to Dhea Prandoleh (H-10) to receive the reward."] = "Vuelve con Dhea Prandoleh (H-10) para recibir la recompensa.",
    ["Return to Dkhaaya, who rewards you with a Lightning Band."] = "Vuelve con Dkhaaya, que te recompensa con una Lightning Band.",
    ["Return to Drake Fang (H-6)."] = "Vuelve con Drake Fang (H-6).",
    ["Return to Edal-Tahdal with the whisper and he offers several reward options, including the ability to summon Leviathan. You can only select one of the rewards at any time, and you may repeat this quest once per Earth day. You receive the title Heir of the Great Water."] = "Vuelve con Edal-Tahdal con el susurro y te ofrece varias opciones de recompensa, incluida la habilidad de invocar a Leviathan. Solo puedes elegir una de las recompensas a la vez, y puedes repetir esta quest una vez por día terrestre. Recibes el título Heir of the Great Water.",
    ["Return to Elki and speak to him."] = "Vuelve con Elki y habla con él.",
    ["Return to Elysia, then speak with Pradiulot (H-9), for your reward, the Map of Tavnazia. For more of the story, speak with Elysia and Pradiulot once more."] = "Vuelve con Elysia y luego habla con Pradiulot (H-9) para tu recompensa, el Map of Tavnazia. Para más historia, habla otra vez con Elysia y Pradiulot.",
    ["Return to Emhi Tchaoryo to receive your Allied Notes and complete the operation."] = "Vuelve con Emhi Tchaoryo para recibir tus Allied Notes y completar la operación.",
    ["Return to Engelhart (K-10) in Bastok Markets (S)."] = "Vuelve con Engelhart (K-10) en Bastok Markets (S).",
    ["Return to Engelhart (K-10) to complete the quest."] = "Vuelve con Engelhart (K-10) para completar la quest.",
    ["Return to Ensetsu in Port Bastok (I-5)."] = "Vuelve con Ensetsu en Port Bastok (I-5).",
    ["Return to Ensetsu to complete the quest."] = "Vuelve con Ensetsu para completar la quest.",
    ["Return to Enu and trade her the star on a clear starry night (clear weather, with stars visible in the sky) to complete the quest."] = "Vuelve con Enu y entrégale la estrella en una noche estrellada despejada (clima despejado, con estrellas visibles en el cielo) para completar la quest.",
    ["Return to Eperdur to receive your reward."] = "Vuelve con Eperdur para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Return to Epinolle for your reward, the Map of Cape Riverne."] = "Vuelve con Epinolle por tu recompensa, el Map of Cape Riverne.",
    ["Return to Erlene (J-8) to receive Klimaform."] = "Vuelve con Erlene (J-8) para recibir Klimaform.",
    ["Return to Etteh Sulaej to receive your reward, 3,000 gil. You can repeat the quest; Angelica then gives you \"Final Fantasy Part II\" instead."] = "Vuelve con Etteh Sulaej para recibir tu recompensa, 3,000 gil. Puedes repetir la quest; Angelica te da entonces \"Final Fantasy Part II\".",
    ["Return to Fari-Wari for a cutscene and an Imperial Gold Piece. Speak to Fari-Wari after this to learn Trust: Gadalar."] = "Vuelve con Fari-Wari para una escena y una Imperial Gold Piece. Habla con Fari-Wari después para aprender Trust: Gadalar.",
    ["Return to Fari-Wari to complete the quest and receive 1,000 Imperial Standing and an Imperial Gold Piece."] = "Vuelve con Fari-Wari para completar la quest y recibir 1,000 Imperial Standing y una Imperial Gold Piece.",
    ["Return to Fhe Maksojha for your reward, 3 Imperial Gold Pieces."] = "Vuelve con Fhe Maksojha por tu recompensa, 3 Imperial Gold Pieces.",
    ["Return to Fochacha for a cutscene that completes the quest and gives you 3 Imperial Bronze Pieces."] = "Vuelve con Fochacha para una escena que completa la quest y te da 3 Imperial Bronze Pieces.",
    ["Return to Fondactiont to receive the Scroll of Recall-Pashh."] = "Vuelve con Fondactiont para recibir el Scroll of Recall-Pashh.",
    ["Return to Fuepepe to complete the quest and receive the Scroll of Aspir."] = "Vuelve con Fuepepe para completar la quest y recibir el Scroll of Aspir.",
    ["Return to Furakku-Norakku."] = "Vuelve con Furakku-Norakku.",
    ["Return to Gatih Mijurabi to complete the quest and receive the Mithran Stone."] = "Vuelve con Gatih Mijurabi para completar la quest y recibir la Mithran Stone.",
    ["Return to Gentle Tiger (H-6) and receive a Flare Grenade."] = "Vuelve con Gentle Tiger (H-6) y recibe una Flare Grenade.",
    ["Return to Gentle Tiger (H-6) in Bastok Markets (S)."] = "Vuelve con Gentle Tiger (H-6) en Bastok Markets (S).",
    ["Return to Gentle Tiger (H-6) to receive the Elixir Tank reward."] = "Vuelve con Gentle Tiger (H-6) para recibir la recompensa Elixir Tank.",
    ["Return to Gentle Tiger (H-6) to receive the Fourth Staff."] = "Vuelve con Gentle Tiger (H-6) para recibir el Fourth Staff.",
    ["Return to Gentle Tiger (H-6)."] = "Vuelve con Gentle Tiger (H-6).",
    ["Return to Ghatsad and speak with him."] = "Vuelve con Ghatsad y habla con él.",
    ["Return to Glenne and trade her the Ointment Case to complete the quest and receive your reward."] = "Vuelve con Glenne y entrégale el Ointment Case para completar la quest y recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Return to Gulemont and speak with him to end the quest."] = "Vuelve con Gulemont y habla con él para terminar la quest.",
    ["Return to Gulmama with the whisper and she offers several rewards, including the ability to summon Shiva. You can only select one reward at a time, and you can repeat the quest once per Earth day."] = "Vuelve con Gulmama con el whisper y te ofrece varias recompensas, incluida la capacidad de invocar a Shiva. Solo puedes elegir una recompensa a la vez, y puedes repetir la quest una vez por día terrestre.",
    ["Return to Gushing Spring to complete the quest."] = "Vuelve con Gushing Spring para completar la quest.",
    ["Return to Hadahda for another cutscene and your reward, a Sutlac."] = "Vuelve con Hadahda para otra escena y tu recompensa, un Sutlac.",
    ["Return to Hakkuru-Rinkuru with the orb."] = "Vuelve con Hakkuru-Rinkuru con el orbe.",
    ["Return to Halver (I-9) at Chateau d'Oraguille after both national paths are complete."] = "Vuelve con Halver (I-9) en Chateau d'Oraguille cuando ambos caminos nacionales estén completos.",
    ["Return to Halver (I-9) at Chateau d'Oraguille to complete the mission."] = "Vuelve con Halver (I-9) en Chateau d'Oraguille para completar la misión.",
    ["Return to Halver (I-9)."] = "Vuelve con Halver (I-9).",
    ["Return to Hampu-Kampu and receive the Torn Patches of Leather key item."] = "Vuelve con Hampu-Kampu y recibe el key item Torn Patches of Leather.",
    ["Return to Hampu-Kampu in Windurst Waters (S) and trade the handbag for the Trainee's Needle reward."] = "Vuelve con Hampu-Kampu en Windurst Waters (S) y entrega el handbag por la recompensa Trainee's Needle.",
    ["Return to Hari Pakhroib for your reward, 5,000 gil. You can repeat the quest."] = "Vuelve con Hari Pakhroib por tu recompensa, 5,000 gil. Puedes repetir la quest.",
    ["Return to Harnek inside the Tenshodo in Lower Jeuno (J-7) for a final cutscene and your reward, the Marauder's Knife."] = "Vuelve con Harnek dentro del Tenshodo de Lower Jeuno (J-7) para una última escena y tu recompensa, el Marauder's Knife.",
    ["Return to Heavy Stone Door (H-8) in King Ranperre's Tomb and examine it again."] = "Vuelve a la Heavy Stone Door (H-8) en King Ranperre's Tomb y examínala de nuevo.",
    ["Return to Helbort to complete the quest and receive your reward."] = "Vuelve con Helbort para completar la quest y recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Return to Heptachiond (H-8) to receive the Scroll of Recall-Meriph."] = "Vuelve con Heptachiond (H-8) para recibir el Scroll of Recall-Meriph.",
    ["Return to Hieronymus to receive your Allied Notes and complete the operation."] = "Vuelve con Hieronymus para recibir tus Allied Notes y completar la operación.",
    ["Return to High Bear and speak with him to complete the quest and receive a Chakram."] = "Vuelve con High Bear y habla con él para completar la quest y recibir un Chakram.",
    ["Return to Hildegard to complete the quest."] = "Vuelve con Hildegard para completar la quest.",
    ["Return to Home Point #1 at (G-8) in Qufim Island."] = "Vuelve al Home Point #1 en (G-8) de Qufim Island.",
    ["Return to Honoi-Gomoi to complete the quest."] = "Vuelve con Honoi-Gomoi para completar la quest.",
    ["Return to Irmilant after the Conquest tally to receive your reward, the Ebisu Fishing Rod. It can be re-obtained if dropped by mistake."] = "Vuelve con Irmilant tras el Conquest tally para recibir tu recompensa, la Ebisu Fishing Rod. Se puede volver a conseguir si se tira por error.",
    ["Return to Iron Eater (J-8)."] = "Vuelve con Iron Eater (J-8).",
    ["Return to Iruki-Waraki in Aht Urhgan Whitegate and speak with him for one last cutscene and to receive your reward, the Puppetry Taj."] = "Vuelve con Iruki-Waraki en Aht Urhgan Whitegate y habla con él para una última escena y para recibir tu recompensa, el Puppetry Taj.",
    ["Return to Jakoh Wahcondalo to receive your reward, the Evisceration weapon skill."] = "Vuelve con Jakoh Wahcondalo para recibir tu recompensa, el weapon skill Evisceration.",
    ["Return to Joachim (H-8)."] = "Vuelve con Joachim (H-8).",
    ["Return to Jonette for a Page from Miratete's Memoirs. You can repeat the quest once per Conquest week by speaking to her again, but only if you collected the page before the week ended."] = "Vuelve con Jonette para obtener una Page from Miratete's Memoirs. Puedes repetir la quest una vez por semana de Conquest hablando con ella de nuevo, pero solo si conseguiste la página antes de que terminara la semana.",
    ["Return to Juroro with the whisper and she offers several rewards, including the ability to summon Titan. You can only select one reward at a time, and you can repeat the quest once per Earth day."] = "Vuelve con Juroro con el whisper y te ofrece varias recompensas, incluida la capacidad de invocar a Titan. Solo puedes elegir una recompensa a la vez, y puedes repetir la quest una vez por día terrestre.",
    ["Return to Justinius for your reward, most often a Page from Miratete's Memoirs. You can repeat the quest after each Conquest Tally."] = "Vuelve con Justinius para tu recompensa, casi siempre una Page from Miratete's Memoirs. Puedes repetir la quest tras cada Conquest Tally.",
    ["Return to Kaede's house and speak with Ensetsu at (I-5) for a cutscene. The quest only appears in your log after this."] = "Vuelve a la casa de Kaede y habla con Ensetsu en (I-5) para una escena. La quest solo aparece en tu registro después de esto.",
    ["Return to Karst after the battle."] = "Vuelve con Karst tras la batalla.",
    ["Return to Kazham and speak with Romaa Mihgo again."] = "Vuelve a Kazham y habla de nuevo con Romaa Mihgo.",
    ["Return to Keal to complete the quest and receive the Scroll of Tonko: Ichi."] = "Vuelve con Keal para completar la quest y recibir el Scroll of Tonko: Ichi.",
    ["Return to Kenapa-Keppa before 6:00 to complete the quest."] = "Vuelve con Kenapa-Keppa antes de las 6:00 para completar la quest.",
    ["Return to Kerutoto to complete the quest."] = "Vuelve con Kerutoto para completar la quest.",
    ["Return to Kerutoto with the whisper. She offers several rewards, including the ability to summon Diabolos; you can only select one reward at a time."] = "Vuelve con Kerutoto con el whisper. Ofrece varias recompensas, incluida la capacidad de invocar a Diabolos; solo puedes elegir una recompensa a la vez.",
    ["Return to Khoto Rokkorah for the final cutscene and your reward."] = "Vuelve con Khoto Rokkorah para la escena final y tu recompensa.",
    ["Return to Kieran for a cutscene. Your key item becomes the Ashen Stratum Abyssite II and the quest is now in your log."] = "Vuelve con Kieran para una escena. Tu key item pasa a ser el Ashen Stratum Abyssite II y la quest ya aparece en tu registro.",
    ["Return to Kieran to complete the quest and receive the key item Ashen Stratum Abyssite III. Skyward Ho, Voidwatcher! begins automatically."] = "Vuelve con Kieran para completar la quest y recibir el key item Ashen Stratum Abyssite III. Skyward Ho, Voidwatcher! empieza automáticamente.",
    ["Return to Kieran to complete the quest."] = "Vuelve con Kieran para completar la quest.",
    ["Return to Koblakiq in Oldton Movalpolos for the key item Glittering fragment."] = "Vuelve con Koblakiq en Oldton Movalpolos para obtener el key item Glittering fragment.",
    ["Return to Kocco Ehllek (H-8), who asks for a piece of kionite."] = "Vuelve con Kocco Ehllek (H-8), que pide un trozo de kionite.",
    ["Return to Kohlo-Lakolo for your reward, the Promise Badge."] = "Vuelve con Kohlo-Lakolo por tu recompensa, la Promise Badge.",
    ["Return to Kohlo-Lakolo to complete the quest and receive your reward."] = "Vuelve con Kohlo-Lakolo para completar la quest y recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Return to Kohlo-Lakolo, who sends you to the House of the Hero in Windurst Walls (G-3) for your reward. If you take too long to return the ring, the quest ends when you return to him and you do not need to go to the House of the Hero; it still counts as complete."] = "Vuelve con Kohlo-Lakolo, que te envía a la House of the Hero en Windurst Walls (G-3) por tu recompensa. Si tardas demasiado en devolver el anillo, la quest termina al volver con él y no necesitas ir a la House of the Hero; se cuenta igualmente como completa.",
    ["Return to Kororo to complete the quest and receive a Tourmaline Earring."] = "Vuelve con Kororo para completar la quest y recibir un Tourmaline Earring.",
    ["Return to Koru-Moru for a cutscene."] = "Vuelve con Koru-Moru para una escena.",
    ["Return to Koru-Moru in a few days (after Japanese midnight) to complete the quest and receive your reward."] = "Vuelve con Koru-Moru en unos días (tras la medianoche japonesa) para completar la quest y recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Return to Kupipi after both paths are complete."] = "Vuelve con Kupipi cuando ambos caminos estén completos.",
    ["Return to Kupipi in Heavens Tower to complete the mission."] = "Vuelve con Kupipi en Heavens Tower para completar la misión.",
    ["Return to Kurando and trade him the egg to complete the quest."] = "Vuelve con Kurando y entrégale el huevo para completar la quest.",
    ["Return to Kuroido-Moido to complete the quest and receive 6,000 gil."] = "Vuelve con Kuroido-Moido para completar la quest y recibir 6,000 gil.",
    ["Return to La Theine Plateau and speak with Vicorpasse (F-6) to receive the Rescue Training Certificate."] = "Vuelve a La Theine Plateau y habla con Vicorpasse (F-6) para recibir el Rescue Training Certificate.",
    ["Return to La Theine Plateau. Deaufrain (F-6), Equesobillot (F-6), and Galaihaurat (E-6) are the three who may provide the Bronze Sword."] = "Vuelve a La Theine Plateau. Deaufrain (F-6), Equesobillot (F-6) y Galaihaurat (E-6) son los tres que pueden darte la Bronze Sword.",
    ["Return to Laisrean for your reward, the Scroll of Utsusemi: Ichi, and the title Treasure-House Ransacker."] = "Vuelve con Laisrean por tu recompensa, el Scroll of Utsusemi: Ichi, y el título Treasure-House Ransacker.",
    ["Return to Leepe-Hoppe (J-8) on the roof of the Rhinostery."] = "Vuelve con Leepe-Hoppe (J-8) en el tejado del Rhinostery.",
    ["Return to Leepe-Hoppe and turn in the whisper to receive your reward; you can only choose one of the rewards offered."] = "Vuelve con Leepe-Hoppe y entrega el whisper para recibir tu recompensa; solo puedes elegir una de las recompensas ofrecidas.",
    ["Return to Leodarion to complete the quest and receive the Ninja Chainmail and the title Paragon of Ninja Excellence. You can repeat the quest."] = "Vuelve con Leodarion para completar la quest y recibir la Ninja Chainmail y el título Paragon of Ninja Excellence. Puedes repetir la quest.",
    ["Return to Magriffon to finish the quest and receive 3 Rafflesia Nectar."] = "Vuelve con Magriffon para terminar la quest y recibir 3 Rafflesia Nectar.",
    ["Return to Mainchelite (I-9) to receive the Large Memory Fragment."] = "Vuelve con Mainchelite (I-9) para recibir el Large Memory Fragment.",
    ["Return to Mertaire in Lower Jeuno (I-8) and trade him the Poetic Parchment for a cutscene and 2,100 gil."] = "Vuelve con Mertaire en Lower Jeuno (I-8) y entrégale el Poetic Parchment para una escena y 2,100 gil.",
    ["Return to Metalworks and speak with Ayame to receive the Bowyer Ring and end the quest."] = "Vuelve a Metalworks y habla con Ayame para recibir el Bowyer Ring y terminar la quest.",
    ["Return to Metalworks and trade the Mythril Sand to Patt-Pott (I-7)."] = "Vuelve a Metalworks y entrega la Mythril Sand a Patt-Pott (I-7).",
    ["Return to Mhaura and trade the Chandelier Coal to Hagain."] = "Vuelve a Mhaura y entrega el Chandelier Coal a Hagain.",
    ["Return to Mhebi Juhbily for your reward, 7,200 gil."] = "Vuelve con Mhebi Juhbily por tu recompensa, 7,200 gil.",
    ["Return to Miageau in Northern San d'Oria."] = "Vuelve con Miageau en Northern San d'Oria.",
    ["Return to Miah Riyuh (H-9) in Windurst Waters (S)."] = "Vuelve con Miah Riyuh (H-9) en Windurst Waters (S).",
    ["Return to Milazahn for your reward, an Imperial Mythril Piece."] = "Vuelve con Milazahn por tu recompensa, una Imperial Mythril Piece.",
    ["Return to Mine Shaft #2716 and trade the Gold Key to the Shaft Entrance, then return to Cid (H-8)."] = "Vuelve a la Mine Shaft #2716 y entrega la Gold Key a la Shaft Entrance, luego vuelve con Cid (H-8).",
    ["Return to Misareaux Coast (G-5)."] = "Vuelve a Misareaux Coast (G-5).",
    ["Return to Mishhar (H-8)."] = "Vuelve con Mishhar (H-8).",
    ["Return to Mishhar for a cutscene."] = "Vuelve con Mishhar para una escena.",
    ["Return to Mishhar for your reward."] = "Vuelve con Mishhar por tu recompensa.",
    ["Return to Moreno-Toeno (L-6)."] = "Vuelve con Moreno-Toeno (L-6).",
    ["Return to Morjean and speak with him with the Wyvern Egg in your inventory."] = "Vuelve con Morjean y habla con él llevando el Wyvern Egg en el inventario.",
    ["Return to Mourices (F/G-10) and trade the two Parana Shields."] = "Vuelve con Mourices (F/G-10) y entrega los dos Parana Shields.",
    ["Return to Muckvix in Lower Jeuno and hand over the key items for the key item Pungent providence pot."] = "Vuelve con Muckvix en Lower Jeuno y entrégale los key items para obtener el key item Pungent providence pot.",
    ["Return to Nafiwaa for a cutscene and begin the mixing process. All five tubes must be filled first, and the quality of the mixture decides your Imperial currency reward. The best quality is Luminium: choose Test Tube #3 three times, Test Tube #2 once, Test Tube #4 once and Test Tube #5 once."] = "Vuelve con Nafiwaa para una escena y empezar el proceso de mezcla. Los cinco tubos deben estar llenos antes, y la calidad de la mezcla decide tu recompensa de moneda Imperial. La mejor calidad es Luminium: elige Test Tube #3 tres veces, Test Tube #2 una vez, Test Tube #4 una vez y Test Tube #5 una vez.",
    ["Return to Naiko-Paneiko (L-8) to complete the quest and receive the Map of Fort Karugo-Narugo."] = "Vuelve con Naiko-Paneiko (L-8) para completar la quest y recibir el Map of Fort Karugo-Narugo.",
    ["Return to Naiko-Paneiko to complete the quest and receive your reward."] = "Vuelve con Naiko-Paneiko para completar la quest y recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Return to Naiko-Paneiko, who asks you to check out a lead in Inner Horutoto Ruins. Enter it from East Sarutabaruta (J-7)."] = "Vuelve con Naiko-Paneiko, que te pide comprobar una pista en Inner Horutoto Ruins. Entra desde East Sarutabaruta (J-7).",
    ["Return to Naja Salaheem (I-10) after the required transition."] = "Vuelve con Naja Salaheem (I-10) tras la transición requerida.",
    ["Return to Naja Salaheem in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10) to complete the quest and receive the SP Wildcat badge, which gives access to SP Assaults."] = "Vuelve con Naja Salaheem en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10) para completar la quest y recibir el SP Wildcat badge, que da acceso a los SP Assaults.",
    ["Return to Naja Salaheem to complete the quest and receive the C Wildcat badge, which gives access to C Assaults."] = "Vuelve con Naja Salaheem para completar la quest y recibir el C Wildcat badge, que da acceso a los C Assaults.",
    ["Return to Naja Salaheem to complete the quest and receive the S Wildcat badge, which gives access to S Assaults."] = "Vuelve con Naja Salaheem para completar la quest y recibir el S Wildcat badge, que da acceso a los S Assaults.",
    ["Return to Nanaa Mihgo in Windurst Woods (J-3) to complete the quest and receive the Rogue's Bonnet."] = "Vuelve con Nanaa Mihgo en Windurst Woods (J-3) para completar la quest y recibir el Rogue's Bonnet.",
    ["Return to Nanaa Mihgo."] = "Vuelve con Nanaa Mihgo.",
    ["Return to Nbu Latteh to complete the quest and receive 100 or 200 gil. The quest is repeatable for players below Bastok fame level 2: zone out each time and you can redo it."] = "Vuelve con Nbu Latteh para completar la quest y recibir 100 o 200 gil. La quest es repetible para jugadores por debajo del nivel 2 de fama de Bastok: cambia de zona cada vez y puedes rehacerla.",
    ["Return to Nelcabrit (H-9) at the San d'Orian Embassy."] = "Vuelve con Nelcabrit (H-9) en la San d'Orian Embassy.",
    ["Return to Norejaie to complete the quest. You can only complete one Eco-Warrior quest a week; wait until the next Conquest tally before accepting another."] = "Vuelve con Norejaie para completar la quest. Solo puedes completar una quest Eco-Warrior a la semana; espera al siguiente Conquest tally antes de aceptar otra.",
    ["Return to Norg after reaching the sealed grate in the Hall of the Gods."] = "Vuelve a Norg tras llegar a la reja sellada de la Hall of the Gods.",
    ["Return to Norg and examine Oaken Door (K-8) again."] = "Vuelve a Norg y examina de nuevo la Oaken Door (K-8).",
    ["Return to Norg and speak with Jaucribaix."] = "Vuelve a Norg y habla con Jaucribaix.",
    ["Return to Norg and speak with Kieran (H-8) first. If you speak with Gilgamesh before Kieran, you have to zone before Gilgamesh will give you the cutscene."] = "Vuelve a Norg y habla primero con Kieran (H-8). Si hablas con Gilgamesh antes que con Kieran, tienes que cambiar de zona para que Gilgamesh te dé la escena.",
    ["Return to Norg and trade your Mumeito to Jaucribaix to complete the quest and receive the Magoroku. If you do not have your Mumeito, Ranemaud at (I-7) can give you a new one for 30,000 gil."] = "Vuelve a Norg y entrega tu Mumeito a Jaucribaix para completar la quest y recibir el Magoroku. Si no tienes tu Mumeito, Ranemaud en (I-7) puede darte uno nuevo por 30,000 gil.",
    ["Return to Norg."] = "Vuelve a Norg.",
    ["Return to Northern San d'Oria and enter the Papal Chambers."] = "Vuelve a Northern San d'Oria y entra en las Papal Chambers.",
    ["Return to Northern San d'Oria and speak with Helaku again."] = "Vuelve a Northern San d'Oria y habla de nuevo con Helaku.",
    ["Return to Northern San d'Oria and speak with Helaku."] = "Vuelve a Northern San d'Oria y habla con Helaku.",
    ["Return to Northern San d'Oria and speak with Kasaroro again."] = "Vuelve a Northern San d'Oria y habla de nuevo con Kasaroro.",
    ["Return to Northern San d'Oria and speak with Kasaroro."] = "Vuelve a Northern San d'Oria y habla con Kasaroro.",
    ["Return to Northern San d'Oria and visit the Papal Chambers to learn what happened to Shamonde."] = "Vuelve a Northern San d'Oria y visita las Papal Chambers para saber qué le pasó a Shamonde.",
    ["Return to Octavien to complete the quest and receive the Runeist Coat and the title Ultimate Runeist."] = "Vuelve con Octavien para completar la quest y recibir el Runeist Coat y el título Ultimate Runeist.",
    ["Return to Octavien to complete the quest."] = "Vuelve con Octavien para completar la quest.",
    ["Return to Odeya for the final cutscene and your reward, 4,000 gil."] = "Vuelve con Odeya para la última escena y tu recompensa, 4,000 gil.",
    ["Return to Ohbiru-Dohbiru and trade him the Canteen to complete the quest and receive 900 gil."] = "Vuelve con Ohbiru-Dohbiru y entrégale la Canteen para completar la quest y recibir 900 gil.",
    ["Return to Ohbiru-Dohbiru and trade him the shells to complete the quest and receive 4,500 gil."] = "Vuelve con Ohbiru-Dohbiru y entrégale las conchas para completar la quest y recibir 4,500 gil.",
    ["Return to Ohruru in Port Windurst and answer her questions. Rune against a spell's element: Fire Unda, Earth Flabra, Water Sulpor, Wind Gelus, Ice Ignis, Lightning Tellus, Light Tenebrae, Dark Lux. Rune for an element it can't stomach: the same element (Fire Ignis, Earth Tellus, Water Unda, Wind Flabra, Ice Gelus, Lightning Sulpor, Light Lux, Dark Tenebrae)."] = "Vuelve con Ohruru en Port Windurst y responde a sus preguntas. Runa contra el elemento de un hechizo: Fire Unda, Earth Flabra, Water Sulpor, Wind Gelus, Ice Ignis, Lightning Tellus, Light Tenebrae, Dark Lux. Runa para un elemento que no soporta: el mismo elemento (Fire Ignis, Earth Tellus, Water Unda, Wind Flabra, Ice Gelus, Lightning Sulpor, Light Lux, Dark Tenebrae).",
    ["Return to Olbergieut and speak with him to end the quest."] = "Vuelve con Olbergieut y habla con él para terminar la quest.",
    ["Return to Oldton Movalpolos for a short cutscene, then speak with Tarnotik and answer yes to both questions. The closest warp is the Proto-Waypoint at the Geomagnetic Fount (K-11). If you get a Voracious Resurgence cutscene with Boudox's Masque/Boudox's Suit instead, zone and speak to him again."] = "Vuelve a Oldton Movalpolos para una escena corta y luego habla con Tarnotik y responde que sí a ambas preguntas. El warp más cercano es el Proto-Waypoint de la Geomagnetic Fount (K-11). Si en su lugar ves una escena de Voracious Resurgence con Boudox's Masque/Boudox's Suit, cambia de zona y vuelve a hablar con él.",
    ["Return to Owain in the Tavnazian Safehold (H-6) to complete the quest."] = "Vuelve con Owain en Tavnazian Safehold (H-6) para completar la quest.",
    ["Return to Owain to complete the quest. VW Op. 004: Bibiki Bombardment begins automatically."] = "Vuelve con Owain para completar la quest. VW Op. 004: Bibiki Bombardment empieza automáticamente.",
    ["Return to Pakh-Jatalfih (I-9) to complete the mission."] = "Vuelve con Pakh-Jatalfih (I-9) para completar la misión.",
    ["Return to Patt-Pott (I-7) in Metalworks."] = "Vuelve con Patt-Pott (I-7) en Metalworks.",
    ["Return to Patt-Pott (I-7)."] = "Vuelve con Patt-Pott (I-7).",
    ["Return to Perih Vashai to complete the quest and receive the Ranger's Necklace."] = "Vuelve con Perih Vashai para completar la quest y recibir el Ranger's Necklace.",
    ["Return to Phillone for a cutscene, then speak with Narvecaint in La Theine Plateau (F-7)."] = "Vuelve con Phillone para una escena y luego habla con Narvecaint en La Theine Plateau (F-7).",
    ["Return to Phillone to receive your reward."] = "Vuelve con Phillone para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Return to Port Jeuno and examine the ??? again. After the cutscene the quest is complete and you receive the Beast Gloves."] = "Vuelve a Port Jeuno y examina de nuevo la ???. Tras la escena la quest queda completada y recibes los Beast Gloves.",
    ["Return to Port Jeuno and examine the ??? again. After the cutscene the quest is complete and you receive the Chaos Gauntlets."] = "Vuelve a Port Jeuno y examina de nuevo la ???. Tras la escena la quest queda completada y recibes los Chaos Gauntlets.",
    ["Return to Port Jeuno and examine the ??? again. After the cutscene the quest is complete and you receive the Choral Cuffs."] = "Vuelve a Port Jeuno y examina de nuevo la ???. Tras la escena la quest queda completada y recibes los Choral Cuffs.",
    ["Return to Port Jeuno and examine the ??? again. After the cutscene the quest is complete and you receive the Drachen Finger Gauntlets."] = "Vuelve a Port Jeuno y examina de nuevo la ???. Tras la escena la quest queda completada y recibes los Drachen Finger Gauntlets.",
    ["Return to Port Jeuno and examine the ??? again. After the cutscene the quest is complete and you receive the Evoker's Bracers."] = "Vuelve a Port Jeuno y examina de nuevo la ???. Tras la escena la quest queda completada y recibes las Evoker's Bracers.",
    ["Return to Port Jeuno and examine the ??? again. After the cutscene the quest is complete and you receive the Fighter's Mufflers."] = "Vuelve a Port Jeuno y examina de nuevo la ???. Tras la escena la quest queda completada y recibes los Fighter's Mufflers.",
    ["Return to Port Jeuno and examine the ??? again. After the cutscene the quest is complete and you receive the Gallant Gauntlets."] = "Vuelve a Port Jeuno y examina de nuevo la ???. Tras la escena la quest queda completada y recibes los Gallant Gauntlets.",
    ["Return to Port Jeuno and examine the ??? again. After the cutscene the quest is complete and you receive the Healer's Mitts."] = "Vuelve a Port Jeuno y examina de nuevo la ???. Tras la escena la quest queda completada y recibes los Healer's Mitts.",
    ["Return to Port Jeuno and examine the ??? again. After the cutscene the quest is complete and you receive the Hunter's Bracers."] = "Vuelve a Port Jeuno y examina de nuevo la ???. Tras la escena la quest queda completada y recibes los Hunter's Bracers.",
    ["Return to Port Jeuno and examine the ??? again. After the cutscene the quest is complete and you receive the Myochin Kote."] = "Vuelve a Port Jeuno y examina de nuevo la ???. Tras la escena la quest queda completada y recibes el Myochin Kote.",
    ["Return to Port Jeuno and examine the ??? again. After the cutscene the quest is complete and you receive the Ninja Tekko."] = "Vuelve a Port Jeuno y examina de nuevo la ???. Tras la escena la quest queda completada y recibes el Ninja Tekko.",
    ["Return to Port Jeuno and examine the ??? again. After the cutscene the quest is complete and you receive the Rogue's Armlets."] = "Vuelve a Port Jeuno y examina de nuevo la ???. Tras la escena la quest queda completada y recibes los Rogue's Armlets.",
    ["Return to Port Jeuno and examine the ??? again. After the cutscene the quest is complete and you receive the Temple Gloves."] = "Vuelve a Port Jeuno y examina de nuevo la ???. Tras la escena la quest queda completada y recibes los Temple Gloves.",
    ["Return to Port Jeuno and examine the ??? again. After the cutscene the quest is complete and you receive the Warlock's Gloves."] = "Vuelve a Port Jeuno y examina de nuevo la ???. Tras la escena la quest queda completada y recibes los Warlock's Gloves.",
    ["Return to Port Jeuno and examine the ??? again. After the cutscene the quest is complete and you receive the Wizard's Gloves."] = "Vuelve a Port Jeuno y examina de nuevo la ???. Tras la escena la quest queda completada y recibes los Wizard's Gloves.",
    ["Return to Port Windurst and speak with Melek again."] = "Vuelve a Port Windurst y habla de nuevo con Melek.",
    ["Return to Portaure for your reward. Completing this quest raises your fame in Norg."] = "Vuelve con Portaure para recibir tu recompensa. Completar esta quest aumenta tu fama en Norg.",
    ["Return to Powhatan to complete the quest and receive a Targe."] = "Vuelve con Powhatan para completar la quest y recibir una Targe.",
    ["Return to Prishe in Abyssea - Empyreal Paradox."] = "Vuelve con Prishe en Abyssea - Empyreal Paradox.",
    ["Return to Pso'Xja through the (H-10) entrance in Beaucedine Glacier, follow the right wall to (I-8), pass through the wall, drop down, take the elevator to the Avatar Gate, and examine it before returning to Cid (H-8)."] = "Vuelve a Pso'Xja por la entrada (H-10) de Beaucedine Glacier, sigue la pared derecha hasta (I-8), atraviesa la pared, déjate caer, toma el ascensor hasta la Avatar Gate y examínala antes de volver con Cid (H-8).",
    ["Return to Raamimi to complete the quest and receive Mulsum x3."] = "Vuelve con Raamimi para completar la quest y recibir Mulsum x3.",
    ["Return to Rabao and speak with Dancing Wolf at (G-7)."] = "Vuelve a Rabao y habla con Dancing Wolf en (G-7).",
    ["Return to Rabao and speak with Maryoh Comyujah (G-7) again to receive the Cerulean crystal."] = "Vuelve a Rabao y habla otra vez con Maryoh Comyujah (G-7) para recibir el Cerulean crystal.",
    ["Return to Rahal and speak to him again."] = "Vuelve con Rahal y habla de nuevo con él.",
    ["Return to Raibaht and speak with him to complete the quest."] = "Vuelve con Raibaht y habla con él para completar la quest.",
    ["Return to Raibaht and trade him the lumber to complete the quest and receive 2,100 gil."] = "Vuelve con Raibaht y entrégale la madera para completar la quest y recibir 2,100 gil.",
    ["Return to Raifa in Port Bastok to receive your reward, 5,000 gil and Dragon Chronicles. Only one Eco-Warrior quest can be completed per Conquest Tally."] = "Vuelve con Raifa en Port Bastok para recibir tu recompensa, 5,000 gil y Dragon Chronicles. Solo se puede completar una quest Eco-Warrior por Conquest Tally.",
    ["Return to Rally Point: Red (F-8)."] = "Vuelve al Rally Point: Red (F-8).",
    ["Return to Ranpi-Monpi and speak with him again to complete the quest and receive 400 gil."] = "Vuelve con Ranpi-Monpi y habla de nuevo con él para completar la quest y recibir 400 gil.",
    ["Return to Rarcasmeult to receive the reward."] = "Vuelve con Rarcasmeult para recibir la recompensa.",
    ["Return to Rasdinice to receive your Allied Notes and complete the operation."] = "Vuelve con Rasdinice para recibir tus Allied Notes y completar la operación.",
    ["Return to Rauteinot for your reward, the Scroll of Teleport-Yhoat."] = "Vuelve con Rauteinot por tu recompensa, el Scroll of Teleport-Yhoat.",
    ["Return to Ravorara in Port Bastok and speak with him four times, once per key item, for 100, 200, 300 and 400 gil."] = "Vuelve con Ravorara en Port Bastok y habla con él cuatro veces, una por key item, para 100, 200, 300 y 400 gil.",
    ["Return to Red Axe (I-8) in The Eldieme Necropolis (S)."] = "Vuelve con Red Axe (I-8) en The Eldieme Necropolis (S).",
    ["Return to Rhea Myuliah in Upper Jeuno. She reveals the pebbles lay at the bottom of Lake Mechieume in Jugner Forest twenty years ago."] = "Vuelve con Rhea Myuliah en Upper Jeuno. Te revela que hace veinte años los guijarros estaban en el fondo del Lake Mechieume, en Jugner Forest.",
    ["Return to Rholont (E-7) in Southern San d'Oria (S) to complete the quest."] = "Vuelve con Rholont (E-7) en Southern San d'Oria (S) para completar la quest.",
    ["Return to Rholont (E-7)."] = "Vuelve con Rholont (E-7).",
    ["Return to Ripapa with the whisper and she offers several reward options, including the ability to summon Ramuh. You can only select one of the rewards at any time, and you may repeat this quest once per Earth day."] = "Vuelve con Ripapa con el susurro y te ofrece varias opciones de recompensa, incluida la habilidad de invocar a Ramuh. Solo puedes elegir una de las recompensas a la vez, y puedes repetir esta quest una vez por día terrestre.",
    ["Return to Rodeupansat (J-7) in Crawlers' Nest (S) to complete the quest."] = "Vuelve con Rodeupansat (J-7) en Crawlers' Nest (S) para completar la quest.",
    ["Return to Rondipur for your reward."] = "Vuelve con Rondipur para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Return to Ronta-Onta with the whisper and he offers several reward options, including the ability to summon Ifrit. You can only select one of the rewards at any time, and you may repeat this quest once per Earth day. You may also keep the whisper to meet the requirements of The Moonlit Path."] = "Vuelve con Ronta-Onta con el susurro y te ofrece varias opciones de recompensa, incluida la habilidad de invocar a Ifrit. Solo puedes elegir una de las recompensas a la vez, y puedes repetir esta quest una vez por día terrestre. También puedes guardar el susurro para cumplir los requisitos de The Moonlit Path.",
    ["Return to Ru'Lude Gardens and approach the Palace."] = "Vuelve a Ru'Lude Gardens y acércate al Palace.",
    ["Return to Ru'Lude Gardens and speak with Maat to complete the quest, which raises your level cap to 75."] = "Vuelve a Ru'Lude Gardens y habla con Maat para completar la quest, que sube tu límite de nivel a 75.",
    ["Return to Ru'Lude Gardens."] = "Vuelve a Ru'Lude Gardens.",
    ["Return to Rycharde and trade him the Popoto to complete the quest and receive a Tea Set. Optional: speak with Valgeir and then Rycharde once more to conclude the story."] = "Vuelve con Rycharde y entrégale la Popoto para completar la quest y recibir un Tea Set. Opcional: habla con Valgeir y luego con Rycharde una vez más para cerrar la historia.",
    ["Return to Rycharde for your reward, the Map of the Toraimarai Canal."] = "Vuelve con Rycharde por tu recompensa, el Map of the Toraimarai Canal.",
    ["Return to Ryoma for another cutscene."] = "Vuelve con Ryoma para otra escena.",
    ["Return to Salaheem's Sentinels."] = "Vuelve a los Salaheem's Sentinels.",
    ["Return to Saliyahf."] = "Vuelve con Saliyahf.",
    ["Return to Savae E. Paleade (I-9) and trade the Mythril Sand."] = "Vuelve con Savae E. Paleade (I-9) y entrega la Mythril Sand.",
    ["Return to Savae E. Paleade (I-9) to receive the Kindred Report."] = "Vuelve con Savae E. Paleade (I-9) para recibir el Kindred Report.",
    ["Return to Selbina and trade the Quadav Stew to Elfriede (J-9)."] = "Vuelve a Selbina y entrega el Quadav Stew a Elfriede (J-9).",
    ["Return to Shantotto in Windurst Walls to receive the Scroll of Warp II. This quest is one of the requirements for Shantotto's Trust."] = "Vuelve con Shantotto en Windurst Walls para recibir el Scroll of Warp II. Esta quest es uno de los requisitos del Trust de Shantotto.",
    ["Return to Sharzalion to receive your Fencing Degen."] = "Vuelve con Sharzalion para recibir tu Fencing Degen.",
    ["Return to Sobane for your reward."] = "Vuelve con Sobane para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Return to Sohyon in Norg (J-8) for the Storeroom key, then speak with Gimb (H-9)."] = "Vuelve con Sohyon en Norg (J-8) para obtener la Storeroom key y luego habla con Gimb (H-9).",
    ["Return to Soun Abralah to complete the quest and receive 5,000 gil. The quest is repeatable."] = "Vuelve con Soun Abralah para completar la quest y recibir 5,000 gil. La quest es repetible.",
    ["Return to Southern San d'Oria (S) between 18:00 and 00:00."] = "Vuelve a Southern San d'Oria (S) entre las 18:00 y las 00:00.",
    ["Return to Southern San d'Oria [S]."] = "Vuelve a Southern San d'Oria [S].",
    ["Return to Stray Cloud for your reward, the Light Buckler."] = "Vuelve con Stray Cloud por tu recompensa, el Light Buckler.",
    ["Return to Sylvie in Western Adoulin (I-5) for a final cutscene, your Geomancy Pants and the title Storied Geomancer. Lhaiso Neftereh's bell is taken from you."] = "Vuelve con Sylvie en Western Adoulin (I-5) para una última escena, tus Geomancy Pants y el título Storied Geomancer. Se te retira la Lhaiso Neftereh's bell.",
    ["Return to Sylvie in Western Adoulin (I-5) for the final cutscene and your Filiae Bell, Dowser's Wand and Bayld. Wait a game day before starting The Bloodline of Zacariah."] = "Vuelve con Sylvie en Western Adoulin (I-5) para la última escena y tu Filiae Bell, el Dowser's Wand y Bayld. Espera un día de juego antes de empezar The Bloodline of Zacariah.",
    ["Return to Sylvie to complete the quest. You receive the Matre Bell and can become a Geomancer. Don't throw the bell away before finishing Treasures of the Earth: if you toss it, Sylvie charges 300,000 gil or 150,000 Bayld before giving you the later AF and Empyrean quests (speaking to her again may let you skip paying)."] = "Vuelve con Sylvie para completar la quest. Recibes la Matre Bell y puedes ser Geomancer. No tires la campana antes de terminar Treasures of the Earth: si la tiras, Sylvie te cobra 300,000 gil o 150,000 Bayld antes de darte las quests posteriores de AF y Empyrean (volver a hablar con ella puede permitirte no pagar).",
    ["Return to Sylvie with the soil and trade her a Petrified Log to receive the key item Luopan."] = "Vuelve con Sylvie con la tierra y entrégale un Petrified Log para recibir el key item Luopan.",
    ["Return to Tavnazian Safehold and approach the bridge around (H/I-8)."] = "Vuelve a Tavnazian Safehold y acércate al puente cerca de (H/I-8).",
    ["Return to Tavnazian Safehold and enter Sealion's Den."] = "Vuelve a Tavnazian Safehold y entra en Sealion's Den.",
    ["Return to Tavnazian Safehold and examine Walnut Door (K-7)."] = "Vuelve a Tavnazian Safehold y examina la Walnut Door (K-7).",
    ["Return to Tavnazian Safehold and speak with Justinius (J-6)."] = "Vuelve a Tavnazian Safehold y habla con Justinius (J-6).",
    ["Return to Tavnazian Safehold and speak with Quelveuiat to complete the quest and receive 2,100 gil."] = "Vuelve a Tavnazian Safehold y habla con Quelveuiat para completar la quest y recibir 2,100 gil.",
    ["Return to Tenshodo Headquarters in Lower Jeuno."] = "Vuelve al Tenshodo Headquarters en Lower Jeuno.",
    ["Return to Thierride (F-8) in Southern San d'Oria (S)."] = "Vuelve con Thierride (F-8) en Southern San d'Oria (S).",
    ["Return to Thunder Hawk for a storytelling scene and your reward, the Map of the Ranguemont Pass and 3,000 gil, and the title Honorary Citizen of Selbina."] = "Vuelve con Thunder Hawk para una escena narrada y tu recompensa, el Map of the Ranguemont Pass y 3,000 gil, y el título Honorary Citizen of Selbina.",
    ["Return to Tressia and put what you learned in order. Two orders are known to work and the right one seems to change with each try: Fouagine, Zadant, Raminey, Noam or Fouagine, Zadant, Noam, Raminey. Keep trying either one."] = "Vuelve con Tressia y ordena lo que has averiguado. Se sabe que funcionan dos órdenes, y el correcto parece cambiar en cada intento: Fouagine, Zadant, Raminey, Noam o Fouagine, Zadant, Noam, Raminey. Sigue probando uno u otro.",
    ["Return to Tressia in the Patrol HQ (J-6)."] = "Vuelve con Tressia en el Patrol HQ (J-6).",
    ["Return to Trilok to complete the quest. The first completion gives 10,000 gil and a Page from Miratete's Memoirs."] = "Vuelve con Trilok para completar la quest. La primera finalización da 10,000 gil y un Page from Miratete's Memoirs.",
    ["Return to Tsetseroon for an Imperial Bronze Piece and to complete the quest. If you chose not to look into Wawaroon's bag, you receive the Map of Aydeewa Subterrane from Tsetseroon instead, and you do not get the Imperial Bronze Piece."] = "Vuelve con Tsetseroon por una Imperial Bronze Piece y para completar la quest. Si elegiste no mirar en la bolsa de Wawaroon, recibes el Map of Aydeewa Subterrane de Tsetseroon en su lugar, y no consigues la Imperial Bronze Piece.",
    ["Return to Tsetseroon to officially begin the quest."] = "Vuelve con Tsetseroon para empezar oficialmente la quest.",
    ["Return to Upper Jeuno and speak to Brutus (G-7) again."] = "Vuelve a Upper Jeuno y habla de nuevo con Brutus (G-7).",
    ["Return to Upper Jeuno and speak with Guslam."] = "Vuelve a Upper Jeuno y habla con Guslam.",
    ["Return to Upper Jeuno and speak with Laila again."] = "Vuelve a Upper Jeuno y habla de nuevo con Laila.",
    ["Return to Upper Jeuno and speak with Monberaux (G-10) again. Enter Batallia Downs and examine the ??? near (K-8) twice to obtain the Delkfutt Recognition Device."] = "Vuelve a Upper Jeuno y habla de nuevo con Monberaux (G-10). Entra en Batallia Downs y examina dos veces la ??? cerca de (K-8) para obtener el Delkfutt Recognition Device.",
    ["Return to Upper Jeuno and speak with Monberaux (G-10)."] = "Vuelve a Upper Jeuno y habla con Monberaux (G-10).",
    ["Return to Vemalpeau."] = "Vuelve con Vemalpeau.",
    ["Return to Veridical Conflux (F-5)."] = "Vuelve al Veridical Conflux (F-5).",
    ["Return to Washu to receive your reward, the Scroll of Hojo: Ichi, and the title Apprentice Sommelier."] = "Vuelve con Washu para recibir tu recompensa, el Scroll of Hojo: Ichi, y el título Apprentice Sommelier.",
    ["Return to Wazyih at (F-11) in Aht Urhgan Whitegate."] = "Vuelve con Wazyih en (F-11) en Aht Urhgan Whitegate.",
    ["Return to Wazyih."] = "Vuelve con Wazyih.",
    ["Return to Western Altepa Desert and enter Quicksand Caves from the entrance around (C/D-11)."] = "Vuelve a Western Altepa Desert y entra en Quicksand Caves por la entrada cerca de (C/D-11).",
    ["Return to Windurst Walls and speak with Koru-Moru to obtain the key item Daze-breaker charm."] = "Vuelve a Windurst Walls y habla con Koru-Moru para obtener el key item Daze-breaker charm.",
    ["Return to Windurst Walls and speak with Koru-Moru to receive your Evoker's Horn and complete the quest. You can toss the Lightning Pendulum and the Wind Pendulum afterwards, as they serve no further purpose."] = "Vuelve a Windurst Walls y habla con Koru-Moru para recibir tu Evoker's Horn y completar la quest. Puedes tirar el Lightning Pendulum y el Wind Pendulum después, ya que no tienen más utilidad.",
    ["Return to Windurst Woods and speak with Mourices (F/G-10) to receive the Kindred Report."] = "Vuelve a Windurst Woods y habla con Mourices (F/G-10) para recibir el Kindred Report.",
    ["Return to Windurst Woods and speak with Perih Vashai for the final cutscene and your reward, Hunter's Socks."] = "Vuelve a Windurst Woods y habla con Perih Vashai para la última escena y tu recompensa, los Hunter's Socks.",
    ["Return to Zantaviat to receive the Temple Knights' Davoi Report."] = "Vuelve con Zantaviat para recibir el Temple Knights' Davoi Report.",
    ["Return to Zon-Fobun to complete the quest and receive your Poison Cesti."] = "Vuelve con Zon-Fobun para completar la quest y recibir tu Poison Cesti.",
    ["Return to Zoriboh in Rabao to complete the quest and receive 3,000 gil and the title Rookie Hero Instructor."] = "Vuelve con Zoriboh en Rabao para completar la quest y recibir 3,000 gil y el título Rookie Hero Instructor.",
    ["Return to any Gate Guard in San d'Oria: Ambrotien (Southern San d'Oria K-10), Endracion (Southern San d'Oria F-9) or Grilau (Northern San d'Oria D-8) to receive the mission."] = "Vuelve con cualquier Gate Guard de San d'Oria: Ambrotien (Southern San d'Oria K-10), Endracion (Southern San d'Oria F-9) o Grilau (Northern San d'Oria D-8) para recibir la misión.",
    ["Return to any Gate Guard in San d'Oria: Ambrotien (Southern San d'Oria K-10), Endracion (Southern San d'Oria F-9) or Grilau (Northern San d'Oria D-8)."] = "Vuelve con cualquier Gate Guard de San d'Oria: Ambrotien (Southern San d'Oria K-10), Endracion (Southern San d'Oria F-9) o Grilau (Northern San d'Oria D-8).",
    ["Return to any Gate Guard in Windurst: Mokyokyo (Windurst Waters F-5), Janshura-Rashura (Port Windurst B-5), Rakoh Buuma (Windurst Woods K-10) or Zokima-Rokima (Windurst Walls H-7)."] = "Vuelve con cualquier Gate Guard de Windurst: Mokyokyo (Windurst Waters F-5), Janshura-Rashura (Port Windurst B-5), Rakoh Buuma (Windurst Woods K-10) o Zokima-Rokima (Windurst Walls H-7).",
    ["Return to green switch (H-7/I-7 area) and activate the switch."] = "Vuelve al interruptor verde (zona H-7/I-7) y actívalo.",
    ["Return to her while you are under the effect of Bane, Mute or Plague."] = "Vuelve con ella mientras estés bajo el efecto de Bane, Mute o Plague.",
    ["Return to the ??? in Arrapago Reef (H-10) for another cutscene."] = "Vuelve a la ??? de Arrapago Reef (H-10) para otra escena.",
    ["Return to the ??? in Arrapago Reef (H-10), map 1, for your reward, the Corsair's Culotte."] = "Vuelve a la ??? en Arrapago Reef (H-10), mapa 1, por tu recompensa, el Corsair's Culotte.",
    ["Return to the ??? in Caedarva Mire."] = "Vuelve a la ??? en Caedarva Mire.",
    ["Return to the ??? near the Augural Conveyor at (C-6)/(B-6)."] = "Vuelve a la ??? cerca del Augural Conveyor en (C-6)/(B-6).",
    ["Return to the Altar Room while wearing your Yagudo Headgear for a cutscene. You receive the key item Vault quipus."] = "Vuelve a la Altar Room llevando puesto tu Yagudo Headgear para una escena. Recibes el key item Vault quipus.",
    ["Return to the Audience Chamber after obtaining all three Magicites."] = "Vuelve a la Audience Chamber tras obtener las tres Magicites.",
    ["Return to the Audience Chamber and obtain the Letter to Jeuno."] = "Vuelve a la Audience Chamber y obtén la Letter to Jeuno.",
    ["Return to the Audience Chamber in Ru'Lude Gardens (H-6) for the Jeunoan approval letter."] = "Vuelve a la Audience Chamber de Ru'Lude Gardens (H-6) para la Jeunoan approval letter.",
    ["Return to the Castle Adoulin gates and report to Ploh Trishbahk (K-9)."] = "Vuelve a las puertas de Castle Adoulin e informa a Ploh Trishbahk (K-9).",
    ["Return to the Castle Gates in Eastern Adoulin."] = "Vuelve a las Castle Gates en Eastern Adoulin.",
    ["Return to the Firebloom Tree and examine the root that matches your remaining vine (check your temporary key items if you forget). Remove a piece of wood to obtain the key item Firebloom Tree Wood."] = "Vuelve al Firebloom Tree y examina la raíz que corresponde a la liana que te queda (mira tus key items temporales si lo olvidas). Saca un trozo de madera para obtener el key item Firebloom Tree Wood.",
    ["Return to the Hall of the Gods and examine Cermet Gate in the Hall of the Gods again."] = "Vuelve a la Hall of the Gods y examina de nuevo la Cermet Gate de la Hall of the Gods.",
    ["Return to the Palace in Ru'Lude Gardens for a cutscene that completes the quest and gives you the key item Whisper of the Wyrmking."] = "Vuelve al Palace de Ru'Lude Gardens para una escena que completa la quest y te da el key item Whisper of the Wyrmking.",
    ["Return to the Rhinostery door in Windurst Waters (S)."] = "Vuelve a la puerta del Rhinostery en Windurst Waters (S).",
    ["Return to the San d'Orian Embassy in Ru'Lude Gardens and examine the Embassy door to complete the mission."] = "Vuelve a la San d'Orian Embassy en Ru'Lude Gardens y examina la puerta de la Embassy para completar la misión.",
    ["Return to the Shattered Telepoint at the Crag of Holla, Dem, or Mea."] = "Vuelve al Shattered Telepoint del Crag of Holla, Dem o Mea.",
    ["Return to the Steaming Sheep restaurant and speak with Hilda to complete the quest."] = "Vuelve al restaurante Steaming Sheep y habla con Hilda para completar la quest.",
    ["Return to the Tavnazian Safehold and talk to Frescheque for your reward, the Yinyang Lorgnette. Talk to Equette again for an additional cutscene."] = "Vuelve a Tavnazian Safehold y habla con Frescheque por tu recompensa, el Yinyang Lorgnette. Habla otra vez con Equette para una escena adicional.",
    ["Return to the Vestal Chamber."] = "Vuelve a la Vestal Chamber.",
    ["Return to the fountain and speak with Enu. The quest now appears in your log."] = "Vuelve a la fuente y habla con Enu. La quest ya aparece en tu log.",
    ["Return to the furniture shop and speak with Morunaude twice."] = "Vuelve a la tienda de muebles y habla dos veces con Morunaude.",
    ["Return to the past and speak with Engelhart (K-10) again."] = "Vuelve al pasado y habla de nuevo con Engelhart (K-10).",
    ["Return to the teahouse and speak with Fari-Wari again to learn Trust: Zazarg."] = "Vuelve a la casa de té y habla de nuevo con Fari-Wari para aprender Trust: Zazarg.",
    ["Return to the top floor of Tavnazian Safehold."] = "Vuelve al piso superior de Tavnazian Safehold.",
    ["Return to town and trade the Steam Clock to Malene to complete the quest and receive 500 gil."] = "Vuelve a la ciudad y entrega el Steam Clock a Malene para completar la quest y recibir 500 gil.",
    ["Revisit Powhatan and select the second option, \"Where am I supposed to meet your guest?\"."] = "Vuelve a Powhatan y elige la segunda opción, \"Where am I supposed to meet your guest?\".",
    ["Ring the tuning fork upon the Lightning Protocrystal. Up to 6 party members can enter the arena, and the time limit is 30 minutes."] = "Haz sonar el diapasón sobre el Lightning Protocrystal. Pueden entrar en la arena hasta 6 miembros del grupo, y el límite de tiempo es de 30 minutos.",
    ["Rolanberry Fields: Cavernous Maw (H-6)."] = "Rolanberry Fields: Cavernous Maw (H-6).",
    ["Rumor has it that the golden figurehead from the Black Coffin, the ship of Luzaf the pirate, can be found somewhere within Ilrusi Atoll. Mission orders: recover the figurehead."] = "Se rumorea que el mascarón dorado del Black Coffin, el barco del pirata Luzaf, puede encontrarse en algún lugar de Ilrusi Atoll. Órdenes de la misión: recuperar el mascarón.",
    ["Rycharde offers to buy you a ticket for the next Ferry between Mhaura and Selbina, but you can travel to Selbina any way you choose."] = "Rycharde se ofrece a comprarte un billete del próximo Ferry entre Mhaura y Selbina, pero puedes viajar a Selbina como prefieras.",
    ["Rycharde pays your fare for the next Ferry between Mhaura and Selbina if you choose to take it."] = "Rycharde te paga el pasaje del próximo Ferry entre Mhaura y Selbina si decides tomarlo.",
    ["Sabotender Campeador in the Western Altepa Desert: rifts at (G-10), (H-5) and (L-6)."] = "Sabotender Campeador en Western Altepa Desert: rifts en (G-10), (H-5) y (L-6).",
    ["Sacrarium: the ??? is in one of the four corner rooms, (F-5), (H-5), (F-11) or (H-11), on the inner side of a bookshelf facing away from the door; it seems to move north-east, north-west, south-east, south-west. Bring Sneak (Invisible isn't needed) for the True-Sight Stegotaurs, take whichever maze entrance is open that day, and pass the one that guards a maze entrance when it turns away, or aggro it, zone and run past before it respawns."] = "Sacrarium: la ??? está en una de las cuatro salas de las esquinas, (F-5), (H-5), (F-11) o (H-11), en el lado interior de una estantería que no mira hacia la puerta; parece moverse en el orden noreste, noroeste, sureste, suroeste. Lleva Sneak (no hace falta Invisible) para los Stegotaurs con True-Sight, toma la entrada del laberinto que esté abierta ese día y pasa junto al que vigila una entrada cuando se dé la vuelta, o atráelo, cambia de zona y pasa corriendo antes de que reaparezca.",
    ["Sagelord Molaal Ja is visiting the training grounds to oversee the progress of the soldiers. His elimination would sow chaos and confusion in the Mamool Ja ranks. Mission orders: defeat Sagelord Molaal Ja. The recommended level is 60."] = "Sagelord Molaal Ja visita los terrenos de entrenamiento para supervisar el progreso de los soldados. Eliminarlo sembraría el caos y la confusión en las filas Mamool Ja. Órdenes de la misión: derrotar a Sagelord Molaal Ja. El nivel recomendado es 60.",
    ["San d'Oria"] = "San d'Oria",
    ["San d'Oria Path:"] = "San d'Oria Path:",
    ["San d'Oria first: travel to Northern San d'Oria and speak with Baraka at the Bastokan Consulate."] = "Primero San d'Oria: viaja a Northern San d'Oria y habla con Baraka en el Bastokan Consulate.",
    ["San d'Oria: Southern San d'Oria (H-8), Northern San d'Oria (J-10), or Port San d'Oria (H-9)."] = "San d'Oria: Southern San d'Oria (H-8), Northern San d'Oria (J-10) o Port San d'Oria (H-9).",
    ["San d'Oria: complete Boy and the Beast and Wrath of the Griffon."] = "San d'Oria: completa Boy and the Beast y Wrath of the Griffon.",
    ["San d'Oria: sick mother = Raminel (Southern San d'Oria, runs between (F-8) and (I-9)); likes her knives sharp = Sobane (Southern, D-6); wants to be a Royal Knight = Taurette (Northern, F-7); breath stinks = Maloquedil (Northern, J-8); job where they're not too rough = Sheridan (Port, H-10); runs the Consortium warehouses = Fontoumant (Port, H-10); nirvana slash = Brifalien (Port, H-8); more than scrolls of Stone = Rugiette (Port, J-8)."] = "San d'Oria: madre enferma = Raminel (Southern San d'Oria, va entre (F-8) y (I-9)); le gustan los cuchillos afilados = Sobane (Southern, D-6); quiere ser Royal Knight = Taurette (Northern, F-7); le apesta el aliento = Maloquedil (Northern, J-8); trabajo no demasiado duro = Sheridan (Port, H-10); lleva los almacenes del Consortium = Fontoumant (Port, H-10); nirvana slash = Brifalien (Port, H-8); más que pergaminos de Stone = Rugiette (Port, J-8).",
    ["Saruta Cotton can be bought from Kuzah Hpirohpon (79 gil) or Meriri (500 gil, Clothcraft Guild Recruit rank or higher) in Windurst Woods (F-12), or found at the Auction House under Materials, Clothcraft."] = "La Saruta Cotton se puede comprar a Kuzah Hpirohpon (79 gil) o a Meriri (500 gil, rango Clothcraft Guild Recruit o superior) en Windurst Woods (F-12), o encontrar en la Auction House en Materials, Clothcraft.",
    ["Sauromugue Champaign: Cavernous Maw (J-10), beyond Banishing Gate #3 in Garlaige Citadel."] = "Sauromugue Champaign: Cavernous Maw (J-10), tras la Banishing Gate #3 en Garlaige Citadel.",
    ["Sauromugue Champaign: Cavernous Maw (J-10)."] = "Sauromugue Champaign: Cavernous Maw (J-10).",
    ["Saying yes teleports you to an arena (for later fights he may not warp you). On rematches, or a job other than your first, you must use that job's assigned arena: Balga's Dais for MNK/WHM/SMN, Horlais Peak for WAR/BLM/RNG, Qu'Bia Arena for PLD/DRK/BRD, Waughroon Shrine for RDM/THF/BST, Chamber of Oracles for SAM/NIN/DRG."] = "Si dices que sí te teletransporta a una arena (en peleas posteriores puede que no lo haga). En revanchas, o con un job distinto del primero, debes usar la arena asignada a ese job: Balga's Dais para MNK/WHM/SMN, Horlais Peak para WAR/BLM/RNG, Qu'Bia Arena para PLD/DRK/BRD, Waughroon Shrine para RDM/THF/BST, Chamber of Oracles para SAM/NIN/DRG.",
    ["Scouts report that the new Mamool Ja soldiers have received supplies from their families. Destroy their morale by stealing these supplies while being careful to remain undetected."] = "Los exploradores informan de que los nuevos soldados Mamool Ja han recibido suministros de sus familias. Destruye su moral robando esos suministros con cuidado de no ser detectado.",
    ["Search for an abnormal ???, which only appears during this specific time frame, and touch it to receive the key item Carrier pigeon letter."] = "Busca una ??? anormal, que solo aparece en esta franja de tiempo, y tócala para recibir el key item Carrier pigeon letter.",
    ["Search the city for a clickable point called Suspicious Object and examine it."] = "Busca por la ciudad un punto seleccionable llamado Suspicious Object y examínalo.",
    ["Search the six Ancient Magical Gizmos until one yields the Cracked Mana Orb."] = "Busca en los seis Ancient Magical Gizmos hasta que uno te dé el Cracked Mana Orb.",
    ["Second Rubious Crystal:"] = "Segundo Rubious Crystal:",
    ["Second envelope: in Lower Jeuno (H-10), speak with Sniggnix in the back hallway of Muckvix's Junk Shop and beat him at dice. Keep rolling until you win."] = "Segundo sobre: en Lower Jeuno (H-10), habla con Sniggnix en el pasillo trasero de Muckvix's Junk Shop y gánale a los dados. Sigue tirando hasta ganar.",
    ["Second goblin, Grasswix (Gausebit Grass): at the ??? at F-4/5 where the underground tunnel comes out."] = "Segundo goblin, Grasswix (Gausebit Grass): en la ??? de F-4/5, donde sale el túnel subterráneo.",
    ["Selbina/Mhaura: weaving woman who lost her memory = Mathilde (Selbina, H-9); Galkan child great at hiding = Vobo (Selbina, I-7); raising his own sheep = Melyon (Selbina, I-9); pupil of Zaldon = Gabwaleid (Selbina, H-9); fiance in Selbina = Celestina (Mhaura, G-8); small mayor = Ekokoko (Mhaura, F-9); knows a lot about pirates = Bihoro-Guhoro (Mhaura, G-9); wants to work with monsters = Jikka-Abukka (Mhaura, H-9)."] = "Selbina/Mhaura: tejedora que perdió la memoria = Mathilde (Selbina, H-9); niño Galka que se esconde muy bien = Vobo (Selbina, I-7); cría sus propias ovejas = Melyon (Selbina, I-9); pupilo de Zaldon = Gabwaleid (Selbina, H-9); prometido en Selbina = Celestina (Mhaura, G-8); alcalde pequeño = Ekokoko (Mhaura, F-9); sabe mucho de piratas = Bihoro-Guhoro (Mhaura, G-9); quiere trabajar con monstruos = Jikka-Abukka (Mhaura, H-9).",
    ["Selbina: choose the first dialogue option, \"You wanted an adventurer?\""] = "Selbina: elige la primera opción de diálogo, \"You wanted an adventurer?\"",
    ["Selbina: examine Oaken Door (K-8) in Norg."] = "Selbina: examina la Oaken Door (K-8) en Norg.",
    ["Selbina: obtain 3 Bee Pollen from Huge Wasps in La Theine Plateau or Konschtat Highlands, or purchase them from the Auction House."] = "Selbina: obtén 3 Bee Pollen de las Huge Wasps de La Theine Plateau o Konschtat Highlands, o cómpralas en la Auction House.",
    ["Selbina: return to Selbina and trade all 3 Bee Pollen to Abelard."] = "Selbina: vuelve a Selbina y entrega los 3 Bee Pollen a Abelard.",
    ["Selbina: speak with Naillina at (F-9) in the Mayor's Residence."] = "Selbina: habla con Naillina en (F-9), en la Mayor's Residence.",
    ["Selbina: speak with Pacomart at (H-10) to travel to Norg."] = "Selbina: habla con Pacomart en (H-10) para viajar a Norg.",
    ["Select the ??? near the entrance and erase your memories (\"I've already forgotten them\" and \"Yes, erase my memories\"), then complete Shadows of the Departed and Apocalypse Nigh again to obtain an earring of your choice."] = "Selecciona la ??? cerca de la entrada y borra tus memorias (\"I've already forgotten them\" y \"Yes, erase my memories\"), luego completa de nuevo Shadows of the Departed y Apocalypse Nigh para obtener un pendiente a tu elección.",
    ["Select the Memento Circle and pick Waking Dreams."] = "Selecciona el Memento Circle y elige Waking Dreams.",
    ["Set the Records of Eminence objective All for One, found under Tutorial in the Records of Eminence menu."] = "Fija el objetivo de Records of Eminence All for One, que está en Tutorial en el menú de Records of Eminence.",
    ["Set the Records of Eminence objective Conflict: South Gustaberg (or similar) to help you keep track of the kills."] = "Configura el objetivo de Records of Eminence Conflict: South Gustaberg (o similar) para llevar la cuenta de las muertes.",
    ["Several NPCs that look very similar to the one Eddy showed you appear on the ship."] = "Varios NPCs muy parecidos al que Eddy te mostró aparecen en el barco.",
    ["Several NPCs that look very similar to the one Grin showed you appear on the ship."] = "Varios NPCs muy parecidos al que Grin te mostró aparecen en el barco.",
    ["Several NPCs that look very similar to the one in the picture appear on the ship."] = "Varios NPCs muy parecidos al de la imagen aparecen en el barco.",
    ["She asks for one body and one legs piece from her list of ordinary armors (for example Banded Mail, Bishop's Robe, Pyro Robe or Silver Mail). Return wearing both."] = "Te pide una pieza de cuerpo y una de piernas de su lista de armaduras corrientes (por ejemplo Banded Mail, Bishop's Robe, Pyro Robe o Silver Mail). Vuelve llevando ambas.",
    ["She makes you the Invisible man sticker you need, but only if you first bring her Shoalweed. Shoalweed drops from Recluse Spider enemies in Kuftal Tunnel."] = "Te hace el Invisible man sticker que necesitas, pero solo si antes le traes Shoalweed. El Shoalweed lo sueltan enemigos Recluse Spider en Kuftal Tunnel.",
    ["She sends you to Ranguemont Pass to look for Semih Lafihna. Semih Lafihna is not there, so speak with Perchond at (F-10); Semih Lafihna was searching for Glittersand around the pond at (E-5)."] = "Te envía a Ranguemont Pass a buscar a Semih Lafihna. Semih Lafihna no está allí, así que habla con Perchond en (F-10); Semih Lafihna estaba buscando Glittersand alrededor del estanque en (E-5).",
    ["She then offers 13 level 50 body armors. Choose one and trade her the matching rare/ex Subligar from the Fomors in Phomiuna Aqueducts and the Sacrarium: for example Aikido Gi (MNK) needs an Aquarius Subligar from Fomor Monk, Gaudy Harness (BRD/BST) an Ophiuchus Subligar from Fomor Beastmaster, Gloom Breastplate (DRK) a Sagittarius Subligar from Fomor Dark Knight, Nokizaru Gi (NIN) a Taurus Subligar from Fomor Ninja, and Wyvern Mail (DRG) a Leo Subligar from Fomor Dragoon."] = "Después te ofrece 13 armaduras de cuerpo de nivel 50. Elige una y entrégale el Subligar rare/ex correspondiente de los Fomors de Phomiuna Aqueducts y el Sacrarium: por ejemplo, Aikido Gi (MNK) necesita un Aquarius Subligar de Fomor Monk, Gaudy Harness (BRD/BST) un Ophiuchus Subligar de Fomor Beastmaster, Gloom Breastplate (DRK) un Sagittarius Subligar de Fomor Dark Knight, Nokizaru Gi (NIN) un Taurus Subligar de Fomor Ninja y Wyvern Mail (DRG) un Leo Subligar de Fomor Dragoon.",
    ["She wants 2 Bomb Arms, a Revival Tree Root and Hiwon's Hair. Speak with Hiwon-Biwon again for the hair. Bomb Arm can be bought from Nogga on the top floor of Metalworks (G-7) for 690 gil when Bastok is at least 2nd in Conquest."] = "Quiere 2 Bomb Arms, una Revival Tree Root y el Hiwon's Hair. Habla de nuevo con Hiwon-Biwon para el pelo. El Bomb Arm se puede comprar a Nogga en el último piso de Metalworks (G-7) por 690 gil cuando Bastok es al menos 2.ª en Conquest.",
    ["Silk Thread can also be bought from Meriri (only for Clothcraft Apprentices or higher) or from Kuzah Hpirohpon at the nearby Clothcrafting Guild (Home Point #5)."] = "La Silk Thread también se puede comprar a Meriri (solo para Clothcraft Apprentices o superior) o a Kuzah Hpirohpon en el Clothcrafting Guild cercano (Home Point #5).",
    ["Solo, bring Sneak and Invisible (spells, Silent Oil and Prism Powder, Spectral Jig, or Tonko/Monomi: Ichi); drop Invisible to click each ??? and reapply. Reraise (e.g a Scroll of Instant Reraise) is recommended. To fight for the drops instead, Trusts are enough; beware Explosure's Self-Destruct and Exoray's conal Breath (Cipher: Zeid stuns them)."] = "En solitario, lleva Sneak e Invisible (hechizos, Silent Oil y Prism Powder, Spectral Jig o Tonko/Monomi: Ichi); quítate Invisible para pulsar cada ??? y vuelve a ponértelo. Se recomienda Reraise (p. ej. un Scroll of Instant Reraise). Si prefieres luchar por los drops, bastan los Trusts; cuidado con el Self-Destruct de Explosure y el Breath cónico de Exoray (Cipher: Zeid los aturde).",
    ["Some monsters inside Promyvion drop items called Recollections. Trade Harith one of these Recollections plus 2,000 gil to receive an Anima: Recollection of Pain gives Hysteroanima (negates special attacks), Recollection of Fear gives Psychoanima (negates normal attacks) and Recollection of Guilt gives Terroanima (causes the monster to flee)."] = "Algunos monstruos dentro de Promyvion sueltan objetos llamados Recollections. Entrega a Harith una de estas Recollections más 2,000 gil para recibir una Anima: Recollection of Pain da Hysteroanima (anula los ataques especiales), Recollection of Fear da Psychoanima (anula los ataques normales) y Recollection of Guilt da Terroanima (hace huir al monstruo).",
    ["Southern San d'Oria: Leuveret (F-8), Raimbroy's Grocery 2nd-floor balcony; Blendare (J-9), under the tree near the Auction House; Maugie (L-9), near the East Gate; Adaunel (K-9), up the stairs on top of the East Gate archway; Rosel (K-8), Rosel's Armour Shop."] = "Southern San d'Oria: Leuveret (F-8), balcón del 2.º piso de Raimbroy's Grocery; Blendare (J-9), bajo el árbol cerca de la Auction House; Maugie (L-9), cerca de la East Gate; Adaunel (K-9), subiendo las escaleras sobre el arco de la East Gate; Rosel (K-8), Rosel's Armour Shop.",
    ["Speak to Arawn again once you have collected all the stamps to complete the quest and receive a Leather Gorget."] = "Habla de nuevo con Arawn cuando hayas reunido todos los sellos para completar la quest y recibir un Leather Gorget.",
    ["Speak to Brutus (G-7) after one game day to receive a chocobo egg. You must change zones and return to Upper Jeuno after the day change."] = "Habla con Brutus (G-7) tras un día de juego para recibir un huevo de chocobo. Debes cambiar de zona y volver a Upper Jeuno tras el cambio de día.",
    ["Speak to Fari-Wari after the day changes to receive a Mercenary Camp Entry Slip."] = "Habla con Fari-Wari tras el cambio de día para recibir una Mercenary Camp Entry Slip.",
    ["Speak to him two more times to start the correct quest, and choose \"Nope, never!\"."] = "Habla con él dos veces más para empezar la quest correcta, y elige \"Nope, never!\".",
    ["Speak to the NPCs to get the option of returning the key item Dropped item to them. You only have one chance to get it right."] = "Habla con los NPCs para tener la opción de devolverles el key item Dropped item. Solo tienes una oportunidad de acertar.",
    ["Speak to the following 7 guards to obtain the stamps. In Bastok Markets: Pavel (D-11), at the gate to Gustaberg. In Bastok Mines: Deadly Spider (G-8), on the 2nd floor of the Depot, and Tall Mountain (J-7), by going down the ramp toward the Alchemist Guild and turning right at the no-entrance area."] = "Habla con los siguientes 7 guardias para obtener los sellos. En Bastok Markets: Pavel (D-11), en la puerta de Gustaberg. En Bastok Mines: Deadly Spider (G-8), en el 2º piso del Depot, y Tall Mountain (J-7), bajando la rampa hacia el Alchemist Guild y girando a la derecha en la zona sin entrada.",
    ["Speak with 20 people around the kingdom's cities; for example Daggao in Southern San d'Oria (K-5), Rouva in Southern San d'Oria (I-8), Giaunne in Northern San d'Oria (I-9) and Perdiouvilet in Port San d'Oria (G-7)."] = "Habla con 20 personas de las ciudades del reino; por ejemplo Daggao en Southern San d'Oria (K-5), Rouva en Southern San d'Oria (I-8), Giaunne en Northern San d'Oria (I-9) y Perdiouvilet en Port San d'Oria (G-7).",
    ["Speak with Abeaule in Northern San d'Oria (F-8)."] = "Habla con Abeaule en Northern San d'Oria (F-8).",
    ["Speak with Abeaule in Northern San d'Oria (F-8); he needs someone to fill an order. Accept the task and he gives you a Supplies Order."] = "Habla con Abeaule en Northern San d'Oria (F-8); necesita a alguien que cumpla un pedido. Acepta la tarea y te da un Supplies Order.",
    ["Speak with Abioleget in Northern San d'Oria (M-7); he needs you to deliver Blue Peas."] = "Habla con Abioleget en Northern San d'Oria (M-7); necesita que entregues Blue Peas.",
    ["Speak with Abioleget in the Cathedral in Northern San d'Oria at (M-7)."] = "Habla con Abioleget en la Cathedral de Northern San d'Oria en (M-7).",
    ["Speak with Adelbrecht (E-9)."] = "Habla con Adelbrecht (E-9).",
    ["Speak with Aeka at (I-8) to receive the Oriental Steel."] = "Habla con Aeka en (I-8) para recibir el Oriental Steel.",
    ["Speak with Agado-Pugado in Rabao (G-9) to obtain the quest. You need Rabao fame level 6 and the Rise of the Zilart pack. Once you have the key item Tuning fork of wind, you can safely undertake the quest. Each party member must have their own Tuning fork of wind."] = "Habla con Agado-Pugado en Rabao (G-9) para obtener la quest. Necesitas el nivel 6 de fama de Rabao y el pack Rise of the Zilart. Cuando tengas el key item Tuning fork of wind, ya puedes emprender la quest con seguridad. Cada miembro del grupo debe tener su propio Tuning fork of wind.",
    ["Speak with Agapito in Port Bastok (G-6) to begin the quest."] = "Habla con Agapito en Port Bastok (G-6) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Ahaadah in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (G-6), in Philosopher's Alley near the Alchemists' Guild, to begin the quest. Alcander and Ahaadah want you to help Tinga-Matonga become a respectable citizen."] = "Habla con Ahaadah en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (G-6), en Philosopher's Alley cerca del Alchemists' Guild, para empezar la quest. Alcander y Ahaadah quieren que ayudes a Tinga-Matonga a convertirse en un ciudadano respetable.",
    ["Speak with Ahkk Jharcham in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10). You need Aht Urhgan fame level 1. She wants a Parchment and a Black Ink so she can write down her secret."] = "Habla con Ahkk Jharcham en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10). Necesitas el nivel 1 de fama de Aht Urhgan. Quiere un Parchment y una Black Ink para poder escribir su secreto.",
    ["Speak with Ailbeche in Northern San d'Oria (J-8)."] = "Habla con Ailbeche en Northern San d'Oria (J-8).",
    ["Speak with Ailbeche in Northern San d'Oria (J-9) for a cutscene that starts the quest. You must be level 10 or higher."] = "Habla con Ailbeche en Northern San d'Oria (J-9) para una escena que inicia la quest. Debes ser nivel 10 o superior.",
    ["Speak with Ailbeche in Northern San d'Oria (J-9)."] = "Habla con Ailbeche en Northern San d'Oria (J-9).",
    ["Speak with Ailbeche near Home Point #2 in Northern San d'Oria (J-8) to begin the quest; he asks you for an Ordelle whetstone."] = "Habla con Ailbeche cerca del Home Point #2 en Northern San d'Oria (J-8) para empezar la quest; te pide una Ordelle whetstone.",
    ["Speak with Aldo (J-8) in Neptune's Spire."] = "Habla con Aldo (J-8) en Neptune's Spire.",
    ["Speak with Alfesar in Rabao (H-7), who asks you to help him find an Ancient tablet fragment. You need Rabao fame level 4 and the Rise of the Zilart pack."] = "Habla con Alfesar en Rabao (H-7), que te pide ayuda para encontrar un Ancient tablet fragment. Necesitas el nivel 4 de fama de Rabao y el pack Rise of the Zilart.",
    ["Speak with Alib-Mufalib in Port Bastok (K-7) to receive a Blue Sentinel badge and begin the quest. This quest requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Habla con Alib-Mufalib en Port Bastok (K-7) para recibir una Blue Sentinel badge y empezar la quest. Esta quest requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Speak with Alois (J-8)."] = "Habla con Alois (J-8).",
    ["Speak with Altiret, who asks you to retrieve the stolen item."] = "Habla con Altiret, que te pide que recuperes el objeto robado.",
    ["Speak with Amaura (G-6) in Southern San d'Oria (S)."] = "Habla con Amaura (G-6) en Southern San d'Oria (S).",
    ["Speak with Amaura (G-6), who asks for Thyme Moss."] = "Habla con Amaura (G-6), que pide Thyme Moss.",
    ["Speak with Ambrosius in Windurst Walls (J-12) to start the quest."] = "Habla con Ambrosius en Windurst Walls (J-12) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Amutiyaal in Southern San d'Oria (L-6) to receive a Red Sentinel badge and begin the quest. This quest requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Habla con Amutiyaal en Southern San d'Oria (L-6) para recibir una Red Sentinel badge y empezar la quest. Esta quest requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Speak with Andecia, in the middle house on the first floor of Squire's Alley in Southern San d'Oria (M-7), once to trigger the story text. Speak with her again to receive the Well Water."] = "Habla con Andecia, en la casa del medio de la primera planta de Squire's Alley en Southern San d'Oria (M-7), una vez para activar el texto de la historia. Vuelve a hablar con ella para recibir el Well Water.",
    ["Speak with Angelica in Windurst Waters (F-10); she asks for a piece of body armor that depends on your job."] = "Habla con Angelica en Windurst Waters (F-10); pide una pieza de armadura de cuerpo que depende de tu trabajo.",
    ["Speak with Angelica in Windurst Waters (North) to receive the key item Old Woman's Portrait."] = "Habla con Angelica en Windurst Waters (North) para recibir el key item Old Woman's Portrait.",
    ["Speak with Anguenet (J-10) and trade him the Attohwa Ginseng for the key item Tonberry blackboard."] = "Habla con Anguenet (J-10) y entrégale el Attohwa Ginseng para obtener el key item Tonberry blackboard.",
    ["Speak with Anteurephiaux (J-8, 3rd floor) to officially begin the quest."] = "Habla con Anteurephiaux (J-8, 3.er piso) para empezar oficialmente la quest.",
    ["Speak with Antreneau and then Thierride, both in the Rusty Anchor Pub (G-7) in Port San d'Oria, to begin the quest."] = "Habla con Antreneau y luego con Thierride, ambos en el Rusty Anchor Pub (G-7) de Port San d'Oria, para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Antreneau in Port San d'Oria (G-7) to flag the quest."] = "Habla con Antreneau en Port San d'Oria (G-7) para activar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Apururu (H-9) in Windurst Woods."] = "Habla con Apururu (H-9) en Windurst Woods.",
    ["Speak with Apururu in Windurst Woods (H-9)."] = "Habla con Apururu en Windurst Woods (H-9).",
    ["Speak with Aquillina in Bastok Markets (K-9); she asks for Flint Stones."] = "Habla con Aquillina en Bastok Markets (K-9); pide Flint Stones.",
    ["Speak with Aramu-Paramu."] = "Habla con Aramu-Paramu.",
    ["Speak with Arawn in Bastok Markets (J-10) to start the quest. You receive the Stamp sheet to collect stamps."] = "Habla con Arawn en Bastok Markets (J-10) para empezar la quest. Recibes la Stamp sheet para coleccionar sellos.",
    ["Speak with Ardea in Bastok Markets (H-8), in front of the Goldsmithing Guild next to Home Point #4. If you have started the quest Rock Racketeer, you must finish it before Ardea lets you continue."] = "Habla con Ardea en Bastok Markets (H-8), delante del Goldsmithing Guild junto al Home Point #4. Si has empezado la quest Rock Racketeer, debes terminarla antes de que Ardea te deje continuar.",
    ["Speak with Ardea in Bastok Markets (H-8), near Home Point #4, and sell her the stone for 10 gil."] = "Habla con Ardea en Bastok Markets (H-8), cerca del Home Point #4, y véndele la piedra por 10 gil.",
    ["Speak with Arminibit and Ceraulian inside Cargo Room A in Port San d'Oria (I-9). You must be level 30 or higher and have the Rise of the Zilart pack. The Auction House or Mog House Home Point are both close."] = "Habla con Arminibit y Ceraulian dentro de la Cargo Room A de Port San d'Oria (I-9). Debes ser de nivel 30 o superior y tener el pack de Rise of the Zilart. La Auction House y el Home Point de la Mog House están cerca.",
    ["Speak with Atelloune in Southern San d'Oria (L-6) for a cutscene that starts the quest. This quest requires the Wings of the Goddess pack and follows Seeing Spots."] = "Habla con Atelloune en Southern San d'Oria (L-6) para una escena que inicia la quest. Esta quest requiere el pack Wings of the Goddess y sigue a Seeing Spots.",
    ["Speak with Aurege in Northern San d'Oria (F-3), near Home Point #4 outside the Carpenter's Guild, to start the quest."] = "Habla con Aurege en Northern San d'Oria (F-3), cerca del Home Point #4 fuera del Carpenter's Guild, para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Ayame at (K-7), in the other Cannonry."] = "Habla con Ayame en (K-7), en el otro Cannonry.",
    ["Speak with Ayame in Metalworks (K-7) for a cutscene and agree twice to start the quest. You need Bastok fame level 3 and the Chains of Promathia pack."] = "Habla con Ayame en Metalworks (K-7) para una escena y acepta dos veces para empezar la quest. Necesitas el nivel 3 de fama de Bastok y el pack Chains of Promathia.",
    ["Speak with Ayame in Metalworks (K-7) for a cutscene that starts the quest. You need Bastok fame level 4 and the Chains of Promathia pack."] = "Habla con Ayame en Metalworks (K-7) para una escena que inicia la quest. Necesitas el nivel 4 de fama de Bastok y el pack Chains of Promathia.",
    ["Speak with Ayame in Metalworks (K-7) for a cutscene that starts the quest. You need Bastok fame level 5 and the Chains of Promathia pack."] = "Habla con Ayame en Metalworks (K-7) para una escena que inicia la quest. Necesitas el nivel 5 de fama de Bastok y el pack Chains of Promathia.",
    ["Speak with Ayame in Metalworks (K-7), as a Monk of level 50 or higher. If you have finished the Treasures of Aht Urhgan missions, you may need to speak with her twice. Once you have talked to Ayame, the quest shows up in your quest log and you may switch to another job to complete it."] = "Habla con Ayame en Metalworks (K-7), siendo Monk de nivel 50 o superior. Si has terminado las misiones de Treasures of Aht Urhgan, puede que tengas que hablar con ella dos veces. Cuando hayas hablado con Ayame, la quest aparece en tu quest log y puedes cambiar a otro trabajo para completarla.",
    ["Speak with Balasiel in Southern San d'Oria (F-7) to receive the key item Weapon Training Guide and the Spear of Trials."] = "Habla con Balasiel en Southern San d'Oria (F-7) para recibir el key item Weapon Training Guide y la Spear of Trials.",
    ["Speak with Balasiel in Southern San d'Oria (F-7) to start the quest."] = "Habla con Balasiel en Southern San d'Oria (F-7) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Balasiel in Southern San d'Oria (F-7), who gives you the Book of Tasks with hints on how to proceed. You must be level 30."] = "Habla con Balasiel en Southern San d'Oria (F-7), que te da el Book of Tasks con pistas para continuar. Debes ser nivel 30.",
    ["Speak with Balasiel in Southern San d'Oria (F-7)."] = "Habla con Balasiel en Southern San d'Oria (F-7).",
    ["Speak with Balasiel on the upper walkways of Southern San d'Oria (F-7); he asks you for a Revival Tree Root. You must be level 10 or higher."] = "Habla con Balasiel en los pasillos altos de Southern San d'Oria (F-7); te pide una Revival Tree Root. Debes ser nivel 10 o superior.",
    ["Speak with Balasiel to complete the quest."] = "Habla con Balasiel para completar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Baldric inside the Darksteel Forge on the first floor of Metalworks (G-9) to begin the quest. You need Bastok fame level 2."] = "Habla con Baldric dentro de la Darksteel Forge en el primer piso de Metalworks (G-9) para empezar la quest. Necesitas el nivel 2 de fama de Bastok.",
    ["Speak with Baren-Moren in the hat shop in Windurst Waters South (H-7) to start the quest and receive the New Model Hat."] = "Habla con Baren-Moren en la tienda de sombreros de Windurst Waters South (H-7) para empezar la quest y recibir el New Model Hat.",
    ["Speak with Baren-Moren in the hat shop in Windurst Waters South (H-7); he asks you to bring him Giant Bird Feather x3."] = "Habla con Baren-Moren en la tienda de sombreros de Windurst Waters South (H-7); te pide que le traigas Giant Bird Feather x3.",
    ["Speak with Bartolomeo in Port Bastok (F-7), inside the Air Travel Agency. Nothing happens."] = "Habla con Bartolomeo en Port Bastok (F-7), dentro de la Air Travel Agency. No ocurre nada.",
    ["Speak with Bartolomeo in Port Bastok (F-7), one of the clerks inside the air travel agency."] = "Habla con Bartolomeo en Port Bastok (F-7), uno de los empleados dentro de la air travel agency.",
    ["Speak with Baunise (H-9), reached from (F-8) in the tower above the West Gate, to receive the Book of the West."] = "Habla con Baunise (H-9), al que se llega desde (F-8) en la torre sobre la West Gate, para recibir el Book of the West.",
    ["Speak with Belgidiveau in Northern San d'Oria (G-8) to begin the quest."] = "Habla con Belgidiveau en Northern San d'Oria (G-8) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Benita in Port Bastok (J-6) to begin the quest."] = "Habla con Benita en Port Bastok (J-6) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Bertenont (E-4) in Northern San d'Oria."] = "Habla con Bertenont (E-4) en Northern San d'Oria.",
    ["Speak with Bhoy Yhupplo at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Apkallu Seizure. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Bhoy Yhupplo en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Apkallu Seizure. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Bhoy Yhupplo at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Bellerophon's Bliss. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Bhoy Yhupplo en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Bellerophon's Bliss. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Bhoy Yhupplo at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Demolition Duty. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Bhoy Yhupplo en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Demolition Duty. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Bhoy Yhupplo at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Deserter. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Bhoy Yhupplo en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Deserter. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Bhoy Yhupplo at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Desperately Seeking Cephalopods. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Bhoy Yhupplo en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Desperately Seeking Cephalopods. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Bhoy Yhupplo at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Extermination. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Bhoy Yhupplo en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Extermination. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Bhoy Yhupplo at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Golden Salvage. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Bhoy Yhupplo en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Golden Salvage. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Bhoy Yhupplo at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Lamia No. 13. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Bhoy Yhupplo en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Lamia No. 13. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Bhoy Yhupplo at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Lost and Found. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Bhoy Yhupplo en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Lost and Found. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Bhoy Yhupplo at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Searat Salvation. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Bhoy Yhupplo en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Searat Salvation. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Bki Tbujhja at the counter in the same room (H-8)."] = "Habla con Bki Tbujhja en el mostrador de la misma sala (H-8).",
    ["Speak with Black Mud in Bastok Mines (J-7) to begin the quest. You receive a Brass Canteen. If you drop it, you can speak to him again to get another one."] = "Habla con Black Mud en Bastok Mines (J-7) para empezar la quest. Recibes una Brass Canteen. Si la tiras, puedes hablar de nuevo con él para conseguir otra.",
    ["Speak with Blandine in Mhaura (I-9) to begin the quest. You need Windurst fame level 4."] = "Habla con Blandine en Mhaura (I-9) para empezar la quest. Necesitas el nivel 4 de fama de Windurst.",
    ["Speak with Blatherix (F-8) in Bastok Markets (S) to receive the Goblin Belt."] = "Habla con Blatherix (F-8) en Bastok Markets (S) para recibir el Goblin Belt.",
    ["Speak with Blatherix (F-8) to receive the reward."] = "Habla con Blatherix (F-8) para recibir la recompensa.",
    ["Speak with Brenton (E-8)."] = "Habla con Brenton (E-8).",
    ["Speak with Brutus in Upper Jeuno (G-7) as a Beastmaster of level 40 or higher. From this point on you can complete the quest on any job."] = "Habla con Brutus en Upper Jeuno (G-7) como Beastmaster de nivel 40 o superior. A partir de aquí puedes completar la quest con cualquier trabajo.",
    ["Speak with Brutus in Upper Jeuno (G-7) as a Beastmaster of level 50 or higher; he gives you three Aquaflora key items. From here on you can be on any job."] = "Habla con Brutus en Upper Jeuno (G-7) como Beastmaster de nivel 50 o superior; te da tres key items Aquaflora. A partir de aquí puedes ir con cualquier trabajo.",
    ["Speak with Brutus in Upper Jeuno (G-7) for a cutscene. You may have to talk to him multiple times to get the cutscene."] = "Habla con Brutus en Upper Jeuno (G-7) para una escena. Puede que tengas que hablarle varias veces para obtener la escena.",
    ["Speak with Brutus in Upper Jeuno (G-7) to receive the key item Weapon Training Guide and the Pick of Trials. You need to break the latent on the Pick of Trials before completing the rest of the quest."] = "Habla con Brutus en Upper Jeuno (G-7) para recibir el key item Weapon Training Guide y el Pick of Trials. Debes romper el latent del Pick of Trials antes de completar el resto de la quest.",
    ["Speak with Brygid again to complete the quest and receive the Gloves. Completing it later unlocks Brygid the Stylist Returns."] = "Habla de nuevo con Brygid para completar la quest y recibir los Gloves. Completarla desbloquea más adelante Brygid the Stylist Returns.",
    ["Speak with Brygid in Bastok Markets (K-9). She tells you how bad your fashion sense is and wants you to come back wearing a Robe and a Bronze Subligar."] = "Habla con Brygid en Bastok Markets (K-9). Te dice lo mal que está tu sentido de la moda y quiere que vuelvas llevando un Robe y un Bronze Subligar.",
    ["Speak with Cacaroon (G-11) for a cutscene."] = "Habla con Cacaroon (G-11) para una escena.",
    ["Speak with Cacaroon in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (G-11) and trade him one Imperial Bronze Piece."] = "Habla con Cacaroon en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (G-11) y entrégale una Imperial Bronze Piece.",
    ["Speak with Cahaurme (J-9), reached from (L-8) in the tower above the East Gate, to receive the Book of the East."] = "Habla con Cahaurme (J-9), al que se llega desde (L-8) en la torre sobre la East Gate, para recibir el Book of the East.",
    ["Speak with Calovour in the Cathedral (M-6)."] = "Habla con Calovour en la Cathedral (M-6).",
    ["Speak with Carbuncle at the ??? in La Theine Plateau (G-6). You must first have obtained spirit pacts with the 6 summonable Celestial avatars before you are presented with the Rainbow resonator."] = "Habla con Carbuncle en la ??? de La Theine Plateau (G-6). Primero debes haber obtenido los pactos espirituales de los 6 avatares Celestial invocables antes de que te den el Rainbow resonator.",
    ["Speak with Carmelo in Port Bastok (E-6) to begin the quest and receive the key item Chanson de Liberte."] = "Habla con Carmelo en Port Bastok (E-6) para empezar la quest y recibir el key item Chanson de Liberte.",
    ["Speak with Carmelo in Port Bastok (E-6) to begin the quest."] = "Habla con Carmelo en Port Bastok (E-6) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Carmelo inside the Steaming Sheep in Port Bastok (E-6) to receive the actual quest and Carmelo's song sheet. If you have The Siren's Tear active, you get a prompt to ask him about the Siren's Tear instead. You need Bastok fame level 5."] = "Habla con Carmelo dentro del Steaming Sheep en Port Bastok (E-6) para recibir la quest real y la Carmelo's song sheet. Si tienes The Siren's Tear activa, te sale una opción para preguntarle por la Siren's Tear. Necesitas el nivel 5 de fama de Bastok.",
    ["Speak with Celestina in the nearby Goldsmithing Guild. The quest now shows in your log."] = "Habla con Celestina en el Goldsmithing Guild cercano. La quest aparece ahora en tu registro.",
    ["Speak with Ceraulian in Port San d'Oria (I-10), inside Cargo Room A, for a cutscene."] = "Habla con Ceraulian en Port San d'Oria (I-10), dentro de la Cargo Room A, para una escena.",
    ["Speak with Ceraulian inside Cargo Room A in Port San d'Oria (I-10) to begin the quest; you must be a Dragoon of level 50 or higher. Agree to help him obtain a Gold Hairpin. From this point on you can change to any other job."] = "Habla con Ceraulian dentro de la Cargo Room A de Port San d'Oria (I-10) para empezar la quest; debes ser Dragoon de nivel 50 o superior. Acepta ayudarlo a obtener una Gold Hairpin. A partir de este punto puedes cambiar a cualquier otro trabajo.",
    ["Speak with Ceraulian once more after the cutscene."] = "Habla una vez más con Ceraulian tras la escena.",
    ["Speak with Chalvatot in Chateau d'Oraguille (F-7) to begin the quest."] = "Habla con Chalvatot en Chateau d'Oraguille (F-7) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Chamama in Windurst Waters (F-10) to start the quest."] = "Habla con Chamama en Windurst Waters (F-10) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Chamama in Windurst Waters (F-10)."] = "Habla con Chamama en Windurst Waters (F-10).",
    ["Speak with Charlaimagnat in Northern San d'Oria (M-7)."] = "Habla con Charlaimagnat en Northern San d'Oria (M-7).",
    ["Speak with Chef Nonberry and trade him the Tonberry Board for the key item Nonberry's knife."] = "Habla con Chef Nonberry y entrégale la Tonberry Board para obtener el key item Nonberry's knife.",
    ["Speak with Chemioue on the top floor of Tavnazian Safehold (J-6), slightly north of Home Point #3, for a cutscene. You need to have completed Promathia Mission 3-5 and have the Chains of Promathia pack."] = "Habla con Chemioue en el piso superior de Tavnazian Safehold (J-6), un poco al norte del Home Point #3, para una escena. Debes haber completado la Promathia Mission 3-5 y tener el pack Chains of Promathia.",
    ["Speak with Cheupirudaux in Northern San d'Oria (F-3), near Home Point #4, to receive the Mannequin joint diagrams."] = "Habla con Cheupirudaux en Northern San d'Oria (F-3), cerca del Home Point #4, para recibir los Mannequin joint diagrams.",
    ["Speak with Chipmy-Popmy in Port Windurst (C-8) to start the quest. This quest requires the Chains of Promathia pack."] = "Habla con Chipmy-Popmy en Port Windurst (C-8) para empezar la quest. Esta quest requiere el pack Chains of Promathia.",
    ["Speak with Chumimi in the basement of Heavens Tower (the bottom floor). You must be on Black Mage, level 40 or higher, to start this quest."] = "Habla con Chumimi en el sótano de Heavens Tower (el piso de abajo). Debes ser Black Mage de nivel 40 o superior para empezar esta quest.",
    ["Speak with Chumimi in the basement of Heavens Tower to start the quest. You must be a Black Mage, level 50 or higher."] = "Habla con Chumimi en el sótano de Heavens Tower para empezar la quest. Debes ser Black Mage de nivel 50 o superior.",
    ["Speak with Chumimi in the basement of Heavens Tower to start the quest. You must be on Black Mage."] = "Habla con Chumimi en el sótano de Heavens Tower para empezar la quest. Debes ser Black Mage.",
    ["Speak with Churano-Shurano on the roof of the Optistery in Windurst Waters (F-8), in front of the telescope."] = "Habla con Churano-Shurano en el tejado del Optistery de Windurst Waters (F-8), delante del telescopio.",
    ["Speak with Cid (H-8) again."] = "Habla de nuevo con Cid (H-8).",
    ["Speak with Cid (H-8) in Bastok Metalworks and complete the San d'Oria and Windurst paths in either order."] = "Habla con Cid (H-8) en Bastok Metalworks y completa los caminos de San d'Oria y Windurst en cualquier orden.",
    ["Speak with Cid (H-8) in Metalworks."] = "Habla con Cid (H-8) en Metalworks.",
    ["Speak with Cid (H-8)."] = "Habla con Cid (H-8).",
    ["Speak with Cid in Metalworks (G-8) as a Dark Knight of level 50 or higher to begin the quest."] = "Habla con Cid en Metalworks (G-8) siendo Dark Knight de nivel 50 o superior para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Cid in Metalworks (H-8) to begin the quest. You need Bastok fame level 4."] = "Habla con Cid en Metalworks (H-8) para empezar la quest. Necesitas el nivel 4 de fama de Bastok.",
    ["Speak with Cid in Metalworks (H-8) to receive the Gun of Trials. You need to break the latent on the Gun of Trials before completing the rest of the quest."] = "Habla con Cid en Metalworks (H-8) para recibir la Gun of Trials. Debes romper el latent de la Gun of Trials antes de completar el resto de la quest.",
    ["Speak with Clarion Star in Port Bastok, near Home Point #1 at (K-7); he gives you the Blue institute card."] = "Habla con Clarion Star en Port Bastok, cerca del Home Point #1 en (K-7); te da la Blue institute card.",
    ["Speak with Corann in Port Bastok (K-6), inside the northmost house, to start the quest."] = "Habla con Corann en Port Bastok (K-6), dentro de la casa más al norte, para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Curilla again."] = "Habla de nuevo con Curilla.",
    ["Speak with Curilla in Chateau d'Oraguille (I-9) and agree to help her; you receive the key item Curilla's bottle."] = "Habla con Curilla en Chateau d'Oraguille (I-9) y acepta ayudarla; recibes el key item Curilla's bottle.",
    ["Speak with Curilla in Chateau d'Oraguille (I-9) to receive the Sapara of Trials. You need to break the latent on the Sapara of Trials before completing the rest of the quest."] = "Habla con Curilla en Chateau d'Oraguille (I-9) para recibir el Sapara of Trials. Debes romper el latent del Sapara of Trials antes de completar el resto de la quest.",
    ["Speak with Curilla in Chateau d'Oraguille (I-9) to start the quest; you must be a Red Mage of level 50 or higher and able to enter Chateau d'Oraguille. You don't have to be on Red Mage for the rest of the quest."] = "Habla con Curilla en Chateau d'Oraguille (I-9) para empezar la quest; debes ser Red Mage de nivel 50 o superior y poder entrar en Chateau d'Oraguille. No tienes que ser Red Mage para el resto de la quest.",
    ["Speak with Dabhuh in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-11), near The Pit, to begin the quest. He wants you to bring him a Merrow Scale. This quest requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Habla con Dabhuh en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-11), cerca de The Pit, para empezar la quest. Quiere que le traigas una Merrow Scale. Esta quest requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Speak with Daigraffeaux (I-11) in Southern San d'Oria (S)."] = "Habla con Daigraffeaux (I-11) en Southern San d'Oria (S).",
    ["Speak with Darcia in Lower Jeuno."] = "Habla con Darcia en Lower Jeuno.",
    ["Speak with Datta in Rabao (F-7) to begin the quest. You need to be level 40 or lower and have the Rise of the Zilart pack. You have been asked to join a tour planned by Datta: travel to the cliff inside the entrance to Kuftal Tunnel with a party of two or more people of level forty or lower, and meet Datta's partner, Hawk Nose."] = "Habla con Datta en Rabao (F-7) para empezar la quest. Debes ser nivel 40 o inferior y tener el pack Rise of the Zilart. Te han pedido que participes en una excursión organizada por Datta: viaja al acantilado de la entrada de Kuftal Tunnel con un grupo de dos o más personas de nivel cuarenta o inferior, y reúnete con Hawk Nose, el socio de Datta.",
    ["Speak with Dauperiat in Northern San d'Oria (I-10) to obtain a Suspicious envelope, and deliver it to Halver in Chateau d'Oraguille."] = "Habla con Dauperiat en Northern San d'Oria (I-10) para obtener un Suspicious envelope y entrégalo a Halver en Chateau d'Oraguille.",
    ["Speak with Davyad (K-6)."] = "Habla con Davyad (K-6).",
    ["Speak with Degenhard in Bastok Markets (I-10) to begin the quest."] = "Habla con Degenhard en Bastok Markets (I-10) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Dehn Harzhapan in Port Windurst (G-6) to start the quest. Only one Escort for Hire quest can be active at a time, and only one can be completed each Conquest Tally."] = "Habla con Dehn Harzhapan en Port Windurst (G-6) para empezar la quest. Solo puede haber una quest Escort for Hire activa a la vez, y solo se puede completar una por Conquest Tally.",
    ["Speak with Deidogg in Bastok Mines (H-6) twice; he is at the bottom of the ramp that leads to the guild. After this point the quest can be completed on any job."] = "Habla dos veces con Deidogg en Bastok Mines (H-6); está al pie de la rampa que lleva al gremio. A partir de este punto la quest se puede completar con cualquier trabajo.",
    ["Speak with Deidogg in Bastok Mines (H-6)."] = "Habla con Deidogg en Bastok Mines (H-6).",
    ["Speak with Deraquien again."] = "Habla de nuevo con Deraquien.",
    ["Speak with Deraquien in Southern San d'Oria (G-8) for a cutscene."] = "Habla con Deraquien en Southern San d'Oria (G-8) para una escena.",
    ["Speak with Despachiaire (K-10)."] = "Habla con Despachiaire (K-10).",
    ["Speak with Despachiaire in Tavnazian Safehold (K-10) to obtain the Letter from Shikaree X. The letter has arrived in the safehold, and she wants to gauge your battle prowess in Boneyard Gully."] = "Habla con Despachiaire en Tavnazian Safehold (K-10) para obtener la Letter from Shikaree X. La carta ha llegado al safehold, y ella quiere medir tu capacidad de combate en Boneyard Gully.",
    ["Speak with Detzo in Bastok Mines (I-6) to begin the quest."] = "Habla con Detzo en Bastok Mines (I-6) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Detzo in Bastok Mines (I-6), in the alleyway around the corner from Deidogg. Speak to him again if he mentions a Mythril Sallet."] = "Habla con Detzo en Bastok Mines (I-6), en el callejón a la vuelta de la esquina de Deidogg. Vuelve a hablar con él si menciona un Mythril Sallet.",
    ["Speak with Devean in Selbina (I-8). He asks you to bet on how long it takes you to get a pair of Power Sandals from Davoi. Find the pair of Power Sandals hidden in a jar somewhere in Davoi and bring them back before time runs out for a cash prize."] = "Habla con Devean en Selbina (I-8). Te pide que apuestes cuánto tardas en conseguir un par de Power Sandals de Davoi. Encuentra el par de Power Sandals escondido en una jarra en algún lugar de Davoi y tráelo antes de que se acabe el tiempo para un premio en metálico.",
    ["Speak with Dhea Prandoleh (H-10) in Windurst Waters (S)."] = "Habla con Dhea Prandoleh (H-10) en Windurst Waters (S).",
    ["Speak with Diordinne at (I-6) in Garlaige Citadel (S) Map 1 and receive the Number Eight Shelter Key."] = "Habla con Diordinne en (I-6) en el Map 1 de Garlaige Citadel (S) y recibe la Number Eight Shelter Key.",
    ["Speak with Dkhaaya in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (G-9) for a cutscene and to obtain Dkhaaya's research journal."] = "Habla con Dkhaaya en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (G-9) para una escena y para obtener el Dkhaaya's research journal.",
    ["Speak with Drake Fang (H-6)."] = "Habla con Drake Fang (H-6).",
    ["Speak with Drangord (D-7) near the entrance to Zeruhn Mines."] = "Habla con Drangord (D-7) cerca de la entrada de Zeruhn Mines.",
    ["Speak with Edal-Tahdal in Norg (H-9) to obtain the quest. You need Norg fame level 4 and the Rise of the Zilart pack; if he won't give it, keep talking to him until his text changes. Once you have the key item Tuning fork of water, you can safely undertake the quest. Each party member must have their own Tuning fork of water. Trusts can't be used."] = "Habla con Edal-Tahdal en Norg (H-9) para obtener la quest. Necesitas fama de Norg nivel 4 y el pack de Rise of the Zilart; si no te la da, sigue hablando con él hasta que cambie su texto. Cuando tengas el key item Tuning fork of water, puedes emprender la quest sin problemas. Cada miembro del grupo debe tener su propio Tuning fork of water. No se pueden usar Trusts.",
    ["Speak with Eddy in Port San d'Oria (H-6) and accept the quest."] = "Habla con Eddy en Port San d'Oria (H-6) y acepta la quest.",
    ["Speak with Edigey in Rabao (F-9) to begin the quest. You need Rabao fame level 4 and the Rise of the Zilart pack. He wants sand scorpion poison so he can make an antidote, an essential item for the desert caravans."] = "Habla con Edigey en Rabao (F-9) para empezar la quest. Necesitas el nivel 4 de fama de Rabao y el pack Rise of the Zilart. Quiere veneno de escorpión de arena para hacer un antídoto, un objeto esencial para las caravanas del desierto.",
    ["Speak with Ekhu Pesshyadha (H-6) for a cutscene with Yadhiwa. You can pick any option to proceed; you may choose to gamble with her, but she always wins."] = "Habla con Ekhu Pesshyadha (H-6) para una escena con Yadhiwa. Puedes elegir cualquier opción para avanzar; puedes apostar con ella, pero siempre gana.",
    ["Speak with Ekhu Pesshyadha in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (H-6)."] = "Habla con Ekhu Pesshyadha en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (H-6).",
    ["Speak with Ekhu Pesshyadha to receive the Vial of luminous water."] = "Habla con Ekhu Pesshyadha para recibir el Vial of luminous water.",
    ["Speak with Elki in Bastok Mines (H-5) to start the quest."] = "Habla con Elki en Bastok Mines (H-5) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Elki in the Bat's Lair Inn in Bastok Mines (H-5) to trigger a cutscene and start the quest. When the cutscene ends you have a Bouquet for the pioneers."] = "Habla con Elki en el Bat's Lair Inn de Bastok Mines (H-5) para activar una escena y empezar la quest. Cuando termina la escena tienes un Bouquet para los pioneros.",
    ["Speak with Elmric (K-7) at Frontier Station."] = "Habla con Elmric (K-7) en la Frontier Station.",
    ["Speak with Elysia on the first floor of Tavnazian Safehold (G-10) to begin the quest. She dropped her hairpin while doing her shopping."] = "Habla con Elysia en el primer piso de Tavnazian Safehold (G-10) para empezar la quest. Perdió su horquilla mientras hacía la compra.",
    ["Speak with Emhi Tchaoryo in Windurst Waters (S) (H-9), select the category defensive operations and sign up for Aegis Scream I."] = "Habla con Emhi Tchaoryo en Windurst Waters (S) (H-9), elige la categoría de operaciones defensivas y apúntate a Aegis Scream I.",
    ["Speak with Emhi Tchaoryo in Windurst Waters (S) (H-9), select the category defensive operations and sign up for Aegis Scream II."] = "Habla con Emhi Tchaoryo en Windurst Waters (S) (H-9), elige la categoría de operaciones defensivas y apúntate a Aegis Scream II.",
    ["Speak with Emhi Tchaoryo in Windurst Waters (S) (H-9), select the category defensive operations and sign up for Aegis Scream III."] = "Habla con Emhi Tchaoryo en Windurst Waters (S) (H-9), elige la categoría de operaciones defensivas y apúntate a Aegis Scream III.",
    ["Speak with Emhi Tchaoryo in Windurst Waters (S) (H-9), select the category defensive operations and sign up for Aegis Scream IV."] = "Habla con Emhi Tchaoryo en Windurst Waters (S) (H-9), elige la categoría de operaciones defensivas y apúntate a Aegis Scream IV.",
    ["Speak with Emhi Tchaoryo in Windurst Waters (S) (H-9), select the category defensive operations and sign up for Aegis Scream V."] = "Habla con Emhi Tchaoryo en Windurst Waters (S) (H-9), elige la categoría de operaciones defensivas y apúntate a Aegis Scream V.",
    ["Speak with Emhi Tchaoryo in Windurst Waters (S) (H-9), select the category defensive operations and sign up for Granite Rose I."] = "Habla con Emhi Tchaoryo en Windurst Waters (S) (H-9), elige la categoría de operaciones defensivas y apúntate a Granite Rose I.",
    ["Speak with Emhi Tchaoryo in Windurst Waters (S) (H-9), select the category defensive operations and sign up for Granite Rose II."] = "Habla con Emhi Tchaoryo en Windurst Waters (S) (H-9), elige la categoría de operaciones defensivas y apúntate a Granite Rose II.",
    ["Speak with Emhi Tchaoryo in Windurst Waters (S) (H-9), select the category defensive operations and sign up for Granite Rose III."] = "Habla con Emhi Tchaoryo en Windurst Waters (S) (H-9), elige la categoría de operaciones defensivas y apúntate a Granite Rose III.",
    ["Speak with Emhi Tchaoryo in Windurst Waters (S) (H-9), select the category intel gathering and sign up for Bailey Borer."] = "Habla con Emhi Tchaoryo en Windurst Waters (S) (H-9), elige la categoría de recopilación de inteligencia y apúntate a Bailey Borer.",
    ["Speak with Emhi Tchaoryo in Windurst Waters (S) (H-9), select the category intel gathering and sign up for Deep Cover I."] = "Habla con Emhi Tchaoryo en Windurst Waters (S) (H-9), elige la categoría de recopilación de inteligencia y apúntate a Deep Cover I.",
    ["Speak with Emhi Tchaoryo in Windurst Waters (S) (H-9), select the category intel gathering and sign up for Deep Cover II."] = "Habla con Emhi Tchaoryo en Windurst Waters (S) (H-9), elige la categoría de recopilación de inteligencia y apúntate a Deep Cover II.",
    ["Speak with Emhi Tchaoryo in Windurst Waters (S) (H-9), select the category intel gathering and sign up for Deep Cover III."] = "Habla con Emhi Tchaoryo en Windurst Waters (S) (H-9), elige la categoría de recopilación de inteligencia y apúntate a Deep Cover III.",
    ["Speak with Emhi Tchaoryo in Windurst Waters (S) (H-9), select the category intel gathering and sign up for Frozen Flame."] = "Habla con Emhi Tchaoryo en Windurst Waters (S) (H-9), elige la categoría de recopilación de inteligencia y apúntate a Frozen Flame.",
    ["Speak with Emhi Tchaoryo in Windurst Waters (S) (H-9), select the category intel gathering and sign up for Hawk Eye I."] = "Habla con Emhi Tchaoryo en Windurst Waters (S) (H-9), elige la categoría de recopilación de inteligencia y apúntate a Hawk Eye I.",
    ["Speak with Emhi Tchaoryo in Windurst Waters (S) (H-9), select the category intel gathering and sign up for Hawk Eye II."] = "Habla con Emhi Tchaoryo en Windurst Waters (S) (H-9), elige la categoría de recopilación de inteligencia y apúntate a Hawk Eye II.",
    ["Speak with Emhi Tchaoryo in Windurst Waters (S) (H-9), select the category intel gathering and sign up for Hawk Eye III."] = "Habla con Emhi Tchaoryo en Windurst Waters (S) (H-9), elige la categoría de recopilación de inteligencia y apúntate a Hawk Eye III.",
    ["Speak with Emhi Tchaoryo in Windurst Waters (S) (H-9), select the category intel gathering and sign up for Hawk Eye IV."] = "Habla con Emhi Tchaoryo en Windurst Waters (S) (H-9), elige la categoría de recopilación de inteligencia y apúntate a Hawk Eye IV.",
    ["Speak with Emhi Tchaoryo in Windurst Waters (S) (H-9), select the category intel gathering and sign up for Prying Eyes I."] = "Habla con Emhi Tchaoryo en Windurst Waters (S) (H-9), elige la categoría de recopilación de inteligencia y apúntate a Prying Eyes I.",
    ["Speak with Emhi Tchaoryo in Windurst Waters (S) (H-9), select the category intel gathering and sign up for Prying Eyes II."] = "Habla con Emhi Tchaoryo en Windurst Waters (S) (H-9), elige la categoría de recopilación de inteligencia y apúntate a Prying Eyes II.",
